{"id": "8708", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=8708", "title": "Dian Fossey", "text": "Dian Fossey (Diyane Fose) yavutse ku ya 16 Mutarama 1932 - apfa ku ya 26 Ukuboza 1985. Yari Umunyamerika w\u2019inzobere mu kubungabunga ibidukikije no kwita ku nyamaswa z'inguge. Yamenyekanye cyane ku bw'ubushakashatsi bwimbitse yakoze ku matsinda y\u2019ingagi zo mu misozi mu Rwanda kuva mu 1966 kugeza yishwe mu 1985. Yigaga imibereho y'ingagi buri munsi mu mashyamba yo mu birunga abanje kubishishikarizwa cyane yabanje gushishikarizwa kuhakorera n\u2019umuhanga Louis Leakey. \"Gorillas in the Mist\" (Ingagi mu bihu), igitabo cyasohowe imyaka ibiri mbere y'urupfu rwe, ni inkuru ya Fossey ivuga ku bushakashatsi bwe bwa siyansi bwerekeye ingagi mu kigo cy\u2019ubushakashatsi cya Karisoke ndetse n'akazi yakoze mbere yaho. Iyo nkuru yaje guhindurwamo firime yo mu 1988 yahawe izina rimwe.\nFossey yari umwe mu bahanga mu bumenyi bw'inguge nini babayeho ku isi hose. Yari umwe mu bagize \"Trimates\", itsinda ryari rigizwe n\u2019abahanga b\u2019abagore bakomeye boherejwe na Leakey kugira ngo bige inguge nini (zirimo ingagi, inkende n'ibitera) bazisanze aho ziba.\nYamaze imyaka 20 mu Rwanda, aho yashyigikiye byimazeyo ibikorwa byo kubungabunga ibidukikije, arwanya cyane ubukerarugendo n'ubuhigi bwari bwibasiye izi nyamaswa ku buryo bukomeye. Ibi byatumye amenyekana cyane kandi abantu benshi na bo bamenya agaciro k'ingagi. Fossey n'ingagi babanaga baje kuzira urugomo rw'abahigi. \nNyuma y\u2019iyicwa ry'ingagi, habayeho amakimbirane hagati ye n'abari bazishe. Mu gihe gito yahise yicirwa mu kazu yabagamo aho mu i birunga. kigeza ubu ntihavugwa rumwe ku waba yaramwishe.\nIbikorwa bya Fossey by'ubushakashatsi no kubungabunga ibidukikije byafashije cyane cyane kugabanya umuvuduko ingagi zicwagaho ku rugero zari ziri hafi kuzimira.\nIbyo yakoze byakomereje mu muryango yasize ashinze wo kubungabunga ingagi witwa Diana Fossey Gorilla Fund mu 1967. Uyu muryango ni na wo ikigo cy'ubushakashatsi cyizwi nka Karisoke Research Center.\nUmunyamakuru w'umunyamerika wamamaye cyane nka Ellen DeGeneres akaba aheruka gutanga inkunga kuri uyu muryango yo kubaka ikindi kigo na cyo kizunganira ibi bisanzwe hafi na pariki y' ibirunga. Icyo kigo kizaba cyitwa Ellen DeGeneres Campus, giteganijwe kuzura muri 2021."}
{"id": "8709", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=8709", "title": "Albert Murasira", "text": "Albert Murasira (wavutse ku wa 11 Ugushyingo 1962) ni umunyapolitiki w'Umunyarwanda. Ni Jenerali Majoro wasezerewe mu ngabo z'u Rwanda. Kuva muri Kanama 2023, ni Minisitiri ushinzwe Ibikorwa by'Ubutabazi (MINEMA).\nMbere yaho, Albert Murasira yabaye Minisitiri w'Ingabo kuva mu 2018 kugeza mu 2023. Kuva mu 2012 kugeza mu 2018, yayoboye banki Zigama CSS.\nUbuzima.\nUbwana n'amashuri.\nAlbert Murasira yavutse ku wa 11 Ugushyingo 1962 i Maniema, muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. Yize amashuri abanza n'igice cy'ayisumbuye i Maniema. Nyuma yaje mu Rwanda. Mu 1983, yarangirije amashuri yisumbuye muri Ecole des Sciences Byimana, mu Karere ka Ruhango.\nKuva mu 1983 kugeza mu 1988, Albert Murasira yize muri Kaminuza Nkuru y'u Rwanda (ubu ni Kaminuza y'u Rwanda). Yahakuye impamyabumenyi mu mibare mu 1986 no mu 1988. Mu 2004, yabonye dipolome mu buyobozi bwa Leta muri Gana. Mu 2011, yabonye dipolome mu bya gisirikare muri kaminuza y'ingabo z'Ubushinwa. Mu 2016, yabonye Masters mu micungire y'imishinga muri Kaminuza ya Liverpool, mu Bwongereza.\nUmwuga.\nAlbert Murasira yinjiye mu gisirikare mu 1988. Yabaye ofisiye mu 1989. Kuva mu 1995 kugeza mu 1998, yigishije imibare muri Kaminuza Nkuru y'u Rwanda. Kuva mu 1999 kugeza mu 2004, yari umuyobozi ushinzwe igenamigambi muri Minisiteri y'Ingabo.\nKuva mu 2004 kugeza mu 2005, yakoze mu butumwa bw'Afurika Yunze Ubumwe muri Sudani (AMIS). Mu 2006, yabaye umuyobozi wungirije w'ishuri rya gisirikare rya Gako. Kuva mu 2007 kugeza mu 2012, yari ashinzwe abakozi mu buyobozi bukuru bw'ingabo z'u Rwanda.\nKuva muri Gashyantare 2012 kugeza mu Kwakira 2018, Albert Murasira yayoboye Zigama CSS, banki y'abagize ingabo. Mu 2018, yahawe ipeti rya Jenerali Majoro.\nKu wa 18 Ukwakira 2018, Albert Murasira yagizwe Minisitiri w'Ingabo. Yasimbuye James Kabarebe. Ni we Minisitiri w'Ingabo wa cumi kuva u Rwanda rwabona ubwigenge mu 1962. Muri Kamena 2023, Perezida Paul Kagame yamusimbuje Juvenal Marizamunda.\nKu wa 22 Kanama 2023, Albert Murasira yagizwe Minisitiri ushinzwe Ibikorwa by'Ubutabazi. Mu 2026, aracyari kuri uwo mwanya."}
