{"id": "8958", "revid": "16351", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=8958", "title": "Ibitaro bya Gisirikare by'u Rwanda", "text": "Ibitaro bikuru, byigisha bya Gisirikare by'u Rwanda, Rwanda Military Referral and teaching Hospital (RMRTH) ni bimwe mu bitaro by'igihugu aho byakira abarwayi b'abasirikare ndetse nabasivili baturutse hirya no hino mu gihugu baje kuvurwa n'inzobere zitandukanye zihakorera.\nAho biherereye.\nIbi bitaro bihererey mu mujyi wa Kigali, Akarere ka Kicukiro, i kanombe ku muhanda wa KK739ST. \nImikorere.\nIbitaro bya gisirikare by'u Rwanda bikorera mu buryo butandukanye aho byakira kandi bikohereza abarwayi ba Gisirikare n\u2019abasivili aho bibaye ngombwa ndetse no ku nzobere zitandukanye nk':\nBuri serivisi itangwa ninzobere mu buvuzi zifite ubunararibonye zikoresha ikoranabuhanga ry\u2019ubuvuzi kandi ryubahiriza amahame yo hejuru yo kwita ku barwayi n'umutekano."}
{"id": "8959", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=8959", "title": "Ingoro ndangamurage yo ku Mulindi w'Intwali", "text": "Ingoro ndangamateka yo kubohora igihugu iri ku Mulindi w\u2019Intwari mu Ntara y\u2019Amajyaruguru, Akarere ka Gicumbi, Umurenge wa\nKaniga, Akagari ka Mukindi, Umudugudu wa Nyakabungo. Iyi Ingoro ndangamurage yo ku Mulindi w\u2019Intwari ifite umwihariko irusha izindi ngoro ndangamurage hafi ya zose zo ku Isi bitangazwa.\nIyi ngoro iherereye ahari ibiro bya FPR Inkotanyi, irimo n\u2019indaki ya Perezida Paul Kagame ikoze mu nyuguti ya L, yakoreshaga mu gutanga amabwiriza igihe yari ayoboye urugamba rwo kubohora igihugu hagati yo mu 1990-1994 no guhagarika Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi. Yanifashishwaga n\u2019abanyamuryango ba FPR Inkotanyi bungurana ibitekerezo ku ngingo zitandukanye.\nMu 2018 Ingoro y\u2019amateka y\u2019urugamba rwo guhagarika Jenoside niyo yasuwe cyane, ikurikirwa n\u2019Ingoro y\u2019Imibereho y\u2019abanyarwanda i Huye, Ingoro y\u2019Abami i Nyanza n\u2019Ingoro y\u2019Ubugeni n\u2019ubuhanzi yahoze yitwa iy\u2019abaperezida iri i Kigali.\nGusura Ingoro z\u2019umurage w\u2019u Rwanda abana n\u2019abanyeshuri bishyura 700 Frw, abakuru bishyura 1500 Frw, abo muri Afurika y\u2019Iburasirazuba bishyura 3000 Frw naho abandi banyamahanga bakishyura 6000 Frw.\nReba.\n1.https://rushyashya.net/ingoro-yo-ku-mulindi-wintwari-igiye-gutangira-kumurikirwamo-amateka-yurugamba-rwo-kubohora-igihugu/\n2.http://ibigwi.rw/spip.php?article765\n3.http://imvahonshya.co.rw/icyo-ingoro-ndangamurage-yo-ku-mulindi-wintwari-irusha-izindi-ku-isi/"}
{"id": "8960", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=8960", "title": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Bisesero", "text": "Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Biseseroni urwibutso ruherereye hafi y\u2019umujyi wa Kibuye, mu karere ka Karongi mu Ntara y\u2019Iburengerazuba bw\u2019u Rwanda, rukaba ruzwi cyane kubera amateka yihariye yaranze aka gace aho Abatutsi bahatuye bagaragaje ubutwari budasanzwe bwo kwirwanaho mu gihe cya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994, bakifashisha amabuye n\u2019inkoni mu guhangana n\u2019interahamwe zari zifite intwaro zikomeye; hagati y\u2019ukwezi kwa Gicurasi na Kamena 1994, ibi bitero byarakomeje bikaza kuganisha ku bwicanyi ndengakamere bwahitanye Abatutsi barenga 40,000, ari na yo mpamvu uyu munsi uru rwibutso ari ahantu ho kuzirikana no guha icyubahiro abazize jenoside, ndetse rukaba n\u2019ikimenyetso cy\u2019ubutwari n\u2019ubudaheranwa byaranze abaharwaniye ubuzima bwabo.\nImiterere rusange.\nUrwibutso rwa Bisesero ni rumwe mu nzibutso za Jenoside ziri hirya no hino mu gihugu, zifite uruhare rwo gushyingura mu cyubahiro, kwibuka no kubika amateka.\nInkuru irambuye.\nMu kwezi kwa Gicurasi 1994, abaturage baturutse mu mirenge ituranye baza guhungira i Bisesero. Uko ubwicanyi bwibasiye Abatutsi,bwagendaga bwiyongera uko bwije n'uko bukeye, abantu bakoze urugendo rw'ibirometero kugira ngo bajyane impunzi. Ubwo ubwicanyi bwatangiraga,abaturage ba Bisesero bari biteguye bihagije kurwana aho kugwa mu ntagondwa z'interahamwe.\nBitegetswe n'umusaza umwe n'umuturage witwa Aminadabu Birara, abatutsi ba Bisesero bateguye amayeri yo kurwanya interahamwe zaje gutera umudugudu wabo. Bisesero ni agace k'imisozi, abatutsi bategekwa kwifata hejuru y'umusozi witwa Muyira aho bashoboraga kubona interahamwe hejuru. Gusa abarwanyi b'abatutsi bari bemerewe ni abagabo n\u2019abahungu bari bafite imbaraga zihagije zo guhangana, mu gihe abana n\u2019abagore bitwikiriye inyuma y\u2019umusozi umwe. Muri ako kanya intwaro ikomeye ku batutsi bahigwaga ba Bisesero yari amabuye n'amacumu make.\nJenoside ikomeye.\nKu ya 13 Gicurasi, interahamwe zimaze kumenya ko abatutsi ba Bisesero biteguye kwirwanaho,interahamwe zashatse intwaro zikomeye (Mortar 81, 82 n\u2019intwaro nyinshi ziremereye) ziva mu mpande zose z\u2019u Rwanda ndetse n\u2019ingabo nyinshi zirimo abasivili b\u2019Abahutu boherejwe i Bisesero kurangiza abaturage.\nBageze i Bisesero, abatutsi barenga 4000 bari bateraniye hejuru y\u2019umusozi wa Muyira bafite amabuye n'amacumu biteguye kwirwanaho. Mortar 81 na 82s zahanganye numusozi zirekura amasasu manini mu gihe intagondwa z'interahamwe zazamutse umusozi. Muri icyo gihe, abatutsi ba Bisesero bari bazi ko bagabweho igitero - ku muntu wese wagerageje kuzamuka hejuru yateraga amabuye n'amacumu mu rwego rwo kwirwanaho.\nN'ubwo abatutsi benshi bapfuye, abatutsi bake barokotse bagerageje gukomeza kwirwanaho kugeza ku ya 13 kamena igihe Abafaransa bafashaga interahamwe kwica abatutsi.\nIgitero cy'Abafaransa.\nKu ya 27 Kamena, baje bavuga ko bafite umugambi wo kubungabunga umutekano no guhagarika jenoside. Bahageze bavugana n'umuntu Eric wahoze ari umwarimu muri kiriya gihe, yari azi igifaransa. Ibintu byari bikomeje gutera ubwoba n'ubwo abatutsi bavuga ko bavuye mu bwihisho bashaka ubufasha bw\u2019ingabo z\u2019Ubufaransa. Nyuma yaho (ingabo z'Ubufaransa) barabihakana bavuga ko bazagaruka nyuma y'iminsi itatu kugira ngo batabare. Umunyamakuru w'Umufaransa Patrick de Saint-Exup\u00e9ry wa \"Le Figaro\", wari kumwe n'ingabo z'Ubufaransa muri \"Op\u00e9ration Turquoise\", yiboneye ibyabereye i Bisesero icyo gihe, maze nyuma abyandikaho inkuru n'ibitabo.\nNtibyatinze ingabo z'Ubufaransa zimaze kugenda, interehamwe zagarutse kurangiza ibyo zatangiye. Ku ikubitiro ubwicanyi bw'Abatutsi bwakomeje ku manywa, ariko kuri iyi nshuro baza kwica amanywa n'ijoro kugira ngo barangize abatutsi bose mbere yuko Abafaransa bagaruka nyuma y'iminsi 3. \nIjoro ryo ku ya 30 Kamena Abafaransa baragarutse basanga hafi ya bose bishwe kandi wenda kimwe cya kane cy'ibihumbi bazima ariko bakomeretse cyane.\nKugeza ubu urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Bisesero rwubatswe mu 1997 rufite inyubako eshatu zuzuyemo imibiri y'abazize jenocide kandi kuri ubu hakaba hakomeje kubakwa inzibutso aho hazashyingurwa imibiri 50-60.000.\nUrwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Bisesero.\n ni rumwe mu nzibutso zikomeye bibukiraho jenoside yakorewe abatutsi mu 1994. Ku wa 20 nzeri 2023 nibwo urwibutso rwa jenocide yakorewe abatutsi mu 1994 rwa Bisesero rwashyizwe mu nzibutso zikomeye n'izindi zirimo Murambi,Nyamata n'urwa Gisozi. Nyuma y'umwaka rushyizwemo; abarusura bavuye ku 4.592 mu 2023 bagera ku 10.170 mu 2024.\nIzindi nzibutso z'itsembabwoko mu Rwanda.\nUru rwibutso ni kimwe mu bigo bitandatu bikomeye byo mu Rwanda bibuka itsembabwoko ry\u2019abatutsi mu mwaka wa 1994. Ahandi ni Urwibutso rwa Kigali, Urwibutso rwa Murambi n\u2019Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Ntarama n\u2019ahandi i Nyamata na Nyarubuye. Urwibutso ruherereye ku birometero 60 uvuye i Kibuye.\nAmashakiro.\n1.https://www.kwibuka.rw/memorial_sites/bisesero-memorial-site/\n2.https://www.nyungweforestnationalpark.org/bisesero-genocide-memorial-centre/\n3.https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bisesero_Genocide_Memorial_Centre"}
{"id": "8961", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=8961", "title": "Umwari wa musamu", "text": "Urutare rwo ku Mwari wa musamu.\nuru rutare ruherereye muntara y mu karere ka ruhango mu murenge wa ruhango\nmu mudugudu wa mwari ruzwi cyane mumateka ya ruhango kubera inkuru \nziruvugwaho kuko bavugako harigitiye umukobwa hakamera uratare kandi\nbakahamwitirira.\nAmateka.\nUmwari wa musamu bavugako ari umukobwa wari ugiye gushyingirwa yagera aho kurubu bita kumwari \nakarigita maze aho arigitiye hakamera urutare kugeza nanubu urwo rutare ruracyahari\nUbuhamya.\nkugeza nanubu abahaturiye bavugako urwo rutare rukihari ruherereye mwisambu yumuturage\nwitwa Kamonyo yozefu wimyaka 95 wemezako ibivugwa ari ukuri kuko yahasanze bimwe mu\nbikoresho byakera bambaraga nk' imitako yabari nabategarugori.\nIngano yarwo.\nuru rutare bavugako rupima metero imwe na santimetero\nzitzri nyinshi yubuhagarike"}
{"id": "8962", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=8962", "title": "Katedirali Basilika ya Bikira Mariya", "text": "Mu mateka y\u2019abaromani ba kera, Basilika yari inyubako nini za leta zifite imyubakire yihariye y\u2019ishusho y\u2019urukiramende, aho uruhande ruto ruteye nka kimwe cya kabiri cy\u2019uruziga. Hari amoko abiri ya bazilika; inini n\u2019intoya, iyi basilika rero ikaba ibarwa mu ntoya. \nKatedirali Basilika ya Bikira Mariya ni katedirali Gatolika y\u2019Abaroma na basilika ntoya yeguriwe Bikira Mariya. Iyi Basilika ni icyicaro cya Diyosezi ya Kabgayi. \nAmateka.\nIyi Basilika y\u2019i Kabgayi yahawe umugisha na Papa Jean Paul II ubwo yasuraga u Rwanda mu 1990. Iyi bazilika yaragijwe Bikira Mariya Utarasamanywe icyaha wanaragijwe diyoseze ya Kabgayi. Basilika yeguriwe Imana ku ya 22 Ukwakira 1992. \nAho iherereye.\nIyi Bazilika iherereye i Kabgayi mu karere ka Muhanga, mu ntara y'amajyepfo, mu Rwanda.\nIzindi Basilika zo mu Rwanda.\nBasilika y\u2019i Kabgayi igiye kunguka murumuna wayo izaba iyirusha ubunini igiye kuyunganira mu mateka y\u2019ubukirisitu mu Rwanda. Ni umushinga utarashyirwa mu bikorwa, uteganya kubaka bazilika izajya yakira abantu ibihumbi 10 bicaye neza izubakwa i Kibeho mu karere ka Nyaruguru ahabereye amabonekerwa y\u2019abakobwa batatu mu 1981. Izaba ikubye hafi inshuro eshatu iy\u2019i Kabgayi kuko ishobora kwakira abantu ibihumbi bitatu.\nHateganijwe ko iyi bazilika izaba yuzuye bitarenze Ukuboza 2021. Ikaba iteganywa gutahwa mu gihe hazaba hizihizwa imyaka 40 i Kibeho habereye aya mabonekerwa.\nNubwo bitaremezwa, iyi Basilika yagenewe izina rya Bazilika y\u2019Umubyeyi wacu y\u2019i Kibeho \u201cOur Lady of Kibeho basilica\u201d."}
{"id": "8963", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=8963", "title": "Irimbi ry abami", "text": "Irimbi ry'abami mu Rwanda.\nIrimbi ryashyingurwagamo abami n'abagabekazi babo mu Rwanda. Ni irimbi ritandukanye\nn'andi marimbi mu Rwanda. Riherereye mu Karere ka Gicumbi mu Ntara ya Amajyaruguru \nIyo uhageze ntiwamenya ko hari irimbi kuko abaturage batangiye kuhahinga no kuhatura.\nAmateka.\nIri rimbi riherereye mu karere ka Gicumbi mu ntara y'amajyaruguru\nNi irimbi ryihariye nk'uko bivugwa n'abahatuye. Ni irimbi bashyinguragamo abami bose bamaze gutanga (Gupfa) ndetse abami bose bayoboye u Rwanda niho bashyinguye uretse Yuhi IV Musinga waguye ishyanga ubwo yahungiraga i Moba ari naho yaguye, ndetse na Mutara III Rudahigwa washyinguwe i Mwima mu murenge wa Busasamana mu karere ka Nyanza\nAho riherereye.\nIrimbi ry'abami riherereye mu Ntara y'amajyaruguru mu Karere ka Gicumbi mu murenge wa Rutare mu mudugudu wa Nyakavunga\nIkiharanga.\nUretse IMva ya Kigeri IV Rwabugiir yabashije kubakirwa ikaba arinayo isigaye iharanga\nmbese igaragaza ko hari irimbi izindi mva zose zarasibanganye ntizikigaragara"}
{"id": "8965", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=8965", "title": "Amateka ku yahoze ari Gereza ya Nyarugenge 1930", "text": "Ubusobanuro.\nIyo gereza ikunze kwitwa 1930, iri mu Murenge wa Muhima, Mu kagari ka Kanunga, muri Nyarugenge, ariyo gereza ya cyera kurusha izindi mu Rwanda kandi ikaba iranga imyubakire y\u2019abakoloni mu Rwanda (architecture coloniale).\nIgihe ya tangiriye n'Igihe ya funze imiryago.\nIyi gereza nkuru ya Kigali yari iherereye mu Akarere ka Nyarungege yubatswe 1930. Iyo gereza yimuriwe i Mageragere muri Nyakanga 2018.\nIbikorwa bitega nyijwe..\n\"Urwego rw\u2019Igihugu rushinzwe imfungwa n\u2019abagororwa mu Rwanda (RCS\"\") rwatangaje ko rugiye kumurika\u00a0 igitabo ku mateka ya gereza zo mu Rwanda \u2018Amateka kuri Gereza z'u Rwanda\u2019 ndetse hatangizwe ku mugaragaro ikinyamakuru cya RCS \u2018 Gororoka Magazine\u2019\" \"kizajya gisohoka buri gihembwe, kandi kikagera ku bantu bose.\"\nKu gishushanyo mbonera cy\u2019 Umujyi wa Kigali biteganyijwe ko Gereza ya Nyarungege izagirwa ahantu Ndangamateka bivuze ko urukuta rwayo rutazasenywa.\nUmuyobozi ushinzwe imiturire mu Mujyi wa Kigali, Eng.Mugisha Fred, yasobanuye ko ihuriro ry\u2019abashoramari bibumbiye muri CHIC (Champion Investment Corporation), rizubaka amacumbi ku butaka bungana na hegitari 5,5 ziri mu kibanza cy\u2019ahahahoze Gereza. Kuyisenya cyangwa kutayisenya, byaba ari amahitamo y\u2019abafata ibyemezo, nk\u2019uko n\u2019ahandi bigenda iyo hari ikimenyetso cy\u2019amateka gikuweho, kigasigara mu nyandiko n\u2019amafoto gusa. Njye nsanga iyi nyubako yabungabungwa, ikanegurirwa INMR kuko ariyo ishinzwe iby\u2019umurage w\u2019igihugu. Bikozwe bityo, INMR niyo yagena uko iyi nzu y\u2019abagororwa n\u2019imfungwa yitwa 1930 yavugururwa ikajya mu zindi \u201cmonuments\u201d z\u2019igihugu.\nAmateka arambuye.\nGereza ya mbere yubakiwe abanyarwanda ariko ku nyungu z\u2019Abakoloni b\u2019Ababiligi n\u2019Abadage bari barateye u Rwanda imigwi.\nMu 1930 ni bwo yubatswe, izina rifata ubwo itangira kuba icumbi ry\u2019abananiranye n\u2019abigometse. Ni yo yazanye ubundi buryo bwo guhana abahamijwe ibyaha butari bumenyerewe, butandukanye n\u2019uko byakorwaga mbere mu rwa Gasabo. Hambere, Abanyarwanda bakosaga barihanangirizwaga, bagatamazwa biciye mu buvanganzo nk\u2019indirimbo n\u2019ibindi, hari n\u2019abacibwaga ihazabu; bikarangirira aho.\nUrutonde rw\u2019abo yacumbikiye rwo ni rurerure. Ndakubwiza ukuri urebye hafi yawe aho, ukabaza mugenzi wawe arakubwira abake batatu, bisobanuye ko yakoze akazi gakomeye. Hari nk\u2019amazina twese tuzi ya vuba cyangwa ya kera! Uhereye ku bari abayobozi bakomeye nka ba Pasiteri Bizimungu wabaye Perezida, Dr Leo Mugesera n\u2019ubu ukiri muri gereza.\nUfashe umwana ku ngufu wagombaga kumenya ko iza kuguha karibu, warya utw\u2019abandi nabwo bikaba uko, wakwenderanya mu kabari n\u2019ibindi... Yo nta mpuhwe yagiraga mu gihe amategeko yabyemeje.\nUko ubuzima bwabaga bwifashe.\nKugira ngo wumve neza ubuzima bwo muri gereza, bigereranye n\u2019ikindi gihugu. Hari umugororwa nigeze gusanga kwa muganga arambaza ati \u2018inaha iwanyu mu gihugu se muraho?\u2019.\nKuri we, Gereza ni mu kindi gihugu gifite amategeko akigenga. Haba imirenge, imidugudu, Umuyobozi w\u2019Akagari n\u2019izindi nzego nk\u2019izo.\nNko muri 1930 harimo Umurenge umwe witwa PCK. Wari ufite imidugudu myinshi ifite n\u2019amazina ameze kimwe n\u2019ayo hanze. Hari nk\u2019umudugudu witwa uw\u2019Amahoro [aho Kizito yabaga].\nImyemerere ya muntu ni ikintu cy\u2019ingenzi.\nIyi gereza yari ifite ahantu hihariye abayisilamu basengeraga, Kiliziya Gatolika aho yari iri hateguye neza ku buryo haberaga misa mu buryo buhoraho.\nIgice cyahariwe abana kirihariye.\nMuri 1930 abana bari munsi y\u2019imyaka 18, bafungirwaga ahantu habo hihariye. Bari abana koko! Kuko n\u2019ubu ubona amagambo bandikaga ku nkuta bakoresheje amakara, bagacishamo bakubahuka bakahandika ibitutsi n\u2019ibindi.\nMu yo nabonye ni nk\u2019ayanditswe n\u2019uwitwa Fabrice mu Cyongereza wavuze ati \u201cTwiteguye kuba imfungwa.\u201d Undi we yandika aho yararaga ati \u201cIyi ni California, Biryogo\u201d.\nBirashoboka ko umubare munini w\u2019abari muri iki gice ari abana b\u2019i Nyamirambo kuko usomye ku nkuta, uhasanga amazina y\u2019uduce twaho ku buryo wakeka ko ariho benshi bakomokaga.\nNasekejwe n\u2019ibyanditswe na Hafashimana wagize ati \u201cUgenzwa na Mambo ntakagere hano.\u201d\nAmazi muri iyi gereza ntiyajyaga abura kuko umunsi ku wundi abagororwa babashaga kubona uko bakora isuku.\nIyo wa kosaga.\nMuri iyi gereza, hari kasho yashyirwagamo abagororwa barenze ku mategeko, igizwe n\u2019uturyango duto turenze 20. Buri kamwe kabaga gafite umuryango gusa.\nImibereho y'umurwayi.\nMuri kasho abagororwa basurwaga na bagenzi babo, ku buryo umwe yavugaga ati \u2018umuntu twari duturanye ari muri kasho\u2019 akajya kumusura amushyiriye nk\u2019ifunguro.\nIyi gereza kandi yari ifite ibitaro biha ubutabazi bw\u2019ibanze abarwayi, abarembye bagahabwa inyandiko \u2018transfert\u2019 zibohereza mu bitaro byo hanze.\nUwajyaga kwivuza arembye yashoboraga kurara mu bitaro bya gereza, afite n\u2019umurwaza.\nIgice cy\u2019abagororwa mpuzamahanga kiruta inzu za benshi mu bwiza.\nMuri 1930 harimo igice cyafungirwagamo abagororwa mpuzamahanga babaga barazanywe mu Rwanda bavanywe mu bindi bihugu.\nUrugero ni nk\u2019urwa Dr Leo Mugesera. Aho yari afungiye, Mugisha asobanura neza ko yajyaga ahajya agiye nko gukora amashanyarazi mu gihe hari ibibazo by\u2019umuriro.\nBuri mugororwa muri iki gice, yabaga mu cyumba kinini cya wenyine. Kirimo uburiri bwiza, ameza n\u2019intebe ku buryo agira icyo umuntu yakwita ibiro.\nMu gihe abandi barebaga televiziyo muri rusange we yayirebaga uko ashatse kuko yabaga ayigengaho. Icyo cyumba cyabaga gisa neza, kirimo amakaro, gifite ubwiherero bugezweho, internet, amazi n\u2019ibindi byose nkenerwa.\nIcyifuzo.\nKu muntu utarafungiwe muri 1930, nasoza mwifuriza kutazajya n\u2019i Mageragere. Ku wagezeyo nawe, ntazasubireyo n\u2019abari yo mbibifurije kugororoka vuba.\nReba.\n1.https://ar.umuseke.rw/sinifuza-ko-gereza-1930-iri-ku-rutonde-rwumurage-ndangamateka-yasenywa.hmtl\n2.http://umuryango.rw/amakuru/mu-rwanda/article/abafungiye-muri-gereza-ya-nyarugenge-1930-batangiye-kwimurirwa-mageragere#!?pr=119201&amp;lang=en\n3.https://www.igihe.com/amakuru/article/ahahoze-gereza-ya-1930-hagiye-kubakwa-amacumbi\n4.http://umuryango.rw/amakuru/mu-rwanda/article/abafungiye-muri-gereza-ya-nyarugenge-1930-batangiye-kwimurirwa-mageragere#!?pr=119201&amp;lang=en\n5.https://www.bbc.com/gahuza/amakuru-56414986\n6.https://igihe.com/amakuru/u-rwanda/ku-batarafunzwe-karibu-mu-itongo-rya-1930-Amafoto-na-Video\n7.https://igihe.com/amakuru/u-rwanda/ku-batarafunzwe-karibu-mu-itongo-rya-1930-Amafoto-na-Video"}
