{"id": "9002", "revid": "8075", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9002", "title": "Intangiriro", "text": "Murakaza neza kuri\nWikipediya mu Kinyarwanda\nInkoranyabumenyi yubakwa n'abayikoresha, mu rurimi rwacu. Buri wese ashobora kuyisoma no kuyandikaho ku buntu.\nUbu ifite ingingo zanditswe mu Kinyarwanda\nUbuhanzi, amateka, indimi\nUbumenyi bwimbitse n\u2019ibintu karemano\nPolitiki, ubukungu, idini\nMudasobwa, ubwubatsi, inganda\nSiporo, ibiryo, umuziki\n\ud83d\udcd6 Ingingo yatoranyijwe\n\ud83c\udf3a Ibimera n'indabo byo mu Rwanda\n\ud83d\udcf7 Ishusho y'icyumweru\n\ud83c\udf3a Ibimera n'indabo byo mu Rwanda\n\ud83d\udca1 Wari uzi ko\u2026\n\ud83e\udd1d Fasha Wikipediya\nWikipediya mu Kinyarwanda ikeneye abanditsi! Ushobora gutangira uyu munsi:\n1 ku buntu (si itegeko, ariko birafasha).\n2Kosora amakosa, wongere amakuru n' mu ngingo zisanzwe.\n3Hindura ingingo ziva mu zindi ndimi ukoresheje.\n4Kwitoza mbere: gerageza ku.\n\u2b50 Ingingo zasomye cyane\nRwanda Imirenge y\u2019u Rwanda Burundi Nijeriya Afurika y\u2019Epfo Pariki ya Nyungwe Pariki y\u2019Igihugu y\u2019Ibirunga Ikiyaga cya Kivu Ingagi zo mu birunga Ikawa Ikinyarwanda Ikirundi Imigani migufi y\u2019Ikinyarwanda Fred Rwigema Imihindagurikire y\u2019ibihe SIDA Ubukirisitu Islamu\n\u2728 Ingingo ziherutse ([\u27f3 Vugurura])\n\ud83c\udf10 Imishinga ifitanye isano na Wikipediya\nWikipediya icungwa na Fondasiyo ya Wikimediya, umuryango udaharanira inyungu unacunga n'indi mishinga y'ubuntu:\n Amafoto n\u2019amajwi by\u2019ubuntu\n Ububiko bw\u2019amakuru\nWiktionary Inkoranyamagambo\n Amagambo yavuzwe\n Ibitabo by\u2019ubuntu\n Inyandiko z\u2019umwimerere\n Ubwoko bw\u2019ibinyabuzima\n Kwiga ku buntu\n Ubuyobozi bw\u2019ingendo\n Amakuru y\u2019ubuntu\n Guhuza imishinga\n Porogaramu ya wiki\nWikipediya mu zindi ndimi: \u00b7 \u00b7 \u00b7 \u00b7 \u00b7 \u00b7 \u00b7 \u00b7 \u00b7 \u00b7 \u00b7 \u00b7 "}
{"id": "9006", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9006", "title": "Umurenge wa Murundi", "text": "Umurenge wa Murundi ni umwe mu mirenge 12 igize Akarere ka Kayonza, mu Ntara y'Iburasirazuba y\u2019u Rwanda.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, Umurenge wa Murundi wari utuwe n\u2019abaturage 57 809. Igice cy\u2019iburasirazuba cy\u2019umurenge kiri muri Pariki y'Akagera.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nUbumenyi bw\u2019isi.\nUmurenge wa Murundi ufite ubuso bwa km\u00b2 491. Ugizwe n\u2019utugari tune: Buhabwa, Karambi, Murundi na Ryamanyoni.\nUhana imbibi n\u2019Akarere ka Gatsibo mu majyaruguru no mu burengerazuba. Uhana imbibi n\u2019Umurenge wa Mwiri mu majyepfo y\u2019iburasirazuba. Uhana imbibi n\u2019Umurenge wa Gahini mu majyepfo. Uhana imbibi n\u2019Umurenge wa Rukara mu majyepfo y\u2019iburengerazuba. Igice cy\u2019iburasirazuba cy\u2019umurenge kiri muri Pariki y\u2019Akagera.\nAbaturage.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Murundi wari utuwe n\u2019abaturage 35 742. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, wari utuwe n\u2019abaturage 57 809. Abagabo bari 28 357. Abagore bari 29 452.\nUbukungu.\nIgishanga cya Gacaca kiri mu Murenge wa Murundi. Gifite uburebure bwa km 26, kuva mu Kagari ka Ryamanyoni kugeza mu Kagari ka Karambi. Muri icyo gishanga hahingwa umuceri.\nKoperative Duterimbere Murundi yashinzwe mu 2013. Ifite abanyamuryango 1 914. Bahinga umuceri kuri hegitari zigera kuri 330. Igishanga gifite ikigega kimwe cy\u2019amazi. Abahinzi basaba ko hubakwa ikindi kigega, kubera imyuzure n\u2019ibura ry\u2019amazi."}
