{"id": "9052", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9052", "title": "Nyakatsi", "text": "Nyakatsi.\nmu Rwanda ndetse no mubindi bihugu byinshi bya Africa hagiye hagaragara izu\nzubatswe mubyatsi cyangwa mubirere nibiti zizwi kwi zina rya nyakatsi\nni inzu zaturwagamo nabakene cyane cyane mubihugu byabo\numwihariko.\nnyakatsi n'inzu zikozwe mu byatsi zirangwa cyane no gukonja\nkubazirimo imbere kuko wasanganga nta muriro ubamo ahubwo\nugasanga bacanyemo inkwi kugirango habone ndetse bakabikora no\nmuburyo bwo kota kugirango bashyuhe \nIterambere.\nmuri ibibihe nko mu Rwanda no mubindi bihugu birimo gutera imbere \nbigize umugabane wa Afurika ntago hakigaragaramo inzu zituwemo na\nabaturage zizwi nka nyakatsi\nUbukungu.\nkugeza ubu inzu za nyakatsi ahantu zisigaye mu Rwanda\ncgangwa muri Afurika ntago zituwemo na Abaturage ahubwo zahinduwe\ninzu ndangamurage zibyo bihugu\nUbukerarugendo.\nInzu za nyakatsi zahinduwe amateka mu Rwanda kuko nta muturage ukizituyemo\nahubwo zabaye izaba mukerarugendo kuko zirzsurwa cyane kandi zibarizwa cyane mu ma Hotel"}
{"id": "9053", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9053", "title": "Agaseke", "text": "Agaseke.\nAgaseke mu Rwanda gafatwa nk'igikoresho cy' Umuco kuko gakoreshwa cyane kandi bagakora mu bimera bya kimeza mu Rwanda. Kakoreshwa kandi mu birori gakondo, nko kubyina cyamgwa gutanga impano. Ubundi ni igikoresho kigaragaza umuco ku bubyo iyo umuntu agiye guha umuntu yubashye impano usanga yayifunze mu gaseke. Nko mu muhango w'ubukwe bwa kinyarwanda cyangwa mu gusaba no gukwa, usanga umukazana aha nyirabukwe igiseke nk'ikimenyetso cyo kumushimira ndetse no kumwubaha, akaba aricyo apfunyikamo impano yamugeneye. Ikindi Agaseke ni ikimenyetso cy\u2019amahoro n\u2019ubumwe mu muco w\u2019u Rwanda. \nIbikoze agaseke.\nAgaseke bakaboha n'intoki bakakaboha mubyatsi byinshi bitandukanye. Muri byo harimo inshinge, imigwegwe n'ibindi...\nUbukungu.\nAgaseke ni bimwe mu bicuruzwa u Rwanda rusigaye rwohereza hanze y'igihugu, kuko gakunzwe cyane n'abanyamahanga. Abenshi bagakoresha nk'Umutako wo mu nzu, abandi bakabikamo ibintu byinshi bitandukanye.\nAkamaro.\nAgaseke gakoreshwa ibintu byinshi bitandukanye bitewe n'ugatunze. Nko mu Rwanda gafatwa nk'Umuco kuko bagaturamo umuntu iyo bamusuye, bakabikamo ibyo kurya bitegura gutunganya nk'inyanya, ibishyimbo, ibitunduru, amasaka n'ibindi\nIbidukikije.\nMu Rwanda bahinga ibihingwa byinshi bitandukanye, ariko sibyo byonyine bifitiye abaturage akamaro Nk'uko tubizi ntabwo ibimera byose ari uko babihinga mu Rwanda, hari ibimera byinshi byimeza kandi bikagira akamaro. Muri byo harimo ibimera bizwi nk'imigwegwe akaba ari ibimera bikora ibintu byinshi, muri byo hakaba harimo nko kuboha uduseke twamamaye mu Rwanda ndetse no hanze yarwo kubera ubwiza n'umwihariko watwo. Si uduseke gusa hari kandi n'imisambi bicaraho, ndetse n'indi mitako itandukanye ibohwa mu byatsi byimeza tuzi nk'imigano."}
{"id": "9054", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9054", "title": "Ibijumba", "text": "Ibijumba.\nmu Rwanda hamwe n'ibindi bihugu byo muri Afurika bihinga ibijumba ndetse n'ibindi byinshi bitandukanye\nibijumba nibimwe mubiribwa abanyarwanda benshi batunzwe nabyo\nInkomoko.\nIbijumba ni igihingwa cyakomotse muri Amerika y Amajyepfo byageze i Burayi bijyanywe n\u2019Abanya-Portugal ndetse n\u2019Abanya-Espagne, nyuma bigera muri Aziya no muri Afurika bizanywe n\u2019Abanyaburayi.\nibijumba kandi bigira vitamine ukandi bitera imbaraga\nAkamaro.\nibijumba bitera imbaraga mumubiri w'umuntu kandi bizwiho kurinda indwara zitandukanye ibijumba byose akamaro nikamwe mumubiri nubwo biba bifite amabara atandukanye\nUbwoko.\nibijumba bigira amabara atandukanye haba imbere cyangwa inyuma ku ishishwa hari ibisa umutuku, umuhondo, igitaka nandi mensi atandukanye"}
{"id": "9055", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9055", "title": "Gusogonera", "text": "Gusogongera.\ngusogongera ni umuco mu Rwanda bakora iyo hari ahantu habaye ubukwe\ncyangwa ibindi birori birimo imibatizo nibindi\nAkamaro.\nnko muri ibibihe gusogongera inzoga munganda zimwe nazimwe zibikora ni Akazi umuntu ahemberwa\nkandi akaba yarabyigiye ndetse akaba anabifitemo uburambe ntago wakora akazi ko gusogongera\ninzoga utazinywa\nAgashya.\ngusogongera bisaba umuntu uba azwi nk umusinzi koko kuburyo agomba kuba azi amoko\nmenshi atandakunye y inzoga"}
{"id": "9056", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9056", "title": "Kwahira", "text": "Kwahira.\nmu Rwanda hari umuco wo kwahira ubwatsi bwa amatungo gusa si mu Rwanda gusa \nhari nibindi bihugu byo muri Africa ndetse no kwi isi yose bagifite umuco wo kwa Hira\nAkamaro.\nkwahira bifite akamaro gakomeye kuko bitunga amatungo ndetse bigakora nibindi\nbikorwa bitandukanye\nUmusaruro.\nkwahira bituma inka itanga umukamo uhagije kandi bigatanga ni ifumbire rikoreshwa\nmubuhinzi"}
{"id": "9057", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9057", "title": "Kuragira", "text": "Kuragira.\nKuragira mu rwanda ni umuco ukorwa nabagabo nabana babahungu kuragira kandi\nbikorerwa ahantu heze ubwatsi bwinshi bitewe namatungo uragiye\nAkamaro.\nKuragira bitanga umusaruro kandi byorohereza ba nyiramatungo kuko bituma Inka \nzibona ibizitunga bitabagoye kandi amatungo yabo agatanga umukamo uhagije\nkuko Inka ziba zabonye ibizitunga"}
