{"id": "9189", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9189", "title": "Yoland Makolo", "text": "Yoland Makolo.\nkuwa 30 Nyakanga 2021nibwo ibiro bya Minisitiri wintebe byatangaje k Yoland Makolo\nyagizwe umuvugizi wa Guverinoma muri minisiteri yububanyi namahanga nubutwererane\nAmateka.\nYoland Makolo yavukiye muri kongo papa we umubyara akaba ari umu kongoman wo mubwoko\nbwa Luba mugace bita Kassai na Nyina wu umunyarwandakazi\nAgashya.\nYoland Makolo ni umuvandimwe wa Yvonne Makolo uyoboye ikigo gikomeye\nmu Rwanda kizwi nka Rwandair\nYolande Makolo kandi ni inshuti cyane yahafi na nyakubahwa Madamu Jeannette Kagame\numufasha wa Perezida wu Rwanda\nMbereyaho.\nYolande makolo yari asanzwe akora mubiro byu Umukuru w'Igihugu yari\nashinzwe gukurikirana ibyerekeranye n' itangazamakuru ndetse n'itumanaho"}
{"id": "9190", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9190", "title": "Uzamberumwana Pacifique", "text": "Uzamberumwana pacifique uzwi nka Oda Paccy (yavutse 06 werurwe 1990), ni umunyarwandakazi w'umuhanzi wamenyekanye mu njyana ya hiphop. muri 2019 yashinze kandi ayobora Ladies Empire Records ikoreramo producer Junior multisystem. afite ibihembo 2 bya salax award \nUbuzima bwe muri make.\nPaccy yavukiye i Kigali mu Gatsata, avuka ari umwana wa mbere mu muryango w'abana 2, yize amashuri abanza mu Gatsata, ayisumbuye ayiga Ecole Secondaire Bulinga i Muhanga, APEM Ruli i Gakenke na EAV Bigogwe i Rubavu. Paccy yagize ati nari nikumbuwe cyane hari hashize igihe kinini ntaboneka, Rero Ku i tariki 9 Kamena 2023, ni bwo Oda Paccy kimwe na bagenzi be ba banyeshuri biganaga muri UTB kaminuza y'ubukerarugendo, bahawe Impamyabumenyi z\u2019Icyiciro cya Kabiri mu Ishami rya Business Information Technology. Ni umuhango w'abereye mu birori byabereye mu Karere ka Rubavu mu intara y'iburengerazuba bwu Rwanda, Ni icyiciro cya masomo asoje uyu muhanzikazi arangije aho nyuma y\u2019imyaka igera ku 10 ubwo yari yarasubitse amasomo yiwe, hari Mu mwaka wa 2013 ukaba yaraje kuyasubukura muri mu mwaka wa 2021. rero ni urugendo rwari nki ntambara igoye cyanegutsinda, ariko ndi hano kandi ni iby\u2019agaciro kongera kkuboneka, ngarutse mu rugo kuko mbikwiye rwose. Uyu muririmyikazi ni nyuma y\u2019iminsi uyu muraperikazi atangaje ko agiye kugaruka nanone muri muziki, kandi ko abantu bakwiye nanone kongera kwitegura imiziki iryoheye amatwi nk\u2019uko nanone twabibamenyereje. \nindirimbo za Paccy.\n-Mbese Nzapfa\n-Umunsi umwe\n-boom boom\n-Miss President\n-amaganya\n-Ninde\n-G.O.L\n-Gangster Love\n-music\n-Biteye Ubwoba\n-Uwo ninde\n-Ndi Uwawe\n-Nyitaho\n-miss president part two"}
{"id": "9191", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9191", "title": "Inkuyu", "text": "Inkuyu.\nubusanzwe inkuyu ni ibyatsi byimeza bisanzwe ariko mu Rwanda bigahabwa agaciro \ngakomeye kubera akamaro bikora ku Inka.\nAkamaro.\nInkuyu ni ubwatsi buzwiho guhanagura inka mu Rwanda mu rwego rwo kuyigirira isuku\nno kurwanya ibirondwe nkudukoko duto wagereranya nibiheri dukunda kwibasira Inka\nzidafite isuku. buri gihugu gifite uko gisukura inka ariko mu Rwanda ho nuko tubigenza.\nUmuco.\nburi gihugu kigira agaciro giha umuco wacyo ariko mu Rwanda umwihariko w' umuco wacu \nushingiye ahanini ku nka gusa si ku nka gusa ahubwo nuko ariyo matungo yonyine afite\namabwiriza yihariye no kuyica bifatwa nko kwica umuco"}
