{"id": "9198", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9198", "title": "Emmanuel Mugisha", "text": "Emmanuel Mugisha, uzwi nka Clapton Kibonke cyangwa Clapton Kibonge, ni umukinnyi wa filime n'umunyarwenya wo mu Rwanda. Azwi cyane muri filime y'uruhererekane \"Seburikoko\". Aririmba kandi indirimbo zihimbaza Imana.\nMu 2023, Mugisha yatsindiye igihembo cy'umukinnyi w'umugabo mwiza muri Rwanda International Movie Awards.\nUbuzima.\nUmwuga.\nMu 2016, Mugisha yari umunyarwenya n'umukinnyi wa filime. Yari amaze gukina muri filime nyinshi z'uruhererekane, harimo \"Seburikoko\". Yamenyekanye kandi mu bikorwa byo gusetsa, cyane cyane ari kumwe na Day Makers. Mugisha ni n'umuhanzi uririmba indirimbo zihimbaza Imana.\nMu 2020, mu gihe cya Guma mu Rugo, Mugisha yanditse filime yise \"Umuturanyi\". Iyi filime ivanga urukundo no gusetsa. Yayishyize ku rubuga rwe rwa YouTube. Mu 2021, Mugisha yavuze ko atavuye mu gusetsa. Yavuze ko asigaye asetsa abantu binyuze muri filime.\nMuri Werurwe 2023, Mugisha yari mu bakinnyi b'abagabo bahataniraga ibihembo bya Rwanda International Movie Awards, kubera filime \"Umuturanyi\". Ku ya 1 Mata 2023, yatsindiye igihembo cy'umukinnyi w'umugabo mwiza (\"Best Actor\").\nMu 2025, Mugisha yamuritse filime ye nshya yitwa \"Deceiver\".\nUbuzima bwite.\nKu ya 18 Ukwakira 2018, Mugisha yasezeranye imbere y'amategeko na Umutoni Jacqueline. Umuhango wabereye mu Murenge wa Niboye, mu Akarere ka Kicukiro."}
{"id": "9199", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9199", "title": "Vanessa Raissa Uwase", "text": "Vanessa Raissa Uwase n'umukobwa w'umushoramari ufite iduka rikomeye mu Rwanda ritwa Hermajesty Vanessa ricuruza ibikoresho byongera ubwiza mu mujyi wa kigali bimwe bakunda kwita cosmetics.\nAmateka.\nYavutse tariki 5 zukwa 1992, avukira i kigali mu murwa mukuru w' U Rwanda. Mu mwaka wa 2015 Vanessa yagiye mu bakobwa bahatanira i kamba rya miss Rwanda. Muri aya marushanywa akaba yarabaye igisonga cya mbere cya miss Rwanda muri 2015. Vanessa ntago yagiye mu marushanywa y' ubwiza gusa ahubwo yabayeho n'umunyamakuru.\nMuri Bucuruzi.\nUmunyamideri ukunzwe cyane ndetse ku kazina ka miss Vanessa yakunze kugaragara cya mu bucuruzu butandukanye, ndetse benshi bahamya ko uyu mukobwa anabushoboye. yabanje gufungura akabari gacuruza inzoga na resitora(Bar&amp; Resto), yakoze ibiganira bigendage no guteka muburyo buri professional ku mbuga nkoranya mbaga harimo na youtube ndetse ubu asigaye akora ibikoresho byongera ubwiza ndetse bigatuma abadamu bagira uruhu rwiza.\n1. Akabari gacuruza inzoga na resitora..\nMu mwaka wa 2019 nibwa miss Vanessa yafunguye akabari ndetse gafite na resitora kazwi kwizina rya V house cyatangiye ari V cofee mu mugi wa kigali i gikondo, Vanessa atangira uyu mushinga yavuze ko yafashe icyemezo cyo gutangira kwicururiza mu rwego rwo kwihangira imirimo nk'umunyarwandakazi ushaka imbere he heza. byatangiye ari V cofee shop nyuma biza kwaguka biba V house, akaba yaraje no gushyiraho akarusho kuko ibicuruzwa bye byageraga kubantu bose muri kigali biciye muri Jumia food.\n2. Ibiganiro bigendanye no guteka..\nMuri 2020 igihe isi yose yarimo ihangana nicyorezo cya korona virus, miss Vanessa ntago yicaye ahubwo yatangiye ibiganiro byo kwigisha bantu guteka binyuze kuri youtube mugihe cya guma murugo. Uyu mukobwa kandi akaba azwiho gukunda no kumenya guteka cyane bikaba ari kimwe mubyatumye abikora nkumushinga. \n3. Ibikoresho byongera ubwiza.\nMuri 2021 nibwo miss Vanessa yazanye agashya ko gushyira ibikoresho byongera ubwiza hanze, we ubwe ndetse nabakoresheje ibyo bikoresho bavuga ko ari qualite yambere ndetse ko bifasha cyane abantu bahuye nibibazo byuruhu mubuzima bwabo. Mu bikoresho bya miss Vanessa harimo puderi zo kwisiga mumaso, ibyo kwisiga ku munywa ndetse niibyo kwisiga ku maso. Sibyo gusa ahubwo Miss Vanessa afite nibindi bikoresho bigendanye n'amaherena, udushene two mwijosi ndetse n' amasaha ndetse n'impeta.\nIbindi wareba.\n.https://www.celebsagewiki.com/vanessa-raissa-uwase\n.https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=M8ZbHVwGmlk"}
{"id": "9200", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9200", "title": "Mackenzies Rwanda", "text": "Mackenzies Rwanda ni itsinda rigizwe n'abakobwa batanu(5) b'abanyarwanda aribo Naomie Nishimwe(Miss Rwanda 2020), Uwase Kathia Kamali, Brenda Iradukunda, Kelly Uwineza na Uwase Pamella Loana. Iri tsinda rizwi nk'irigizwe n'abakobwa beza kuko rwavuyemo miss Rwanda 2020, kumurika no gucuruza Imyenda. Ubu Mackenzies bafite iduka rikora rikanacuruza imyenda rizwi nka Zoi Design Rwanda\nIbitangaje kuri Mackenzies.\nBa Mackenzies uko ari abakobwa 5 bafitanye isano kuko Naomie Nishimwe,Uwase Kathia Kamali na Brenda Iradukunda baravukana naho Kelly Uwineza akaba nyirasenge wabo maze Uwase Pamella Loana akaba mubyara wabo."}
{"id": "9201", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9201", "title": "Sonia mugabo", "text": "Sonia Mugabo ni Umunyarwanda kazi wihangiye imirimo akaba umunyamideri ndetse akaba numwe mu bagore babikora nk'umwuga mu Rwanda. Niwe washinze ikigo Sonia Mugabo akaba akibereye n'umuyobozi mukuru ndetse n'umuhanzi w'imideri\".\"\nAmateka.\nSonia Mugabo yavutse tariki 5 zukwa gatanu 1990 avukira I kigali. Muri genocide yo 1994 yabaye afite imyaka ine, aho yaje guhura nihungabana ryinshi nyuma yo kurokokera mu kigo cy'imfubyi cya Gisimba n'umuryango we mugari muri jenocide yakorewe abatutsi. Akaba yarize amashuri yisumbuye muri greenhills academy, aza gukomereza amashuri ye muri buena vista university mu gihugu cya leta zunze ubumwe za america, akaba yarize ibigendanye n'itumanaho n'imideri (communication and design).\nRwiyemezamirimo.\nSonia Mugabo ni umunyarwandakazi uzwiho cyane guhanga imideri, akaba yaranashinze ikigo gikomeye akitirira izina rye kuva muri 2011. Ikigo cya sonia Mugabo cy'itabiriye amarushanywa menshi yo kumurika imideri ndetse bikaba byaramuhaye namahirwe yo kuba ku rutonde rwakozwe na forbes magazin ikinyamakuru cyo muri leta zunze ubumwe za america kigaragaza abagore mirongo itatu babashoramari mu bigendanye n'imideri bakomeye muri america.\nSonia Mugabo w'umunyamideri ukomeye azwiho gukora imideri ndetse no kuyimurika akora imyenda yabadamu ndetse nabagabo myiza kandi igaragaza cyane umuco wacu muri Africa ndetse no kwikwiza mu muco nyarwanda, abifuza iyo myenda kandi bashobora kuyitumiza aho baba bari hose murwanda ndetse no mumahanga biciye ku mbuga nkoranya mbaga, sibyo gusa ahubwo Sonia yanashinze ihuriro ryabamurika imideri ye akorana nabo ndetse bagashobora no kwiteza imbere\nIbindi wareba.\nIduka rya Sonia Mugabo muri Marriot Hotel \nSonia Mugabo design official wesbsite"}
{"id": "9202", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9202", "title": "Carole Karemera", "text": "Carole Umulinga Karemera ni umunyarwandakazi wavutse 1975 n'umukinnyi wa filimi umubyinnyi, umucuranzi w'inanga gakondo ya saxofone ndetse akaba n'umwanditsi. Karemera yashinze ikigo k'imyidagaduro ndetse akaba akibereye n'umuyobozi Ishyo Art Center.\nAmateka.\nUmilinga yavutse mu 1975 i Buruseli mu bubirigi, n'umukobwa w\u2019abanyarwanda bari mu buhungiro. Akiri umwana, Karemara yari umuhanga mu mibare kandi arota gufungura ubucuruzi bw'ihariye bwo gukora imigati. Karemera yize muri National Conservatory of Theatre and Dance i Buruseli. ninaho yarangirije amashuri ye ya kaminuza mu 1994, ise,yari umunyamakuru, yasubiye mu Bubiligi biturutse kuri Jenoside yo yakorewe abatutsi yabereye mu Rwanda. Karemera yavumbuye u Rwanda kuri moto mu 1996. Yakinnye mu makinamico menshi, nka The Trojan Women by Euripides, Umugore w'umuzimu ya Kay Adshead, na Anathema, mbere yo gutangira umwuga we wa film. Hagati ya 2000 na 2004, yagize uruhare runini mu Rwanda muruganda rwa sinema. \nUmukinnyi wa filime.\nMu 2005, Karemara yakinnye nka Jeanne muri filime ya Raoul Peck \"Rimwe na rimwe muri Mata\", ivuga kuri jenoside yabereye mu Rwanda. Muri uwo mwaka, yahisemo gutura i Kigali. Amaze kwimukira mu gihugu, Karemara yagize uruhare mu mishinga y\u2019umuco, harimo no gukina amakinamico mu tubari no mu mihanda yo mu mijyi y\u2019u Rwanda, kugira ngo amateka rusange akomeze amenyekane kandi asigasirwe. Afatanije na C\u00e9cilia Kankonda, yashyizeho \"katedrali yumvikana\" yaririmbwe mu majwi yo kwibukwa aho abitabiriye amahugurwa bashoboraga kuvuga ibyo bibuka ku Rwanda mbere ya 1994. \nIshyo Art Center.\nMu 2006, Karemara n'abandi bagore barindwi bashinze ikigo cy\u2019ubuhanzi cya Ishyo i Kigali kugira ngo bashyigikire umuco mu murwa mukuru, utari ufite ikinamico kugeza icyo gihe. Karemera niwe muyobozi mukuru wiki kigo gifite byinshi mu guteza imbere umuco harimo ibitabo, kwiga kuyina, gukina ikinamico ndetse nibindi.\nKaremara yakinnye nka Beatrice muri film ya \"Juju Uruganda\" 2007. Yabonye igihembo cyumukinnyi witwaye neza muri Festival Sinema Africano mu Butaliyani. Yanditse ikinamico \"Chez l'habitant\", ivuga ku byabaye ku bagore i Buruseli, Kigali na Sevran. \nKaremara yabaye umunyamabanga wungirije w\u2019urusobe rwa Arterial, ndetse n\u2019uhagarariye umuryango wa Arterial Network mu Rwanda. Yakinnye mu mukino wa \"Battlefield wa\" Peter Brook mu 2016, ashingiye kuri \"Mahabharata\". Muri 2018, yahawe igihembo muri Les Journ\u00e9es th\u00e9\u00e2trales de Carthage, yishimira ibikorwa bye mu ikinamico mu Rwanda. "}
{"id": "9203", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9203", "title": "Ariel Uwayezu", "text": "Uwayezu Ariel (azwi muri muzika nka Ariel wayz) ni umuhanzikazi w'umunyarwanda wavukiye mu karere ka RUBAVU, mu ntara y 'Uburengerazuba,akaba ari umwana wa gatanu mu muryango w'abantu umunani.\nAriel Wayz ntakidasanzwe kubona yarakuze akunda umuziki kuko yakuze nyina akunda kuririmba muri orukesiteri (orchester) yitwa INGERI mu imyaka ya 1990. Mu gihe abandi banyeshuri bibandaga mu gukurikirana ayandi masomo asanzwe, weyibanze gusa mu muziki aba aribyo akurikirana nk'umwuga kuko nizo zari inzozi ze.\nIntangiriro y'urugendo rwe.\nUwayezu Ariel ni umwe mubari bagize itsinda ryari rikomeye mu muziki nyarwanda ryitwa symphony ryari rigizwe n'abanyeshuri barangije kwiga umuzika ku Nyundo. Uwayezu Ariel ubu afite imyaka 22 gusa ni umukobwa ukiri muto afatwa nkumwe mubahanzikazi bazamuka vuba mu Rwanda rufite.\nAmashuri Yize.\nUwayezu Ariel yize umuziki mu mashuri makuru(secondary) mu ishuri ryigisha umuziki n'ubuvanganzo rya Nyundo akaba abafite Advanced certificate (A Level) muri muzika.\nInkuru ye y'urukundo.\nUwayezu Ariel yaje gukundana n'umuhanzi mugenzi we uzwi ku izina rya Juno Kizigenza.\nByaravuzwe cyane kuko bose bari ibyamamare muri muzika, aho haje gushira amezi atandatu bakundana. \nAriel yasohoye indirimdo ye ari kumwe n'umukunzi we yitwa Away byatumye abona ikiraka cyo kuririmba mu mikino ya basiketi. Gusa ntabwo byakomeje kumuhira kuko uwo yitaga umukunzi we yaje ku mutenguha. "}
{"id": "9204", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9204", "title": "Mutesi Jolly", "text": "Mutesi Jolly yavutse taliki 15 Ugushyingo 1996, akaba yarize amashuri ye y'incuke n'abanza mu gihugu cya Uganda akaba ari naho yavukiye. umwaka wa gatandatu we w'amashuri abanza yawize mu Rwanda ku kigo cya Remera Academy ya mbere. \nMutesi jolly Nyampinga w'u Rwanda wa gatanu.\nMutesi jolly ni umwe mu bakobwa batangiye guhagararira u Rwanda mu marushanwa y'ubwiza. kurwego mpuzamahanga, ndetse no mu bindi bintu byinshi bitandukanye mu gihugu nyuma yaho atorewe kuba nyampinga w'u Rwanda wa gatanu nyuma ya Genocide yakorewe Abatutsi 1994 mu Rwanda, akaba yarambitswe ikamba taliki 27 Gashyantare 2016.\nIbikorwa yakoze.\nYakiriwe na ambasaderi w'u Rwanda Gen.Maj Charles Karamba muri Tanzaniya ubwo yaragiye gutegura umushinga we w'irushanwa ry'ubwiza rya miss East Africa. \nAkarusho.\nMutesi Jolly wambaye ikamba ry'ubwiza nk'umukobwa wahize abandi mu bwiza umuco ndetse n'ubwenge umwe muri ba nyampinga bazwiho kugira ibitekerezo cyane kandi bakabishyira mu bikorwa niwe kandi wagaruye irushanwa rya Miss East Africa ritaherukaga gututumba akaba yarashyizemo imbaraga uko ashoboye kandi byatanze umusaruro kuko ryaje kwegukanwa n'umunyarwandakazi Shanitah muri 2021. Ibyo birori byakataraboneka byabereye mu gihugu cy'abaturanyi cya Tanzaniya ahitwa Milimani cityhall "}
{"id": "9205", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9205", "title": "Assia Mutoni", "text": "Assia Mutoni ni Umunyarwandazi wavutse 14, Nyakanga 1993, wamenyekanye nka Rosine muri filimi yakunzwe cyane \"Intare y'ingore\", Ni umwanditsi akaba n'umukinnyi wa filimi nyarwanda guhera muri 2012. ubu amaze gutsindira ibihembo inshuro 8 bitangwa nabahemba abakinnyi ba filimi bitwaye neza, zimwe muri filimi amaze gukinamo ni City Maid, Intare y'Ingore, Seburikoko, Impeta Yanjye, Giramata nizindi.\nUbuzima bwa Assia muri make.\nAssia yavukiye i Nyamagabe gusa iwabo bimukira I Kigali afite umwaka umwe gusa, amashuri abanza yayize kuri Remera Catholic primary school, ayisumbuye ayiga Lycee de Nyanza na RHC Gasogi aharangiza muri 2012,Kaminuza ayiga muri UTB mu bijyanye n'Ubukerarugendo aharangiza muri 2016. Yatangiye gukina filimi muri 2012, filimi yahereyeho harimo Rwema, Ntundekure ariko iyatumye amenyekana ni Intare y'Ingore muri 2015 aho yatumye atwara igihembo cy'umukinnyi w'umukobwa watowe nabantu benshi muri 2016. Muri 2021 akaba yaratoranyijwe mubakinnyi bazitabira iserukiramuco Silicon Valley African Film festival ribera muri Amerika.."}
{"id": "9206", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9206", "title": "Willy Ndahiro", "text": "Willy Ndahiro ni umunyarwanda wavukiye i bujumbura, mu Burundi iya 1, mata 1976, yamenyekanye nka Paul muri filimi nyarwanda yakunzwe cyane \"Ikigeragezo cy' ubuzima\", Ni umuyobozi ndetse n'umukinnyi wa filimi nyarwanda kuva 2006. Byatumye aba umuyobozi wa komite ishinze abakinnyi bamafilimi mu Rwanda mu mwaka wa 2014-2015, ubu akaba ari umuyobozi w'urugaga nyarwanda rureberera abakora umwuga wa Cinema mu Rwanda (Rwanda Film Federation).. Zimwe muri filimi yayoboye akanakinamo ni \"Ay'urukundo\",\" Kanyarwanda\",\"Anitha\" na \"Ikigeragezo cy'ubuzima\".\nUbuzima bwa Willy muri make.\nWilly Ndahiro yavukiye mu Burundi muri 1976, muri 1993 yaje mu Rwanda yinjira mu gisirikare cya Rwanda Patriotic Army (APR) afatanya n'abandi guhagarika jenocide yakorewe abatutsi muri 1994, nyuma yakomereje akazi mu ngabo zirinda perezida kugeza 2004. Willy avuye mu gisirikare yasubiye kwiga mu gihugu cy'u Burundi aho yari yaracirkirije amashuri ye arangiriza mu bijyanye n'indimi(Lettreture), muri 2006 nibwo yatangiye inzira yo gukina filimi atangirira kuri filimi yahise ituma amenyekana \"Ikigeragezo cy'ubuzima\", muri 2010 yayoboye ndetse akina muyindi filimi yakunzwe cyane \"Ay'urukundo\". Willy kandi yagiye ashinga studio zitunganya amafilimi harimo iyakoze filmi nyinshi yitwa\"Vision Production Ltd\" Willy NDAHIRO ubu ni umuyobozi wa Rwanda Film Federation,rukaba ari urugaga nyarwanda ruhuza abakora umwuga wa Cinema mu Rwanda."}
{"id": "9207", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9207", "title": "Ndjoli Kayitankore", "text": "Ndjol ni Umunyarwanda wavukiye muri kongo iya 23, Ugushyingo 1962 i Goma. Wamenyekanye cyane mu gukina filimi zo gusetsa mu Rwanda nka Kanyombya kuko yatangiye kuzikina 2001.byatumye amenyekana cyane kuko afatwa nkumwe mubantu bifatizo muri filimi zo gusetsa mu Rwanda. Yakinnye harimo \"Bwenjye naguhenze,\"Buhahara\",\"abatubuzi\",\"ibikuruka\", \"nyabingi\" nizindi.\nubuzima bwa Kanyombya muri make.\nKanyombya yavutse kuri mama we Gaudence Mukandutiye na papa we Jean Baptiste Sakumi, avukira mu muryango w'abana 7 gusa hasigaye 5. Yize amashuri abanza kuri ecole primaire ste Andre i Goma, akomereza ayisumbuye muri Tuugane Institute ahava muri 1992 ahita ajya mu gisirikare yaje kuvamo muri 2002. Mu gisirikare yarwaniye mu ngabo za RPA zafashe igihugu muri 1994, Avuye mugisirikare nibwo yatangiye gukina filimi kugeza nanubu ntiyigeze ahagarara. Kanyombya ubu afite umugore babanaga nuko baza gusezerana imbere y'amategeko muri 2012 kandi bafitanye abana 2 ndetse n'abandi barera. Kanyombya avugako impano yo gusetsa yayikuye ku muryango we kuko ngo bose abazi basetsa haba abavandimwe n'ababyeyi be."}
{"id": "9208", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9208", "title": "Jeannette Bahavu", "text": "Jeannette Bahavu (amazina yose: Usanase Bahavu Jeannette) ni umukinnyi wa filime wo mu Rwanda. Azwi ku ruhare rwa Diane muri filime y'uruhererekane \"City Maid\". Azwi kandi muri filime y'uruhererekane \"Impanga\".\nMu 2023, Bahavu yatsindiye igihembo cy'umukinnyi ukunzwe cyane muri Rwanda International Movie Awards.\nUbuzima.\nUmwuga.\nMu 2018, Bahavu yakinaga muri filime y'uruhererekane \"City Maid\". Iyi filime yacaga kuri Televiziyo y'u Rwanda (TVR). Bahavu yakinaga uruhare rwa Diane, mushiki wa Nick. Yakinnye kandi muri filime \"Umuziranenge\". Yagaragaye no mu mashusho y'indirimbo \"Ku ndunduro\" ya Social Mula.\nMu 2018 kandi, Bahavu yatangiye gukora itangazamakuru kuri Authentic TV. Yayoboraga ikiganiro \"Christian Celebrity Show\". Iki kiganiro cyacaga buri wa Gatandatu.\nNyuma, Bahavu yamenyekanye muri filime y'uruhererekane \"Impanga\".\nKu ya 1 Mata 2023, Bahavu yatsindiye igihembo cy'umukinnyi ukunzwe cyane (\"People's Choice\") muri Rwanda International Movie Awards. Ibi bihembo bitegurwa na Ishusho Arts, iyobowe na Jackson Mucyo. Igihembo cyari imodoka. Iyi modoka yatinze gutangwa. Bahavu yayihawe ku ya 16 Gicurasi 2023.\nUbuzima bwite.\nBahavu n'umugabo we Ndayirukiye Fleury bamenyanye mu 2015. Batangiye gukundana mu 2016. Basezeranye imbere y'amategeko ku ya 17 Ukuboza 2020. Ubukwe bwabo bwabaye ku ya 27 Werurwe 2021. Ndayirukiye Fleury ni we ureberera umwuga wa Bahavu."}
{"id": "9209", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9209", "title": "Filimi ya Seburikoko", "text": "Seburikoko ni Urukurikirane rw'urwenya rwo mu Rwanda rwakozwe na Misago Nelly Wilson abikora binyuze muri, Afrifame ltd. Ikiganiro cy'iminota 15 kinyura kuri Televiziyo y'u Rwanda (RTV) buri wa mbere no ku wa kane saa kumi n'ebyiri na mirongo ine n'itanu (4h45 PM GMT) guhera muri Werurwe 2015. Uruhererekane ruzaba rugizwe n'ibihe 4 byanditswe na Mutiganda Wa Nkunda hamwe na 'Rurema Misago Nelly Wilson' kandi bikayoborwa na Jones Kennedy Mazimpaka hamwe na samples studios. Irimo itsinda ryitsinda rigizwe n'umunyarwanda wamamaye wumunyarwenya Gratien Niyitegeka nk'umuntu w'icyubahiro Seburikoko, Antoinette Uwamahoro nkumugore we Siperansiya, Erneste Kalisa, Ngabo Leo, Mediatrice ya Muhutukazi (uzwi cyane kubera uruhare muri radio yisabune yo mu Rwanda yitwa Kankwanzi)), n'abandsi benshi. \nSeburikoko yabaye porogaramu ikunzwe cyane kuri Televiziyo y'u Rwanda kandi mu mpera za sizoni 4 muri Werurwe 2016, televiziyo yategetse izindi sizoni 4 zizakomeza muri Werurwe 2017.\nIbihembo.\nKu nshuro ya 5 ya Rwanda Movie Awards, Urukurikirane rwa TV rwatsindiye ibihembo 8 birimo Urukurikirane rwiza rwa TV, Umuyobozi mwiza, Umukinnyi wa mbere witwaye neza ndetse n\u2019umukinnyi wa filime maze akomeza gutsindira 4 kuri serivise nziza za TV, umuyobozi mwiza, umukinnyi wa cinemateri mwiza na injeniyeri mwiza.\nInyandiko.\nSEBURIKOKO avuga inkuru y'umugabo witwa Seburikoko wiyita SEBU kubera izina yumva muri we nk'umutunzi mu baturanyi b'umudugudu w'impimbano wa Gatoto. Ntakintu akorera umuryango we kuko amara umwanya wose anywa inzoga, agurisha ibintu byo munzu yaguzwe n'umugore we Siperansiya ukora ibishoboka byose kugirango atunge umuryango.\nUmwana wabo umwe rukumbi Mutoni, batashoboye gushyira mu ishuri, yavuye i Kigali gushaka ubuzima bushya. Igihe kirageze ubwo yiyemeza gusubira mu rugo kurugamba rwo kurwanya se. Bazamuhindura?\nIbisobanuro.\nUbwoko: Urwenya, Ikinamico, filimi\nUmuremyi: Misago Nelly Wilson\nUmwanditsi (s): Mutiganda Wa Nkunda na Misago Nelly Wilson\nAbakinnyi:\nIgihugu bakomokamo:Rwanda\nUrurimi rwumwimerere: Kinyarwanda\nOya y'ibihe: 4\nUmubare w'ibice: 96\nUmusaruro.\nProducer Executif: AFRIFAME LTD, ZACU ENTERTAINMENT\nProducer: Misago Wilson (Nelly)\nMuhinduzi (s):\nSinema: Habarurema Mustafa, Udahemuka Louis\nUmuyobozi: Jones Kennedy Mazimpaka, Niyitegeka Gratien Ijwi: Sengabo Ally Tresor, Alain Gilbert\nGushiraho Kamera: Kamera imwe\nIsosiyete ikora: Amashusho ya Afrifame\nIkwirakwiza: RTV, TV ya Zacu"}
{"id": "9210", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9210", "title": "Kevine Kagirimpundu", "text": "Kevine Kagirimpundu (wavutse 1991) ni Umunyarwandakazi w\u2019umucuruzi, ni umuyobozi mukuru akaba ari nawe washinze Uzuri K&amp;Y.\nUburezi.\nAfite impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu bijyanye no guhanga no kubungabunga ibidukikije byubatswe mu 2015, yakuye muri kaminuza y'u Rwanda..Akaba yarize amashuri yisumbuye muri lucee\nUmwuga.\nUZURI K&amp;Y ni uruganda rwo mu Rwanda rufite icyicaro i Kigali mu Rwanda kandi rwanditswe muri RDB kuva muri Kamena 2013, rukora umurongo winkweto z'ufunguye. batezimbere tekinike yumwimerere yo gukora inkweto nyafurika, imiterere idasanzwe, hamwe nuburyo bwihariye bwo gutegura ibikoresho. \nIbyo Kevine avuga nyuma yokwihangira umurimo.\nUbu twafungutse mumitekereze dufite ibitekerezo byo gupima ibikorwa byacu. Gupima ubucuruzi bigomba gutegurwa kandi ntitwari dufite igitekerezo cyo kubikora mbere yuko twinjira muri mu mwuga \nIbyo wamenya kuri Uzuri.\nUZURI K&amp;Y numushinga wabaafrica bishize hamwe muguteza imbere ibidukikije no kurwanya ibyangiza ibidukikije. Yashinzwe ifite icyerekezo cyo kwerekana Afurika nkinkomoko yimyambarire irambye, uruganda rwimibereho rukora ibisubizo bifatika mugutunganya imyanda mukweto."}
{"id": "9211", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9211", "title": "Misago Nelly Wilson", "text": "Misago Wilson (wavutse 14 Ukuboza 1985), Tumuzi nka Nelly Wilson Misago, azwiho gutunganya filimi mu Rwanda. Ni Umuyobozi Mukuru w' Ikigo Zacu Entertainment, gikora nikanatunganya filime nyarwanda. \"Azwi cyane nk'umwanditsi w'uruhererekane rw'amakinamico aca kuri\" televiziyo azwi cyane nka \"Inshuti\", Seburikoko,\"City Maid, N' Indoto\". Ni umwanditsi na producer ushobora gukora muri filime gusa ubusanzwe abikora kuri televiziyo. Yakoze kandi anatunganya urukurikirane rw'ikinamico \"Ejo Si Kera\" ku bufatanye na Imbuto Foundation kuri televiziyo y'igihugu y'u Rwanda.\nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse ku ya 14 Ukuboza 1985 i Gisagara, mu Rwanda. Muri 2009, yabonye impamyabumenyi mu by'imari yakuye mu Ishuri ry\u2019Imari n\u2019amabanki, (kuri ubu izwi ku izina rya kaminuza y\u2019u Rwanda Ishuri Rikuru ry\u2019Ubucuruzi n\u2019Ubukungu: UR-CBE). \nMuri 2013 yashakanye n' umukunzi we w'igihe kinini, Hilarie Uwabimfura. Ibirori by'ubukwe byabereye i Remera -Kigali. Ni se w'abahungu babiri. Muri Mutarama 2014 umuhungu we w'imfura yavutse naho uwa kabiri avuka muri Gashyantare 2018.\nMisago ashishikajwe cyane no gutunganya film no guhanga. Akunda umuziki no kureba filime cyane cyane izitambuka kuri TV mu gihe afite akanya. Akunda gutembera nko kwishimisha no gushaka inshuti nshya.\nUmwuga.\nMuri 2009 Wilson Misago yinjiye Inyarwanda Ltd nk'umunyamakuru. Mu mwaka wa 2010, yabaye umuyobozi ushinzwe kwamamaza mu Inyarwanda Limited, ari naho yaje kuzamurwa ku mwanya w'umuyobozi. Muri 2012, yakoze nk'umunyamakuru wa radio kuri City Radio no gukora imyidagaduro n'inkuru kuri inyarwanda.com. Muri 2013, yakoze seri\" \"Ubu n'ejo\"\" itaramenyekanye. Ariko, muri 2014, Misago yakoze seri y'urwenya \"Inshuti\" yacaga kuri TV10. Urukurikirane rufatwa nkurukurikirane rwa mbere rwa TV rwakorewe mu karere. Intsinzi yayo, yatumye akora urwenya rwa \"Seburikoko\" yabaye imwe mu ma kinamico azwi cyane mu Rwanda. Urukurikirane rwanyuze kuri Televiziyo y'u Rwanda.\nHanyuma mu mpera za 2014, yahimbye kandi akora \"City Maid\", indi filimi yanyuze kuri RTV. Yamamaye cyane muri rubanda. Muri 2017, yanditse kandi ayobora Little \"Skater\". Nyuma muri uwo mwaka, yashinze isosiyete ikora amajwi n'amashusho 'Afrifame Limited', ikora ibijyanye no gutunganya filimi na serivisi zifotora. \nNiwe washinze 'ZACUTV', (VOD) yambere mu Rwanda byerekana ibiganiro bya Sinema mu Rwanda. Yashyizwe ahagaragara ku mugaragaro mu nama ya Transform Africa 2019.\nMu mwaka wa 2022 hagati, ZACU TV yaguzwe n'ikigo mpuzamahanga Canal+ Group mu rwego rwo gukomeza gutunganya ibijyanye n'amajwi n'amashusho mu Rwanda, gukungahaza isoko rya filime zikorewe mu Rwanda, gutekereza kubuhanga n'impano by'abakinnyi n'abayobora ba filime ndetse nabandi bahanzi ba filime bahazaza muri rusange. Ubu ZACU TV iboneka kuri decoderi ya Canal+ uhereye ku ifatabuguzi \"Ikaze\" kuri shene ya 99. "}
{"id": "9212", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9212", "title": "Ysolde Shimwe", "text": "Ysolde Shimwe ni umunyarwandakazi ndetse akaba n'umunyamideri wamenyekanye cyane nk'umwe mubashinze ikigo cy'ubucuri gikomeye cya Uzuri K&amp;Y ndetse akaba ari n'umuyobozi wacyo mubigenda no guhanga udushya.\nAmateka.\nYsolde Shimwe yavukiye mu 1992 mu murwa mukuru w'u Rwanda i Kigali ndetse aranahakurira yakuze akunda ibintu byose bigendanye nubugeni. Yaje kubona buruse yo kujya muri Kaminuza nkuru y\u2019u Rwanda aho yagiye kwiga ubugeni ndetse no guhanga udushya muri 2015, akaba akunda cyane ibigendanye n'ubugeni ndetse ndetse no gutanga umusanzu we ngo igihugu gishyikire amajyambere arambye.\nUbucuruzi.\nMuri 2013 Ysolde Shimwe yashinze ikigo Uzuri K&amp;Y cyibanze cyane mu gukora inkweto za made in Rwanda z'ubwoko bwinshi, bahawe ibihembo byinshi biytandukanye na RDBIkigo gishinzwe iterambere mu Rwanda ndetse na Jack ma foundation, ikigo cy'ubucuruzu cyo mubushinywa. Sibyo gusa ahubwo bakora n'amahugurwa kubantu bose babyifuza bakabigisha gukora inkweto kugirango nabo bajye kwihangira imirimo. Uzuri K&amp;Y ifite umwihariko wo gukoresha abagore benshi kandi bakabafasha no kwiteza imbere.\nIbindi wareba.\n.Uzuri K&amp;Y\n.Ikigo gishinzwe iterambere mu Rwanda\n. Kevine Kagirimpundu"}
{"id": "9213", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9213", "title": "Mutiganda Janvier", "text": "Mutiganda Janvier (wavutse ku ya 18 Ukwakira 1989), ni umukinnyi wa filime mu Rwanda wagize uruhare runini nk'umwanditsi wa sinema ndetse na producer muri filime nyinshi zica kuri televiziyo. \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse ku ya 18 Ukwakira 1989 i Kigali, mu Rwanda. \nUmwuga.\nMuri 2013, yarangije icyiciro cya kabiri cya kaminuza mu buhinzi. Icyakora yaje kwimukira mubakinnyi ba firime no gukora film kubera ishyaka rye rya sinema. Nyuma muri uwo mwaka, amashusho ye 4 yambere yerekana ibihimbano yashyizwe ku rutonde mu marushanwa ya Global Dialogues Amateka magufi yo gukora amarushanwa. Muri 2014, yanditse, atunganya kandi ayobora filime ye ya mbere ya \"Rayila\", Ninkuru yumubyeyi wataye umwana we akiyahura. Iyi filime yamamaye cyane kandi yegukana ibihembo mu birori byinshi bya firime ndetse no mu mamahanga. \nMuri 2014 kandi, yanditse sitcom izwi cyane \"Inshuti yanyuze\" kuri TV 10 mu Rwanda hagati ya 2014 na 2015. Ifatwa nkurukurikirane rwa mbere rwa TV rwakozwe mu Rwanda. Yasohotse kandi kuri YouTube kandi yakira abafana benshi. Muri 2015, Janvier yakoze nka producer kuri firime ngufi \"Ishaba\" yakozwe mu mahugurwa yo gukina amafilime yakozwe mu iserukiramuco rya sinema nyafurika rya Mashariki (MAAFF). Amashusho yerekanwe mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime kandi asohoka kuri DVD na Africalia mu rwego rwo gukusanya filime ngufi za Afurika nziza. Nyuma y'umwaka, yagiye mu mahugurwa yo kwandika filimi ya Maisha Film Lab i Kigali, aho yakoraga nk'umwanditsi kuri series zizwi cyane zisetsa \"Seburikoko zanyuze\" kuri televiziyo y'u Rwanda muri Werurwe 2015. Hagati aho, yakoraga akazi ko gutunganya filime n\u2019umunyamakuru kuva mu 2013 mu bitangazamakuru byinshi byaho. Nyuma yaje gukora firime ngufi, \"La Femme Nue\" yatoranijwe kunshuro ya 3 muri MAAFF. \nNyuma yo kuva mu mwuga w\u2019abanyamakuru mu 2016, yibanze cyane ku gukina amafilime aho yayoboye ibiganiro bya TV \"City Maid\" kuri ubu bica kuri Televiziyo y\u2019u Rwanda. Muri icyo gihe, yakoze serial ya \"Virunga School\" yerekana kuri TV. Hanyuma yanditse, akora kandi ayobora film ye ya kabiri ngufi \"Ibanga ry'umunezero\" muri 2017. Hagati aho, yashinze isosiyete yigenga itunganya firime yitwa 'IZACU'. Muri iyi sosiyete, yakoze filime ye ya mbere yise Nameless nyuma ayishyira mu mahugurwa ya Takmil ya Carthage Film Festival 2018. Muri aya mahugurwa, iyi filime yaguzwe n\u2019igihangange cya Orange Studio y\u2019Abafaransa kandi iyi filime ikaba yerekanwe bwa mbere mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Friborg mu Busuwisi. Nk'umuproducer, yakoze A Taste of our Land yatsindiye ibihembo byambere bya firime nziza muri PanAfrican Film Festival 2020 na AMAAs 2021. "}
{"id": "9215", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9215", "title": "Edouard Bamporiki", "text": "Edouard Bamporiki (yavutse Ukwakira 24, 1983) ni umuhanzi w'umunyapolitike w'umunyarwanda. Kugeza ubu afite umwanya muri guverinoma y\u2019u Rwanda nka Minisitiri ushinzwe umuco muri Minisiteri y\u2019Urubyiruko n\u2019umuco Bamporiki yabaye umukinnyi umukinnyi wa filime n'umwanditsi n'umusizi. \nUbuzima bwambere nuburere.\nBamporiki yavukiye mu karere ka Nyamasheke, Intara y'Uburengerazuba bw'u Rwanda. Yize amashuri muri ako karere. Muri 2003, igihe Bamporiki yari afite imyaka 20, yinjiye mu ikinamico episodic yacaga kuri radiyo y'igihugu. Ibi byamuhaye kwiyerekana mugihugu cyose nk'umukinnyi w'umuhanga.Afite impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu by'amategeko yakuye muri Universit\u00e9 Libre de Kigali (ULK). \nUmwuga wa politiki.\nMu 2013, Bamporiki yatorewe kuba Umudepite mu Nteko ishinga amategeko y'u Rwanda, Urugereko rwo hasi. Muri 2019, yagizwe Minisitiri muri Minisiteri y\u2019Urubyiruko n\u2019umuco na Perezida Paul Kagame.Mbere y\u2019inama y\u2019abaminisitiri, yari Perezida wa komisiyo y\u2019igihugu y'itorero ry'u Rwanda. \nUmwuga wa film.\nBamporiki n'umukinnyi wa firime. \"Long Coat\" ni imwe muri filime zizwi cyane - binyuze mu nkuru y\u2019umuntu warokotse Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994 ndetse n'umwe mu bahungu b'uwakoze icyaha, iyi filime yibanda ku gusiga amateka ye. Bamporiki yanditse, akina, ayobora kandi akora ikinamico y'iminota 63 yerekanwe bwa mbere muri 2008. Byamushirishije mu karere ndetse no ku rwego mpuzamahanga mu gumutwara igihembo cya mbere mu ireukiramuco rya filimi nyafurika ribera i newyork. \nBamporiki yari yakoze d\u00e9but ye muri \"Munyurangabo\", filime ya Lee Isaac Chung aho yatorewe kuba umukinnyi mwiza muri Cannes. Yatunganije kandi \"akina mu Rwanda: Fata Babiri\" mu 2010 hanyuma umwaka urangiye, yakinnye muri \"Kinyarwanda\", ikinamico yamateka, hamwe na Cassandra Freeman. Aheruka kugaragara kuri ecran muri 2015 ubwo yakinaga ikinamico y'urukundo \"Umutoma\". \nMuri 2017, Bamporiki yasohoye igitabo cyiswe \"Umwana wanjye, Ninkuru ndende: Ibitekerezo by'abakoze Jenoside\". Gushyira ahagaragara igitabo cyitabiriwe na madamu wa perezida w\u2019u Rwanda Jeannette Kagame. "}
{"id": "9216", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9216", "title": "Diogene Ntarindwa", "text": "Ntarindwa Diogene ni umunyarwenya uzwi ku izina nka Atome cg Gasumuni, yavukiye mu gihugu cy'u Burundi mu 1977, Atome wamenyekanye mu gukina byendagusetsa, ni Umwanditsi n'umukinnyi wa filimi, ikinamico na comedy. yamenyekanye mu ikinamico nka Gasumuni.\nAmateka ye.\nAtome yatangiye gukina ikinamico muri 1994, yabikoze cyane yiga muri kaminuza y'u Rwanda mu iishami ry'amategeko muri 1996. muri 2002 yagiye gukomeza amasomo i Liege mu Ububiligi ibijyanye na Art Dramatique naho akomeza gukina aho yagaragaye mu ma kinamico arimo Koulsy Lamko, Corpx et voix, Paroles rhizome. muri 2008 yagarutse mu Rwanda agaragara cyane akina asetsa muri forum yari yateguwe n'Imbuto Foundation Rwanda.\nAtome mu gisirikare.\nAtome mu rugamba rwo kubohora igihugu 1994 yarimo nk'umusirikare, avuga ko yakigiyemo akiri umusore muto niyompamvu urugamba rurangiye yagiye gukomeza amashuri."}
{"id": "9217", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9217", "title": "Anne Kansiime", "text": "Kansiime Kubiryaba Anne (yavutse ku ya 13 Mata 1986) kandi uzwi cyane ku izina rya Anne Kansiime, ni Umugande w'umunyarwenya, akaba n'umukinnyi wa filime. Bimwe mu bitangazamakuru byo muri Afurika byamwise \"Umwamikazi wa Afurika wo gusetsa\". \nAmavu n'amavuko.\nYavukiye i Mparo mu gake ka Rukiga y'ubu, mu burengerazuba bwa Uganda. Igihe yavukaga, Mparo yari mu gace ka Kabale. Se ni umunyamabanki uri mu kiruhuko cy'izabukuru, naho nyina ni umugore wo mu rugo. Kansiime yize amashuri abanza i Kabale. Amashuri ye yisumbuye, yize mu ishuri ry'isumbuye ry'abakobwa rya Bweranyangi i Bushenyi. Afite impamyabumenyi y'isumbuye mu buhanzi n\u2019imibereho yakuye muri kaminuza ya Makelele, kaminuza ya kera ya Uganda kandi nini muri Leta. \nUmwuga.\nl \nDukurikije ibibazo byafashwe amajwi yatanze mu 2014, Anne yatangiye gushyira kuri YouTube amashusho yerekana udukino dusetsa. Yakiriye ibitekerezo byiza kandi bimutera inkunga yo kohereza izindi videwo. Icyerekezo cye cyerekanwe kuri tv y'abaturage muri Kenya ituranye na Uganda yamuhaye umwanya wo gukora, gukina no kwerekana ikiganiro gisetsa rimwe mucyumweru. Nibwo yazanye na Don't mess with Kansiime yerekana urwenya. Kugeza mu Gushyingo 2014, umuyoboro wa YouTube umaze gukusanya abantu barenga miliyoni 15. Amashusho ye yo kuri YouTube yakira ibihumbi n'ibihumbi kandi yagaragaye kuri BBC yibanze kuri Afrika. Yakinnye mu nzu zuzuye abafana muri Blantyre, Gaborone, Kigali, Kuala Lumpur, Lagos, Lilongwe, London, Lusaka na Harare. \nAmashusho.\nIbihembo\nUbugiraneza.\nAnne Kansiime abinyujije mumuryango we utanga imfashanyo, The Kansiime Foundation, ashyigikira abana batishoboye ariko bafite umucyo mubakomeza mwishuri. Ubu afasha abana barenga 35 haba mu mashuri abanza n'ayisumbuye.\nUbucuruzi.\nAnne Kansiime nawe ari mubucuruzi bwo kwidagadura. Ayobora Kansiime Backpackers kandi iherereye ku nkombe z'ikiyaga cya Bunyonyi, ikagenzura neza ikiyaga cya Bunyonyi mu Karere ka Kabale, muri Uganda."}
{"id": "9218", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9218", "title": "100 Days (2001 film)", "text": "100 Days ni filme y'ikinamico yo muri 2001 yayobowe na Nick Hughes ikorwa na Hughes na Eric Kabera inkuru y'ino filme igaruka kuri jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu Rwanda mu 1994. Umutwe wa filime ugaragaza uburebure bw'igihe cyo kuva jenoside yatangira ku ya 7 Mata kugeza ihagaritswe hagati muri Nyakanga 1994.\nIyi filime niyo filime ya mbere yakinwe ikozwe ku mateka ya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu Rwanda mu 1994, ikaba yibanda ku buzima bw\u2019umukobwa muto w'umututsi wabaye impunzi ashakisha uko yarokora ubuzima bwe mu gihe cya Jenoside. Amashusho y'ino filme yafatiwe ahantu Jenoside yabereye mu Rwanda. \nAMASHAKIRO; "}
{"id": "9219", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9219", "title": "Eric Kabera", "text": "Eric Kabera (wavutse 1970) ni umunyamakuru w' umunyarwanda, umukinnyi wa firime akaba ari nawe washinze akaba na perezida w\u2019ikigo cya Sinema cy\u2019u Rwanda.(Rwanda Cinema Center\nibikorwa Yakoze.\nKabera ni we washinze kandi akaba na perezida w\u2019ikigo cya Sinema cy\u2019u Rwanda(Rwanda Cinema Center), umuryango ugamije guteza imbere inganda za firime mu gihugu. Kabera yabanje gushyiraho Ikigo nk'umuryango uzahugura abakora amafilime mashya ariko, kuva 2005, iki kigo cyamenyekanye cyane mugutegura iserukiramuco rya cinema ngarukamwaka. Iserukiramuco rya sinema mu Rwanda, ryiswe \"Hillywood\" kubera izina ry'u Rwanda ryiswe \"Igihugu cy'imisozi igihumbi\", ni umunsi mukuru w'ingendo. Bitewe n'icyifuzo cya Kabera cyo kwerekana amafilime ku bantu benshi bashoboka, iserukiramuco ntiribera mu murwa mukuru wa Kigali gusa ahubwo ni filime, cyane cyane izakozwe n'abakora amafilime yo mu Rwanda. Kabera yatangaje ko ibirori bizatera intambwe yo kutibanda gusa ku kibazo cya jenoside; kurusha ibindi bibazo byimibereho y'u Rwanda. "}
{"id": "9220", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9220", "title": "Sometimes in April", "text": "Sometimes in April ni filime y'akozwe n'abanyamerika muri 2005 ivuga kuri jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994 mu Rwanda, yanditswe kandi iyobowe n'umukinnyi wa filime wo muri Hayiti Raoul Peck. Abakinnyi bagize itsinda barimo Idris Elba, Oris Erhuero, Carole Karemera, na Debra Winger.\nUko yateguwe.\nBitandukanye na \"Hotel Rwanda\", yahawe igihembo cya PG-13 kandi ikaba yaravugaga mu buryo bwihishe inyuma ya jenoside aho kwerekana ku buryo bweruye, iyi filime yari izwiho kwerekana ihohoterwa rishingiye ku gitsina, ryayihaye TV-MA. Byongeye kandi, amashusho atandukanye yashyizwe mu Rwanda yafatiwe muri Kigali no hafi yayo, hagaragaramo ahantu nyaburanga nka Hotel des Mille Collines ndetse na kiliziya ya Sainte-Famille.\nFilime yabanje kwerekanwa kuri HBO. Nyuma yaje gutangazwa na PBS hanyuma isesengurwa n\u2019umunyamakuru jeff Greenfield hamwe na Paul Bonerwitz hamwe n\u2019abandi."}
{"id": "9221", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9221", "title": "Osita Iheme", "text": "Osita Iheme, (yavutse ku ya 20 Gashyantare 1982) ni umukinnyi wa fiimi muri Nigeriya. Azwi cyane mu gukina uruhare rwa Pawpaw muri filime Aki na Ukwa hamwe na Chinedu Ikedieze. Osita Iheme ni we washinze Inspired Movement Africa yashinze kugira ngo atere imbaraga, ashishikarize kandi akangure imitekerereze y'abasore bo muri Nigeriya n'Abanyafurika. Muri 2007, Iheme yahawe igihembo cya \"Lifetime Achievement Award\" muri African Movie Academy Awards. Afatwa nk'umwe mu bakinnyi bazwi cyane muri Nijeriya. Mu mwaka wa 2011, Osita Iheme yahawe igihembo cyo kuba umwe mubagize iteka rya Perezida wa Repubulica Goodluck Jonathan. \nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nOsita Iheme akomoka muri Mbaitoli, muri Leta ya Imo, muri Nijeriya. Iheme yakuriye muri Leta ya Abia kandi afite impamyabumenyi ya MBA yakuye mu Ishuri Rikuru ry'Ikoranabuhanga, Ghaziabad (IMT). Amaze kurangiza amasomo ye muri IMT, yabanje gushaka kuba umunyamategeko ariko akomeza umwuga we wo gukina filime mu 1998, abanza kugaragara mu nshingano ngufi muri filimi.\nIcyubahiro.\nMu rwego rwo guhemba uruhare rwe mu ma filime asetsa ya muri Nigeriya, mu 2011 yahawe igihembo cy\u2019igihugu cya Nigeriya cy\u2019umunyamuryango w\u2019itegeko rya Repubulika (MFR) na Perezida Goodluck Jonathan. \nIngaruka.\nFilimi ya Osita Iheme hamwe na mugenzi we Chinedu Ikedieze muri filime \"Aki na Ukwa yo\" mu 2002 kiracyavugwa cyane kandi aba bombi, cyane cyane imiterere ya Osita, bagiye bagaragara muri memes kuva mu 2019 kuri Twitter no ku mbuga nkoranyambaga. Ibi byaje kumuhesha umufana munini cyane kwisi yose. \nAmashusho yagaragayemo.\nrs (2006) "}
{"id": "9222", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9222", "title": "Chinedu Ikedieze", "text": "Chinedu Ikedieze, (yavutse 12 Ukuboza 1977) ni umukinnyi wa filimi muri Nigeriya, rwiyemezamirimo n'umushoramari udasanzwe. Azwi cyane mu gukina na Osita Iheme muri firime nyinshi nyuma yo gutera imbere nka bombi muri filime \"Aki na Ukwa\" 2002. Yagaragaye muri firime zirenga 150 mu mwuga umaze imyaka 20. Yakinnye mu ruhare rw'umwana muri filime nyinshi mu buzima bwe akiri muto kubera igihagararo ndetse n'imiterere y'umubiri. Azwi nka Aki kubera ibikorwa bye muri film \"Aki na Ukwa\". Mu 2011, yashakanye n'umuhanga mu kwerekana imideli Nneoma Nwaijah maze bombi babyarana umwana wabo wa mbere mu 2012 \nUmwuga.\nChinedu yize amashuri abanza n'ayisumbuye muri Aba, muri Leta ya Abia. Amaze kurangiza amashuri yisumbuye yakurikiranye Impamyabumenyi ihangane mu buhanzi bwa tiyatere ndetse n'impamyabumeny mu itumanaho rusange yakuye mu kigo gishinzwe imiyoborere n'ikoranabuhanga, Enugu (IMT). Amaze kurangiza amasomo ye muri IMT, yabanje gushaka kuba umunyamategeko ariko akomeza umwuga we wo gukina filime mu 1998, abanza kugaragara mu nshingano nto. Yatangiye gukina bwa mbere muri filime Evil Men 1998. Yiyandikishije mu ishuri rya Flimi rikomeye rya New York mu 2004. \nIbyo yakoranye na Osita Iheme.\nYinjiye muri Nollywood muri 2000 maze azamuka cyane muri filime \"Aki na Ukwa\" mu 2002 aho yakinnye cyane muri Aki ari kumwe n\u2019undi mukinnyi muto Osita Iheme. Aba bombi bakunze kwitwa \"Aki Paw Paw\" kuva iyi filime isohoka kandi bagaragaye hamwe muri firime nyinshi mu bakinnyi ba mbere. Chinedu na Osita bombi bakomeje kubungabunga chimie ya ecran na offscreen ishimwa cyane na Nollywood.\nIcyubahiro.\nMu 2007, Ikedieze yahawe igihembo cya \"Lifetime Achievement Award\" muri African Movie Academy Awards. Yahawe kandi icyubahiro n'Iteka rya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Repubulika ryatanzwe na Perezida wa Nijeriya icyo gihe Goodluck Jonathan kubera uruhare yagize muri Nollywood no mu kuzamura ubukungu bw'igihugu.\u00a0\nUmurage.\nImyitwarire ye hamwe nabakinnyi bato bakinnyi ba filime Osita Iheme muri film ya \"Aki na Ukwa yo\" mu 2002 iracyavugwa cyane kandi aba bombi cyane cyane imico ya Osita yagiye agaragara muri memes kuva muri 2019 kurubuga rwa Twitter ndetse nizindi mbuga nkoranyambaga ku isi. Osita yashyizwe ku rutonde rw'abakinnyi bakize muri Nijeriya. "}
{"id": "9223", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9223", "title": "Aki na Ukwa", "text": "Aki na Ukwa ni filimi yakorewe muri Nigeriya muri 2002 iyobowe na Amayo Uzo Philips. Muri filime hagaragaramo Osita Iheme na Chinedu Ikedieze. Filime yatangije umwuga wo gukinana ari abakinnyi bombi Osita na Chinedu kandi iyi film yaranze ubufatanye bwabo bwa mbere. Iyi filime yashimiwe cyane ko yafunguye ibitekerezo byiza kandi iyi filime yafashwe nka imwe muri filime nziza kurusha izindi zose muri sinema yo muri Nijeriya ahanini hagamijwe kumenyekanisha Osita Iheme na Chinedu Ikedieze mu nshingano zabo bakina abiyita ba PawPaw na Aki.. Aba bombi bahagurukiye kuba ibyamamare maze bahinduka ijuru ryose muri Nijeriya kubera imikorere yabo muri filime kuva yasohoka. Kuva icyo gihe, aba bombi bakinnye hamwe muri firime nyinshi mu nshingano zabo. Chukwuka Emelionwu wari uwatunganije iyi filime yashimiwe kuba yararemye abantu baranga \"Aki\" na \"PawPaw\". \nInyandiko.\nAbavandimwe babiri bateza akaduruvayo mu rugo rwabo, mu ishuri ryabo ndetse no mu mudugudu wabo wose. "}
{"id": "9224", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9224", "title": "Munyurangabo Filimi", "text": "Munyurangabo ni filime nyarwanda yasohotse muri 2007 iyobowe na Lee Isaac Chung. Yafatiwe amashusho yose mu Rwanda hamwe n'abakinnyi b'abanyarwanda, niyo filime yambere yerekana inkuru mu rurimi rw' iKinyarwanda. Yerekanwe bwa mbere mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Cannes 2007 ku ya 24 Gicurasi, kandi yegukana igihembo muri AFI Fest 2007. Umunyamerika Roger Ebert impuguke muri filimi yayise filimi y'igitangaza.\" \nUmusaruro.\nNk 'uko ikinyamakuru \"The New York Times\" kibitangaza ngo mbere yo gukora iyi filimi, umugore wa Lee Isaac Chung, Valerie yari yakoze urugendo mu Rwanda nk'umukorerabushake wo gukorana n\u2019abagizweho n'ingaruka na jenoside yakorewe abatutsi muri 1994, Chung yari yamuherekeje mu Rwanda yatekereje gukinira filimi muri Kigali muri 2006. Chung ahita aboneraho akanya ko kwerekana ukuri kubijyanye nuko u Rwanda rwari rumeze akoresheje abanyeshuri yari amaze iminsi yigisha gukina filimi. Chung yanditse filimi ku mpapuro icyenda abifashijwemo n'inshuti (gusa nyuma yaje gushaka abandi banditsi bamufasha kunoza neza inkuru harimo Samuel Gray Anderson. Chung yafashe amashusho ya Munyurangabo mu minsi 11, akorana n'itsinda ry'abakinnyi babanyarwanda. \nIterambere ryakurikiyeho.\nLee Isaac Chung yakomeje gufasha abo bakinanye kuburyo ubu bakora amafilimi yo mu Rwanda bikabagirira akamaro abinyujije muri Almond Tree Rwanda."}
{"id": "9225", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9225", "title": "Abouna (film)", "text": "Abouna (Arabic, English: \"Our Father\") ni filimi yo muri Chad yakinwe muri 2002,iyoborwa na Mahamat Saleh Haroun. Yafatiwe amashusho ahitwa Gaoui na N'Djamena, Tchad.\nUmugambi.\nAbahungu babiri (Tahir na Amine) babyutse mugitondo basanga se yataye umuryango wabo. Barumiwe, batangira kwitwara nabi. Mugihe bareba firime, batekereza ko babona se avugana nabo,bakiba firime kugirango babone izo kureba. Nyina wabo (Achta) amaherezo yihebye maze abohereza ku ishuri rya Koran. Ntibishimye, bateganya guhunga kugeza umuhungu w'imfura akundana n'umukobwa utumva (Khalil).\nGukina no gutanga umusaruro.\nAhidjo Mahamat Moussa wakinnye Tahir wimyaka 15, yahawe abahungu ngo ahitemo gukina murumuna we Amine. Yahavuye ahitamo Hamza Moctar Aguid wimyaka umunani kuko yumvaga ko Aguid ashobora kuba murumuna we. Nyuma ya buri munsi wo gufata amashusho, film yoherejwe ibirometero 2600 i Paris kugirango itunganyirizwe. Gusa nyuma yo gutegereza iminsi myinshi, iyo ijambo ryagarukaga rivuga ko ntakibazo, gufata amashusho byarakomezaga. \nIbihembo.\nFilime yatsindiye ibihembo bikurikira: "}
{"id": "9226", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9226", "title": "Touki Bouki", "text": "Touki Bouki,(Urugendo rwa Hyena) ni filime y'ikinamico yo muri 1973 yo muri Senegali, iyobowe na Djibril Diop Mamb\u00e9ty. Yerekanwe mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Cannes 1973 no mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya 8 rya Moscou.Iyi filime yagaruwe mu 2008 muri Cineteca di Bologna / L'Immagine Ritrovata Laboratoire na World Cinema Foundation. Yatoranijwe nka firime ya 93 ikomeye mubihe byose byakozwe na Sight and Sound Critic's Poll.\nMory, umushumba w'inka ufite charismatique utwara moto yashizwemo igihanga gifite amahembe y'inka, na Anta, umunyeshuri w\u2019umukobwa, bahurira i Dakar. Abanyamahanga kandi barambiwe ubuzima muri Senegali, barota bajya i Paris bakazana gahunda zitandukanye zo gushaka amafaranga y'urugendo. Mory yaje gutsinda kwiba amafaranga, n'imyenda myinshi, murugo rwabakire bahuje igitsina bakize mu gihe aba barimo kwiyuhagira. Anta na Mory amaherezo.barashobora kugura amatike y'ubwato bugana mubufaransa. Ariko igihe Anta yinjiye mu bwato ku cyambu cya Dakar, Mory, yiteguye ku gatsiko kari inyuma ye, yahise afatwa no kutabasha kuva mu mizi, maze ahunga asara asanga moto ye ifite amahembe y'inka, ariko abibona. yangiritse mu mpanuka yahitanye hafi uwagenderaga wari wayitwaye. Ubwato bwahagurutse hamwe na Anta ariko ntabwo ari Mory, wicaye iruhande rw'ingofero ye hasi, yitegereza moto ye yamenetse."}
{"id": "9227", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9227", "title": "Black Girl (1966 film)", "text": "Black Girl (1966) ni Filime yo muri Senegali yanditswe numwanditsi / umuyobozi Ousmane Semb\u00e8ne, yakinnye na Mbissine Th\u00e9r\u00e8se Diop. Umutwe wayo wigifaransa ni La noire de\u2026, bisobanura ngo \"Umukobwa / umugore wumwirabura wa\u2026\", cyangwa \" Iyi filime yibanze kuri Diouana, umukobwa ukiri muto wo muri Senegali, wimukiye i Dakar, muri Senegali yerekeza muri Antibes, mu Bufaransa gukorera umugabo n'umugore b'Abafaransa. Mu Bufaransa, Diouana yizeye gukomeza akazi yakoraga nk'umubyaza, kandi ateganya ubuzima bushya bw'isi. Ariko, ageze muri Antibes, Diouana ahura n\u2019umugabo n'umugore, bamuhatira gukora nk'umukozi. Agenda arushaho kumenya imiterere ye ko itandukanye atangira kwibaza ubuzima bwe mubufaransa. Bikunze gufatwa nka firime ya mbere yo munsi yubutayu bwa Sahara numukinnyi wamafirime nyafurika yitabiriwe n\u2019amahanga.Inkuru ishingiye kubintu byabayeho."}
{"id": "9228", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9228", "title": "Cairo Station", "text": "\"Cairo Station, cyangwa THE IRON GATE\" (Arabic \"B\u0101b al-\u1e24ad\u012bd\"), ni filime y\u2019akinwe muri 1958 ikinirwa mu Misiri iyobowe na Youssef Chahine. Iyi filimi yinjiye mu marushanwa mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya 8 rya Berlin. Iyi filime yatoranijwe mu Misiri nka filimi nziza y\u2019ururimi rw\u2019amahanga mu irushanwa rya 31 bya Osama. Kuva mu myaka ya za 70, iyi filimi yongeye gushimisha n'ibisekuru bishya by'abakunzi ba filimi mpuzamahanga. Insanganyamatsiko zerekanwa muri filimi zirimo itsinda ry\u2019abakozi bo mu mijyi, ihohoterwa rishingiye ku gitsina, no gukandamiza igitsina gore. \nUbusobanuro bw'amateka.\nCairo Station yatangiye bwa mbere mu 1958. Hamwe n'ihirikwa ry'ubwami bwa Misiri muri 1952, ubushobozi bwa Youssef Chahine bwo gukemura insanganya z'abakozi bo mu mijyi, ihohoterwa rishingiye ku gitsina no gukandamiza igitsina gore byari ngombwa kubigaragaza kuko byerekanaga ubuyobozi bubi. ubwo ubushobozi yari afite bwamwereraga gusunika imbibi za Sinema yo muri Misiri, ikintu ubusanzwe batashoboraga gukora kuko inganda za filimi zashyizwe mugihugu muri 1966. Mu guhimba filimi umuhanzi Chahine yagerageje kwerekana neza umuryango wa Misiri nkuko byari bimeze mu myaka ya za 1950 kandi abikora abiha Abanyamisiri ndetse n\u2019amahanga kugira ngo basobanukirwe neza imibereho ya Misiri uko yari imeze. "}
{"id": "9229", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9229", "title": "I Am Not a Witch", "text": "I Am Not a Witch ni filime yikinamico yakozwe mu 2017 ku rwego mpuzamahanga yanditswe kandi iyobowe na Rungano Nyoni muri filime ye ya mbere. Yerekanwe mu gice cy\u2019abayobozi ba Fortnight mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Cannes 2017 kandi yegukana igihembo cya BAFTA kubera igihembo cyambere cyatanzwe n\u2019umwanditsi w\u2019Umwongereza, Umuyobozi cyangwa Producer wa Nyoni hamwe na producer Emily Morgan mu bihembo bya 71 bya Filime by\u2019Abongereza. Yatoranijwe muri Filime Nziza Y\u2019ururimi rw\u2019amahanga mu bihembo bya 91 bya Academy, ariko ntabwo yatowe. \nUmusaruro.\nUmwanditsi-umuyobozi Rungano Nyoni yakuye igitekerezo mu nkuru zifatika zo gushinja abarozi muri Zambiya. Mu bushakashatsi yakoze kuri iyo filimi, yagiye muri Gana kandi amara igihe mu nkambi y\u2019abapfumu, yitegereza ubuzima bwabo bwa buri munsi n'imigenzo yabo. \nAmashimwe.\nI am not a witch yakusanyije intsinzi nyinshi hamwe naba nomination mubirori byinshi byingenzi bya firime nibihembo bya firime, harimo gutsindira ibihembo bya 71 bya British Academy Film Awards ibihembo byambere byatanzwe n'umwanditsi wumwongereza, Diregiteri cyangwa Producer hamwe nabatoranijwe 10 nabatsinze batatu muri Independent yu Bwongereza Ibihembo bya Filime 2017. Yatsindiye igihembo cya Feature Fiction mu iserukiramuco rya Filimi rya Adelayide 2017."}
{"id": "9230", "revid": "6702", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9230", "title": "District 9", "text": "District 9 ni filime y'ibikorwa bya siyanse yo mu 2009. iyobowe na Neill Blomkamp mu mashusho ye ya mbere yakinnye, yanditswe na Blomkamp na Terri Tatchell, ikorwa na Peter Jackson na Carolynne Cunningham. Ni filimi yafatiwe amashusho muri Nouvelle-Z\u00e9lande, Amerika na Afurika y\u2019Epfo. Muri iyi filime hagaragaramo Sharlto Copley, Jason Cope, na David James, kandi yakuwe muri filime ngufi ya Blomkamp yo mu 2006 \"Alive i Joburg\"."}
{"id": "9231", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9231", "title": "Waiting for Happiness", "text": "Waiting for Happiness (cyangwa: Heremakono) ni filime y'ikinamico yo muri Mauritania yakozwe muri 2002 yanditswe kandi iyobowe na Abderrahmane Sissako. abakinnyi nyamukuru ni umunyeshuri, wagarutse iwabo i Nouadhibou, umutoza w\u2019umwana, hamwe n\u2019abagore baho. Iyi filime irangwa nuruhererekane rwerekana ubuzima bwa buri munsi bw'abantu bavugwa mu mico yabo yihariye y\u2019umuco nyafurika n\u2019abarabu, mu gihe hari ibyo bakura muri tropes yigihe cya Tayeb Saleh cyo kwimukira mu majyaruguru (\u0645\u0648\u0633\u0645 \u0627\u0644\u0647\u062c\u0631\u0629 \u0625\u0644\u0649 \u0627\u0644\u0634\u0645\u0627\u0644). Abareba bagomba kwisobanurira ibyabaye nta ruhare runini rw'abavuga cyangwa umugambi, ibyinshi bikaba bigarukwaho mubindi bikorwa muri opus ya Abderrahmane Sissako, harimo amashusho kuri saro yogosha hamwe nicyumba cyamafoto, nacyo kiboneka muri \"La Vie Sur Terre\". Iyi filime irerekana ibihe bisanzwe bya Mauritania byubwiza, urugamba, kwitandukanya, no gusetsa, bibaho mumatsinda atandukanijwe muburyo butandukanye, nkabagore ba Bidhan banywa icyayi no gusebanya, abimukira bo muri Afrika yuburengerazuba banyura muri Mauritania kugirango bagere i Burayi. Umusore w'intwari wagarutse akorana naya matsinda yose nk'umuntu wo hanze, mugihe arwana no kwibuka ndetse nimvugo ye y'icyarabu ya Hassaniya, ariko ahitamo ahubwo igifaransa.. Waiting for Happiness yerekanwe bwa mbere mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Cannes 2002 mu gice cya Un Certain Regard. "}
{"id": "9232", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9232", "title": "The Battle of Algiers", "text": "The Battle of Algiers ni filimi yakinwe n'abataliyani bafatanyije n'abanyalijeliya yakinwe muri 1966 ivuga kumateka yanditswe na iyoborwa Gillo Pontecorvo na Star Jean Martin na Saadi Yacef. Ishingiye ku bikorwa byakozwe n\u2019inyeshyamba mu gihe cy\u2019intambara ya Alijeriya (1954\u20131962) kurwanya leta y\u2019Ubufaransa muri Afurika y\u2019Amajyaruguru, icyagaragaye cyane ni Intambara izwi ku izina rya Algiers, umurwa mukuru wa Alijeriya. Yafatiwe amashusho ahantu hateguwe na Roberto Rossellinimu buryo bwa newsreel style: umwirabura n'umuzungu hamwe no guhindura ubwoko bwa documentaire kugirango hongerwe kumyumvire yukuri kwamateka, hamwe nabakinnyi badafite umwuga babayeho kurugamba nyarwo. Amanota ya film yahimbwe na Ennio Morricone. Bikunze guhuzwa na cinema yo mubutaliyani. \nIyi filime yibanze cyane cyane ku barwanyi b'impinduramatwara Ali La Pointe mu myaka iri hagati ya 1954 na 1957, igihe abarwanyi b'inyeshyamba za FLN bishyira hamwe bakaguka i Casbah, umurwa mukuru wa Alijeriya. Ibikorwa byabo byahuye nabaparakomando b'Abafaransa bagerageza kugarura akarere kari karafashwe. Filime cyane ivuga kubyerekeye imitwe yitwara gisirikari hamwe nuburyo butemewe, nkiyicarubozo, byakoreshwaga nimbaraga zabakoloni. Alijeriya yashoboye kubona ubwigenge bw'Abafaransa. \nFilime yarashimiwe cyane. Imitwe yombi y'inyeshyamba hamwe n'abayobozi ba leta basanze ari ibisobanuro by'ingenzi ku ntambara yo mu mujyi. Ifite umwanya wa 48 kuri \"Filime 250 za Critics \"' \"Amajwi ya Sight &amp;amp; Sound\" 2012, ndetse n\u2019umwanya wa 120 ku \"rutonde rw\u2019ikinyamakuru Empire\" ku rutonde rwa \"Filime 500 zikomeye mu bihe byose\". Yatoranijwe kugirango yinjire kurutonde rwa \" Filime 100 zo mu Butaliyani zigomba gukizwa \". Ikibazo kijyanye na sociopolitiki, film ntabwo imaze imyaka itanu yerekanwe mubufaransa 1971. "}
{"id": "9233", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9233", "title": "The Season of Men", "text": "The Season of Men ni filime y'ikinamico yo mu 2000 y\u2019Abafaransa-Tuniziya iyobowe na Moufida Tlatli. Yerekanwe mu gice cya Un Certain Regard mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Cannes 2000. Umutwe wa filime, Igihe cy'abagabo, werekeza ukwezi kumwe kwumwaka abagabo baza ku kirwa cya Djerba. \nUmugambi.\nUmusore w'imyaka 18 ku kirwa cya Djerba, A\u00efcha, yashakanye na Said, ukora muri Tuniziya igihe kinini cy'umwaka. Mbere yuko ashobora kubana na we muri Tuniziya, Said amusaba ko yamuha umuhungu. Ku kirwa cya Djerba, A\u00efcha abaho ategekwa na nyirabukwe, hamwe n'abandi bagore bake, mu gihe abagabo babo bakorera ahandi. A\u00efcha yaje kubyara umuhungu kandi yemerewe kwimukira muri Tuniziya hamwe n'umugabo we. Ariko, umuhungu we Aziz afite ibibazo by'ubuzima, bigatuma Sa\u00efd amwanga. A\u00efcha asubira i Djerba, kuri iyi nshuro ari kumwe n'umuhungu we Aziz n'abakobwa be babiri bakuru. Iyi filime ikoresha ibintu byinshi byagaragaye hagati ya A\u00efcha n\u2019abakobwa be bato batuye i Djerba mbere y\u2019ivuka rya Aziz hanyuma igaragara muri iki gihe, aho Aziz afite imyaka umunani, mbere yuko asubira i Djerba. Filime irangira A\u00efcha na Aziz bakorana bombi bakora imyenda, bakora kaseti A\u00efcha agurisha. Filime irangira umukobwa muto wa A\u00efcha Emna agenda, A\u00efcha na Aziz babana i Djerba."}
{"id": "9234", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9234", "title": "Yeelen", "text": "Yeelen (Bambara kuri \"umucyo\" / \"urumuri\") ni film yo muri Mali yakinwe muri 1987 iyobowe na Souleymane Ciss\u00e9. Ifata amashusho mu ndimi za Bambara na Fula, kandi ishingiye ku mugani wabwiwe n'abaturage ba Bambara. Nubwo ibihe bitarasobanurwa neza, birashoboka ko byashyizweho mu kinyejana cya 13 mu bwami bwa Mali, kandi ni inkuru yo gushakisha ubutwari irimo ubumaji no kuvumbura.\nIrimo Issiaka Kane nka Nianankoro, umusore wumunyafurika ufite imbaraga zubumaji. Niamanto Sanogo akina nka se wa Niankoro, ukurikirana umuhungu we binyuze mu bihugu bya Bambara, Fulani na Dogon byo muri Afurika y'Iburengerazuba akoresheje inkingi y'ibiti by'amayobera kugira ngo amuyobore. \nibikombe.\n\"Yeelen\" yahuye nitsinzi ikomeye, ahabwa igihembo cyabacamanza mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Cannes 1987. Yatowe kandi igihembo cya Golden Palm umwaka umwe. Yatowe muri Filime Nziza Mpuzamahanga muri Film Independent Spirit Awards. Umuhango ngarukamwaka wa 4 wo gutanga ibihembo byumwuka wakiriwe na Buck Henry - igitaramo cyuzuye (1989) | Filime Yigenga kuri YouTube \nNi mwanya # 94 mu \"Nganji\" kinyamakuru \"The 100 Best Films w'isi Cinema\" mu 2010. "}
{"id": "9235", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9235", "title": "Chronicle of the Years of Fire", "text": "Chronicle of the Years of Fire (Arabic ; French ; aya mazina yombi asobanura \"Chronicle of the Year of Embers \") ni filime yamateka yikinamico yo muri Alijeriya yakinwe muri 1975 iyobowe na Mohammed Lakhdar-Hamina. Irerekana Intambara yo kwigenga ya Alijeriya nkuko bigaragara mumaso y'umuhanzi.\nFilime yatsindiye igihembo cya \"Palme d'Or\" mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Cannes 1975. Yatoranijwe kandi nk'iyinjira muri Alijeriya muri Filime Nziza y'indimi z'amahanga mu bihembo bya 48 bya Academy, ariko ntiyakirwa nk'umukandida. "}
{"id": "9236", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9236", "title": "Yaaba", "text": "Yaaba ni filime y\u2019ikinamico ya Burkinab\u00e9 yo mu 1989 yanditswe, yakozwe, kandi iyobowe na Idrissa Ouedraogo, \"imwe muri filime zizwi cyane zo muri Afurika yo munsi y\u2019ubutayu bwa Sahara\". Yatsindiye igihembo cya Sakura Gold mu iserukiramuco rya Filime rya Tokyo mu 1989. Iyi filime yatoranijwe muri Burkinab\u00e9 muri Filime Nziza Y\u2019ururimi rw\u2019amahanga mu bihembo bya 62 bya Academy, ariko ntiyemerwa nk'umukandida. Iyi filime \"yavuzweho na documentaire ngufi Parlons Grand-m\u00e8re\", yafashwe igihe yatunganyirizwaga na Djibril Diop Mamb\u00e9ty.\nUmugambi.\nMu mudugudu wa Mossi muri Burkinafaso, Bila (Noufou Ou\u00e9draogo), umuhungu w'imyaka icumi, agirana ubucuti n'umukecuru witwa Sana (Fatimata Sanga), washinjwaga kuroga n'umudugudu we. Gusa Bila \"aramwubaha\", akamwita yaaba (Nyirakuru).\nIgihe mubyara wa Bila, Nopoko (Roukietou Barry), arwaye, umugabo w\u2019umuganga ashimangira ko Sana yibye roho y\u2019umukobwa. Sana akora urugendo rurerure kandi rutoroshye ariko amaherezo aratsinda kugirango abone imiti irokora ubuzima bwa Nopoko, ariko aracyafatwa nk'umurozi.Sana amaze gupfa, impamvu nyayo ituma yangwa mu mudugudu iragaragara, ariko urukundo n'ubwenge yashoye muri Bila na Nopoko birakomeza."}
{"id": "9237", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9237", "title": "Of Good Report", "text": "Of Good Report ni filime y\u2019urukundo yo muri Afurika y'epfo yakinwe 2013, iyobowe na Jahmil XT Qubeka. Filime yari ifite Mothusi Magano na Petronella Tshuma mu nshingano zabo. Mu bihembo bya 10 bya Afurika Movie Academy Awards, yari bifite ibihembo byinshi, kandi yegukana igihembo cya Afurika Movie Academy Academy cya Filime Nziza. Iyi filime yerekanwe mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime rya Toronto 2013. \nMuri Nyakanga 2013, mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya Filime rya 34 rya Durban, filime yatoranijwe mbere yo gufungura iri serukiramuco yatangaje ko yabujijwe na Fondasiyo y\u2019igihugu ya Filime na Video kubera ko irimo \"porunogarafiya y\u2019abana\", iki cyemezo cyaje gukurwaho nyuma y\u2019ubujurire n'abatunganya firime. \nUmugambi.\nFilime ivuga amateka y'umubano w'urukundo rudakwiye hagati y'umwarimu w'ishuri ryisumbuye numwe m'ubanyeshuri be b'abakobwa."}
{"id": "9238", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9238", "title": "Beauty (2011 film)", "text": "Beauty ni filime yo muri Afurika yepfo ya 2011 yanditswe kandi iyobowe na Oliver Hermanus. Yerekanwe bwa mbere mu gice cya Un Certain Regard mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Cannes 2011. Iyi filime yatoranijwe nk'iyinjira muri Afurika y'Epfo muri Filime nziza y'ururimi rw'amahanga mu bihembo bya 84 bya Osama, ariko ntabwo yakoze urutonde rwa nyuma \nKwakira neza.\nFilime yakiriwe neza n'abayireba. Isubiramo ryegeranya Rotten Tomatoes ivuga ko 83% by'abanegura umwuga bahaye filime isuzuma ryiza, naho impuzandengo ya 6.8 kuri 10. Abenshi mu banegura bashimye imikorere ya Deon Lotz, Peter Bradshaw wo muri \" \"The Guardian\" 'yise \"Igikorwa gikomeye, ariko cyihishe kandi kitoroshye\". David Parkinson wo mu kinyamakuru Empire Magazine na we yashimye Lotz, kandi mu nyenyeri eshatu kuri eshanu zasuzumye incamake y'urubanza rwe agira ati: \"Nubwo iri zina, hari imbaraga mbi kuri ubu bushakashatsi bwo gutwarwa n'uburakari.\" \nIbihembo.\n\"Ubwiza\" bwahawe igihembo cya Queer Palm mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Cannes 2011. Umukinnyi Deon Lotz yakiriwe bidasanzwe mu iserukiramuco rya Filime rya Zurich 2011 kubera ibikorwa bye muri iyi filime."}
{"id": "9239", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9239", "title": "The Wedding Party (2016 film)", "text": "Wedding Party ni filimi yo muri Nigeriya yakinwe muri 2016 iyoborwa Kemi Adetiba. Yerekanwe bwa mbere ku ya 8 Nzeri 2016 mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime rya Toronto muri Kanada no ku ya 26 Ugushyingo 2016 muri Eko Hotel na Suites i Lagos. Iyi filime yasohotse ku isi yose ku ya 16 Ukuboza 2016, iba filime yinjije amafaranga menshi muri Nijeriya; agahigo kaciwe muri 2017 nurukurikirane rwayo \"Ubukwe\". \nUmusaruro.\nFilime yakozwe na ELFIKE Film Collective. yayobowe na Kemi Adetiba. ELFIKE Film Collective ni ubufatanye bwamazu ane akomeye atunganyiriza filimi muri Nijeriya: EbonyLife Films, FilmOne Distribution, Inkblot Productions na Koga studios.\nKurekura.\nIyi filime yerekanwe bwa mbere i Toronto ku ya 8 Nzeri 2016 mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime rya Toronto (TIFF). Muri Kanama 2017, filime yashyizwe ahagaragara kuri Netflix."}
{"id": "9240", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9240", "title": "Kaddu Beykat", "text": "Kaddu Beykat (Letter from My Village cyagwa \"Lettre paysanne\") ni filime yo muri Senegal yo mu 1975 iyobowe na Safi Faye. Niyo filime ya mbere yerekanwe yakozwe n\u2019umugore wo muri Afurika yo munsi y\u2019ubutayu bwa Sahara yatanzwe mu bucuruzi kandi izana amahanga ku muyobozi wayo. Ishingiye ku rukundo, ivuga ubuzima bwa buri munsi bw'abantu bo mucyaro cya Senegal.\nUmugambi.\nNgor ni umusore uba mu mudugudu wa Senegali wifuza kurongora Coumba. amapfa yo mu mudugudu afite ingaruka kubihingwa, nuko Ngor ntashobore kubona inkwano ya Columba. Yagiye mu murwa mukuru wa Senegali, Dakar, kugira ngo agerageze gushaka amafaranga menshi. Agaruka ku baturage maze abwira abandi ibyamubayeho mu mujyi. Iyi nkuru yerekana ubuzima bwa buri munsi bw'abaturage, ivuga uburyo bw'ibaruwa yandikiye inshuti ye, izwi nka Faye. "}
{"id": "9241", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9241", "title": "The Nightingale's Prayer", "text": "The Nightingale's Prayer ni film yo mu misiri yakozwe muri 1959 iyoborwa na Henry Barakat kandi ishingiye kuri novel y'umwanditsi ukomeye Taha Hussein. Irimo Faten Hamama na Ahmed Mazhar.\nMu 1996, mugihe k'imyaka 100 ya Sinema yo muri Egiputa, iyi film yatoranijwe murimwe mu mafilime 150 meza yo muri Egiputa. Yakiriye igihembo cyishimiwe n\u2019ishuri rikuru ry\u2019imashusho y\u2019ubuhanzi n\u2019ubumenyi kandi yatoranijwe muri Filime nziza y\u2019ururimi rw\u2019amahanga mu bihembo bya 32 bya Academy, ariko ntiyemerwa nk'umukandida. Yinjiye kandi mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya 10 rya Berlin.\nKwakira.\nMu 2020, Peter Bradshaw wo mu \"kinyamakuru The Guardian\" \"Isengesho rya Nightingale\" nka filime ya 19 ikomeye muri Afurika yabayeho mu bihe byose, ayita \" melodrama yo kwihorera bidasanzwe, cyangwa Umugani w'ubwiza-na-nyamaswa.\""}
{"id": "9242", "revid": "9488", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9242", "title": "Amashuri Makuru", "text": "Ko te Times Amashuri Makuru (THE), i mua ko te Times Amashuri Makuru Yongeyeho (THES), we moheni Ingarangi e whakaatu ana i nga korero me nga gufata e pa ana ki te maatauranga teitei.\nNyirubwite.\nTPG Capital yaguze uburezi bwa TSL muri Charterhouse mu masezerano miliyoni 400 zama pound muri Nyakanga 2013 maze ihindura TSL Education, muri yo Amashuri Makuru ayigiramo uruhare, nka TES Global. Kugura kwa TPG byagaragaje impinduka ya gatatu nyir'ubwite mu gihe kitarenze imyaka icumi ya Times Higher Education, yari isanzwe ifitwe na News International mbere yo kugurwa na Exponent Private Equity mu 2005.\nMuri Werurwe 2019, itsinda ryigenga ryigenga Inflexion Pvt. Equity Partners LLP yaguze Times Amashuri Makuru muri TPG Capital, ibaye ba nyirayo ba kane mumyaka 15. Nyuma yo kugurwa nitsinda ryigenga ryigenga, Times Higher Education yakozwe nkikigo cyigenga kuva TES Global. Ishoramari ryakozwe na Inflexion yihariye yo kugura isoko ryo hagati.\nUmujyanama wihariye wo kugura na Inflexion ni Houlihan Lokey, isosiyete ishora imari yafashije mbere amatsinda menshi y\u2019abikorera ku giti cyabo kubona amashyirahamwe y\u2019uburezi yunguka. Nyuma yo kugura, Houlihan Lokey yavuze ko itsinda ry\u2019Amashuri Makuru risanzwe rizakora kugira ngo rihuze ibyifuzo by\u2019ibicuruzwa n\u2019ibicuruzwa, kandi harebwe no kugurisha abakiriya bahari.\nAmateka.\nKuva ku nomero yacyo ya mbere, mu 1971, kugeza mu 2008, The Times Higher Education Supplement (THES) yasohotse mu buryo bw'ikinyamakuru kandi yavutse, kandi ifatanya n'ikinyamakuru The Times. Ku ya 10 Mutarama 2008, yasubukuwe nk'ikinyamakuru. Yasohowe na TES Global, kugeza mu Kwakira 2005 yari igabana rya News International Rupert Murdoch. Ikinyamakuru cyateguwe na John Gill. Phil Baty ni umwanditsi mukuru, kandi ashinzwe gukwirakwiza mpuzamahanga. Ni n'umwanditsi w'ikinyamakuru World University Rankings.\nIki kinyamakuru kirimo inkingi mpimbano yanditswe na Laurie Taylor, \"Poppletonian\", igaragaza ubuzima muri kaminuza ya Poppleton.\nMu mwaka wa 2011, Times Higher Education yahawe igihembo cyiswe \"Ikinyamakuru cy\u2019ubucuruzi cy\u2019icyumweru\" na \"Media Business Brand of the Year\" n\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019abanditsi babigize umwuga.\nMuri 2019, byavuzwe cyane ko Elsevier usanzwe akorana na THE mu rwego rwo gukusanya urutonde rwabo muri kaminuza, yateganyaga kwigarurira Times Higher Education burundu.\nMuri Kanama 2020, Times Higher Education yatangaje ubufatanye n\u2019ikigo gishinzwe gushaka abakozi SI-UK hamwe n\u2019umushinga w\u2019amacumbi Casita, byerekana ko cyinjiye mu kwinjiza abanyeshuri mu mahanga no ku masoko y\u2019imiturire y\u2019abanyeshuri.\nKu ya 11 Nzeri 2020, Studyportals ikorera mu Buholandi yatangaje ko yagiranye amasezerano na Times Higher Education, izasura abanyeshuri basura urubuga rwa Times Higher Education berekeje ku rubuga rw\u2019abanyeshuri ba Studyportals igihe cyose abanyeshuri bareba amasomo ayobowe na kaminuza THE THE iri mu Urutonde rwa Kaminuza Yisi.\nUrutonde rwa kaminuza.\nIngingo nkuru: Ibihe Byisumbuye Amashuri Yisumbuye ya Kaminuza Yisi\nTimes Higher Education yamenyekanye cyane mugutangaza buri mwaka Times Higher Education - QS Urutonde rwa Kaminuza Yisi Yambere, yagaragaye bwa mbere mu Gushyingo 2004. Ku ya 30 Ukwakira 2009 Amashuri Makuru ya Times yatandukanije na Quacquarelli Symonds, icyo gihe umufatanyabikorwa mu gukora Urutonde, maze asinyana amasezerano na Thomson Reuters gutanga amakuru aho. Iki kinyamakuru cyashyizeho uburyo bushya bwo kugisha inama abasomyi bacyo n\u2019inama y\u2019ubuyobozi kandi ibisubizo byatangajwe buri mwaka guhera mu gatasi 2010 kugeza 2013, ubwo THE yasinyaga amasezerano mashya na Elsevier.\nKimwe nu rutonde rwa Kaminuza Yisi Yose, Times Higher Education nayo itangaza izindi nzego nyinshi:\nIbyabaye.\nTimes Amashuri Makuru akora urukurikirane rw'inama, ihuriro hamwe ninama nyunguranabitekerezo umwaka wose. Iyobowe n\u2019abanyamakuru b\u2019ubwanditsi, ibyo birori bihuza abayobozi n\u2019abayobozi ku isi baturutse mu masomo, guverinoma n\u2019inganda kugira ngo bungurane ibitekerezo, baganire kandi bateze imbere ejo hazaza h\u2019imiyoborere yo mu mashuri makuru, guhanga udushya n\u2019ubushakashatsi.\nIbihembo.\nIki kinyamakuru gikoresha ibihembo bibiri buri mwaka, \"Times Higher Education Awards\" (cyatangijwe mu 2007) na \"Times Higher Education Awards Asia\" (cyatangijwe muri 2019). \"Times Higher Education Leadership and Management Awards\" (Thelmas) yatangiye kuva 2011 kugeza 2018. [citation ikenewe]. Kaminuza Yisumbuye Yisumbuye Yumwaka wa 2020 Abatsinze, batoranije kaminuza yuburezi mu Bwongereza ibihembo bya kaminuza yumwaka wa 2020."}
{"id": "9243", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9243", "title": "Divine Carcasse", "text": "Divine Carcasse (Umubiri w\u2019Imana) ni filime y\u2019amoko yo muri B\u00e9nine yo mu 1998 yayobowe n\u2019umukinnyi wa filime w\u2019Ababiligi Dominique Loreau. \nIyi filime ivanze n\u2019ibihimbano n\u2019amoko, iyi filime ikorewe ku modoka ya Peugeot yo mu 1955, mu ikubitiro yari ifitwe na Simon, umwarimu wa filozofiya w\u2019abanyaburayi baba mu mahanga, iyi modoka iza kuba iy'uwitwa Joseph, uyikoresha nka tagisi kugeza igihe izatereranwa mu mahugurwa y\u2019umukanishi. Ngaho harasakaye kubice byakoreshejwe numuhanzi Simonet Biokou mugukora igishusho cy'intama y'Imana Agbo. Imodoka yafashwe hagati yibyara nibicuruzwa nyuma yubukoloni. iyi filimi ikaba yarashyizwe kurutonde rwa filimi 20 nziza zakorewe muri Africa mu gihugu cy'ubwongereza"}
{"id": "9244", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9244", "title": "Mandabi", "text": "Mandabi (Igifaransa: Le Mandat, \"The Money Order\") ni filime yo mu 1968 yanditswe kandi iyobowe n'umukinnyi wa filime wo muri Senegali Ousmane Semb\u00e8ne. Iyi filime ishingiye ku gitabo cya Semb\u00e8ne cyitwa \"The Money-Order\" kandi ni filime ya mbere y\u2019umuyobozi mu rurimi rwe kavukire rwa Wolof. Kubera ko benshi mu baturage ba Senegal batumva igifaransa, Semb\u00e8ne yashakaga guhanga sinema kubavuga Wolof. Iyi niyo filime ya mbere yuzuye ururimi nyafurika kuva muri Afrika y'uburengerazuba. \nUmugambi.\nUmuyisilamu wo muri Senegal udafite akazi, Ibrahima Dieng, abana n'abagore be babiri n'abana barindwi i Dakar. Mwishywa we, Abdou, yohereje we kugira amafaranga kuva Paris agaciro 25.000 y'amanyarwanda, akaba yarakijjwe no gukubura mu muhanda. Ibrahima akabika amafaranga ye wenyine, akazigamira mwishywa we, agaha mushiki we umugabane.\nKwandika.\nNyuma yuko iyi filime itari imaze imyaka igera ku bantu bareba sinema, yasubiwemo mu mwanzuro wa 4K maze itangwa mu iserukiramuco rya Lumi\u00e8re rya 2019 ryabereye i Lyon mu Bufaransa. Muri Kamena 2021, iyi verisiyo yasubiwemo yerekanwe muri sinema mu Bwongereza."}
{"id": "9245", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9245", "title": "The Land (1969 film)", "text": "The Land (Arabi) ni film yo mu misiri yakinwe muri 1969 iyoborwa Youssef Chahine, bishingiye kuri novel yakunzwe ya Abdel Rahman al-Sharqawi. Iyi filime ivuga amakimbirane hagati y'abahinzi na nyir'irsambu mu cyaro cya Egiputa mu myaka ya za 1930, ikanagaragaza isano iri hagati y'inyungu z'umuntu ku giti cye hamwe n'ibisubizo rusange ku gukandamizwa. Yinjiye mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Cannes 1970. "}
{"id": "9246", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9246", "title": "Soleil O", "text": "Soleil \u00d4 (\u00a0[s\u0254.l\u025bj o] ; \"Oh, Sun\") ni filime yikinamico yo mu gifaransa-Mauritanian yanditswe kandi iyobowe na Med Hondo.\nUmugambi.\nFilime \"Soleil\", yakozwe mu myaka ine n\u2019ingengo y\u2019imari iciriritse cyane, ivuga amateka y\u2019umwimukira w'umwirabura winjiye i Paris ashakisha \u201cabakurambere be ba Gaul\u201d. Iyi manifeste ya firime iramagana ivangura: Abimukira bashaka cyane akazi n\u2019aho baba, ariko ugasanga imbonankubone batitaweho, bakangwa, kandi bagasuzugurwa, mbere yo kumvira umuhamagaro wa nyuma wo kwigomeka.\nUmutwe werekeza ku ndirimbo yo mu Burengerazuba bw'Ubuhinde ivuga ububabare bw'abirabura bo muri Dahomey (ubu ni B\u00e9nin) bajyanywe muri Karayibe nk'abacakara.\nKugarura.\nMuri 2017, \"Soleil\" given yahawe gusanwa na Cineteca di Bologna ayobowe na Med Hondo. Inkunga yaturutse mu muryango wa George Lucas Family Foundation n'Umushinga wa Sinema ku Isi, mu rwego rwo gusana aba nyuma bise umushinga ndangamurage w'Afurika."}
{"id": "9247", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9247", "title": "Tsotsi", "text": "Tsotsi ni film yanditswe na tuyoborwa Gavin Hood na Petero Fudakowski muri 2005 nibwo yasohotse. \"Ni uguhuza\" igitabo cyitwa Tsotsi, cyanditswe na Athol Fugard Afurika yepfo / Ubwongereza bukorana. muri Afurika y'Epfo, hagaragaramo Presley Chweneyagae nka David / Tsotsi (\"izina rya Tsotsitaal\" ryitwa \"inkozi y'ibibi\"), umusore wibye imodoka gusa abona umwana yicaye inyuma. Irimo kandi Terry Pheto, Kenneth Nkosi, Jerry Mofokeng, na Rapulana Seiphemo. \nAmajwi y'iyi filime agaragaza umuziki wa Kwaito wakozwe n'umuhanzi wo muri Afurika y'Epfo Zola ndetse n'amanota ya Mark Kilian na Paul Hepker agaragaza ijwi ry'umuririmbyi wo muri Afurika y'Epfo wigaragambyaga akaba n'umusizi Vusi Mahlasela.\nIyi filime yakunzwe cyane, ishimwa cyane cyane iyandikwa, icyerekezo, ndetse n\u2019imikorere, cyane cyane ibya Chweneyagae na Pheto, sinema n\u2019uburemere bw\u2019amarangamutima. Yakomeje gutsindira igihembo cya Akademiki cya 2006 muri Filime nziza y\u2019ururimi rw\u2019amahanga kandi itorwa muri Golden Globe muri Filime Nziza y\u2019indimi z\u2019amahanga, iba filime ya mbere yo muri Afurika yepfo ndetse na filime ya mbere nyafurika idakozwe mu gifaransa yatsindinze. Muri 2009, yasubiwemo kumugaragaro muri Tamil nka \"Yogi\"."}
{"id": "9248", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9248", "title": "Timbuktu (2014 film)", "text": "Timbuktu ni filime y\u2019ikinamico ya Mauritanian-Igifaransa yakozwe 2014 iyobowe kandi yanditswe na Abderrahmane Sissako. Iyi filime yibanze ku bikorwa bigufi bya Timbuktu, muri Mali na Ansar Dine, kandi bigira uruhare runini mu gutera amabuye rusange mu mwaka wa 2012 abashakanye batashyingiranywe muri Aguelhok. Yafatiwe amashusho muri Oualata, muri Mauritania, \"Timbuktu\" yatoranijwe guhatanira Palme d'or mu gice cy\u2019amarushanwa akomeye mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Cannes 2014, aho yatsindiye igihembo cya Ecumenical ndetse n\u2019igihembo cya Fran\u00e7ois Chalais. Yatoranijwe muri Mauritania ihatanira igihembo cya Akademiki ya Filime Nziza Y\u2019amahanga, ikomeza gutorwa itwara igihembo mu bihembo bya 87 bya Academy. atorewe kandi igihembo cya BAFTA igihembo cya Filime Nziza itari mu Cyongereza mu bihembo bya 69 bya British Academy Film Awards. \"Timbuktu\" yahawe igihembo cya Filime nziza mu bihembo bya 11 bya Afurika Movie Academy Awards, aho yatorewe ibindi bihembo icumi. Muri 2017, \"Ikinyamakuru New York Times\" cyayishyize ku rutonde rwa filime ya cumi na kabiri nziza yo mu kinyejana cya makumyabiri na rimwe. "}
{"id": "9249", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9249", "title": "Queen Sono", "text": "Queen Sono ni ikinamico yo muri Afurika yepfo yerekanwa kuri televiziyo yakozwe na Kagiso Lediga yerekanwe kuri Netflix ku ya 28 Gashyantare 2020. Uru rukurikirane rukinamo Pearl Thusi, Vuyo Dabula, Sechaba Morojele, Chi Mhende, Loyiso Madinga, Rob Van Vuuren, Kate Liquorish, Khathu Ramabulana, Enhle Maphumulo, Abigail Kubeka, Connie Chiume, Otto Nobela na James Ngcobo na Featuring Mario Diederiks. Nibikorwa bya mbere bya Netflix. \nimaze kurekurwa, yakiriwe neza n'abayireba, bashimye icyerekezo, sinema, uko ibikorwa byakurikiranye ndetse n'ibitaramo, cyane cyane Soi, Dabula na Kubeka, maze bavuga ko ari \"igihe cyiza.\" Ku ya 28 Mata 2020, Netflix yavuguruye urukurikirane rwa season ya kabiri. Icyakora, ku ya 26 Ugushyingo 2020, byavuzwe ko Netflix yahagaritse uruhererekane kubera ibibazo by\u2019umusaruro byazanywe n'icyorezo cya COVID-19. \nInyandiko.\n\"Queen Sono\" akurikira inkuru y\u2019umukozi w\u2019ibanga wo muri Afurika yepfo wihishe ukemura ibibazo by\u2019ubugizi bwa nabi mu gihe akemura ibibazo mu buzima bwe bwite."}
{"id": "9250", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9250", "title": "Queen of Katwe", "text": "Queen of Katwe film y'amateka yakiniwe muri Amerika iyoborwa na Mira Nair yanditswe na William Wheeler. Iyi filime yakinnye na David Oyelowo, Lupita Nyong'o, na Madina Nalwanga, iyi filime igaragaza ubuzima bwa Phiona Mutesi, umukobwa utuye i Katwe, agace ka Kampala, umurwa mukuru wa Uganda. Yize gukina chess ahinduka Umukandida w'umugore nyuma yo gutsinda muri World Chess Olympiads. \nIyi filime yakuwe mu kiganiro n'ikinyamakuru cya ESPN n'igitabo cyanditswe na Tim Crothers, iyi filime yakozwe na Walt Disney Pictures na Filime ya ESPN. \"Umwamikazi wa Katwe\" yerekanwe mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime rya Toronto 2016. Iyi filime yasohotse muri Amerika muri Amerika ku ya 23 Nzeri 2016, mbere y\u2019ikinamico rusange ku ya 30 Nzeri. "}
{"id": "9251", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9251", "title": "Naomie Nishimwe", "text": "Naomie Nishimwe.\nMu mwaka wa 2020, ni bwo umukobwa muto w'imyaka 21 y'amavuko witwa Naomie Nishimwe yegukanye ikamba rya Nyampinga w'u Rwanda asimbuye uwitwa Meghan Nimwiza nawewahize abandi mu buranga mu Rwanda mu mwaka wa 2019\nAkarusho.\nNaomie Nishimwe azajya ahembwa ibihumbi magana inani (800.000) by'amafaranga y'u Rwanda igihe kingana n'umwaka, ahabwe imodoka yo mu bwoko bwa Suzuki swift nshyashya n'ibindi byinshi birimo nko gukorerwa ubwiza bw'umusatsi we n'ibindi bitandukanye by'abaterankunga banyuranye bagiye batera inkunga irushanwa rya Nyampinga w' Rwanda\nUmuryango.\nNaomie afite nyina witwa Fanny Uwimbabazi wishimiye cyane kuba umukobwa we Naomie Nishimwe yegukanye ikamba rya Nyampinga w'u Rwanda 2020 kuko ngo byahoze ari ibyifuzo bye.\nNaomie Kandi yinjiye mu irushanwa ahagarariye umujyi wa Kigali. Miss Naomi Nishimwe yambitswe impeta y'urukundo taliki ya 01 Mutarama 2024, nyuma yaho yasezeranye imbere y'amategeko na Michael Tesfay ukomoka muri Ethiopia ibirori byabaye taliki 27 Ukuboza 2024. \nImikorere.\nNaomie kandi mbere y'uko ajya muri Miss Rwanda yari asanzwe azwi ku mbuga nkoranyambaga cyane nka Instagram\nmu itsinda afitanye n'abakobwa bagenzi be ndetse buje uburanga nkawe, rizwi ku izina rya Mckenzie rikora ibijyanye no kumurika imideri. Naomie kandi n' itsinda rye yakoranye bya hafi n'ikigo cy'igihugu cy'u Rwanda gishinzwe itumanaho kizwi nka MTN Rwanda mu buryo bwo kucyamamariza no gushishikariza imiryango gukoresha smat phone. \nAgashya.\nBivugwa neza ko itsinda rya Mackenzie ririmo uyu Nyampinga w'u Rwanda 2020 Naomie Nishimwe kandi abarigize bose ari umuryango umwe harimo abo bavukana munda imwe na mubyara wabo ndetse na Nyirasenge wabo. \nUbudasa.\nMiss Naomie kandi niwe Nyampinga wenyine wanzuye ko inyungu zizava mu mishinga ye ndetse n'ibikorwa bye bizagenzurwa nawe ubwe bwite mu gihe byari bimenyerewe ko itsinda rishinzwe gutegura irushanwa rya\nrya Miss Rwanda rikomeza gukurikirana. Naomie we si ko byagenze yabatangarije ko mu gihe agifite ikamba azanigenzurira inyungu ze n'ibikorwa bye.Kuwa 14 Ukuboza 2025, Miss Naomie Nishimwe yamuritse igitabo cye yise more than a crown mu birori byabereye muri Kigali Convention Centre."}
{"id": "9252", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9252", "title": "The Boy Who Harnessed the Wind", "text": "The Boy Who Harnessed the Wind ni filime yikinamico yo mu Bwongereza yo mu 2019 yanditswe, iyoborwa na Chiwetel Ejiofor. Filime ishingiye kuri memoire y'izina na William Kamkwamba na Bryan Mealer. Yerekanwe mu gice cya Premieres mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Sundance 2019 kandi itangira kunyura kuri Netflix ku ya 1 Werurwe 2019. Yatoranijwe muri Filime Nziza Mpuzamahanga Yamamaye mu bihembo bya 92 bya Academy, ariko ntabwo yatowe. \nKurekurwa.\nKu ya 14 Ugushyingo 2018, Netflix yabonye uburenganzira bwo gukwirakwiza ku isi, usibye Ubuyapani, Ubushinwa, n'Ubwongereza. Iyi filime yagaragaye bwa mbere ku isi mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Sundance 2019 ku ya 25 Mutarama 2019. Nyuma yaje gusohoka kuri Netflix ku ya 1 Werurwe 2019."}
{"id": "9253", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9253", "title": "Virunga (film)", "text": "Virunga ni filime documentaire yo mu Bwongereza yakinwe muri 2014 iyobowe na Orlando von Einsiedel. Yibanze ku bikorwa byo kubungabunga abashinzwe parike muri pariki ya Virunga ya Kongo mu gihe havutse imyigaragambyo ikaze ya M23 mu mwaka wa 2012, kandi ikora iperereza ku bikorwa by\u2019isosiyete ikora peteroli yo mu Bwongereza Soco International mu murage ndangamurage wa UNESCO. Soco International yarangije gushakisha peteroli muri Virunga muri Mata 2014. Iyi filime yerekanwe bwa mbere mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Tribeca ku ya 17 Mata 2014. Nyuma yo gutambuka kuri Netflix, yatorewe igihembo cya Akademiki ya Best Documentary Feature.\nIbihembo.\n\"Virunga\" yatsindiye ibihembo byinshi harimo na Peabody Award. Feature documentaire Award ku DOXA documentaire Festival mu Vancouver, Canada; igihembo cy'umukinnyi mpuzamahanga wavutse muri Hot Docs i Toronto; Igihembo cya Zahabu ya Rock mu Iserukiramuco rya Filime Ntoya; n'Ibikorwa no Guhinduka Hamwe (ACT Now) Igihembo cya Crested Butte Film Festival. Yatsindiye gongs ebyiri muri One World Media Awards muri BAFTA - Inyandiko nziza. Iyi filime kandi yatorewe igihembo cyiza cya Documentaire nziza muri Tribeca Film Festival. Filime yatorewe igihembo cya Akademiki kubera ibihembo bya Documentaire Nziza ya 87 ya Osama Awards."}
{"id": "9254", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9254", "title": "Beasts of No Nation (film)", "text": "Beats of No Nation ni film yo muri Amerika yanditswe, itunganywa,ifatwa amashusho, no iyoborwa na Cary Joji Fukunaga. Bikurikira umuhungu muto wabaye umusirikare mugihe igihugu cye cyari gifite intambara iteye ubwoba. Iyi filime yakorewe muri Gana ikinwamo na Idris Elba, Abraham Attah, Ama K. Abebrese, Grace Nortey, David Dontoh, na Opeyemi Fagbohungbe, iyi filime ishingiye ku gitabo cyo mu 2005 cyitwa izina rimwe na Uzodinma Iweala, igitabo ubwacyo cyiswe izina. nyuma ya alubumu ya Fela Kuti.\nYerekanwe mu gice cy\u2019amarushanwa akomeye mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime rya 72 rya Venice, aho yatsindiye igihembo cya Marcello Mastroianni. Iyi filime yerekanwe mu gice cyihariye cyo kwerekana iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya Filime rya Toronto mu mwaka wa 2015, ikanasohoka kuri Netflix ku isi yose ndetse no mu isohoka rito na Bleecker Street ku ya 16 Ukwakira 2015. \nItangazamakuru ryo murugo.\nFilime yasohotse kuri Blu-ray na DVD na The Criterion Collection ku ya 31 Kanama 2021. \nImpaka.\nMu mwaka wa 2015, Artnet yasohoye inyandiko ivuga ko Fukunaga yakoresheje ibikubiyemo atiriwe ashimira ibihangano by'umuhanzi wo muri Irlande, Richard Mosse, umurimo we wari umaze kumenyekana cyane mu buhanzi kubera gukoresha firime ya infragre ndetse no kwerekana ishusho y'abasirikare b'abana muri Repubulika iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. Mu rwego rwo gushyigikira ikirego cyayo cyo gukopera, iyi ngingo yarimo kugereranya mu buryo butaziguye amakadiri ya buri muntu muri filime n'amafoto y'umwimerere ya Mosse."}
{"id": "9255", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9255", "title": "Ingabire Grace", "text": "Ingabire Grace.\nTariki ya makumyabiri (20) werurwe muri imwe mu mazu akomeye mu Rwanda \nizwi nka Intare Arena nibwo hatangajwe nyampinga mushya wu Rwanda 2021 ariwe\nIngabire Grace byari ibirori byiza kandi bitangaje kuko bititabiriwe kubera icyorezo cya COVID 19\nbyanyuze kuri Televisiyo KC2 na za youtube\nMumenye neza.\nIngabire Grace yavutse ku itariki ya 11 ugushyingo mu mwaka 1995 avukira mu Rwanda i Kigali akaba \nari umunyeshuri urangije Kaminuza mubijyanye no kubyina globalization na Filozofia na \nphyscologiya\nIgitangaje.\nNyampinga Ingabire Grace niwe nyampinga wu Rwanda wenyine ufite Impamyabumenyi mu mbyino. Muri Gicurasi 2019, yarangije muri Bates College i Lewiston, muri Leta ya Maine, muri Amerika ahoyakuye Impamya bumenyi Ihanitse mu Mbyino za choreography, filozofiaya na phyiscologiyamu ugushyingo 2019 Grace yatangije umushinga witwa Ikiringo umushinga ugamije guteza imbere imbyino. \nKu wa gatanu, tariki ya 19 Ugushyingo, Grace Ingabire, Miss Rwanda 2021, yerekeje muri Porto Rico ubwo yatangiraga gushaka ikamba rya Miss World rya 70 kuri ubu rifite umwamikazi w\u2019ubwiza wa Jamayike Toni-Ann Singh.\nImikorere.\nGrace ntago imishinga ye yagenze neza nkuko yabishakaga kubera icyorezo cya COVID19\ncyari cyugarije Isi nu u Rwanda muri rusange gusa muri bimmwe yakoze byamenyekanye harimo \nnko kuba yara koranye na Africa Improved Foods boroje ingurube coperative eshatu (3) zabajyanama\nbubuzima bo mu karere ka Rwamagana mu Murenge wa Muhazi"}
{"id": "9256", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9256", "title": "\u00d2l\u00f2t\u016br\u00e9", "text": "\u00d2l\u00f2tur\u00e9 ni filime yo muri Nijeriya yo muri 2019 iyobowe na Kenneth Gyang uhereye ku mashusho ya Yinka Ogun na Craig Freimond. Irimo Sharon Ooja, Beverly Osu, Ada Ameh na Blossom Chukwujekwu.\nIkibanza.\n\"\u00d2l\u00f2tur\u00e9\" avuga amateka ya \u00d2l\u00f2tur\u00e9 (Sharon Ooja), umunyamakuru ukomoka mu gihugu cya Nijeriya ukiri muto kandi utagira ubwenge, ujya mu bwihisho kugira ngo ashyire ahagaragara icyaha cyo gucuruza abantu. bayteguriye i Lagos, yerekana uburyo abakora imibonano mpuzabitsina bashakirwa gukoreshwa mu mahanga. \nUmusaruro.\nInyandiko ya \"\u00d2l\u00f2tur\u00e9\" igice gishingiye ku gutanga raporo y\u2019umunyamakuru w\u2019iperereza wo muri Nijeriya, Tobore Ovuorie. Gufata amashusho byatangiye ku mugaragaro ku ya 5 Ugushyingo 2018 ahitwa i Lagos, muri Nijeriya. \ngusohoka.\nIyi filime yerekanwe bwa mbere ku ya 31 Ukwakira 2019 mu iserukiramuco rya Filime rya Carthage muri Tuniziya. Muri Nzeri 2020, Netflix yabonye uburenganzira bwo gukwirakwiza filime. Isakara ryatangiye ku ya 2 Ukwakira 2020. Nyuma yiminsi mike isohotse, \"\u00d2l\u00f2tur\u00e9 yagaragaye\" muri firime 10 za mbere zirebwa kuri Netflix."}
{"id": "9257", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9257", "title": "Cook Off (2017 film)", "text": "Cook Off ni filime yo gusetsa y'urukundo yo muri Zimbabwe yasohotse muri 2017 yanditswe kandi iyoborwa na Tomas Brickhill. film ikinamo Tendaiishe Chitima, Fungai Majaya na Tehn Diamond. Gutunganya iyi filime byahoraga byibasirwa no kunanirwa kw'amashanyarazi, imbogamizi z\u2019ingengo y\u2019imari, imyigaragambyo yo kurwanya leta n\u2019imvururu zadutse mu cyiciro cya nyuma cya Perezidansi ya Robert Mugabe. Yabaye filime ya mbere yasohotse muri Zimbabwe nyuma ya Mugabe yamaze imyaka igera kuri 40. Iyi filime kandi yabaye filime ya mbere ya Zimbabwe yerekanwe kuri Netflix. Yitabiriwe n\u2019itangazamakuru mpuzamahanga kuva yashyirwa ku rubuga rwa Netflix muri Kamena 2020. Ni filime ya kabiri ya Zimbabwe yitabiriwe n\u2019amahanga nyuma ya \"Neria\". Iyi filime irashimwa nka imwe muri filime nziza kurusha izindi zose muri Sinema ya Zimbabwe nyuma ya \"Neria\" na yellow Card kandi yafunguwe ku buryo bwiza cyane bwatanzwe n'Abanyazimbabwe. Iyi filime izwiho gusenya imyumvire y\u2019inganda za firime zo muri Zimbabwe zari zamugaye kubera ibibazo by\u2019ubukungu ndetse na hyperinflation muri iki gihugu. \nInyandiko.\nIyo umubyeyi urera abana wenyine Anesu (Tendaiishe Chitima) yinjiye rwihishwa mu marushanwa yo guteka kuri tereviziyo n\u2019umuhungu we, agomba gutsinda ibyo nyina atemera ndetse no guhangana n\u2019abatetsi babigize umwuga.\nGutanga ibihembo.\nFilime yakiriye ibihembo bike yanatoranijwe mubirori bya firime. Yatwaye ibihembo bine byose mu birori bya firime, harimo bibiri buri kimwe mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Cambria 2020. na Zimbabwe International Film Festival. Iyi filime kandi yahawe ibihembo bibiri by\u2019ubuhanzi byatanzwe n\u2019inama y\u2019ubuhanzi ya Zimbabwe muri 2019."}
{"id": "9258", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9258", "title": "A United Kingdom", "text": "A United Kingdom Ni filimi yu rukundo yasohotse muri 2016 muri Botswana iyoborwa na Amma Asante yanditswe na Guy Hibbert, Ishingiye ku urugo nyakuri, ubuzima hagati ya Seretse Khama, kuragwa ubutegetsi kwa Bechuanaland (yari perezida wa Botswana), n'umugore we Ruth Williams Khama. David Oyelowo na Rosamund Pike bagaragaza Seretse na Ruth.\nYerekanwe mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga ryabereye muri Toronto mu 2016, kandi ni yo filime yatangiye Iserukiramuco rya sinema rya 60 rya London.\nuko yakozwe.\nPike yinjiye mu bakinnyi muri Gicurasi 2015, Asante yinjira nyuma gato. Muri Nzeri 2015, Asante yatangaje ko gufata amashusho bizagabanywa hagati ya Botswana na London, kandi ko bizatangira mu Kwakira mu rwego rwo kwitegura irekurwa rya filimi muri 2016 rihurirana n\u2019imyaka 50 y'ubwigenge muri Botswana. Mu Kwakira 2015, Jack Davenport na Tom Felton bifatanije n'aba bakinnyi. Mu Gushyingo 2015, amashusho amwe yabereye hafi ya Hyde Park / Kensington Gardens harimo na Imperial College Union. Umukinnyi wa sinema yari Sam McCurdy naho umuyobozi wa filimi yari Simon Bowles "}
{"id": "9259", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9259", "title": "The Gods Must Be Crazy", "text": "The Gods must be Crazy ni film yo gusetsa yo mu mwaka 1980 yanditswe, inakozwe, Itunganywa kandi iyobowe na Jamie Uys. ubufatanyabikorwa mpuzamahanga muri Afurika y\u2019Epfo na Botswana, ni film yambere muri The Gods must be Crazy series.\nIyi filime yashyizwe muri Afurika y\u2019Epfo, ikinamo umuhinzi wo muri Namibiya San N\u01c3xau \u01c2Toma nka Xi, umuhigi-uhiga mu butayu bwa Kalahari umuryango we wavumbuye icupa ry'ikirahure ryamanutse mu ndege, kandi bizera ko ari impano yatanzwe n'imana zabo. Igihe Xi yiyemeje gusubiza icupa ku mana, urugendo rwe ruba ruhujwe n\u2019umuhanga mu binyabuzima (wakinnye nka Marius Weyers), Umwarimu w\u2019ishuri ry\u2019umudugudu mushya (Sandra Prinsloo), hamwe n\u2019itsinda ry\u2019iterabwoba.\n\"The Gods must be Crazy\" yarekuwe na Ster-Kinekor muri Afurika y\u2019Epfo, aho yakoze amateka yinjiza amafaranga menshi, ikaba yarasohoye amafaranga menshi mumateka yinganda za firime za Afurika y\u2019Epfo. Iyi filime yagenze neza mu bucuruzi no mu bindi bihugu, harimo na Leta zunze ubumwe z\u2019Amerika, aho yatanzwe na 20 Century Fox, aho ibiganiro by\u2019umwimerere bya Afrikaans yashyizwe mu cyongereza. Nubwo byagenze neza, iyi filime yakunze kunengwa kwerekana ubwoko kandi bigaragara ko atazi ivangura muri Afurika yepfo. Film yakurikiwe ni ikindi gice \"The Gods must be Crazy\" part II yashyizwe ahagaragara Columbia Pictures mu 1989.\nGufata Amashusho.\n\"The Gods Must Be Crazy yafatiwe amashusho\" i Tsumkwe, muri Namibiya, ndetse no muri Botswana. Nk\u2019uko Uys abitangaza ngo N! Xau yasubizwaga mu rugo rwe mu butayu bwa Kalahari buri byumweru bitatu cyangwa bine kugira ngo atababazwa n\u2019umuco. Mu gihe mu mijyi, N! Xau yize kunywa inzoga n'itabi. Uys yavuze ko yishyuye N! Xau $ 300 mu minsi 10 ya mbere yakoraga, ariko ko amafaranga bivugwa ko yatwawe n'umuyaga. N! Xau yahise yishyurwa n'inka 12. Mu 1985, Uys yavuze ko yohereje N! Xau $ 100 buri kwezi kuva yafata amashusho, N! Xau yakoresheje mu iduka ry\u2019ubucuruzi ku bilometero 60 uvuye aho yahigaga; Uys yavuze kandi ko hashyizweho konti y\u2019amadolari 20.000 y\u2019izina rya N! Xau. \nControversies.\n\"The Gods Must Be Crazy\" yakunze kunengwa kubera ko bigaragara ko ikomeje imyumvire ishingiye ku moko n'ivangura n'ivangura muri Afurika y'Epfo. Muri Amerika, ngo iyi filime yatowe n\u2019inama y\u2019igihugu y\u2019abavoka b\u2019abirabura n\u2019indi mitwe irwanya ivanguramoko ubwo yerekanaga mu nzu ya Street ya 68 mu mujyi wa New York. "}
{"id": "9260", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9260", "title": "From a Whisper", "text": "From a Whisper ni firime yikinamico yo muri Kenya yanditswe kandi iyobowe Wanuri Kahiu. Iyi filime yakiriye nomination 12 kandi yatsindiye ibihembo 5 muri African Movie Academy Awards muri 2009, harimo \"Ishusho\" Nziza, \"Amajwi Yumwimerere\" \", Umuyobozi\" mwiza, \"Amashusho yumwimerere meza\" na \"AMAA Achievement muguhindura\". Iyi filime kandi yatsindiye igihembo \"cyiza cyo kwerekana inkuru nziza\" mu iserukiramuco rya Pan African Film &amp;amp; Arts 2010, kandi ihabwa igihembo cya BAFTA / LA \"Festival Choice\" Award 2010. Nubwo iyi filime yibuka isabukuru yimyaka 10 ry\u2019iterabwoba ryabaye ku ya 7 Kanama muri Kenya mu 1998, ntabwo ivuga ku gisasu cy\u2019iterabwoba. Iyi filime yerekana inkuru ifatika y\u2019inyuma y\u2019icyo gisasu, ifata ubuzima bw\u2019abahohotewe n\u2019imiryango yabo bagombaga gutora ibice by\u2019ubuzima bwabo byangijwe n\u2019icyo gisasu. "}
{"id": "9261", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9261", "title": "Hyenas (1992 film)", "text": "Hyenas (French) ni filime yo muri Senegali yo mu 1992 yahinduwe na Friedrich D\u00fcrrenmatt ikinamico ya comedy iturutse kuri \"The Visit\" (1956), iyobowe na Djibril Diop Mamb\u00e9ty. Inkuru yimbitse y'urukundo no kwihorera irasa no kunegura ubukoloni na mpatse ibihugu yabagaho muri Afrika. Yinjiye mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Cannes 1992. \nUmugambi.\n\"Hyenas\" (Hyenas) avuga amateka ya Linguere Ramatou, umukecuru ugeze mu za bukuru, ukize usuye umudugudu yavukiyemo wa Colobane. Linguere atanga igitekerezo kibangamiye abaturage ba Colobane kandi abaha ibintu byiza cyane kugirango abemeze. Uyu mugore warakaye, \"w'umukire nka Banki yisi\", azaha Colobane amahirwe yo kumwicira Dramaan Drameh, umucuruzi w\u2019umudugudu waho wamutereranye nyuma y\u2019urukundo no gutwita mu buryo butemewe n\u2019imyaka cumi n'irindwi."}
{"id": "9262", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9262", "title": "Sambizanga (film)", "text": "Sambizanga ni film yo mu 1972 yakozwe n'umuyobozi Sarah Maldoror. yashyizweho mu 1961 igihe Intambara y\u2019Ubwigenge ya Angola yatangiraga, ikurikira urugamba rw\u2019abarwanyi ba Angola bagize uruhare mu ishyaka rya rubanda riharanira kwibohora muri Angola (MPLA), umutwe wa politiki urwanya ubukoloni umugabo wa Maldoror, M\u00e1rio Coelho Pinto de Andrade, yari umuyobozi. Iyi filime ishingiye ku gitabo cyitwa \"A vida verdadeira de Domingos Xavier\" (\"Ubuzima nyabwo bwa Domingos Xavier\") cyanditswe n'umwanditsi wa Angola, Jos\u00e9 Luandino Vieira.\nUmusaruro.\nIyi filime yafatiwe ahantu muri Repubulika y\u2019abaturage ya Kongo (izwi kandi nka Congo-Brazzaville) mu byumweru birindwi. \nAbakinnyi.\nBenshi mu bakinnyi bari abadafite umwuga bagize uruhare mu bikorwa bimwe na bimwe byo muri Afurika birwanya ubukoloni, nka MPLA n\u2019ishyaka nyafurika riharanira ubwigenge bwa Gineya na Cape Verde (PAIGC). Imiterere ya Domingos Xavier yakinwe n'umuny'Angola uba muri Kongo, Domingos Oliveira naho imico ya Maria yakinwe n\u2019umuhanga mu bukungu Elisa Andrade ukomoka muri Cape Verde "}
{"id": "9263", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9263", "title": "Come Back, Africa", "text": "Come Back, Africa ni filime yo mu 1959, filime ya kabiri ndende yanditswe, yakozwe, kandi iyobowe n'umukinnyi wa filime wigenga w\u2019umunyamerika witwa Lionel Rogosin.\nIyi filime yagize impinduka zikomeye kuri sinema nyafurika, kandi iracyafite akamaro gakomeye mu mateka n\u2019umuco nkinyandiko ibungabunga umurage w'imijyi yo muri Afurika y\u2019Epfo muri 1950. Ishobora gushyirwa mubikorwa nka raporo, documentaire, firime yamateka cyangwa sinema ya politiki, kubera ko yerekana ibintu byabaye. Ku rundi ruhande, irerekana ubusobanuro bwibintu bifatika hamwe nigitekerezo gikomeye cyimyitwarire y'abantu nkivanguramoko.\nIbihembo.\nFilime yerekanwe bwa mbere mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Venice 1959. Rogosin yateye inkunga kandi ashyigikira ihunga rya Bloke Modisane muri Afurika y\u2019Epfo ndetse n'igihe cye cy'inzibacyuho i Londres, aho yanditse igitabo cye Blame me on history. Rogosin muri icyo gihe yahaye ruswa abayobozi muri Afurika y'Epfo maze abasha gukura Miriam Makeba mu gihugu yanga kwishyura ingwate kugira ngo ashobore kumwereka filime mu iserukiramuco rya Filime rya Venice. Iyi filime hamwe no kuririmba kwa Makeba hamwe n\u2019imisatsi ya \"afro\" byatumye abantu bumva ibintu kandi iyi filime yatsindiye igihembo cyiswe \"Italian Critics Award\". Ntabwo byashobokaga kuvana abahanzi birabura muri Afrika yepfo icyo gihe, kandi ntibishoboka ko aba bahanzi bakora umwuga hanze yigihugu. Rogosin yasezeranye na Makeba mu masezerano, anamutera inkunga y'ingendo n'amafaranga yo kubaho mu Bwongereza no muri Amerika. Yashakishije kandi umukozi ushinzwe kwamamaza, anategura isura ye mu Mudugudu wa Vanguard mu mujyi wa New York ndetse no ku ncuro ya mbere kuri \"The Steve Allen Show\" "}
{"id": "9264", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9264", "title": "Fundi-Mentals", "text": "fundi-Mentals ni urwenya rwo muri Kenya rwo muri 2015 rwayobowe na Alexandros Konstantaras, nawe wari inyuma \"y'inzu ya Lungula\" yagaragayemo umucamanza Ian Mbugua, iyi comedi yamaze gutorwa muri Afurika Magic Viewer Choice Awards y'uyu mwaka mu bakinnyi beza muri comedi. Muri filime hagaragaramo Charlie Karumi, Gerald Langiri na Lizz Njagah.\nUmugambi.\nIgitekerezo cya Fundi-mentals kizenguruka mubuzima bwa Fundis ebyiri (intoki), Joseph (Gerald Langiri) numufasha we Moses (Charlie Karumi) bakunda kwibwira ko ari Fundis nziza mumitungo ya Kinoo nubwo uburyo bwabo budasanzwe bwo gutunganya ibintu. Ariko iyinjira rya sosiyete nshya ya Multinational Service Company mumujyi itera ibi byose mukaga. Kugira ngo birinde gusohoka mu bucuruzi, bamenyesha abakiriya babo b'abakobwa ubwoko bushya bwa serivisi ya Ex-press hamwe n'ingaruka zishimishije.\nKurekura no kwakirwa.\n\"Fundi-Mentals\" yarekuwe ku ya 12 Gashyantare 2015, i Nairobi. Yapimwe basanga igombwa kurebwa nabantu barengeje imyaka 18+ kandi mugihe cyo gusohora abayitabiriye bari bakuru gusa. Isubiramo kuri Kenya Buzz Wangechi Maina yaranditse ati: \" \"Witege ko uzabona Fundi-Mentals\" bashize amanga babiganiraho [igitsina] muburyo uvuga ku mibonano mpuzabitsina na bagenzi bawe, nta kintu kibujijwe. Ibi bituma \"Fundi-Mentals\" bifitanye isano. \" "}
{"id": "9265", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9265", "title": "Disconnect (2018 film)", "text": "Disconnect ni filime yo gusetsa yo muri Kenya yo muri 2018 iyobowe na David 'Tosh' Gitonga na Michael Jones. Muri iyi filime hagaragaramo umukinnyi w'amafirime ukomoka muri Kenya Brenda Wairimu n'umukinnyi wa filime Nick Mutuma uyobora abakinnyi batandukanye bakora ubushakashatsi ku bijyanye no gukundana i Nairobi. Iyi filime izerekanwa kuri Netflix ku ya 16 Ukwakira 2020 izabe filime iheruka gukorerwa muri Kenya inyuze kuri Netflix, nyuma ya Poacher na Daisy Sincerely.\nUmugambi.\nIyi filime irazenguruka gukundana rwihishwa hagati yinshuti ebyiri nziza, Celine (yakinnye nka Brenda Wairimu) na Josh (Nick Mutuma), ninshuti zabo magara mumurwa mukuru wa Kenya. Celine afite ikibazo cyo kwinjira muburyo bukwiye, kandi akenshi yishingikiriza kumpanuro ninkunga yamarangamutima yinshuti ze zirimo TK (Catherine Kamau-Karanja) umusazi, Judy (Patricia Kihoro) umurwanyi wamasengesho, Robin (Pierra Makena) Mushiki wa Celine na Preeti (Aseem Sharma) mugenzi we bakorana. Inshuti magara ya Celine ni Josh, yakinnye na Nick Mutuma, nawe ufite itsinda ryinshuti z'abasore zimufasha kuyobora umubano we numukuniz we mu mujyi; igizwe na Otis (Pascal Tokodi) na Jennings (Arthur Sanya). "}
{"id": "9266", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9266", "title": "The First Grader", "text": "The First Grader ni filime yikinamico ya biografiya ya 2010 iyobowe na Justin Chadwick. Irimo Naomie Harris, Oliver Litondo, na Tony Kgoroge. Iyi filime ishingiye ku nkuru y'impamo ya Kimani Maruge, umuhinzi wo muri Kenya wiyandikishije mu mashuri abanza afite imyaka 84 nyuma yaho guverinoma ya Kenya yatangaje ko amashuri abanza ari buntu ku isi mu 2003. \nAbakinnyi.\nGufata amashusho.\nProducer ukomoka muri Amerika witwa Sam Feuer yasanze inkuru kurupapuro rwambere rwa LA Times ahitamo We, hanyuma, ashaka umufatanyabikorwa Richard Harding, yafatanije na BBC Films maze aha akazi Ann Peacock kwandika amashusho. Filime yakozwe n\u2019abongereza yafatiwe ahitwa Rift Valley muri Kenya, nubwo mbere byavuzwe ko izafatirwa muri Afrika yepfo. Umuyobozi Chadwick yagize ati: \"Twashoboraga kuyirasa muri Afurika y'Epfo, ariko Kenya ifite izo mbaraga zidasanzwe, zidasobanutse zirangwa mu bana, ndetse n'abantu twakoraga film\". "}
{"id": "9267", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9267", "title": "The Constant Gardener (film)", "text": "The Constant Gardener ni filim iri ituruka muri England and German yasohotse muri 2005 iyoborwa na Fernando Meirelles. Amashusho yakozwe na Jeffrey Caine ashingiye ku gitabo cya John le Carr\u00e9 cyo mu 2001 cyitwa The Constant Gardener. Iyi nkuru ikurikira Justin Quayle (Ralph Fiennes), umudipolomate w\u2019Ubwongereza muri Kenya, ubwo yageragezaga gukemura ikibazo cy\u2019iyicwa ry\u2019umugore we Tessa (Rachel Weisz), uharanira Amnesty, asimburana n\u2019ibintu byinshi byerekana amateka y\u2019urukundo rwabo.\nIyi filime yafatiwe amashusho ahitwa Loiyangalani no mucyaro cya Kibera, igice cya Nairobi, muri Kenya. Ibintu muri kariya gace byagize ingaruka ku bakinnyi ndetse no ku bakozi ku buryo bashizeho Constant Gardener Trust kugira ngo batange uburezi bw'ibanze kuri iyo midugudu. Uyu mugambi washingiye ku buryo budasobanutse ku rubanza rwabayeho i Kano, muri Nijeriya. Impapuro za DVD zasohotse muri Amerika ku ya 1 Mutarama 2006 no mu Bwongereza ku ya 13 Werurwe 2006. Ubwitonzi bwa Justin ariko bwitondewe kubihingwa bye ninsanganyamatsiko yagarukaga, aho ishusho ya firime yakomotse. Hubert Kound\u00e9, Danny Huston, Bill Nighy, Pete Postlethwaite, na Donald Sumpter bakoranye. Iyi filime yagenze neza kandi yinjiza amafaranga menshi kandi yegukana ibihembo bine bya Oscar, yegukana umukinnyi wa filime witwaye neza muri Rachel Weisz."}
{"id": "9268", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9268", "title": "18 Hours", "text": "18 Hours ni filime y'ikinamico yo muri Kenya 2017 yanditswe kandi iyobowe na Njue Kevin ku mugaragaro bwa mbere. Abakinnyi barimo Nick Ndeda, Sue Wanjiru, Brian Ogola, Isaya Evans na Shirleen Wangari. Iyi filime \"ikurikira inkeragutabara ya rookie irokoka amasaha 18 muri ambulance ubuzima bw'impanuka yo mu muhanda yangiwe kwinjira mu bitaro.\" Iyi filime, yakoze amateka nk\u2019ifoto ya mbere yo muri Kenya yatowe muri filime nziza muri rusange muri Afurika Magic Viewers Choice Awards (AMVCA) yegukana ibindi 4 bahatanira ibihembo muri 2018. \nUmusaruro.\nIgitekerezo cya filime cyatangiye mu 2015 ubwo Njue Kevin, umwanditsi &amp; diregiteri, yasomaga inkuru ku kinyamakuru. Ni inkuru yahumetswe n'amakuba yabayeho, aho umugabo yavuye ambulance mumasaha 18 kuko ibitaro byigihugu bya Kenyatta(Kenyatta National Hospital) byavugaga ko bidafite uburiri bwa ICU(ICU bed). Nibwo twatangiye gukina hirya no hino twibwira ko iyi idashobora kuba filime ikomeye; twibwira ko ari filime yo kwishimisha ariko ikanakoreshwa mu guhindura imibereho. Producer, Phoebe Ruguru yahise yomekwa hanyuma iterambere ry'imyandikire ritangirana no kuvugana n'abaganga benshi n'abatekinisiye byihutirwa bari barinjiye rwose kandi bafite uruhare mu mushinga hose. Njue yabitangaje, kubw'ibyo twagombaga kuba abizerwa mu buvandimwe, nkuko Njue yabitangarije BBC Gahuzamiryango. \nIgikorwa cyo gukina cyari cy'itabiriwe n'abantu kandi cy'itabiriwe n'abakinnyi ba Kenya nubwo umusaruro wakiriye ibyifuzo by'abakinnyi ku isi yose harimo bamwe bo muri LA, Hollywood, London, nu Budage. Ihamagarwa rya casting ryashyizwe k'umurongo kandi ryakiriye abasaba 1000 hanyuma 25 (makumyabiri na ba tanu)gusa binjira muri filime. Nyuma yo kwandika, Njue yahaye akazi umuhanzi w'inkuru maze akambika ibyumweru 4 mu nzu ye i Nairobi aho bakoze ibishushanyo n'amashusho kugira ngo basobanure inkuru.\nKurekura.\n18 Hours yafunguriwe mu nzu y'imikino muri Afrika y'Uburasirazuba ku ya 10 Ugushyingo 2017 kuri premier yagurishijwe. Abanyamakuru benshi bishimiye itangizwa ryabo barimo umukinnyi ukomoka mu gihugu cya Kenya, David Rudisha, wagize uruhare mu gikorwa cyo kwamamaza kugira ngo baharanire ubutabazi bwihuse muri Kenya. Filime yakiriwe neza muri Kenya hamwe n'ibisobanuro byerekana ubutwari bwa Njue Kevin n'itsinda rye gukora filime 18 Hours"}
{"id": "9269", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9269", "title": "House of Lungula", "text": "House of Lungula ni filime yo gusetsa yo muri Kenya yasohotse 2013 iyobowe na Alexandros Konstantaras. Yibanze ku mibonano mpuzabitsina y'Abanyakenya basanzwe. Ijambo \"lungula\" risobanura \"igitsina\" mu mvugo ya Kenya, Sheng. Muri filime hagaragaramo Gerald Langiri, Lizz Njagah na Ian Mbugua. Langiri akina ari umugabo ukora cyane ukeneye amafaranga kugirango yishyure inkwano y'umukunzi we, naho Njagah akina ari umugore wahisemo gukina umukino wa tit-tat-tat amenye ko umugabo we afite ihabara. Mbugua afitanye umubano wihishe nundi mukoba muto wakinnye yitwa Sara Hassan, akaba yikundira abagabo b'inararibonye bafite amafaranga. Filime yagenewe abarengeje imyaka 18+ nishyirahamwe ry'ubuyobozi bwa firime muri Kenya.\nUmuziki.\n\"House of Lungula\" yagaragayemo ibikorwa byinshi bya muzika byari byakozwe n'abahanzi bo muri Kenya. Ni Sisi Band yakoze \"(Give it all to me) Inzu ya Lungula\", niyo yari amajwi nyamukuru ya firime. Muri iyi filime kandi hagaragayemo Chuom 32 hamwe na Doreen Nyawira akora \"House of Lungula OST\".\". "}
{"id": "9270", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9270", "title": "I Want to Be a Pilot", "text": "I Want to Be a Pilot ni filimi ngufi yasohotse 2006 yegukanye igihembo gikomeye cyane cya Oscars muri 2006, ituruka muri Kenya - Mexique yanditswe inayoborwa na Diego Quemada-Diez. Iyi filime imaze kubona ibihembo mpuzamahanga birenga 50, harimo \"igihembo cy\u2019abateze amatwi\" mu iserukiramuco rya Filimi rya Los Angeles, kandi yitabiriye iserukiramuco rya firime risaga 200 nka Sundance, Locarno, Telluride, Edinburgh, Amiens, Los Angeles, S\u00e3o Paulo, Manhattan, Silverdocs, Bermuda, San Francisco.\nUmugambi.\nFilime ivuga amateka y'umuhungu wibasiwe n'ubukene muri kamwe mu turere dukennye cyane two muri Kenya ureba mu kirere kandi arota kuba umupiloti w\u2019indege."}
{"id": "9271", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9271", "title": "Intellectual Scum", "text": "Intellectual Scum ni film ngufi yo muri Kenya yasohotse 2015 iyobowe na Njue Kevin. Yakozwe na Rocque Pictures, iyi filime ni uguhuza ingingo itavugwaho rumwe 'Wowe Umunebwe (Umunyabwenge) wo muri Afurika!' yakozwe na Field Ruwe, umunyamerika ukora umwuga wo gutangaza amakuru muri Zambiya.\nUmugambi.\nMu ndege y'ubucuruzi, umunyabwenge w'umunyafurika (Field Ruwe), yicaye iruhande rw'umuzungu (Walter). Mu kiganiro cyabo, kikaba ari ubugome bukabije, inyangamugayo ndetse na bamwe mu bavangura amoko, Walter ashinja 'Abanyabwenge' kuba afurika iri aho iri ubu. \nUko yakozwe.\nAmafoto yibanze kuri firime yatangiye ku ya 15 Ugushyingo 2015 arangira ku ya 20 Ugushyingo 2015. Urukurikirane rw'indege kuri firime rwafatiwe,amashusho ku ndege nyirizina ku kibuga cy'indege cya Wilson bitandukanye no gukora sound stage.\nUyu muyobozi, Njue Kevin, kuri iki cyemezo yagize ati: \"Twari gukoresha inshuro ebyiri ingengo y\u2019imari itari ku kibuga cy\u2019indege nyirizina. Iyo ku ngengo y'imari idahwitse, ugomba gukora ibyo ugomba gukora. \""}
{"id": "9272", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9272", "title": "Kibera Kid", "text": "Kibera Kid ni filime ngufi yashyizwe mu gace ka Kibera i Nairobi, Kenya. Yanditswe, iyobowe kandi ifatanya na Nathan Collett ku bufatanye n\u2019abaturage ba Kibera. Iyi filime y'iminota cumi n'ibiri yagaragayemo abakinnyi ba filimi muri Kibera mubikorwa by'ingenzi. Yakinywe mu birori bya firime ku isi yose harimo iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Berlin kandi yatsindiye ukomoka muri Hollywood. Byanditswe na BBC, Reuters \u00a0 hamwe na Al Jazeera Icyongereza. Muri Mata 2009, hafashwe amashusho yerekana amashusho ya Kibera Kid. Filime ndende yuzuye yibanda ku makimbirane ashingiye ku moko ndetse no kwiyunga. Iyi filime yagize ingaruka nini kuko yatumye hashyirwaho Hot Sun Foundation itoza urubyiruko rwo mucyaro gukora firime zabo. \nUmugambi.\nKibera Kid ninkuru ya Otieno, impfubyi yimyaka 12 yo muri Kibera abana nitsinda ryabajura bagomba guhitamo ubuzima bw'agatsiko no gucungurwa. Inkuru ni ibihimbano ibintu byerekanwe ntabwo ari ukuri. Ubugizi bwa nabi n'ubukene birasanzwe muri Kibera, nyamara hari benshi bazaharanira ubuzima bwiza nubwo ibintu bimeze nabi."}
{"id": "9273", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9273", "title": "The Letter (2019 film)", "text": "The Letter ni filime documentaire ifite iminota 84 yo muri Kenya 2019 iyobowe na maia Lekow afatanyije na Christopher King. Yatoranijwe nkumunyakenya winjiye muri Filime Nziza Mpuzamahanga Yamamaye muri 93 Awards Academy, ariko ntabwo yatowe. \nInyandiko.\nUmusore yasuye umudugudu wa nyirakuru kugira ngo amenye ko yashinjwaga kuroga. "}
{"id": "9274", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9274", "title": "The Rescue (2021 film)", "text": "The Rescue ni film documentaire yasohotse 2021 iyobowe kandi ikorwa na Elizabeth Chai Vasarhelyi na Jimmy Chin. Bikurikiranye gutabara ubuvumo bwa Tham Luang, ubutumwa bwa 2018 bwakijije ikipe y'umupira w'amaguru mu buvumo bwamazi. Iyi filime yagaragaye bwa mbere ku isi mu iserukiramuco rya Filime rya 48 rya Telluride ku ya 2 Nzeri 2021, ikaba yarasohotse mu ikinamico muri Amerika ku ya 8 Ukwakira 2021.\nUmugambi.\nFilime ikurikira gutabara ubuvumo bwa Tham Luang.\nUmusaruro.\nMuri Werurwe 2019, byatangajwe ko Kevin Macdonald azayobora filime yerekanwe ku gutabara ubuvumo bwa Tham Luang, hamwe na National Geographic Documentary Films igiye gukorwa. Muri Gashyantare 2021, byatangajwe ko Elizabeth Chai Vasarhelyi na Jimmy Chin bazasimbura Macdonald nk'umuyobozi. \nAbakinnyi ba firime bagize ikibazo cyo kubona uburenganzira ku nkuru, aho National Geographic yashoboye kubona uburenganzira ku nkuru zinyuranye, mu gihe Netflix yari yarabonye uburenganzira ku bunararibonye bw'ikipe y'umupira w'amaguru, ibabuza kuvuga amateka yabo muri filime. \nKurekura.\nIyi filime yagaragaye bwa mbere ku isi mu iserukiramuco rya Filime rya 48 rya Telluride ku ya 2 Nzeri 2021. Yerekanwe kandi mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime rya 2021 rya Toronto ku ya 12 Nzeri 2021, aho yatsindiye igihembo cy\u2019abaturage cyo guhitamo inyandiko. Greenwich Entertainment izakwirakwiza film muri Amerika.\nAmashimwe.\n\"The Rescue\" yatsindiye igihembo cyiza cya Documentaire mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Midburg."}
{"id": "9275", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9275", "title": "Nairobi Half Life", "text": "Nairobi Half Life ni film y'ikinamico yo muri Kenya yasohotse 2012 iyobowe na David \"Tosh\" Gitonga. Iyi filime yatoranijwe nka filime yo muri kenya yinjiye neza mu rurimi rw'amahanga muri Oscar mu bihembo bya 85 bya Osama, ariko ntiyaboneka k'urutonde rwa nyuma, kandi ni ubwa mbere Kenya itanga filime muri iki cyiciro. Mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya Filime rya 33 rya Durban, Joseph Wairimu yatsindiye igihembo cy'umukinnyi mwiza. Yatsindiye kandi igihembo cya Afurika Movie Academy igihembo cy'umukinnyi wizewe cyane kuva mu birori bya 9. Yatsindiye ibihembo byinshi muri Afrika Magic Viewers Choice Awards 2014. \nKwakira.\n\"Umunyamakuru wa Hollywood,\" Todd McCarthy, yashimye iyi filime nyuma yo kuyireba muri AFI Fest 2012: \"Iyi kinamico igaragaramo ubunyangamugayo bufatika.\" KenyaBuzz yerekanye imikorere yibye yakozwe na Maina Olwenya ubwo Oti yagize ati: \"Iyi mico ni ghetto kuruta kumva alubumu za kera za NWA. Avuga ko afite ubugizi bwa nabi kandi agenda nkaho atunze umujyi nubwo ari umugizi wa nabi. \"Muri Werurwe 2014 Afurika Magic Viewers Choice Awards muri Werurwe 2014, \"Nairobi Half Life\" yahawe ibihembo kuri: "}
{"id": "9276", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9276", "title": "Pumzi", "text": "Pumzi ni film ngufi ya siyanse y'impimbano yo muri Kenya yanditswe kandi iyobowe na Wanuri Kahiu. Yerekanwe mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Sundance 2010 mu rwego rwa gahunda yayo nshya ya Afurika. Uyu mushinga watewe inkunga n\u2019ikigega cy\u2019ubuhanzi cya Changamoto, ndetse n\u2019ikigo cya Goethe Institut na Focus Features. Kahiu yizeye kwagura bigufi muburyo bwuzuye. Filime iri mucyongereza, ariko umutwe ni Igiswahili bisobanuye\"Umwuka\". \nAfurika.\nPumzi igwa cyane mubwoko bwa Africanfuturism. Irerekana uko ejo hazaza hazaba umuco (uherereye kumugabane wa Afrika) utuwe cyane nabirabura. Byongeye kandi, yakozwe na sitidiyo yo muri Afrika yepfo igizwe nitsinda ryabashinzwe gukora no kumenyekanisha uburyo bushya bwibintu ndangamuco biva mubihugu bya Afrika. \"Pumzi\" ihuza neza na motif ikunze kuboneka muri Africanfuturism, ariko ntibigarukiraho gusa, kuba hari ahantu nyaburanga hatagira uruhare runini rw'amazi."}
{"id": "9277", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9277", "title": "Poacher (film)", "text": "Poacher ni film ngufi ya Kenya / Ubwongereza yasohotse 2018 iyobowe na Tom Whitworth. Iyi filime yitabiriwe n'abantu benshi nyuma yo gusohoka muri Netflix muri Nzeri 2020. Yabaye kandi filime ya mbere yo muri Kenya yasohotse binyuze kuri Netflix. \nUmugambi.\nYakozwe mu buryo butangaje bwa firime, \"Poacher\" ivuga amateka y\u2019umuhinzi wihebye uhura n\u2019ibibazo nyuma yo kwiba igiti cy\u2019amahembe y\u2019inzovu mu gatsiko k\u2019iterabwoba. Iyi filime irashaka kwerekana ikibazo gikomeye mpuzamahanga cy\u2019ubucuruzi bw\u2019inzovu mu buryo butemewe hifashishijwe ibibazo by\u2019abaturage, inzovu ziri mu kaga muri Afurika. \nUmusaruro.\n\"Poacher\" yafashwe amashusho muminsi itandatu muri parike yigihugu ya Tsavo yuburengerazuba bwamajyepfo yumurwa mukuru wa Kenya, Nairobi. Umusaruro warimo abanyamuryango n'abakozi barenga 30. Umuyobozi Tom Whitworth yasebeje umuyobozi wa mbere ukiri muri filime ku ya 10 Mata 2018, atangaza ko sinema yakozwe na Nathan Prior na Ishmael Azeli. Byagaragaye ko filime ngufi yabanje gutekerezwa nk'ikinamico ya TV. \nKurekura.\n\"Poacher (2018)\" yarekuwe muri Kanama 2018, imaze kwerekanwa mu iserukiramuco rigufi kugeza ku ngingo (STTP), atoranyirizwa igihembo cya \"Best Editing\" Award \".\" Iyi filime yerekanwe bwa mbere muri Kenya mu nzu mberabyombi ya ANGA IMAX ku ya 10 Ugushyingo 2018 muri \"Kalasha International Film Awards\" i Nairobi. \"Poacher\" yanerekanywe mu \"iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya sinema mpuzamahanga rya\" Moscou 2018 muri Nzeri 2018 i Moscou. Iyi filime yanyujijwe kuri Netflix ku ya 30 Nzeri 2020."}
{"id": "9278", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9278", "title": "Rafiki", "text": "Rafiki (drama film yo muri Kenya iyoborwa na Wanuri Kahiu. \"Rafiki\" ninkuru y'urukundo rukura hagati y'abakobwa 2 bakiri bato, Kena na Ziki, hagati y'umuryango n\u2019igitutu cya politiki gikikije uburenganzira bwa LGBT muri Kenya. Iyi filime yagaragaye bwa mbere mpuzamahanga mu gice cya \"Un Certain Regard\" mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Cannes 2018. niyo filime ya mbere yo muri Kenya yerekanwe muri ibyo birori. \nUmugambi.\nKena afasha se John Mwaura kuyobora iduka rito ryorohereza i Nairobi mugihe yiyamamariza amatora yaho. Kena abana na nyina, utari mubyukuri kuvugana na John. Kena atangira gukundana na Ziki, umukobwa wabaturanyi ufite umusatsi wamabara, nawe wabaye umukobwa wa Peter Okemi, mukeba wa John muri politike. Kena na Ziki bafite gahunda nyinshi z'urukundo, kandi bahita begera cyane, ariko hariho amakimbirane yo kwerekana urukundo rwabo kumugaragaro kuko abaryamana bahuje ibitsina bitemewe muri Kenya.\nKwakira.\nKuri Metacritic film ifite amanota 68 ku 100 ishingiye kubisubizo byatanzwe nabanenga 17, byerekana \"muri rusange ibitekerezo byiza\". \nIbihembo.\nMugatsia yatsindiye igihembo cy'umukinnyi witwaye neza muri FESPACO ya 2019 i Ouagadougou, Burkina Faso kubera kwerekana Kena"}
{"id": "9279", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9279", "title": "Rise and Fall of Idi Amin", "text": "Rise and Fall of Idi Amin, izwi kandi ku izina rya Amin: The Rise and Fall, ni filime yerekeye ubuzima bwa \"Idi Amin mu\" 1981 yayobowe na Sharad Patel ikinwamo na Joseph Olita nka Idi Amin. Olita yakinnye kandi nka Amin muri filime \"Mississippi Masala yo\" mu 1991. \nUmugambi.\nIrasobanura ibikorwa n\u2019ubugizi bwa nabi bitavugwaho rumwe n\u2019uwahoze ari umunyagitugu wa Uganda, Idi Amin Dada, igihe yazamukaga ku butegetsi mu 1971 kugeza igihe yahiritswe ku butegetsi mu 1979 biturutse ku ntambara ya Uganda na Tanzaniya. \"Rise and Fall of Idi Amin\" yari ifatanije n\u2019Ubwongereza, Kenya, na Nijeriya, aho amashusho menshi yakorewe muri Kenya, hashize igihe kitageze ku mwaka Amin avuye kubutegetsi.. \nAmateka Yukuri.\nNubwo yiswe filime ikoreshwa nabi, birasobanutse neza ku byabaye n'amatariki y'ibyabaye byerekanwe, birimo igitero cya Isiraheli, intambara na Tanzaniya, no gufata no gufunga umunyamakuru w\u2019Ubwongereza Denis Hills (wigaragaza muri filime). \nIgisubizo.\nubwo yasohotse ku rwego mpuzamahanga, amajwi menshi yarahinduwe kubera amajwi atumvikana neza. Filime yatsindiye ibihembo bitanu, harimo umukinnyi mwiza, mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime rya Las Vegas. "}
{"id": "9280", "revid": "10227", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9280", "title": "Anne Mungai", "text": "Anne G. Mungai (wavutse 1957) ni umuyobozi wa firime yo muri Kenya. Azwi cyane muri firime ndende, \"Saikati\" (1992). Azwiho gucukumbura inkuru z'abakobwa b'Abanyafrika bakiri bato n'ingorane bahura nazo mu gihe bagenda muri Afurika nyuma y'ubukoloni. \nUbuzima.\nAnne Mungai yahawe impamyabumenyi mu kigo cya Kenya gishinzwe itumanaho rusange akomereza aho. Niwe washinze-umuyobozi w'ikinamico y'abana ya Shagilia. Mu 1993, Mungai yafatanyije gushinga Abagore muri Sinema muri Kenya, ifatanya n\u2019abagore b\u2019abanyafurika muri Filime na Video nka komite y\u2019agateganyo y\u2019igice cyayo cya Kenya. \nUmwuga w'ubuyobozi.\nUmwuga wo kuyobora Anne Mungai watangiye mu 1980 n\u2019igice gito cya mbere yise \"Nkomani Clinic.\" Kuva icyo gihe, yayoboye filime nyinshi ngufi-ndende, ndetse na filime ye ya mbere \"Sa\u00efkati.\" Iyi filime, kimwe n\u2019ibikorwa byinshi bya Mungai, yibanda ku miterere y\u2019umugore uba muri Afurika mu gihe gitandukanijwe n\u2019imigenzo gakondo y\u2019umuco nyafurika n\u2019izanwa mu bihugu by\u2019iburengerazuba mu gihe cy'abakoloni. "}
{"id": "9281", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9281", "title": "Shuga (TV series)", "text": "Shuga, izwi kandi ku izina rya MTV Shuga, ni urukurikirane rw'ikinamico rwa televiziyo rwatangajwe bwa mbere mu Gushyingo 2009 kuri MTV Base mu rwego rwo kwitwa \"MTV staying alive Ignite!\". Ibice byayo bibiri byambere byahawe inshingano na MTV Networks Africa ifatanije na MTV Staying Alive Foundation, PEPFAR, Ubufatanye bw\u2019umuryango urwanya virusi itera SIDA (HFG) na Guverinoma ya Kenya, mu rwego rwo gukwirakwiza ubutumwa bugamije gukwirakwiza ubutumwa ku myitwarire yimibonano mpuzabitsina no kwihangana\nIyi filime yaje gukundwa cyane kandi yerekanwa mu bihugu 40 bitandukanye bya Afurika mbere yuko isohoka ku rwego mpuzamahanga kuri televiziyo zirenga 70. Ikinamico yatekerezaga ko ari urukurikirane ruvuguruzanya cyane nabasekuruza bakuru ba Kenya kuko rwarimo amashusho amwe yarimo ibintu byerekeranye n'igitsina. Yabonye igihembo cya Zahabu muri Gicurasi 2010 mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga ry\u2019itangazamakuru ryabereye i Hamburg mu Budage mu cyiciro cy\u2019ubuzima rusange kubera kwibanda ku rukundo, amarangamutima, n\u2019imyitwarire y\u2019imibonano mpuzabitsina mu rubyiruko rwo muri Kenya. \nMTV Shuga (2020).\nKubera icyorezo cya Coronavirus, Shuga yagiye mu gitaramo gito cya nijoro cyiswe MTV Shuga Alone Together kigaragaza ibibazo bya Coronavirus ku ya 20 Mata 2020. Iki gitaramo cyagombaga gutambuka amajoro 65 kandi abayishyigikiye barimo Umuryango w\u2019abibumbye. Urukurikirane rushingiye muri Nijeriya, Afurika y'epfo, Kenya na C\u00f4te D'Ivoire kandi inkuru isobanurwa n'ibiganiro kumurongo hagati yabantu nyamukuru. Inyandiko yanditswe na Tunde Aladese na Nkiru Njoku. Nibo banditsi bakuru kuri iki gitaramo kandi banayoboye ibice. Gufata amashusho, kumurika no kwisiga byakozwe nabakinnyi ubwabo."}
{"id": "9282", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9282", "title": "Something Necessary", "text": "Something Necessary ni film yikinamico yo muri Kenya yasohotse 2013 iyobowe na Judy Kibinge. Yerekanwe mu gice cya Sinema y'isi muri iki gihe mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya sinema rya Toronto 2013. \nUmugambi.\nKenya 2007: Nyuma y'ibyavuye mu matora ya perezida atavugwaho rumwe, urugomo rwadutse. Agatsiko k'urubyiruko rudafite akazi rwatewe n'abanyapolitiki bajya mu mihanda hirya no hino. Anne akanguka mu bitaro avuye muri koma asanga ubuzima yagize mbere yihohoterwa butakibaho. Umugabo we yarapfuye kandi yashyinguwe mbere yuko agira amahirwe yo kumuririra. Umuhungu we Kitur ari muri koma kandi The Haven, umurima we n'inzu, byangijwe kandi byarasahuwe. Yagiye kuba umuforomo, umugore aba umupfakazi udafite akazi n'umuhungu uri mu bitaro uharanira kubaka umurima we. Ikirenze ibyo, ni umugore wa Kikuyu utuye mu gace ka Kalenjin, mushiki we yemera ko adahari kandi ko agomba gusubira mu rugo kugira ngo abe mu bwoko bwe. Ariko kubijyanye na Anne, ari murugo kandi ntazemera ko hagira umuntu umutera ubwoba.\nMugihe filime yegereje, Joseph yitegereza nyina akora yibaza icyo byose bivuze. Yahisemo gusibanganya amateka ye y\u2019urugomo maze ava mu mudugudu kugira ngo atangire ubuzima bushya i Nairobi hamwe n\u2019umukobwa w\u2019inzozi ze. Mugihe ibi bibaho, Anne asanga kwizera kwe kugaruwe muburyo butunguranye kubwimpano itazwi bimuha ubutwari nimbaraga akeneye cyane guhaguruka, guhangana namateka ye no gukomeza."}
{"id": "9283", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9283", "title": "Stories of Our Lives", "text": "Stories of Our Livesni film yo muri Kenya, yasohotse muri 2014. Iyi filime yakozwe n\u2019abanyamuryango ba The Nest Collective, ihuriro ry\u2019ubuhanzi rishingiye ku mujyi wa Nairobi, iyi filime ni anthologiya ya firime eshanu ngufi zerekana amateka y\u2019ubuzima bwa LGBT muri Kenya. \nUmugambi.\nVignettes eshanu zigize film nizi zikurikira:\nAsk Me Nicely.\nKate (Kelly Gichohi), umunyeshuri wigometse wigaga mumashuri yisumbuye - ahura na Kwizera, umunyeshuri mugenzi we muri koridoro yishuri. Batangira umubano wibanga, kugeza umuyobozi wishuri afashe ingamba zo gutandukanya bombi bahagarika Kate mwishuri. Mugihe yari kure yishuri, Kate atabishaka akora imibonano mpuzabitsina numuhungu mubaturanyi be. Agarutse, Kate abwira Kwizera kubyerekeye guhura numuhungu. Ibi birakaza Kwizera, biganisha ku kurangiza umubano wabo.\nRun.\nNyuma yo kugirana amasezerano n\u2019ubucuruzi n\u2019uwigana disiki(disc duplicator), Patrick (Paul Ogola) yaguye ku kabari kabo bahuje igitsina ubwo yagendanaga ninshuti ye magara, Kama. Kama agaragaza imyumvire mibi kubyerekeye akabari uko banyuze hejuru. Nyuma Patrick yaje gusubira muri club ijoro ryose, yizeye ko ntawe uzabimenya. Kama yerekana Patrick avuye mu kabari, kandi bafite guhangana gukabije. Patrick yahunze kugira ngo ahunge urugamba.\nAthman.\nAbakozi bo mu mirima Ray na Athman babaye inshuti magara imyaka myinshi. Kubabazwa nubusabane bwa Athman nubusabane na Fiona mushya, Ray yagiranye ikiganiro kibi na Athman kubyerekeye umubano wabo. Athman yongeye gushimangira ko adashishikajwe n'imibonano mpuzabitsina na Ray. Biyunze, noneho Ray abaza Athman niba ashobora kumusoma. Umukinnyi yatunguwe nikibazo aragenda, ntibyoroshye. Bombi bongera kwiyunga bukeye, ariko Ray ahitamo kuva mu murima.\nDuet.\nJeff (Mugambi Nthiga), umushakashatsi wasuye u Bwongereza mu nama - aha akazi umuherekeza Roman mu gihe cy'isaha imwe mu cyumba cye cya hoteri. Roman (Louis Brooke) arahagera, yumva impungenge za Jeff, agerageza kumutuza. Jeff abaza niba bashobora kuvuga bike mbere yo kwishora mubikorwa byose. Bombi baricara bakaganira kubyerekeye isano iri hagati yubwoko. Roman noneho aha Jeff massage, bigatuma Jeff adahangayika.\nEach Night I Dream.\nLiz (Rose Njenga), yerekana gahunda zidasanzwe zo guhunga we na mugenzi we Achi mugihe abadepite baho bakangisha kubahiriza amategeko arwanya abaryamana bahuje ibitsina.\nUmusaruro.\n\"Stories of Our Lives\" Yatangiye nkumushinga winyandiko na Nest Collective. Iri tsinda ryazengurutse Kenya, rifata amajwi yabajijwe n'abantu bavuga ko ari LGBTIQ. Iyandikwa ryabaye ishingiro rya firime vignettes. 15,000 y\u2019amadorali yavuye muri Uhai / EASHRI - ikigega cy\u2019uburenganzira bw\u2019imibonano mpuzabitsina muri Afurika y\u2019iburasirazuba gifite icyicaro i Nairobi, muri Kenya - kikaba cyarafashwe amashusho n\u2019itsinda mu gihe cy\u2019amezi umunani hakoreshejwe kamera imwe ya Canon DSLR. "}
{"id": "9284", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9284", "title": "Togetherness Supreme", "text": "Togetherness Supreme ni film yo muri Kenya yasohotse muri 2010.\nInyandiko.\nUkurikije ibyabaye, \"Togetherness Supreme\" ni inkuru ya Kamau, umuhanzi, ushakisha impinduka hagati y\u2019amakimbirane ashingiye ku moko mucyaro. Kamau yahagurukiye kurwanya se n'umuryango we kugira ngo yinjire mu muryango uhanganye n'incuti ye Otieno. Kamau na Otieno barwanira impinduka za politiki kubatuye mu bukene bukabije, ariko bafatiwe hagati y\u2019amakimbirane ashingiye ku moko asenya igihugu cyabo kandi, bahanganye kubera urukundo rwa Alice, umukobwa w\u2019umuganga. Nyuma y\u2019amatora y\u2019umukuru w\u2019igihugu ateganijwe (amatora y\u2019umukuru w\u2019igihugu cya Kenya yo mu Kuboza 2007), akajagari kadutse mu ihohoterwa kandi isi ya Kamau irasenyuka."}
{"id": "9285", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9285", "title": "To Walk with Lions", "text": "To Walk with Lions ni film yo mu 1999 iyobowe na Carl Schultz ikinwamo na Richard Harris nka George Adamson na John Michie nka Tony Fitzjohn. Bikurikiranye imyaka yakurikiyeho Ntare wunganira Adamson. Nyuma yo gushyingiranwa na Joy Adamson wa \"Born Free\" fame, Adamson yamaze igice cya nyuma cyubuzima bwe arinda intare n\u2019ibindi binyabuzima muri Kora National Reserve, Kenya. Ahura na ba rushimusi na ruswa ya leta imubuza gushaka kubungabunga inyamaswa.\nUmugambi.\nTony Fitzjohn (John Michie) aje gukora kuri Kora, kubungabunga intare, kubavandimwe babiri bageze mu zabukuru, George na Terence Adamson (Ian Bannen). Ku munsi we wa mbere, Fitzjohn yirengagije inama za George zo kutiruka kandi hafi yarakubiswe. Kumenyeshwa ubu nuburyo umuntu wa nyuma wujuje umwanya we yapfuye, Fitzjohn yanditse ahantu hose nk'umusazi ahitamo kugenda. Nyuma yumunota wanyuma uhinduye umutima, hamwe n'icyana cy'intare cyamuzanye muri pariki kugirango amutoze kandi yongere yinjire mwishyamba, avumbura umuhamagaro wukuri mubuzima bwe."}
{"id": "9286", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9286", "title": "Veve (film)", "text": "Veve ni film y'ikinamico yo muri Kenya 2014 iyobowe na Simon Mukali. VEVE ni co-production of One Fine Day Films na Ginger Ink.. \nUmugambi.\nAmos, umwe mu bagize Inteko ishinga amategeko w\u2019ibanze, arashaka kuba guverineri wa Maua mu matora ari imbere mu gihe yagura inyungu z\u2019ubucuruzi. Ni umutanga wingenzi kubohereza ibicuruzwa hanze, Wadu, umucuruzi uzi ubwenge, utegeka umugabane munini wubucuruzi. Nyuma y'ikiganiro numucungamari we winyuma, Amos abona umwanya wo kuzamura umubano we w'akazi na Wadu no kubona imigabane minini mubucuruzi. Yasangiye umugambi we n\u2019umugabo we w\u2019iburyo witwa Sammy, wagize uruhare runini mu kubaka imbaraga za Amosi, amukorera imirimo yanduye. Ariko Sammy yifuza imirimo nk'iyi iragabanuka. Aracyafite agahinda k'urupfu rw'umugore we nubwo hashize imyaka mike, Sammy arwana urugamba rwo guhuza umubyeyi n'umuhungu we wigometse, uhumeka kole."}
{"id": "9287", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9287", "title": "De Voortrekkers", "text": "De Voortrekkers ni film idafite amajwi yasohotse 1916 yamenyakanye nka filime ya mbere muri Afurika y'Epfo. Yakozwe na African Film Productions kandi iyobowe na Harold M. Shaw, yerekana \" Great Trek \" ya Boers yo mu myaka ya za 1830, isozwa n\u2019imyidagaduro ya hegemonike y\u2019Intambara y\u2019amaraso yabaye ku ya 16 Ukuboza 1838, igihe Abanyafurika bitwaje intwaro. yatsinze ibihumbi byinshi Zulus. \"Abakomoka kuri voortrekkers\" bavuga ururimi rw\u2019Ubuholandi cyangwa \"abapayiniya\" bitabiriye Great Trek bubahaga filime kandi barayikoresha mu kwibuka ibirori, bikaba bigize igice cy\u2019amakimbirane menshi mu mateka ya Afurika y'Epfo. Abanyafurika babigaragaje mu byumba by\u2019ishuri imyaka ibarirwa muri za mirongo kandi barabigaragaza buri mwaka mu birori mbonezamubano bizihiza isabukuru y'intambara.\n\"De Voortrekkers\" yerekanwe muri Afurika y'Epfo ahitwa Krugersdorp ku ya 14 Ukuboza 1916, hasigaye iminsi ibiri ngo isabukuru y'imyaka 78 imaze ibaye. Nyuma yaje gukwirakwizwa mu magambo ahinnye muri sinema zo mu Bwongereza, Amerika, Kanada, n'ahandi hanze ya Afurika ku izina rya \"Winning a Continent\". Intertitles zikoreshwa muri firime y'umwimerere no mubisohoka nyuma ikoresha imiterere ya ecran yerekana inyandiko mucyongereza no muri Afrikaans. "}
{"id": "9288", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9288", "title": "Sarie Marais", "text": "\" Sarie Marais \" (bizwi kandi nka \"My Sarie Marais\", n'indirimbo gakondo y'Afurika y'Epfo, yakozwe bishoboka mu gihe cy'Intambara ya mbere y'Abongereza (nko mu 1880) Intambara ya Kabiri ya Anglo-Boer (nko mu 1900). Iyi ndirimbo ishobora kuba yarakuwe mu ndirimbo yaturutse mu ntambara y'Abanyamerika yitwa \"Carry me back to Tennessee\" cyangwa \" Sweet Ellie Rhee \" hamwe n'amagambo yahinduwe muri Afrikaans.\nMu busobanuro bw'ikinyarwanda, indirimbo itangira igira iti: \"Sarie Marais wanjye ari kure cyane y'umutima wanjye ariko nizeye ko tuzongera kumubona. Yatuye hafi y'uruzi rwa Mooi mbere yuko iyi ntambara itangira... \"; kandi korari ni:\" Yoo, nsubiza muri Transvaal ishaje, aho Sarie wanjye atuye, hepfo hariya mu mirima y'ibigori hafi y'igiti cy'amahwa kibisi, ngaho abaho Sarie Marais. \" \"hejuru y'inyanja\" (mu by'ukuri, mu 28.000 Boer abagabo batwawe nkimbohe 25 000 bajyanwa mu bwongereza\n\"Sarie Marais\" (1931): film ya mbere yo muri Afrika yepfo ifite amajwi.\n\"Sarie Marais\" kandi yari umutwe w'ishusho ya filime ya mbere yo muri Afurika y'Epfo ivuga, iyobowe na Joseph Albrecht () kandi yakozwe mu 1931. Ifoto yafatiwe i Johannesburg, \"Sarie Marais abasha\" gupakira byinshi mugihe cyiminota 10 yo kwiruka. Iyi firime yashyizwe mu nkambi ya POW yo mu Bwongereza, yibanda ku itsinda ry\u2019imfungwa za Boer uko zigenda zireba ijisho ry\u2019abafashwe n\u2019abongereza. umunsi umwe imfungwa itera ijwi ryw hejuru aririmba agira ati \"My Sarie Marais\". Ishyaka rye rifata izindi mfungwa, bikabaha ibyiringiro by'ejo hazaza. "}
{"id": "9289", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9289", "title": "African Jim", "text": "African Jim, izwi kandi ku izina rya Jim Aza i Jo'burg, ni filime yo muri Afurika y'Epfo yasohotse muri 1949, iyobowe na Donald Swanson kandi yakozwe na Eric Rutherford. Irimo Daniel Adnewmah, Dolly Rathebe, Inkspots nyafurika, Sam Maile, na Dan Twala. Birazwi cyane nka republika ya Afrika yepfo film ya mbere yuburebure bwa Afrika. \nTegura ibisobanuro.\nJim yavuye mu gace k'imiryango gushaka umutungo we i Johannesburg. Akimara kuhagera, abambari batatu baramukubita. Iyo agaruye ubwenge, umuzamu w'ijoro wa gicuti amwitaho. Abifashijwemo n'umuzamu, Jim abona akazi muri club ya nijoro nk'umukozi. Yahawe amahirwe yo kuririmbira kuri stage hamwe numurimbyikazi wikipe, Dolly. Mbere yuko atangira bwa mbere, amenya abambari bamusahuye kandi yumva ko bategura ubujura. Jim agomba guhitamo uburyo bwo guhagarika icyaha kandi akiri mugihe cyo gukora. "}
{"id": "9290", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9290", "title": "Daar doer in die bosveld", "text": "Daar doer in die bosveld (Icyongereza: \"Far Away in Bushveld\") niyo film yambere yakozwe numuyobozi wumunya Afrika yepfo Jamie Uys. Yasohotse bwa mbere mu 1951. Filime iri mu rurimi rwa Afrikaans, ururimi rwihariye rwa Afrika yepfo.\nUmugambi.\nIyi filime ni urwenya ku muhinzi ufite isoni witwa Hans Botha usabwa gufata umwarimu ukiri muto witwa Martie du Toit. Hans ageze aho bisi ihagarara gufata Martie arumirwa rwose kubera ubwiza bwe kandi abasha kuvuga gusa interuro, \"It looks like rain..\" na It was an accident.\" Bombi bahura ningorane nyinshi munzira; ahanini bitewe n'imodoka ya kera ya Hans. Igihe bombi bageze aho Martie yerekeza, Martie atose kandi yemeza ko Hans ari igicucu. Hans, ariko, akunda byimazeyo Martie. "}
{"id": "9291", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9291", "title": "Kimberley Jim", "text": "Kimberley Jim ni filime yo gusetsa y'umuziki yo muri Afurika y\u2019Epfo yasohotse 1963 yayobowe na Emil Nofal ikinwamo Jim Reeves, Madeleine Usher na Clive Parnell. Umugambi wayo ukurikira umuririmbyi w'umunyamerika witabira kwihuta kwa diyama ya Kimberley muri Afrika yepfo mu mpera zikinyejana cya 19. By'umwihariko, \"Jim Reeves na Clive Parnell bakina abantu bakundwa na con-men binjiza amafaranga yo kugurisha imiti y\u2019ipatanti no gushuka kuri poker... babiri bashora amafaranga yabo mu guteza imbere ikirombe cya diyama ariko bagomba kurenza umucuruzi waho ugoramye\", nk'ukoincamake ibivuga. \nReeves, umuririmbyi wo mu gihugu, yakunzwe cyane mu myaka ya za 1960. Nk\u2019uko ikinyamakuru Billboard kibitangaza ngo \" Reeves yamuritse mu mahanga mu Bwongereza, Ubuhinde, Ubudage, ndetse no muri Afurika y'Epfo\". Muri film, umuhanzi aririmba igice cy'indirimbo imwe muri Afrikaans. Amajwi y'indirimbo 14 yarimo indirimbo \"Kimberley Jim,\" \"Strike It Rich,\" \"Nakuze,\" \"Ubuzima bwanjye ni Gypsy,\" \"Navutse Kugira Amahirwe,\" \"Rag Fashioned Rag,\" \"Diamonds The Umusenyi, \" Inshuti Y'umunyamahanga Gusa, \" Gwa kandi Ukurikire, \"\" Umukinnyi ukina urusimbi \"na\" Dolly hamwe n'amavi yataye. \" \nInyuma nyinshi zafatiwe amashusho mu gace ko mu mujyi muto w\u2019Ubwongereza mu gihe imbere yafatiwe kuri sitidiyo ya Jamie Uys mu majyaruguru y\u2019umugi wa Johannesburg. Nyuma Reeves yavuze ko yishimiye uburambe bwo gukora firime kandi ko azatekereza gukoresha byinshi mu mwuga we. Iyi filime yasohotse mu 1965 nyuma y'urupfu rwa Reeves azize impanuka y'indege. "}
{"id": "9292", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9292", "title": "Death Drums Along the River", "text": "Death Drums Along the River (yitwa Sanders muri Amerika) ni filimi yasohotse muri 1963 mu Bwongereza n\u2019Ubudage bakoranye n\u2019amahanga, bakoresheje abantu bavugwa mu gitabo cya Edgar Wallace cyo mu 1911 cyitwa \"Sanders of the River\" na filime ya Zolt\u00e1n Korda yo mu 1935 ishingiye ku gitabo, ariko yashyizwe mu nkuru itandukanye rwose. Ifata amashusho aherereye muri Afrika yepfo, igaragaramo Richard Todd na Marianne Koch bayoboye itsinda ryabakinnyi b\u2019abongereza, Abadage na Afurika yepfo. Iyi filime niyo filime yambere yerekanwe na producer w\u2019abongereza Harry Alan Towers.\nUko yakozwe.\nHarry Alan Towers yakoze firime nyinshi muri Afrika yepfo ku nkunga ya Film ya Constantin mu Budage bw\u2019Iburengerazuba hamwe n\u2019abakinnyi baturutse muri kiriya gihugu. Iyi filime yagurishijwe mu Budage bw\u2019Iburengerazuba nka imwe mu mafilime yakunzwe cyane ya Edgar Wallace, ariko ntaho ahuriye cyane n\u2019igitabo cya Wallace cyitwa \"Sanders of the River\", cyangwa filime zabanjirije iyi zishingiye kuri icyo gitabo, usibye izina Sanders n'ubwato. \"Zaire\", nubwo hano ari ubwato buto bwa moteri aho kuba parike. Intambara hagati y\u2019ibikorwa bya Wallace yasimbuwe n\u2019inkuru isanzwe y\u2019iperereza irimo ubwicanyi na magendu ya diyama. Abakoloni b'impimbano ntibahawe izina, ariko mu rwego rw'ibihe Dr Jung abaza Sanders icyo azakora igihe azahabwa ubwigenge "}
{"id": "9293", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9293", "title": "Coast of Skeletons", "text": "Coast of Skeletons ni filime yo kwidagadura yo mu Bwongereza na Afurika yo mu 1965, iyobowe na Robert Lynn ikinwamo na Richard Todd na Dale Robertson. Ni urukurikirane rwa filime yo mu 1963 \"y\u2019urupfu ku Ruzi\", kandi kimwe n\u2019iyo filime, ikoresha abantu bavugwa mu gitabo cya Edgar Wallace cyo mu 1911 cyitwa \"Sanders of the River\" na Zolt\u00e1n Korda yo muri 1935 ishingiye kuri roman, ariko igashyirwa mu inkuru itandukanye rwose. \"Coast of Skeletons\" yarekuwe mubudage nka \"Sanders und das Schiff des Todes\" / \"Sanders hamwe nubwato bwurupfu\".\nNyuma y'ubwigenge, ubukoloni bw\u2019Abongereza butavuzwe izina aho Komiseri Harry Sanders amaze imyaka myinshi akorera yirukanywe n'abapolisi b\u2019Ubwongereza. Sanders rero asubira i Londres, aho yahise abona akazi mu isosiyete y'ubwishingizi, ishaka ko yakurikirana umushinga wo gucukura diyama mu mazi magari yo muri Afurika y'Epfo."}
{"id": "9294", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9294", "title": "Sandy the Seal", "text": "Sandy the Seal ni film yumuryango w'ubwongereza mu 1965 iyobowe na Robert Lynn ikinwamo na Heinz Drache, Marianne Koch na Gert Van den Bergh. Iyi filime yakozwe kandi afatanije na Harry Alan Towers, yafatiwe amashusho muri Afurika yepfo muri Technicolor na Techniscope II hamwe n\u2019uruhererekane rwakorewe ku kirwa cya Seal, muri Afurika yepfo. Iyi filime yasohotse mu Bwongereza na Tigon British Film Productions mu 1969.\nUmugambi.\nUmuzamu w'amatara asanga kashe yakomeretse yasizwe na ba rushimusi. Azana kashe k'umugore we n'abana babiri biga inshingano bareba kashe bise Sandy. Sandy aherekeza abana mubyababayeho no mubikorwa byabo maze avumbura ubwato bwaba rushimusi ba kashe bateganya gusubira ku kirwa cy'umucyo kubutaka bw'agaciro."}
{"id": "9295", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9295", "title": "The Naked Prey", "text": "The Naked Prey ni filime yo muri Amerika yo mu 1965 yakozwe kandi iyobowe na Cornel Wilde, nawe ukina mu mwanya wa mbere. Bashyizwe muri veldt yo muri Afrika yepfo, imigambi ya firime yibanda kumuyobozi wa safari ugerageza kubaho mubuzima bubi bwa veldt, mugihe agerageza kwirinda urupfu rwatewe nabarwanyi ba Afrika bihorera. Iyinkuru ishingiye kuburambe bw'umushakashatsi w'umunyamerika John Colter. Amashusho yamamaye yinjije abanditsi Clint Johnson na Don Peters mu gihembo cya Akademiki cyiza cyumwimerere.\nIyi filime yerekanwe bwa mbere mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya sinema rya San Sebasti\u00e1n 1965, nyuma isohoka muri Amerika ku ya 23 Werurwe 1966. Iyi filime yakozwe ku ngengo yimari itarenga 700.000 $, iyi firime yafatiwe ahantu hose muri Afrika yepfo.\nuko yakozwe.\n\"The Naked Prey yafatiwe\" amashusho muri Afrika yepfo. Amashusho ya firime yari afite impapuro icyenda gusa. Amazina yatangije iyi filime yaherekejwe n\u2019ibishushanyo byerekanwe n\u2019umuhanzi waho Andrew Motjuoadi."}
{"id": "9296", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9296", "title": "The Cape Town Affair", "text": "\"The Cape Town Affair ni\" filime y'ubutasi yakozwe na 20 Century Fox kuri Studiyo ya Killarney muri Afrika yepfo iyoborwa na Robert D. Webb muri 1967. Muri iyi filime hagaragaramo Claire Trevor, James Brolin, na Jacqueline Bisset. Nibisubirwamo by'amafoto 1953 \"\".Nibwo bwa mbere Brolin yakinnye We na Bisset bombi bagiranye amasezerano na Fox. Nyuma yaje kuvuga ati \"Sinigeze nkunda cyane ariko twe [we na Bisset] ntabwo twari babi.\" \nUmugambi.\nAbakozi bo muri Afrika y'epfo bagerageza kubika microfilm y'ibanga mbere y'uko Abakomunisiti babifata."}
{"id": "9297", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9297", "title": "Lost in the Desert", "text": "Lost in the Desert ku ikubitiro yasohotse nka Dirkie, ni filime yo muri Afurika y'Epfo yo mu 1969 yanditswe, yakozwe kandi iyobowe na Jamie Uys ku izina rya Jamie Hayes. Yafashwe amashusho muri Techniscope na Technicolor. Uys ubwe akina nka Anton De Vries, umucuranzi wa piyano w'igitaramo cy'umuhungu we Dirkie wimyaka 8. Dirkie akinishwa n'umuhungu wa Uys Wynand Uys, uzwi nka Dirkie Hayes. Umugambi wahujwe nyuma yimyaka ibiri na \"Walkabout\" yatsinze cyane.\nTelugu remake.\nIsubiramo ryamamaye cyane ryakozwe mu rurimi rwa Telugu, ururimi rwo mu majyepfo y\u2019Ubuhinde, mu 1972, ku izina rya \"Papam Pasivadu\" hamwe n\u2019impinduka nkeya zahinduwe mu nkuru kugira ngo zihuze n'abari aho."}
{"id": "9298", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9298", "title": "Shangani Patrol (film)", "text": "Shangani Patrol ni filime y'intambara ishingiye ku gitabo kitari ibihimbano \"A Time to Die\" cyanditswe na Robert Cary (1968), hamwe n\u2019amateka ya Shangani Patrol, hamwe na Brian O'Shaughnessy nka Major Allan Wilson na Will Hutchins nk'umuskuti Frederick. Russell Burnham. Harimo n'indirimbo \"Shangani Patrol\" ya Nick Taylor (recording 1966).\nKu buyobozi bwa Major Wilson, irondo rikurikirana umwami Ndebele Lobengula wahunze hakurya y'uruzi rwa Shangani. Bagabanijwe ku mbaraga nyamukuru, batewe igico na Ndebele impi kandi, usibye abagabo bake boherejwe nk'imbaraga, bose baricwa. Ubwo ni bwo butwari bw'irondo rya Shangani ku buryo Ndebele watsinze yagize ati: \"Bari abagabo ariko na ba se bari abagabo mbere yabo.\" Ukurikije uko umuntu abibona, ibyabaye byari rimwe mu makosa akomeye no kwibeshya kwa gisirikare muri iki gihe cy'amateka, cyangwa igihagararo cyanyuma cyintwari cya bake. Ibyabaye byari bifite akamaro gakomeye mubwongereza, Afrika yepfo, na Rodeziya bihwanye na ' Custer's Last stand '. Ngiyo inkuru yabo, yavuzwe muri firime ya 1970 yafatiwe ahitwa Matabeleland, Rhodesia (ubu ni muri Zimbabwe)."}
{"id": "9299", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9299", "title": "Animals Are Beautiful People", "text": "Animals Are Beautiful People (nanone yitwa Beautiful People) ni documentaire y\u2019ibidukikije yo muri yo mu 1974 yanditswe, yakozwe, iyoborwa, ifatwa amashusho kandi ihindurwa na Jamie Uys, ivuga ku nyamaswa zo muri Afurika yepfo, zerekanwe nibintu bisetsa. Yafatiwe amashusho mu butayu bwa Namib, ubutayu bwa Kalahari n'umugezi wa Okavango na Delta ya Okavango.. yahawe igihembo cya Golden Globe 1974 muri Filime Nziza.Iyi filime, intsinzi ikomeye mu bucuruzi, yakozwe mu bwigenge na Uys, izwi kandi nyuma yo gusetsa muri \"The Gods Must Be Crazy\" (1980). \nUmuziki wa kera.\nFilime ikoresha umuziki wa kera na cyane ibice bizwi kugirango bishyigikire "}
{"id": "9300", "revid": "6702", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9300", "title": "Boesman and Lena", "text": "Boesman na Lena ni ikinamico ngufi yakorewe muri Afurika y'Epfo ikozwe na Athol Fugard, Swartkops mudflats hamwe na Port Elizabeth mur Cape Town y'iburasirazuba, yerekana ingaruka ya apartheid ku bantu bakeya, hagaragaramo \"umugabo n'umugore bagenda bava mu mujyi umwe bajya mu wundi.\nAmavu n'amavuko.\nMubisanzwe hamwe nibindi bikorwa byinshi bya Fugard, ikinamico yibanda ku bantu batari abazungu kandi ikubiyemo ibintu byo kwigaragambya. \"Boesman na Lena\" batewe inkunga n'ibyabaye mu 1965 igihe Fugard yari atwaye mu umuhanda wo mu cyaro muri Afurika y'Epfo. Yabonye umukecuru ugenda mu muhanda izuba ryamwishe, ku bilometero uvuye aho agana, maze amuha lift. Yaratsinzwe ararira ashimira. Yamubwiye ko umugabo we yari amaze gupfa kandi ko yari yagiye mu rindi sambu. iyo Fugard adahagarara, yari kurara kumuhanda. (Byari akamenyero muri Afurika y'Epfo ivangura rishingiye ku gitsina abahinzi birukana imiryango y'abakozi igihe umukozi yapfaga.) Icyatangaje Fugard nuko umugore yari afite ububabare ariko akaba ataratsinzwe. Ibi byamuteye kwandika ikinamico."}
{"id": "9301", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9301", "title": "Funeral for an Assassin", "text": "Funeral for an Assassin ni filime yo muri Afurika yepfo yasohotse muri 1974 iyobowe na Ivan Hall yasohotse muri Amerika mu 1977.\nUmugambi.\nMichael Cardiff numuntu uharanira impinduramatwara wabigize umwuga watojwe cyane muburyo butandukanye bwo kwica, gucengera no guhunga amategeko. Amaze gutoroka gereza ashyira ibintu bimuranga ku mubiri wangiritse kugira ngo agaragare ko yapfuye mu gihe ateganya kwihimura kuri guverinoma. Cardiff akoresha ubuhanga bwe mu kwica umucamanza ukomeye bituma urupfu rwe rusa nkimpanuka kugirango atere ibikoresho biturika bitunguranye mu muhango wo kumushyingura witabiriwe n\u2019abimuka n\u2019abanyeganyeza ubutegetsi. Gusa kapiteni wa polisi udahuje ibitekerezo ari kuri gahunda ze."}
{"id": "9302", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9302", "title": "No Gold for a Dead Diver", "text": "No Gold for a Dead Diver ni film yo muburengerazuba bw'Ubudage yasohotse muri 1974 yayoborwa na Harald Reinl fatanyije na Star Horst Janson, Monika lundi na Marius Weyers. Igishimishije kubyerekeranye ninyanja ndende ishakisha ubutunzi bwashyinguwe, yafatiwe amashusho muri Afrika yepfo. Amashusho ya firime yateguwe n'umuyobozi wubuhanzi Dieter Bartels.\nNyuma yo gutsinda kwa kw'abayahudi muri(1975), film yasohotse muri Amerika ifite izina rya Deadly Jaws."}
{"id": "9303", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9303", "title": "Albino (film)", "text": "Albino (izwi nka The Night of the Askari, Death in the Sun and Whispering Death) ni filimi yasohotse muri 1976 yakozwe n'abadage iyoborwa na J\u00fcrgen Goslar na Star Christopher Lee, James Faulkner na Sybil Danning yafashwe amashusho mugihe cy'intambara ya Rhodesian Bush. Filime ishingiye ku gitabo \"The Whispering Death\" cyanditswe na Daniel Carney.\nUmugambi.\nTerrick (James Faulkner), umupolisi w\u2019Ubwongereza muri Afurika yepfo mu cyaro cya Rhodesia, ategereje ko umurimo we urangira ndetse n\u2019izabukuru hakiri kare mu murima we hamwe n\u2019umukunzi we, Sally (Sybil Danning). Icyizere cya Terrick cyo kubaho mu mahoro hamwe na Sally kiracika intege, ariko, igihe inyeshyamba z'abirabura b'abirabura zateye umurima. Sally yafashwe ku ngufu akicwa n'umuyobozi w'inyeshyamba, albino izwi gusa na moniker \"Urupfu rwongorera\" (Horst Frank). Ababajwe n'agahinda, Terrick n'abakozi be bo mu mirima, bayobowe na Katchemu (Sam Williams) bahisemo kwihorera Sally bonyine. Nyuma baza kumenya ko inyeshyamba zahamagaye abaturage baho mu nama yo kubanyapolitiki no kubateza igico \"Urupfu rwongorera\". Icyakora ishyaka rya Terrick rifungura umuriro imburagihe, ryica kandi rikomeretsa bamwe mu baturage bari bahari."}
{"id": "9304", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9304", "title": "Killer Force", "text": "Killer Force, izwi kandi ku izina rya The Diamond Mercenaries, ni filime ishimishije yo mu 1976 iyobowe na Val Guest ikinwamo na Telly Savalas, Peter Fonda na Christopher Lee. Byari ubufatanye hagati ya Repubulika ya Irilande, Ubusuwisi na Amerika kandi yafashwe amashusho cyane muri Afurika y'Epfo. Umugambi wayo ni agatsiko k'abagizi ba nabi bategura ubujura bukomeye mu kirombe cya diyama.\nUmugambi.\nUmuyobozi w\u2019umutekano Harry Webb afite ubwoba ko ubujura bwa diyama bugiye kubera mu ruganda rukora ubucukuzi bw\u2019amabuye y'agaciro mu butayu. Yahise abasha gukundwa cyane, na Claire Chambers, umukobwa wamamaye cyane n'umukobwa w'umuyobozi w'ibirombe. Arimo gusura umugabo akunda, Mike Bradley, ushinzwe umutekano kuri iki kirombe.\nNelson, umuyobozi w\u2019ibirombe, aha Bradley ubutumwa bw'amatsiko - kwiba diyama. Arashaka kugira uruhare kuri Bradley kugira ngo amuhuze na Lewis runaka witegura kwiba ikirombe abifashijwemo n'itsinda ry'abacanshuro ndetse n'ibikoresho byaho bizwi nka Padiri Noheri. Webb, itamenyeshejwe uburiganya, idahwema gukurikirana Bradley, wavuganye na Lewis. Hamwe n'abacanshuro mugikorwa cyo kwinjira mu kirombe, Bradley yerekanye ko ari Padiri Noheri, wateguye iki gikorwa cyose. Hamwe na Webb ikurikirana, Bradley yahungiye mu butayu hamwe nabandi barokotse."}
{"id": "9305", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9305", "title": "Kill or Be Killed (1980 film)", "text": "Kill or Be Killed (bwa mbere yasohokeye muri Amerika nka Karate Killer irongera isohorerwa muri Afurika y'epfo nka Karate Olympiad) ni filime yasohotse muri 1977 muri Afurika y'Epfo / Amerika karate film iyoborwa na Ivan Hall. Iyi filime yakorewe muri Afurika y'Epfo, iyi filime yiswe \"Kill cyangwa Be Killed\" muri Amerika mu 1980 kugira ngo yunguke menshi mu gukina filime z'ubuhanzi bw'intambara zo muri Amerika. Urukurikirane rwo kwamamara rugaragaza imiterere ya James Ryan Steve Hunt agerageza gukinira ikipe ya von Rudloff kandi ubwamamare burenze umubiri wa Ryan ahantu hose, usibye izina rya film. \nkarate yo mubuyapani.\nUburyo bwo kurwana muri film bwerekana uburyo bwiza bwa karate yu Buyapani, tubikesha Ishyirahamwe rya Karate ry\u2019Ubuyapani (Afurika yepfo). Shihans Stan Schmidt na Norman Robinson bakoze choreografi ya karate ya firime, ndetse banagaragara muri iyi filime nk'abanyamuryango babiri bagize ikipe ya karate ya von Rudloff."}
{"id": "9306", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9306", "title": "Target of an Assassin", "text": "Target of an Assassin ni film yo mu 1977 iyobowe na Peter Collinson ikinwamo na Anthony Quinn na John Phillip Law. yafatiwe amashusho muri Afurika y'Epfo mu 1976 ikitwa Tigers Don't Cry ariko ntabwo yashyizwe ahagaragara muri Amerika imyaka hafi icyenda. andi mazina arimo \"African Rage\", \"The Long Shot\", and \"Fatal Assassin\".. Ukurikije igitabo cya Jon Burmeister cyitwa \"Running Scared\". \nUmugambi.\nFilime yakiniwe mubitaro byo muri Afrika yepfo. Anthony Quinn wamenyekanye cyane akina nk'umuforomo w'umugabo, Hobday, washinzwe kwita kuri perezida w\u2019amahanga (Simon Sabela). Hamwe n\u2019iterabwoba ryinshi ryangiza ubuzima bwe, umuyobozi arinzwe cyane kumasaha. Hobday abasha gushimuta umurwayi we ku nyungu z'umuntu ku giti cye, atazi ko sniper yahawe akazi agerageza guhitana ubuzima bw'umuyobozi w\u2019amahanga igihe yari afunzwe na Hobday. Ibi biganisha kumurongo wamatsiko y'imigambi iganisha kumiterere yikirere hamwe n'imodoka ya kabili kumusozi muremure."}
{"id": "9307", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9307", "title": "Kill and Kill Again", "text": "Kill and Kill Again ni film y'ibikorwa yo mu 1981 iyobowe na Ivan Hall. Muri iyi filime hagaragaramo James Ryan nka Steve Chase wahawe akazi ko gukiza umuhanga Horatio Kane, washimuswe n'umuhanga Marduk. Chase akoranya itsinda ryabacanshuro basanga inzira igana ku gihome cy'umugome hanyuma ugasanga barwanira ubuzima bwabo uko bafashwe.\n\"Kill and Kill Again\" ni urukurikirane rwa film \"\" kandi yatangiye gufatwa amashusho muri kamena 1980. Iyi filime yafatiwe mu Burayi no muri Amerika hamwe n'abakinnyi ahanini bakomoka muri Afurika y'Epfo. Yasohotse i New York ku ya 8 Gicurasi 1981. Yakiriye ibitekerezo bibi byatanzwe na \"Variety\" na \"The New York Times\" basanze filime \"idashimishije\" kandi ifite \"umugambi mubi\".\nKurekura.\n\"Kill and Kill Again\" yasohotse i New York ku ya 8 Gicurasi 1981. Ku ya 12 Kanama 1980, \"Umunyamakuru wa Hollywood\" yatangaje ko hateganijwe filime ya gatatu muri uruhererekane. Kugeza mu Kuboza 2013, nta filime ikurikirana yagiye mu bikorwa."}
{"id": "9308", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9308", "title": "Boetie Gaan Border Toe", "text": "Boetie Gaan Border Toe ni filime yo gusebanya 1984 yashyizweho mugihe cy'intambara y'umupaka wa Afrika yepfo. Iyi filime yayobowe na Regardt van den Bergh, ikaba ikinamo Arnold Vosloo, Frank Dankert na Frank Opperman. Umusaruro wafashijwe n\u2019ingabo z\u2019Afurika yepfo (SADF). \nUmugambi.\nBoetie van Tonder, umusore wo muri Afrikaner, ashobora kwinjizwa mu gisirikare cya Afurika y'Epfo. Nubwo mu mizo ya mbere yiyemeje kurwanya umurimo w\u2019igihugu no kwanga amabwiriza, ahita abona ihumure ari kumwe n\u2019abasirikare bagenzi be mu gihe bahuye n\u2019imyitozo ikaze y\u2019amahugurwa y\u2019ibanze ndetse no koherezwa ku mupaka wa Angola. \nKwakira.\nUmusesenguzi w\u2019ubuvanganzo Monica Popescu yasobanuye ko \"Boetie Gaan Border Toe\" hamwe \"n\u2019uruhererekane rwayo\"\", Boetie Op Maneuvers\", nk'ibikorwa byerekanaga urukundo rw\u2019intambara yo ku mupaka wa Afurika y'Epfo kandi byibanze cyane ku \"myitwarire idahwitse y'abasirikare ba SADF\". Keyan Tomaselli wo muri kaminuza ya Johannesburg yanenze iyi filime \"kwamamaza\"."}
{"id": "9309", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9309", "title": "King Solomon's Mines (1985 film)", "text": "King Solomon's Mines ni film yasohotse muri 1985, iturutse kuri novel yitwa King Solomon's Mines yanditswe na H. Rider yajonjogoye. Irimo Richard Chamberlain, Sharon Stone, Herbert Lom na John Rhys-Davies. Yahinduwe na Gene Quintano na James R. Silke kandi iyobowe na J. Lee Thompson. Iyi verisiyo yinkuru yari yoroheje, urwenya, iganisha ku gusebya \"Indiana Jones\" (aho umukinnyi wa francise Rhys-Davies yagaragaye mubice bibiri). Yafatiwe amashusho hanze ya Harare muri Zimbabwe. \nYakurikiwe nuruhererekane \"\" (1986) kandi yagombaga gukurikirwa nuruhererekane rutigeze rukorwa, igerageza ry'ambere ryaba rishingiye kuri \"She na Allan\", ikindi gitabo cya Haggard, hanyuma kugerageza bwa kabiri kwitwa \"Allan Quatermain na Jewel of the East\" kandi iyobowe na producer Golan."}
{"id": "9310", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9310", "title": "Master Harold...and the Boys (1985 film)", "text": "Master Harold...and the Boys ni filime y\u2019ikinamico yo muri Amerika yo mu 1984 yakozwe na televiziyo ikorwa na Athol Fugard, yakuwe mu ikinamico ye yo mu 1982 yakinnye izina rimwe, iyobowe na Michael Lindsay-Hogg. Iyi filime yerekanwe bwa mbere kuri Showtime ku ya 12 Ugushyingo 1984 ndetse inerekanwa kuri PBS mu rwego rwo kwerekana \"ibitaramo bikomeye\" ku ya 15 Ugushyingo 1985. \nUmugambi.\nIyi filime yahinduwe na Athol Fugard ikinamico ya autobiographical ibera mu 1950 Afurika y'epfo mugihe cya apartheid. kwerekana uburyo ivanguramoko rishingiye ku nzego, urwikekwe cyangwa inzangano bishobora gutwarwa n'ababa munsi yacyo. Ikinamico y'umwimerere yarabujijwe muri Afurika y'Epfo. Filime yagizwe PG-13. Zakes Mokae ukina nka Sam, yagaragaje uruhare rwamuhesheje igihembo cya Tony mu 1982 kubera Umukinnyi witwaye neza mu ikinamico. "}
{"id": "9311", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9311", "title": "Jock of the Bushveld (1986 film)", "text": "Jock of the Bushveld, ni filimi yasohotse muri 1986 yo muri Afurika y'Epfo, iyoborwa na Gray Hofmeyr itunganywa amashusho na Duncan MacNeillie hamwe na Duncan MacNeillie Production na Toron International. Muri iyi filime hagaragaramo Jonathan Rands, Jocelyn Broderick na Michael Brunner mu mwanya wa mbere hamwe na Gordon Mulholland, Wilson Dunster mu nshingano zunganira n'imbwa \"Umfubu\". Iyi filime ishingiye ku gitabo cyanditswe n'umwanditsi wo muri Irilande James Percy FitzPatrick wagiye muri Afurika y'Epfo mu myaka ya 1800 kandi akibonera ibintu byinshi byabereye mu mashyamba. \nUmugambi.\nMu 1886, Percy Fitzpatrick w'imyaka 20 ukomoka mu mujyi wa Cape Town yerekeje ku kirwa cya Delagoa muri Transvaal gucukura zahabu. Agezeyo, abuza icyana cy'imbwa, Jock, kurohama arakirera. Iyo amaherezo Percy ageze iyo yerekeza, nta zahabu iba ikiriho, nuko atangira kuba umuyobozi. Nyuma yaho, we na Jock babayeho mubyabaye byinshi birimo inyamaswa zo mwishyamba hamwe nabashoferi batwaraga abacakara. "}
{"id": "9312", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9312", "title": "Place of Weeping", "text": "Place of Weeping (ikinamico nka Afrika - Land der Hoffnung), ni filime y'ikinamico yo muri Afrika yepfo yasohotse muri 1986 yayobowe na Darrell Roodt ikanakorwa na Anant Singh muri Place of Weeping Productions. Muri iyi filime hagaragaramo James Whyle, Gcina Mhlophe na Charles Comyn mu bakinnyi ba mbere mu gihe Norman Coombes, Michelle du Toit, Kerneels Coertzen na Patrick Shai bagize uruhare runini. Iyi filime isobanura mu buryo burambuye ku matsinda y\u2019imico myinshi yo muri Afurika y'epfo n\u2019uburyo Afurika yepfo yaguye kubera ibikorwa by\u2019abanyafurika yepfo n\u2019amakimbirane mu butegetsi bukandamiza Afurika yepfo. Iyi niyo shusho yambere yo kurwanya ivanguramoko yakozwe muri Afrika yepfo. Filime yagaragaye bwa mbere ku ya 5 Ukuboza 1986. Filime yakiriwe neza nabayireba. "}
{"id": "9313", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9313", "title": "Platoon Leader (film)", "text": "Platoon Leader ni film ya Cannon Films yo mu 1988 yakozwe mu ntambara ya Vietnam kandi iyobowe na Aaron Norris; ikinamo Michael Dudikoff na Michael DeLorenzo kandi yafatiwe amashusho muri Afrika yepfo. Rishingiye ku nyandiko ya James R. McDonough yibuka izina rimwe. Iyi filime ivuga kubyerekeranye na liyetona mushya w\u2019abasirikare bageze muri Vietnam kugira ngo yigarurire platoni ye ya mbere. Asanga agomba kwigaragaza no kugirirwa ikizere nabagabo banditswe niba ashaka kubayobora.\nUmugambi.\nLt. Jeffrey Knight, umusirikare mushya wo mu Ishuri rya Gisirikare rya Leta zunze ubumwe za Amerika, yajyanywe mu ndege ku birindiro biri muri Vietnam, aho ahurira na platon ye, itsinda ry\u2019abasirikare bakomeye b'intambara. Platon Serija McNamara asobanurira Knight ko platoni idakeneye umuyobozi ukurikiza amategeko. Ibikorwa bya Lt. Knight nabyo byamaganwa nabagabo be bose usibye Pvt. Parker, umukoresha wa radio.\nKuri rimwe mu irondo rye rya mbere, Knight yasitaye atitaye ku kirombe cyanjye cy'urugendo kandi aricwa. Parker noneho amaradiyo ya evac hanyuma McNamara ategeka ingabo kwimukira muri LZ kugirango zivemo. Nyuma, mu gihe Lt. Knight arimo gukira ibikomere mu bitaro bya Gisirikare, Major Flynn amubaza niba ashobora kongera gufata icyemezo maze Knight arabyemera. Knight asubizwa mu ndege asubira ku birindiro bya platon ariko ntiyakirwa n'abantu be asanga ibikoresho bye byabuze aho yari atuye, kuko batari biteze ko azagaruka. Bamenye ko Knight yagarutse, abasirikare bihutira gusubiza ibintu bye hanze y'ibiro bye mbere yuko agaruka. Knight amenya ko agomba gufata ubundi buryo kugirango abagabo be bamwubahe."}
{"id": "9314", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9314", "title": "Skeleton Coast (film)", "text": "Skeleton Coast ni filime y\u2019intambara y\u2019abacanshuro yo muri 1987 yakozwe na John Cardos muri firime eshatu za mbere kuri producer Harry Alan Towers. Nibwo bwambere muri Towers 'Breton Film Productions.\nUmugambi.\nMugihe cy'intambara yo muri Angola umukozi wa CIA Michael Smith akorana ninyeshyamba za UNITA. Yafashwe n\u2019ingabo za Angola, yoherezwa muri gereza kugira ngo abazwe n\u2019umudage w\u2019iburasirazuba witwa Major Schneider. Se wa Smith, Koloneli Bill Smith wahoze mu kiruhuko cy'izabukuru Colonel Bill Smith ntabwo yizera leta ya Amerika kurekura umuhungu we. Koloneli yagiye muri Afrika yepfo y'uburengerazuba aho yishyuye Elia amayobera kugirango amenye amakuru yukuri kubyerekeye umuhungu we aho yari ari imbohe. Colonel Smith aha akazi abacanshuro barindwi azajyana muri Angola gutabara umuhungu we.\nKapiteni Simpson, umuyobozi w\u2019inzego zishinzwe umutekano z\u2019ikirombe cya diyama afite umugabo uhanze amaso Coloneli atinya ko ashobora kuba akora magendu ya diyama. Umugore wa Elia, Opal akomeje kugirana umubano utemewe na Simpson amumenyesha ko Coloneli yishe umuntu w\u2019umutekano we, mu byukuri yishwe na Rick Weston, umuyobozi w\u2019ingabo bwite za Smith. Rick yamenyesheje Coloneli ko yari umukozi wibanga wa Angola. Elia yahise amenya ko Col. Smith yamwishyuye amafaranag yamiganano. Binjiye muri Angola, abacanshuro bafatanya na Sekassi, umuyobozi wo mu bwoko bwa Jonas Savimbi w\u2019inyeshyamba kugira ngo bashyigikire gutabara Michael Smith."}
{"id": "9315", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9315", "title": "Alien from L.A.", "text": "Alien from L.A. ni filime ya siyanse yo mu 1988 iyobowe na Albert Pyun ikinwamo na Kathy Irlande nk'umukobwa ukiri muto usura umuco wo munsi ya Atlantis. Filime yagaragaye kuri \"Theatre Science Theatre 3000\". Iyi filime ishingiye cyane ku gitabo cya Jules Verne cyo mu 1864 \"cyurugendo rugana hagati yisi\" hamwe n\u2019ibintu bito byerekeza kuri \"Wizard ya Oz\".\u00a0\nUmugambi.\nWanda Saknussemm (Kathy Irlande) Ni umukobwa wari warananiranye ahora yamabaye amarinete manini ndetse afite nijwi ridasanzwe,uba i Los Angeles kandi ukora kuri restora. Nyuma yo kujugunywa n'umukunzi we kubera \"kutagira amarangamutima\", Wanda amenyeshwa ibaruwa ivuga ko se, umuhanga mu bucukumbuzi bw'ibyataburuwe mu matongo, yaguye mu rwobo rutagira epfo na ruguru arapfa. Yerekeje muri Zamboanga muri Afurika y'Amajyaruguru (\"Afurika Yimbitse\" avuga ko ibahasha yagarutse) maze mu gihe anyuze mu bintu bya se, ahasanga ibyo yanditse kuri Atlantis, bigaragara ko ari ubwato bw'abanyamahanga bwaguye mu binyejana byashize bukarohama hagati mu Isi. Wanda ahura nicyumba munsi yinzu ya se maze atabishaka ashyiraho urunigi rwibintu amaherezo bituma agwa mu mwobo muremure."}
{"id": "9316", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9316", "title": "Act of Piracy", "text": "Act of Piracy ni filimi yasohotse muri 1988 yakozwe yagati ya Amerika na South African thriller film iyoborwa na Yohana Cardos na Star Gary Busey, Belinda Bauer na Ray Sharkey. Mugihe bishimira ingendo zidasanzwe muri Ositaraliya, ubwato bwumuryango bufatwa nabaterabwoba. Bazwi kandi nka Barracuda.\nUmugambi.\nTed Andrews (Gary Busey) yemeje uwahoze ari umugore we Sandy (Belinda Bauer) kureka abana babo Mark (Mathew Stewardson) na Tracey (Candic\u00e9 Hillebrand) bamuherekeza n'umukunzi we Laura Warner (Nancy Mulford) mu rugendo mu bwato bwe buhenze cyane muri Ositaraliya, aho ateganya kugurisha ubwato. Icyakora, nyuma yiminsi mike, biragaragara ko Laura ari umunyamuryango w\u2019umutwe w\u2019iterabwoba uyobowe na Jack Wilcox (Ray Sharkey), wifuza ko ubwato bwaba ishingiro ry\u2019ibikorwa bye. Jack afata yacht, nuko ubwa burashimutwa, kandi kubwibyo, Mark na Tracey babikwa nkingwate. Hamwe na Sandy, Ted atangira gushakisha Wilcox, no gutabara Mark na Tracey."}
{"id": "9317", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9317", "title": "Fiela's Child", "text": "Fiela's Child ni ikinamico yo muri Afurika y'Epfo yanditswe na Dalene Matthee kandi yasohotse mu 1985. Igitabo cyanditswe mbere muri Afrikaans ku izina rya Fiela se Kind, nyuma kiza guhindurwa mu Cyongereza, Igifaransa, Ikidage, Icyesipanyoli, igitaliyani, Igiheburayo, Isilande na Sinhalese, n'ibindi.\nInsanganyamatsiko.\nMatthee akemura ibibazo by\u2019ibidukikije, insanganyamatsiko zishingiye ku ivanguramoko no kuvangura amoko. blue-buck burenze guhigwa kandi inzovu ziricwa. Umubano hagati y'abazungu nabandi birabura uragoye. Nubwo ibi mbere ya Apartheid mugihe tekiniki habaye uburinganire imbere y amategeko, gahunda y'amategeko yabogamye kandi ishyigikira abazungu. Inganda zo mu nyanja zibabajwe no kwinjiza amato akoreshwa na parike.\nIbice byo kugarukira.\nMu gitabo cyanditswe na Dalene Matthee icyerekezo cyo kugarukira, aho umuntu abasha guhitamo uwo ari we n'icyo agomba kuba afite, uruhare runini. Mu gitabo, Benjamini ari mu ntera ntarengwa kandi ntazi umwirondoro we. Na none, igenamiterere risobanurwa ko riri murwego ntarengwa bityo bibera kumpande zombi z'umusozi\u00a0.\nFilime.\nIgitabo cyakozwe muri firime mu 1988 gikinwamo Shaleen Surtie-Richards nka Fiela. Filime muri 2019 yakinnye na Zenobia Kloppers nka Fiela."}
{"id": "9318", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9318", "title": "Mapantsula", "text": "Mapantsula ni filime yo muri Afurika yepfo yo mu 1988 iyobowe na Oliver Schmitz kandi yanditswe na Schmitz na Thomas Mogotlane. Ivuga amateka ya Johannes 'Panic' Themba Mzolo (Mogotlane), umujura wigihe gito, yashyizwe inyuma ya Apartheid. Iyi filime yakoresheje ibintu byagaragaye hagati y\u2019igihe cya Panic yatewe n\u2019umugororwa we w\u2019ivangura rya 'Stander' (Marcel Van Heerden) hamwe n\u2019ibibera mu mujyi wa Johannesburg mu mujyi wa Soweto byerekana akarengane abirabura bo muri Afurika yepfo bahuye nako mu gihe cya apartheid ndetse n\u2019urugamba rwabo rwo gutora. Iyi filime ikoresha cyane imyigaragambyo ya politiki, ubugome bwa polisi, n\u2019itandukaniro rishingiye ku moko kugira ngo tugaragaze ingaruka za apartheid ku Birabura bo muri Afurika yepfo. Yerekanwe mu gice cya Un Certain Regard mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Cannes 1988. Iyi filime yatoranijwe nk'iyinjira muri Afurika y'Epfo muri Filime nziza y'indimi z'amahanga mu bihembo bya 62 bya Osama, ariko ntiyemerwa nk'umukandida. \nUmutwe.\nDukurikije amagambo magufi yabanjirije iyi filime, Amapanstula ni ijambo rikoreshwa kuri \"udutsiko two mu muhanda wo muri Afurika y'Epfo tugaragazwa n'imiterere yabo y'imyambarire n'umuziki.\" Ikomeza ivuga ko, \"Mu gace kabo gakabije nta mategeko abaho kandi kubaho kw'ibikwiye ni gahunda y'umunsi.\""}
{"id": "9319", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9319", "title": "Red Scorpion", "text": "Red Scorpion ni film muri Amerika yo mu 1988 yakinnye na Dolph Lundgren kandi iyobowe na Joseph Zito. Lundgren agaragara nk\u2019ingabo zidasanzwe z\u2019Abasoviyeti zoherejwe kwica umuyobozi w\u2019inyeshyamba zirwanya abakomunisiti muri Afurika, gusa ashyigikiye inyeshyamba. yakozwe na lobbyist Jack Abramoff kandi yafatiwe amashusho muri Afrika yepfo yuburengerazuba ku nkunga ya Afrika yepfo yo muri apartheid. Iyi filime yasohotse muri Amerika ku ya 21 Mata 1989. \nUmugambi.\nLiyetona Nikolai Petrovitch Rachenko, umukozi wa Spetsnaz w\u2019Abasoviyeti yoherejwe mu gihugu cya Afurika aho ingabo z\u2019Abasoviyeti, Cekosolovakiya na Cuba zifasha guverinoma kurwanya umutwe w\u2019inyeshyamba zirwanya abakomunisiti. Ashinzwe ubutumwa bwo kwica umuyobozi w'inyeshyamba. Rachenko yinjiye mu mutwe w'inyeshyamba no kugera kure cyane y'intego yari afite, ateza ibibazo mu kabari kabo maze atabwa muri yombi azira imyitwarire idahwitse. Yashyizwe mu kagari kamwe n\u2019umuyobozi wafashwe n\u2019umutwe kandi arizera ko byoroshye guhunga. Amaherezo ageze mu nkambi y'inyeshyamba, ahura no kutizerana n'inyeshyamba. Mwijoro, agerageza kwica umugambi we, ariko inyeshyamba zitizera ibikorwa bye.\nIgisubizo gikomeye.\nKevin Thomas wo mu kinyamakuru \"Los Angeles Times\" yasobanuye ko ari \"igitabo gisekeje kizwi cyane\", ko nubwo Lundgren afite charisma, bishoboka ko byangiza umwuga we. Stephen Holden wo mu \"kinyamakuru The New York Times\" yanditse ko physique ya Lundgren ari yo nyenyeri nyayo ya filime, kuko ivuga amarangamutima kuruta uko yakinnye."}
{"id": "9320", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9320", "title": "Space Mutiny", "text": "Space Mutiny (izwi nka Mutiny in Space) ni film yasohotse muri 1988 muri Afurika y'Epfo ikorwa na American filimi yerekeye ubwato bwitwa \"Southern Sun\"\"..\" Kuva ubwo iyi filime imaze guteza imbere umuco nyuma yo kugaragara mu gice kizwi cyane kuri televiziyo \"Mystery Science Theatre 3000\".\nUmugambi.\n\"The Southern Sun\" ni ubwato bwibisekuruza, cyangwa ubwato bugenda mu kirere burimo abantu benshi, intego yabo ni ugukoloniza isi nshya. Urugendo rwabwo kuva kwisi yambere (bivuze ko ari Isi) bumaze ibisekuruza cumi na bitatu, kuburyo benshi mubayituye bavutse kandi bazapfa batigeze bakandagiza ikirenge hasi. Ibi ntibishimisha abanzi, Eliya Kalgan (John Phillip), wafatanije naba pirate binjira muri sisitemu ya Corona Borealis yegeranye n\u2019umuyobozi mukuru w\u2019ubwato MacPhearson (James Ryan). Kalgan yateguye umugambi wo guhungabanya uburyo bwo kugendesha ubwato bwa Southern Sun no gukoresha Enforcers, abapolisi b'ubwo bwato, kugira ngo bashimute ubwo bwato kandi babuyobore kuri ubu buryo. Kuri ubu, abatuye \"Southern Sun\"' nta kundi byagenda uretse kwemera \"ubuntu\" bwe."}
{"id": "9321", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9321", "title": "A Dry White Season", "text": "A Dry White Season ni filime y'ikinamico yo muri, Amerika yo mu mwaka 1989 yayobowe na Euzhan Palcy ikinwamo na Donald Sutherland, J\u00fcrgen Prochnow, Marlon Brando, Janet Suzman, Zakes Mokae naSusan Sarandon yanditswe na Colin Welland na Palcy, ishingiye ku gitabo cya Andr\u00e9 Brink cyitwa A Dry White Season. Robert Bolt nawe yatanze umusanzu wo gusubiramo amashusho atemewe. Yashyizwe muri Afirika y\"epfo mu mwaka wa 1976 kandi ivuga kubyerekeye ivanguramoko. Brando yatorewe muri Oscar nk'umukinnyi witwaye neza.\nUmugambi.\nMu 1976, muri Afurika y'epfo mu gihe cya apartheid, Ben Du Toit (Donald Sutherland) ni umwarimu w\u2019ishuri ryo muri Afurika yepfo ku ishuri ry\u2019abazungu gusa. Umunsi umwe, umuhungu w\u2019umurimyi we, Gordon Ngubene (Winston Ntshona), yakubiswe n\u2019abapolisi bera nyuma yo gufatwa n\u2019abapolisi mu myigaragambyo y\u2019amahoro hagamijwe politiki nziza y\u2019uburezi ku birabura muri Afurika yepfo. Gordon asaba Ben ubufasha. Ben amaze kwanga gutabara kubera ko yizeraga abapolisi, Gordon na we yafashwe na polisi kandi akorerwa iyicarubozo na Kapiteni Stolz (J\u00fcrgen Prochnow). Bitandukanye n'ubushake bw'umugore we Susan (Janet Suzman) n'umukobwa we Suzette (Susannah Harker), Ben agerageza kumenya byinshi ku ibura ry'umurinyi we wenyine. Nyuma y\u2019ivumburwa ry\u2019ubwicanyi bwakozwe na Gordon n\u2019umuhungu we bombi, Ben yahisemo kugeza iki kibazo imbere y\u2019urukiko na Ian McKenzie (Marlon Brando) nk'umunyamategeko ariko aratsindwa. Nyuma yaho, akomeje gukora wenyine kandi ashyigikira itsinda rito ryabirabura, barimo umushoferi we Stanley Makhaya (Zakes Mokae), kugira ngo afashe abandi bateze imbere imibereho."}
{"id": "9322", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9322", "title": "Have You Seen Drum Recently?", "text": "Have You Seen Drum Recently? yasohotse 1989, ni film ikaba ikoresha amafoto aturuka muri \"Drum\" archives ikaba ivuga inkuru kinyamakuru n'inyandiko ku buzima bw'umuco na politiki ya Afurika y'Epfo. Mu myaka ya za 1950, \"Ingoma\" yibanze ku birabura bo mu mijyi baba mu isi yiganjemo ivanguramoko. Harimo ingingo zerekeye umujyi wa jazz umujyi w'ubugizi bwa nabi, ibihimbano na siporo byerekanaga ibyiringiro, ibyifuzo no kwiheba byumujyi, umujyi wigishije abirabura.\nIyobowe na J\u00fcrgen Schadeberg, iyi filime ikubiyemo amashusho ya Oliver Tambo nk'umunyamategeko, Trevor Huddleston yerekanye ko yamaganye isenywa rya Sophiatown, Nelson Mandela wagaragaye mu bakinnyi bateramakofe, Chief Luthuli wegukanye igihembo cyitiriwe Nobel ndetse n'umuririmbyi Miriam Makeba. Umuziki winyuma ushingiye kumuziki wo muri 1950, harimo itsinda rinini, jazz, swing, kwela na."}
{"id": "9323", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9323", "title": "4 Play (film)", "text": "'4 Play (yasubiwemo muri\" Nollywood nka 4 can Play\" by De-Kross Movies, kuko gukwirakwiza mpuzamahanga) ni filimi yasohotse muuri 2010 \nyakorewe muri Nigeria na Ghana ikozwe mu bwoko bwa romantic blue comedy yayobowe na Frank Rajah Arase, Star Majid Michel, Yvonne Okoro, John Dumelo, Jackie Appiah, Roselyn Ngissah na Juliet Ibrahim. Filime ikurikirwa \"nuruhererekane rwiswe 4Play Reloaded\", rwasohotse muri 2011. Yakiriye nomination 3 muri Gana Movie Awards muri 2010 kandi amaherezo yegukana igihembo cy'umukinnyi \"mwiza witwaye neza\". \nKwakira.\n\"modernghana.com\" yashimye gukina no kuyobora film. "}
{"id": "9324", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9324", "title": "2016 (2010 film)", "text": "2016 ni filimi yasohotse muri 2010 ikorerwa muri Gana mu buryo butaziguye iganisha ku bikorwa bya Siyansi. yayobowe na pseudonymous na Ninja. Iyi filime igaragara mu mwaka wa 2010 kandi ikurikira Abanyagana bagomba kurokoka itsinda ry\u2019abanyamahanga bashaka gutera Accra bizeye gukoloniza isi mu mwaka wa 2016. Filime yamenyekanye cyane kuri trailer idasanzwe nukuntu yari ifite ibibazo byingengo yimari. \nKurekura.\n\"2016\" yamenyekanye bwa mbere muri 2011 ubwo trailer yiyi firime yashyizwe kuri YouTube. \"Huffington Post\" yise iyo trailer\"Bizarre and Wonderful\", igihe Cyriaque Lamar wo muri io9 yavuze ko \"ahanini ari Alien, \"Inyamanswa\", na \"Terminator\" bose bazindukiye muri imwe\". Iyi trailer yerekanwe ku gice cya 2015 cy'ibiganiro bitinze nijoro \"Conan\", irimo umushyitsi TJ Miller. Filime yacitsemo ibice bibiri, kimwe nibisanzwe ku isoko ryerekanwa na videwo muri Afurika y'Iburengerazuba."}
{"id": "9325", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9325", "title": "Adams Apples", "text": "Adams Apples ni urukurikirane rw'amafilime yo muri Gana, yakinwe na Yvonne Okoro, Joselyn Dumas, John Dumelo, Naa Ashorkor Mensa-Doku, Anima Misa Amoah, Adjetey Anang, Helene Asante, SoulKnight Jazz, Jasmine Baroudi, Vincent McCauley, Roselyn Ngissah, Fred Kanebi. Urukurikirane rugizwe na firime icumi zerekana amakinamico, azwi ku izina rya \"chapters\", yakozwe na Ken Attoh kandi iyobowe na Shirley Frimpong-Manso. \nUrukurikirane film bukurikira ubuzima mu muryango wa Adam, bakaba bagizwe na Doris Adams (Anima Misa Amoah), umupfakazi wa ikintu KALIMANZIRA umudiplomate, n'abakobwa be batatu; Baaba (Okoro), Jennifer (Dumas) na Kuukua (Mensah-Doku), berekana uburyo bakemura umuryango wabo utoroshye, ubuzima bw'urukundo, amabanga ya buri muntu, ibinyoma no kwicuza. televiziyo drama series, na title kimwe kwerekanwa muri Gashyantare 2013, kandi kuva batangiye airing ku DSTV 's Afurika Magic televiziyo yashyizeho nyuma y'umwaka igice cya cumi cy'urukurikirane rwa firime. "}
{"id": "9326", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9326", "title": "Agony of Christ (film)", "text": "Agony of Christ ni film yo muri Gana yo muri 2009 iyobowe na Frank Rajah Arase. akaba ari film yamenyekanye cyane kuko iganisha ku kwizera kwa muntu kuko igaragaza Umwuka wera ndetse n'umwuka wa sekibi imbaraga hagati y'umupadiri ndetse n'abapfumu hakabikorera ku musore umwe uba utazi icyo gukora. \nUmugambi.\nUmusore yahunze umudugudu we kuko umupadiri gakondo yashakaga ko yicwa. Yakijijwe nabakristo bamutoje ubumenyi bw'ubukristo aravuka ubwa kabiri. Yagarutse mu mudugudu we aho basengaga imana nto. Igikorwa cye cyo guhindura abantu bose bo mu mudugudu kuba umukirisitu cyaburijwemo n\u2019umupadiri w\u2019igihugu, wemera ko ibyo bibaho bityo amushora mu ntambara yo mu mwuka. "}
{"id": "9327", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9327", "title": "Aloe Vera (film)", "text": "Aloe Vera ni filim yasohotse muri 2020 yo muri Gana ikaba yarateguwe kandi itunganywa amshusho na Manaa Abdallah afatanyije na Anny Araba bose bari bayobowe na Peter Sedufia.\"\nUmugambi.\nAmatsinda abiri yabantu atuye mumudugudu umwe, Aloes na Vera. Hariho uguhangana gukabije hagati yabo kwihanganira no kubana kandi buri ruhande rurangwa nibara ryarwo. Iyo abana b'abayobozi b'umujyi ', Aloewin na Veraline, bakundanye bagomba gushaka uburyo bwo guhuza iyo miryango yombi nubwo bangana. Umuganda nyuma uba umwe bitewe nubusabane hagati yabo bombi. \nUmusaruro.\nIzina ry'iyi filime ryatangajwe mu mwaka wa 2019, hamwe n'itangazo rivuga ko umuyobozi Peter Sedufia yubaka amazu 100 mu rwego rwo gushinga umudugudu wo gufata amashusho mu gace ka Dabala, mu karere ka Volta muri Gana. Abakinnyi Priscilla Opoku Agyemang, Nana Ama Mcbrown, na Roselyn Ngissah nabo bagaragaye ko bakinnye muri firime. Worlasi yazanywe no gutanga amajwi ya firime. Sedufia yavuze ko iyi filime ari \"kuzamura umushinga we mbere kandi igamije guha abantu ikintu gifite agaciro n'igihe cyabo.\" \"Aloe Vera\" yari ifite ingengo yimari ingana na N58.204.500 ariko yagiye hejuru yingengo yimari N77.606.000 kubera amatariki yo gufata amashusho nyuma yimvura nyinshi yangije ibikoresho byo gufata amashusho. Imvura kandi yangije cyane firime, Sedufia yavuze ko byagaragaye ko ari ikibazo gikomeye. "}
{"id": "9328", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9328", "title": "Ama Ata Aidoo", "text": "Ama Ata Aidoo, \"n\u00e9e\" Christina Ama Aidoo (wavutse ku ya 23 Werurwe 1942) ni umwanditsi wo muri Gana, umusizi, umwanditsi w'amakinamico n'umunyeshuri. Yari Minisitiri w\u2019uburezi uyobowe na Jerry Rawlings administration. Mu 2000, yashinze Fondasiyo ya Mbaasem yo guteza imbere no gushyigikira umurimo w\u2019abanditsi b\u2019abagore b\u2019abanyafurika. \nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nAidoo yavutse ku ya 23 Werurwe 1942 i Saltpond mu mu gace ko hagati muri Gana, Amakuru amwe arimo Megan Behrent, kaminuza ya Brown, na Afurika Ninde wavuze ko yavutse ku ya 31 Werurwe 1940. Yakuriye mu rugo rw'umwami wa Fante, umukobwa wa Nana Yaw Fama, umutware wa Abeadzi Kyiakor, na Maame Abasema. Yakuze mugihe cy' ubwongereza bushya bwa neocolonialism bwaberaga mu gihugu cye. Sekuru yiciwe na neocolonialiste, ibyo bikaba byaratumye se yibanda ku kamaro ko kwigisha abana n'imiryango yo mu mudugudu n'amateka yabayeho. Ibi byatumye afungura ishuri rya mbere mu mudugudu wabo maze bituma Aidoo yiga mu ishuri ryisumbuye rya Wesley Girls aho yahisemo bwa mbere ko ashaka kuba umwanditsi. \nUburezi.\nAidoo yize amashuri yisumbuye ya Wesley Girls i Cape Coast, kuva 1961 kugeza 1964. Amashuri yisumbuye, yiyandikishije muri kaminuza ya Gana, muri Legon aho yakuye impamyabumenyi ya Bachelor of Arts mu Cyongereza ndetse yandika n'ikinamico ye ya mbere yise \"\u201cDilemma of Ghost\u201d\", mu 1964. Ikinamico yasohowe na Longman umwaka wakurikiyeho, bituma Aidoo aba umukinnyi wa mbere w\u2019amakinamico wo muri Afurika. \nFilime.\nNiwe filime ya documentaire ya 2014, \"Ubuhanzi bwa Ama Ata Aidoo\", yakozwe na Yaba Badoe. \nInyandiko.\nIkinamico ya Aidoo irimo \"The Dilemma of Ghost\", yakorewe i Legon mu 1964 (yatangajwe bwa mbere 1965) na Pittsburgh mu 1988, na \"Anowa\", yasohowe mu 1971 ikorerwa i Londres mu 1991. "}
{"id": "9329", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9329", "title": "Azali (film)", "text": "Azali ni film y'ikinamico yo muri Gana yasohotse 2018 iyobowe na Kwabena Gyansah. Yatoranijwe muri Gana muri Filime Nziza Mpuzamahanga igaragara mu bihembo bya 92 Awards Academy, ariko ntabwo yatowe. Bwari ubwambere Ghana itanga firime nziza muri Oscar award. \nUmugambi.\nUmukobwa ukiri muto, Amina, abana na nyina, nyirakuru na nyirarume mu mudugudu muto hanze ya Accra. Abaho ubuzima bwiza ariko burambiranye nyina yifuza kumubohora. Nyirakuru yifuriza Amina kurongora umusaza ukomoka mu mudugudu wabo. Nyina wa Amina arigaragambya kandi agurisha Amina ku muntu atazi atizeye ka azabona ubuzima bwiza muri uyu mujyi. Mu rugendo rwe Amina ahura numusore nawe wagurishijwe akiri umusore kandi muburyo bumwe, aba inshuti ye yonyine. Bombi bahunze hamwe nitsinda rito ry'abana nabo bagurishijwe. Mugihe bombi batangiye imirimo itandukanye binyuze muri Accra bagerageza kubona ibyo bakomeza.\nIbihembo.\nIyi filime yatowe mu byiciro 15 muri Gana Movie Awards 2018. Yakiriye nomination 19 muri Golden Movie Awards 2019."}
{"id": "9330", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9330", "title": "The Boy Kumasenu", "text": "The Boy Kumasenu ni filime yasohotse muri 1952 yakorewe muri Gana n'abakozi ba firime yo mu Bwongereza. Yakozwe kandi iyobowe na Sean Graham uhereye ku nyandiko ya Graham na John Wyllie. Amanota yari Elisabeth Lutyens. Filime yamenyekanye kandi igira ingaruka mubuzima rusange bwabaturage. Yagaragaje ibimenyetso by'ejo hazaza byatumye bijyana no kurwanya ubukoloni n'impinduka mu mibereho mu bwigenge bushya bwa Gana. \nUmusaruro.\nThe Boy Kumasenu yari filime ya mbere yagaragaye yakozwe na Gold Coast Film Unit, yashakaga gukora film zombi zigisha kandi zitanga amakuru kugirango zikwirakwizwe muri Gana ndetse no mumahanga. Uyu muyobozi yari Sean Graham, wari umunyeshuri w\u2019umwanditsi w\u2019inyandiko John Grierson, nubwo Graham yahisemo gukora cyane mu mvugo ya sinema izwi. Umucuranzi Guy Warren yari umwe mu bakinnyi, yakinnye nka Yeboah. \nYafashwe amashusho mu 1950 na 1951 i Accra, Kedze na Keta, hamwe nabakinnyi batabigize umwuga, ikorerwa i Londres. Yerekanwe bwa mbere muri Gana mu 1952 ariko abayikoze bagize ikibazo cyo kuyikwirakwiza muri Gana, kubera imyizerere y\u2019uko Abanyafurika bakunda filime zo guhunga. Ariko, byaje kugaragara ko ikunzwe cyane. Yahawe impamyabumenyi n'Iserukiramuco rya Filime rya Venice kandi ryerekanwe bwa mbere mu Bwongereza mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Edinburgh 1952; yerekanwe no mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Berlin 1953. Yatorewe igihembo cya Filime y'Ubwongereza ya Filime ya Filime nziza mu 1953. \nUmugambi.\nIyi filime ivuga amateka y\u2019umuhungu witwa Kumasenu wimukiye mu mujyi wa Accra avuye mu mudugudu muto w\u2019uburobyi, yatewe inkunga na mubyara we Agboh imigani ikabije y\u2019ibitangaza byo mu mujyi. Ashonje, yiba umugati afatwa n'abapolisi, ariko arokorwa na muganga n'umugore we basanga akora. Agboh agerageza kwiba Kumasenu muganga, ariko Kumasenu yanga imigambi ya mubyara we."}
{"id": "9331", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9331", "title": "Broken Mirror (film)", "text": "Broken Mirror ni filimi yo muri Gana yasohotse muri 2014 ikozwe na Media 5 Studio Productions. James Gardiner, Fred Amugi, Jackie Appiah, Roselyn Ngissah, Mikki Osei Berko, Victoria Lebene Mekpah na Jasmine Baroudi ni abakinnyi bingenzi. Yanditswe na Pappa Deric kandi yakozwe na David Owusu hamwe na Mikki Osei Berko nk'umuyobozi. Ninkuru yumugore uhinda umushyitsi mugihe amahirwe y'umukunzi we ahindutse neza, nyuma yo kumuhagararaho mubihe bikomeye. \nUmugambi.\nThompson yakinnye na James Gardiner, ni umunyeshuri urangije kaminuza udafite akazi ufata ububaji kugira ngo abeho. Umukunzi we Priscilla (Jackie Appiah) yamuhaye inkunga y'amarangamutima ndetse n'amafaranga. Priscilla udakize kandi akora akazi ko kudoda, ahora ashimishwa na bagenzi be Evelyn (Roselyn Ngissah) na Angela (Victoria Lebene Mekpah) kubera urukundo rwe no gushyigikira byimazeyo Thompson. Kumwizera kumutsindira mugihe cyImana birakomeye kandi arabikora mugihe cy'umwaka.\nBarashyingirwa, barishima kandi bategereje umwana wabo wambere, mugihe Thompson yakiriye amashusho yerekana Priscilla nundi mugabo. Ibi bimuha kumva ko ariganya kandi biganisha ku gusenyuka. Evelyn amenyesha umukunzi we Priscilla mugihe runaka. Hari ukuntu yemera ko Priscilla yamwibye kandi niwe uri ku mashusho hamwe na we."}
{"id": "9332", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9332", "title": "The Burial of Kojo", "text": "The Burial of Kojo ni filime yikinamico yo muri Gana yasohotse 2018 yanditswe, yahimbwe kandi iyobowe na Blitz Bazawule. Yakozwe na Bazawule, Ama K. Abebrese na Kwaku Obeng Boateng, yafatiwe amashusho yose muri Gana ku ngengo yimari iciriritse, hamwe nabakozi baho ndetse nabakinnyi benshi ba mbere. Iyi filime ivuga amateka ya Kojo, usigaye apfira mu kirombe cya zahabu cyatawe, mu gihe umukobwa we muto Esi yagendaga mu gihugu cy'umwuka kugira ngo amukize.\nYerekanwe bwa mbere ku isi i New York ku ya 21 Nzeri 2018, mu iserukiramuco rya Filimi rya Urban World, aho ryamenyekanye nk'Imvugo Nziza (Sinema y'Isi). Iyi filime yakiriye ibihembo icyenda mu bihembo bya 15 bya Afurika Movie Academy Awards kandi yatsindiye bibiri, harimo Filime Nziza Yambere Yakozwe n'Umuyobozi. CYatanzwe na ARRAY kandi yasohotse kuri serivise ya Netflix ku ya 31 Werurwe 2019, ibaye filime ya mbere yo muri Gana yerekanwe bwa mbere mu bihugu byatoranijwe ku isi, kuri Netflix. "}
{"id": "9333", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9333", "title": "Coz Ov Moni 2", "text": "Coz Ov Moni 2 (FOKN) -lni film y'umuziki wa Gana yasohotse 2013 yakozwe na FOKN BOIS kandi iyobowe n'umukinnyi wamafirime wigenga wo muri Gana King Luu. Filime numuziki uvugwa byose ni mucyongereza cya Pidgin, ariko subtitles zirerekanwa. ni filime yamenyekanye cyane muri Gana kuko ikurura abakunzi bumuziki ndetse na filimi. \nKurekura.\nIyi filime yerekanwe bwa mbere muri Gana ku ya 23 Ukuboza 2013 mu nzu mberabyombi ya Gana i Accra, yerekanwe muri Amerika ku ya 21 Gashyantare 2014 i Cantina Royale mu mujyi wa New York ndetse no mu Bwongereza ku ya 24 Nzeri 2014 i Hackney Attic i Londres. Iyi filime kandi yerekanwe mu minsi mikuru itandukanye ya firime, harimo iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime rya Afurika (Tinapa), iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Durban (Durban), Norient Musikfilm Festival (Bern) na Fantastic Fest (Austin). Nyuma yaje gusohoka kuri DVD, hamwe no gukuramo ubuntu kuri Soundtrack kuri buri kopi yaguzwe ya firime."}
{"id": "9334", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9334", "title": "The Cursed Ones", "text": "The Cursed Ones ni filime yo mu Bwongereza ya 2015 yayobowe na Nana Obiri Yeboah ikorwa na Nicholas K. Lory. Amashusho yumwimerere yanditswe na Maximilian Claussen. Iyi filime ivuga amateka y\u2019umunyamakuru wacitse intege ndetse n\u2019umupasitori ukiri muto ufite ibitekerezo, urwanira kubohora umukobwa uregwa ubupfumu mu maboko ya gahunda yononekaye n\u2019imiziririzo hagati muri Afurika y\u2019iburengerazuba.\nFilime yahawe ibihembo 3 bya African Movie Academy Awards mu 2016 \"kubuyobozi bwiza\", \"Sinema nziza\", hamwe nubushakashatsi \"bwiza\". Yatowe mu bihembo 13 bya AMAA byose hamwe, bituma iba filime yatowe kurusha izindi mu 2016. \nUmusaruro.\nFilime yafatiwe ahantu hose muri Gana. Abenshi muri iyo filime bakorewe mu mudugudu umwe wo mu karere k'iburasirazuba bwa Gana. \nKurekura.\nThe Cursed Ones berekanwe kuri Hackney Picturehouse i Londere mu Bwongereza mu rwego rwo gutoranya ku mugaragaro iserukiramuco rya Filime rya Afurika ryitwa Royal African Society. Mu 2016 film kandi screened mu marushanwa ya Pan African Film Festival i Los Angeles, muri Atlanta Film Festival, ku Helsinki African Film Festival, 27 ngarukamwaka Emden International Film Festival, na New York Iserukiramuco rya Filime nyafurika mu kigo cya Lincoln gishinzwe ubuhanzi aho cyatanzwe na Human Rights Watch."}
{"id": "9335", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9335", "title": "Da Yie", "text": "Da Yie (izwi kandi ku izina ry'icyongereza Good Night) ni filime ngufi yasohotse muri 2019 iyobowe na Anthony Nti. Muri 2020, yatsindiye iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime rya Clermont-Ferrand kandi yari mu bahatanira ibihembo bya BAFTA Los Angeles Awards. \"Filime Da Yie\" yakozwe na Anthony Nti, Chingiz Karibekov na Dimitri Verbeek, ikwirakwizwa ku isi yose na sosiyete mpuzamahanga yo gutunganya no gukwirakwiza filimi Salaud Morisset.\nUmugambi.\nUmusore Matilda na Prince bajyanwa murugendo ruhindura ubuzima numuntu utazwi..\nIbihembo.\nKuva yatangizwa, iyi filime yatoranijwe mu minsi mikuru irenga 130 ku isi. Muri Gashyantare 2021, yakoze urutonde rwibikorwa bya firime ngufi ya Live ibihembo bya 93 bya Academy. "}
{"id": "9336", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9336", "title": "Drexciya (2010 film)", "text": "Drexciya ni filimi yo muri Gana yasohotse 2010 akaba documentary film ntoya yayoboye na Akosua Adoma Owusu afatanije na California Institute wa Arts (CalArts). Iyi filime yerekanwe bwa mbere mu ikinamico mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya Filimi Rotterdam 2011 kandi yitabira \"Video ya Changing Same\" mu nzu ndangamurage ya Studio i Harlem, muri New York.\nInyandiko.\n\"Drexciya\" yerekana ikigo cyo koga rusange cyatawe giherereye i Accra, muri Gana cyashyizwe kuri Riviera. Riviera icyarimwe yari iterambere ridasanzwe, rigizwe nizamuka ryiza cyane hamwe na hoteri yinyenyeri eshanu. Kuva mu myaka ya za 70, Riviera yaguye mubihe bidasanzwe. Iyi documentaire ngufi yahumetswe n imigani ya afro-futurist yakwirakwijwe nitsinda rya Drexciya ryitwa Detroit. Bavuga ko Drexciya ari umugani w\u2019amazi utuwe n\u2019abana bataravuka b\u2019abagore b\u2019abanyafrika bajugunywe mu nyanja mu gihe cy\u2019ubucuruzi bw\u2019abacakara ba Trans-Atlantike. Aba bana bamenyereye kandi bahinduka kugirango bahumeke mumazi."}
{"id": "9337", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9337", "title": "Fix Us", "text": "Fix Us ni firime yo muri Gana ya 2019 yakozwe na Yvonne Nelson kandi iyobowe na Pascal Amanfo. Filime yatsindiye ibihembo byinshi muri Gana Movie Awards.\nUmugambi.\nAbakobwa batatu bakiri bato bafite icyifuzo cyo kuba superstars bahurira ahakorerwa igenzura aho bari bafite inzozi zisa, babaye inshuti hanyuma nyuma ubuzima bwabo bwarose ariko bumva ko hari ikintu kibuze mubuzima bwabo nyuma yo kugera ku bwamamare n'ubutunzi. \nUmusaruro.\nAbakinnyi benshi b'Abanyafurika bamenyekanye ko bakinnye muri iyi filime, barimo Yvonne Okoro, igikomangoma David Osei, na Michelle Attoh. Iyi filime yagaragaye bwa mbere mu gukina imbuga nkoranyambaga Hajia4real n'umucuranzi Irene Logan. \nKurekura.\n\"Fix Us\" yerekanwe bwa mbere muri Gana ku ya 6 Ukuboza 2019 mu nzu mberabyombi ya Silverbird i Accra, nyuma yerekanwa muri Gana ndetse no mu tundi turere twa Afurika. Muri 2020 firime yerekanwe kuri Netflix. \nKwakira.\nPulse Nigeria yashyize ahagaragara \"Fix Us\" nk'imwe muri filime nshya nziza zo muri Gana z'umwaka, aho ikinyamakuru \"Glitz Africa\" kivuga ko yakiriwe neza nyuma yo gusohoka. Amakuru ya Kemi Filani yanenze iyi filime, avuga ko ikubiyemo \"gukina nabi, kuvuga inkuru ziteye isoni, gukomeza kubaho nabi, gutura ahantu hamwe n'ibibazo byinshi bibabaza.\""}
{"id": "9338", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9338", "title": "Heart of Men", "text": "Heart of Men (Yongeye gusubizwa muri Nollywood nka Forbidden Fruits na Henrikesim Multimedia Concept for International distribution) ni filime ishimishije yo muri Gana no muri Nijeriya yo mu 2009 yakozwe &amp; iyobowe na Frank Rajah Arase, ikinwamo na Majid Michel, John Dumelo, igikomangoma David Osei na Yvonne Nelson. Yakiriye nomination eshanu muri Awards ya 6 ya Afrika Movie Academy Awards.\nKwakira.\nMuri rusange iyi filime yanenzwe guteza imbere ubwambure muri firime no kumenyekanisha amashusho yoroheje kuri Nigeriya na Gana yo mu rugo. Yashyizwe ku rutonde rw'inyenyeri 3 kuri 5 kuri Nollywood Reinvented yashimye ubuziranenge, imiterere n'amanota ya muzika, ariko ugasanga umugambi utoroshye kandi amashusho yimibonano mpuzabitsina yarenze."}
{"id": "9339", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9339", "title": "House of Gold (film)", "text": "House of Gold (yasohotse nka Family Runs kuri DVD) ni filime yo gusetsa yo muri Gana yo muri Nijeriya 2013, yakozwe na Yvonne Nelson ikayoborwa na Pascal Amanfo. Irimo Majid Michel, Yvonne Nelson, Omawumi Megbele, Mercy Chinwo, Ice Prince Zamani, Eddie Watson na Francis Odega. \nIyi filime ivuga amateka y\u2019umucuruzi w\u2019umucuruzi ukunda gusabana, Dan Ansah Williams upfa azize kanseri kandi yabwiwe ko asigaje ibyumweru bitandatu ngo abeho. Afata icyemezo abifashijwemo n\u2019avoka we guhamagara abana be bose basubira mu rugo, abenshi muri bo bakaba baravutse batashyingiranywe ndetse n\u2019ibintu bitandukanye bitemewe. Ubumwe bwongeye kuzunguruka ibintu byinshi bitunguranye nkuko buri mwana agarutse afite gahunda, itanga ibisubizo bisekeje.\nYasohotse ku ya 12 Mata 2013 muri Gana no ku ya 19 Nyakanga 2013 muri Nijeriya. Nubwo iyi filime yagiye ihura n\u2019ibitekerezo bitari byiza, yakiriye ibihembo muri Golden Icons Academy Movie Awards 2013, 2013 Gana Movie Awards, 2014 Africa Magic Viewers Choice Awards na 2013 Zulu African Film Academy Awards. Yatsindiye ibihembo bitandatu kuri icya nyuma, harimo ibyiciro: \"Ishusho nziza\", \"Umuyobozi mwiza\", \"Umukinnyi witwaye neza\", \"Umukinnyi witwaye neza\" na \"Sinema nziza\".\nKurekura.\nInzu yamamaza \"Inzu ya Zahabu\" yasohotse kuri YouTube ku ya 4 Werurwe 2013. Iyi filime yerekanwe bwa mbere muri Gana ku ya 12 Mata 2013 no muri Nijeriya ku ya 19 Nyakanga 2013, mbere yo kujya ahagaragara muri rusange muri Nijeriya. Yasohotse kuri DVD ifite umutwe wa \"Family Runs\" mu Gushyingo 2013 na Henrikesim Multimedia Concept."}
{"id": "9340", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9340", "title": "I Told You So (film)", "text": "I Told You So ni firime yo muri Gana yo mu 1970. Filime yerekana abanya Gana nuburyo bwabo bwo kubaho muburyo bwo gusebanya. Iratanga kandi ubushishozi mubuzima bw'umukobwa ukiri muto utakiriye inama za se mugihe agiye kurongora umugabo, ntacyo yari azi kumugabo agiye kurongora, ahubwo yakiriye inama za nyina na nyirarume kuko agendera k'ubutunzi n'imbaraga umugabo afite.\nUyu mukobwa ukiri muto yaje kumenya ko umugabo agomba kurongora yari igisambo cyitwaje imbunda. Ntiyishimiye ibyabaye byose. Papa abajije uko byagenze, asubiza ko umugabo yagombaga kurongora ari umujura witwaje imbunda; ise yarangije avuga ati \"Nakubwiye gutya\". "}
{"id": "9341", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9341", "title": "John and John", "text": "John na John ni firime yo muri Gana igaragaramo inshuti ebyiri bombi bitwaga John. John umwe yashutse umugabo amugurisha zahabu mpimbano. Inshuti zombi zarimo zihunga n'amafaranga, ariko imodoka yabo yagenze nabi barara mu nzu y'abashyitsi. Igihe bakuraga amafaranga mu gikapu cyabo, yaguye hasi itera impungenge mu bashyitsi ndetse n'abakozi muri hoteri aho abantu bose bashakaga kwiba amafaranga \nIgishimishije, iyi filime niyo yagurishije cyane kurenza uko babikekaga, ariko yanze kwemerwa muri Afrika yepfo kuko hasohotse yo indi bisa yitwa Skeem yanditswe kandi iyobowe na Tim Greene mumwaka wa 2011. \nMuri 2017 abanyamakuru ba Ghanain begereye Greene kugira ngo barebe ibyo Asamoah avuga ko yahawe uruhushya rwo guhuza iyo filimi, ariko we akaba atari ayifite. Asamoah yemeye kugura uburenganzira bwo gusubiramo, ariko ntiyigeze akurikiza amasezerano. Nta kirego cyemewe n'amategeko, kubera ko ikiguzi cyo gukurikirana urubanza rw'umutungo bwite mu by'ubwenge kirega Asamoah kitari kuba ingirakamaro."}
{"id": "9342", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9342", "title": "Kwaku Ananse (film)", "text": "Kwaku Ananse ni film ngufi ya 2013 iyobowe na Akosua Adoma Owusu. Filime ngufi ikomatanya ibintu byigice cya autobiographical hamwe numugani wa Kwaku Ananse, umunyamayeri mu nkuru zo muri Afrika yuburengerazuba na Karayibe bigaragara nkigitagangurirwa numugabo. Umugani wa Kwaku Ananse uhujwe ninkuru y'umusore wo hanze witwa Nyan Koronhwea, witabiriye gushyingura se. Mu gihe cyo gushyingura, yasubiye mu ishyamba ashakisha se. Iyi filime yakinnye n'umucuranzi w'icyamamare Koo Nimo n'umukinnyi w'amafirime w'inararibonye Grace Omaboe. \nAmashusho yanditswe hamwe n\u2019umukinnyi wa firime wo muri Pakisitani n\u2019umunyamerika akaba na rwiyemezamirimo Iram Parveen Bilal. Iyi nyandiko yandikiwe MaameYaa Boafo, umunyamerika wavukiye muri Pakisitani wavukiye muri Gana, wahoze ari umukinnyi wa mbere nka Nyan Koronhwea. Ariko, itsinda ryababyaye mumujyi wa New York amaherezo ryafashe umwanzuro wo gusubiramo imico mugihe cyabanjirije umusaruro hamwe na Jojo Abot, umuhanzi ukomoka muri Gana. \nInyandiko.\nDushingiye ku migani ikungahaye yo muri Gana, iyi filime ngufi y\u2019ubumaji ihuza ibintu byanditswe mu buzima bwa Owusu n\u2019imigenzo ya rubanda kugira ngo ivuga amateka y\u2019umukobwa ukiri muto w\u2019umunyamerika wagarutse muri Afurika y\u2019iburengerazuba gushyingura se, ariko akavumbura umwirondoro we wihishe kabiri.\nKwaku Ananse ni umugani gakondo wo muri Afrika y'uburengerazuba kubyerekeye ikiremwa kigizwe numuntu nigitagangurirwa, kimara imyaka ikusanya ubwenge bwose bwisi mumasafuriya y'imbaho. Mugihe agerageza guhisha inkono mugiti, ntashobora kubona uburyo bwo kuyishyira hejuru mumashami yacyo. Iyo umuhungu we muto, Ntikuma amweretse inzira, Kwaku Ananse ararakara cyane, ajugunya inkono hasi. Iraturika kandi ubwenge burashira. Umuntu wese arihuta, yizeye gukiza ibyo ashoboye.\nNyan Koronhwea asubira kwa se Kwaku Ananse wavukiye muri Gana kumuhamba. Bari barabuze umubano hagati yabo kera. Yatandukanye ibyiyumvo by'ubuzima bwa se n'umuryango umwe muri Gana undi muri Amerika. Yarengewe n\u2019ishyingurwa, asubira mu isi y\u2019umwuka ashakisha Kwaku Ananse. \nIbihembo.\n\"Kwaku Ananse\" yatorewe kuba Golden Bear mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya sinema rya Berlin kandi yegukana igihembo cyiza cya Filime ngufi mu bihembo bya 9 bya Afurika Movie Academy Academy Awards. Iyi filime kandi yakiriye abacamanza badasanzwe mu Ishyirahamwe Cin\u00e9mas et Cultures d'Afrique 2015 i Angers, mu Bufaransa."}
{"id": "9343", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9343", "title": "Love or Something Like That", "text": "Love or Something Like That ni film yo muri Gana no muri Nigeriya yasohotse muri 2014 iyobowe na Shirley Frimpong-Manso. Irimo John Dumelo, Joselyn Dumas na OC Ukeje. Iyi filime yerekanwe bwa mbere i Londres ku ya 28 Ugushyingo 2014 muri Odeon Sinema. Yakiriye nomination ebyiri muri 11 ya Afrika Movie Academy Awards. \nUmugambi.\nFilime ivuga inkuru ivuga ku bashakanye bashya no kurangaza bahuye nako mukazi nyuma gato y'ubukwe. Kwarley Mettle (Joselyn Dumas) yaryamanye n'umukunzi we, Henry Dominic (OC Ukeje) atabishaka, imyaka ibiri mbere yo gushaka. Ibi byatumye asaba ko umugabo we, Alex Walker (John Dumelo) yakoresheje uburinzi igihe cyose baryamanye. Henry na Kwarley bongeye guhura nyuma yo kwinjira mu bitaro bye kwivuza. Henry amaze kumenya uwahoze ari umukunzi we, yahise ava mu bitaro atamuvugishije. Kwarley yagiye muri dosiye ye y'abarwayi, kugira ngo arebe ko arwaye kanseri na AID. Yabonye aho atuye hanyuma amusura. Agezeyo, amubwira ibyamutengushye.\nKwakira.\nIyi filime yabonye ibitekerezo bibi kuri 360nobs.com, yashushanyije isano iri hagati ya film na \"Tango with Me\", indi film iyobowe na Shirley Frimpong-Manso. Yagaragaje ko muri filime zombi, abashakanye bibagora gukora imibonano mpuzabitsina kubera ikibazo cyo gufata ku ngufu. Yagaragaje kandi ibibazo bidasanzwe byo gushyingiranwa nk'ingaruka muri filime zombi. \"Tango hamwe Nanjye\" Urukundo cyangwa Ikintu nkicyo byombi byarangiye abagabo bumva bafite icyaha cyo kutita cyane kubo bashakanye. Byongeye kandi, Devil in Details indi filime yakozwe nuyu muyobozi, yagaragajwe nkufite ibiganiro nka firime mugihe cyo kugisha inama abashakanye. Yanenze kandi Kwarley kuba yarakubiswe nyuma yo kubona Henry bwa mbere nubwo afite dosiye ku meza ye. Hanyuma, iyi filime yasobanuwe ko ifite ishingiro ridakwiriye kubera ko ubu ari ibisanzwe ko abashakanye bipimisha virusi itera sida mbere yo gushyingirwa mu nsengero, tutibagiwe ko umugeni yari umuganga."}
{"id": "9344", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9344", "title": "Nakom", "text": "Nakom ni filime yikinamico yakozwe mu mwaka wa 2016 iyobowe na Kelly Daniela Norris na TW Pittman. Iyi filime yagaragaye bwa mbere ku isi mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya Filime rya 66 rya Berlin mu gice cya Panorama kandi yatumiriwe kuzerekanwa bwa mbere muri Amerika y'Amajyaruguru mu iserukiramuco rya new diroctorss i New York. \nUmugambi.\n\"Nakom\" inkuru yimbitse yaturutse mu majyaruguru ya Gana, Nakom akurikira Iddrisu, umunyeshuri w\u2019ubuvuzi ufite ubuhanga ugomba gusubira mu mudugudu w'iwabo nyuma y'urupfu rutunguranye rwa se maze agaharanira ko umuryango we ubaho.\nAbakinnyi.\n\"Nakom\" yatsindiye igihembo cya Audience Choice mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya 37 rya Durban. Yatorewe igihembo cyiza cya mbere cyiza mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime rya 66 rya Berlin. Mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya sinema rya Seattle, ryatowe mu marushanwa y'abayobozi bashya. Yatorewe igihembo cyigenga cyigenga cya 2016 John Cassavetes"}
{"id": "9345", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9345", "title": "Nana Means King", "text": "Nana Means King ni film yo muri Gana ya 2015 iyobowe kandi yakozwe na Nana Obiri Yeboah, ni firime yakunzwe cyane muri Gana ndetse no ku isi yose muri rusange.\nUmugambi.\nNana Kwame, umwimukira utemewe n'amategeko wo muri Gana ukorera mu Bwongereza wabuze byose kubera ubuhemu, asanga yatangiriye kuri odyssey ku giti cye cyo kwivumbura. Yambuwe ibintu hafi ya byose, aho atuye, ndetse n'icyubahiro, agomba kubona inzira anyuze mu butaka butamenyerewe bw'abimuwe kandi batagaragara. Ni muri iyi saha y'umwijima, ku batishoboye cyane, ubuzima bwe buhinduka mu buryo butunguranye iyo abonye ubwiza n'urukundo bikura mu butayu bwa beto. Nubwo indorerwamo ari Shauna, ahita amenya ko ibyahise bishobora kuba gereza twaremye kubwubwenge bwacu. Mu gufasha kuvana Shauna muri gereza ye ni bwo yaje kurekurwa wenyine. "}
{"id": "9346", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9346", "title": "No Tears For Ananse", "text": "No Tears For Ananse ni filime yo muri Gana yayobowe na Sam Aryeetey kandi yanditswe na Ato Kwamina Yanney mu 1968. \nUmugambi.\nFilime ya rubanda isobanura uburyo amayeri Ananse agerageza kurenza umuryango we kubera igitutu cyo guha umuryango we burimunsi. Yigize nk'uwapfuye abwira umuryango we kumushyingura mu isambu ye, bityo aribwa n'abakozi bashinzwe ibiryo mu murima igihe cyatinze. Umuryango washyizeho umutego ukoresheje igishusho cyometseho kole. Ananse abonye igishusho atekereza ko ari kizima nuko atangira no gukubitaho urushyi arumirwa. Bukeye bwaho, yafashwe n'umuryango ndetse n'abaturage. "}
{"id": "9347", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9347", "title": "No Time to Die (2006 film)", "text": "No Time To Die ni filime yo gusetsa no gukundana yo muri Gana yo mu 2006 yakozwe na Wolfgang Panzer, Umudage, umwanditsi akaba n'umuyobozi kandi yayikoranye na King Ampaw, igihembo yatsindiye nk'umuyobozi akaba n'umukinnyi wa Gana. Filime yari iyobowe na King Ampaw. Umuziki wahimbwe na Ben Michael Mankhamba umucuranzi wa gitari wa Malawi, umuririmbyi, umwanditsi w'indirimbo. Imyambarire yateguwe na Lisa Meier. Yakozwe mu 2006 muri Gana no mu Budage. Ni firime ivuga icyongereza imara iminota 95. Yatoranijwe mu Kuboza 2016 mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya filime rya Afurika Diaspora (ADIFF) i New York. \nIkibanza.\nAsante, umushoferi utwara imodoka zo gushyingura muri Gana, akeneye uwo bashakanye ariko akazi ke gakanga abadamu benshi. Atangira kureba umukiriya (Esi) wapfushije nyina, akamenya uburyo bwo kumuganiriza. ariko se akabuza uwo mubano kagati ya Esi na Asante. Asante arakomeza ahinduka umushoferi wambere wimodoka yo gushyingura i Accra ubashije kurongora. Iyi filime yari iyo gusobanura umuco nyafurika werekana impinduka mumigenzo yo gushyingura abanyafurika kubera ingaruka zabakoloni muri Afrika. "}
{"id": "9348", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9348", "title": "One Night in Vegas", "text": "One Night in Vegas ni filime yikinamico yo muri Nigeriya 2013 iyobowe na John Uche. Irimo Jimmy Jean-Louis, John Dumelo, Yvonne Nelson, Sarodj Bertin, Van Vicker, Michael Blackson na Koby Maxwell. Filime yibanze ku Bashakanye bo muri Gana bagerageza kunoza umubano wabo bafata urugendo i Las Vegas. Biteganijwe ku ngengo y\u2019imari ntoya kandi ifatwa amashusho mu gihe cyiminsi 19, iyi filime yamenyekanye ku isoko rya Nollywood USA kubera ko iyi filime yiteguye kuzamura umurongo wa filime nyafurika ikoresheje inzira y\u2019iburengerazuba ku bwiza bw'umusaruro n'ibipimo. By'umwihariko gukoresha uburambe bw'umukinnyi w'amafirime w'umunyamerika (Tim \" Black Magic Tim \" Wilson) kugirango akore Cinematografi na Muhinduzi. filimi yarekuwe kumugaragaro muri Ghana yari ubwa mbere hasohotse turnout mu mateka ya Silverbird Theatre mu Accra Mall. Film yerekanywe ku muryango w'Abibumbye i New York City, Ku Library of Congress mu Washington DC, Mu Pan Film Festival Afurika, Dublin muri Irlande, Haiti, Nigeria ku Nyakanga 18, 2014, Maryland, Virginia, California, Ubwongereza, Afurika y'Epfo, na Siyera Lewone. "}
{"id": "9349", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9349", "title": "Perfect Picture", "text": "The Perfect Picture ni firime yo muri Gana yakozwe kandi yanditswe na Shirley Frimpong-Manso mu 2009. \nUmugambi.\nMubintu bisa nkubuzima butunganye, abagore batatu beza bagiye kuzuza imyaka mirongo itatu,bagerageza bashize amanga kugirango bahindure ubuzima bwabo nubwo ibizazane bitabura. Hamwe nubukwe busa nkaho bugiye kurimbuka kuva mbere, kugeza kumukandida udashoboka no gukurikirana urukundo rutagira iherezo, inshuti eshatu ziziga amasomo akomeye yubuzima, imbogamizi zubukwe, impfu zo gukundana nibihembo bya guseka neza mu gihu cy'akababaro. Ishusho Yuzuye itanga ubushishozi bwamabara kandi asetsa mwisi aho ibintu byose bitunganye nkubuzima bwawe ninshuti zawe."}
{"id": "9350", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9350", "title": "Potato Potahto", "text": "Potato Potahto ni filime yo gusetsa y\u2019urukundo yo muri Gana yo muri 2017 yakozwe na Shirley Frimpong-Manso ivuga amateka yo gutandukana muri societe y'uburengerazuba bwa Afrika nuburyo bigoye.\nUmugambi.\nPotato Potahto ni firime yo gusetsa yo muri Gana-Nigeriya ikurikira ubuzima bwabafatanyabikorwa babiri bahatirwa kubana ubuzima bwabo munzu imwe nyuma yo gutandukana. \nUmusaruro.\nIyi filime ifatanije n\u2019amasosiyete yo muri Nijeriya Ascend Studios, ku ya 19 Mata Imyidagaduro Virgo Sun Ltd na Lufodo Productions ikaba yari iyobowe n\u2019umukinnyi wa firime wo muri Gana, Shirley Frimpong-Manso. Irerekana ibintu by'akajagari bibaho iyo abashakanye batanye bagumye hamwe murugo rwabashakanye, buri wese afata ubufasha bushimishije bwabahuje igitsina. Iyi filime yafashwe mu gihe cy'ibyumweru bibiri, ku bufatanye n\u2019abatunganya amafilime yo muri Suwede, Abafaransa, Abongereza, Nijeriya na Gana. \nKwakira.\nIbirayi Potahto yakiriwe neza na rubanda, kubera intsinzi Shirley Frimpong-Manso yagezeho mbere. Filime yagaragaye 7.9 nabakoresha kuri Nollywood Reinvented. Ibirayi Potahto yabonye imyiyerekano mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Cannes, Iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya Filime rya Durban ndetse n\u2019Iserukiramuco rya Filimi ry\u2019Abongereza. Iyi filime kandi yagaragaye mu rwego rwo gutoranya iserukiramuco rya Filime Afurika kuva ku ya 27 Ukwakira kugeza 5 Ugushyingo. Ukuboza 2019, Potato Potahto yongewe kumugaragaro kurutonde rwa Netflix."}
{"id": "9351", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9351", "title": "Potomanto", "text": "Potomanto (yakomotse ku ijambo ry'igifaransa \"portmanteau\") ni filime yo muri Gana ya 2013 - Nijeriya yerekana ibikorwa bya Shirley Frimpong Manso. Irimo Olu Jacobs, Yvonne Okoro na Adjetey Anang. Yerekanwe bwa mbere muri Sinema ya Silverbird, Accra, muri Gana, ku ya 20 Ukuboza 2013. \nUmugambi.\nUwahoze ari umupolisi urakaye, Andane, akazi ke ni ugukora iperereza no gufata abafatanyabikorwa bahemutse afata indi sura iyo yahawe akazi ko gukora iperereza ku mugore w\u2019umucuruzi ukize. Yatsitaye ku mpeta y'abasaruzi b'ingingo n'abacuruzi bashuka abasore babasezeranya kubajyana mu mahanga. Umukwe wumukire numukozi wihishe nawe ukora iperereza kugirango afate abacuruza urugingo. Bishyize hamwe bagerageza guhagarika kanseri yatwaye ubuzima bwa benshi mu rubyiruko mu baturage. \nKwakira.\nNollywood Reinvented yahaye firime amanota 55% anashimira inkuru yayo no kuyobora. Ghanafilmindustry.com yakurikiranye hamwe ninyenyeri 4 kuri 10 maze asoza avuga ko film yagerageje guhendwa no gukomera. "}
{"id": "9352", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9352", "title": "Rebecca (2016 film)", "text": "Rebecca ni filime yo muri Gana-Nijeriya 2016 iyobowe na Shirley Frimpong-Manso, ikinwamo na Yvonne Okoro na Joseph Benjamin. Nk\u2019uko Manso abitangaza ngo iyi filime yasohotse bwa mbere i Londres, mbere ya Gana kubera ubukungu bw'igihugu bigatuma igabanuka ry'abakunzi ba filime. Iyi filime ni filime ya kabiri yakinnye igaragaramo umukinnyi wa filime ukomoka muri Nijeriya Yvonne Okoro. \nUmugambi.\nFilime itangirana na Clifford (Joseph Benjamin) na Rebecca (Yvonne Okoro) bazimiye mu ishyamba nyuma yuko imodoka yabo isabye gusanwa. Byagaragaye ko Rebecca yasezeranijwe na Clifford kuva mu bwana bwabo ko bazabana. Mu gihe Rebecca yacecetse mu rugendo rwose kandi asa nkaho atababajwe n'amagambo yavuzwe n'umugabo we mushya, Clifford agaragaza ko adashaka gushyingiranwa nawe neza kuko yashakaga gusohoza icyifuzo cye cyo gupfa kwa se. Clifford yarumwe nikiremwa cyomwishyamba kandi ibi biganisha kubiganiro byambere hagati yabo. Rebecca amufasha gukira igikomere cye. Aramuhishurira kandi ko mbere yakundaga kandi akagaragaza ko atamwitayeho kubera ko atamwubaha kandi ko amukunda. Nyuma y'ibiganiro birebire hagati yabo, batangiye gukundana. Rebecca ashimuswe nabagabo babiri, nyuma byaje kugaragara ko byateguwe nuwahoze ari umukunzi we. Rebecca asubira kwa Clifford maze asobanura imigambi ye yose yo guhimbira urupfu rwe no guhagarika umushoferi we kumukurikira amuroga. Nyuma yo kumva no kubona ukuri kwinginga kwe, Clifford aramwakira mugihe bombi bategereje itsinda ryabatabazi."}
{"id": "9353", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9353", "title": "Run Baby Run (2006 film)", "text": "Run Baby Run ni film y'ibikorwa yo muri Gana iyobowe na Emmanuel Apea ikinwamo na John Apea yasohotse muri 2006 aho yakunzwe cyane nabayireba byatumye abaknnyi bayo bahabwa ibihembo. Iyi filime yakiriye nomination 8 kandi yatsindiye ibihembo 4 muri African Movie Academy Awards muri 2008, harimo ibihembo \"byamafoto\" \"meza\", Umuyobozi mwiza ndetse na \"Screenplay nziza\". \nUmugambi.\nEnoch Sarpong Jr., umunyeshuri wo muri Gana uba mu Bwongereza, asurwa na mushiki we muto ukomoka muri Gana, wari wibeshye afata ivalisi itari yo ku kibuga cy'indege. Ivalisi irimo kokayine nyinshi. Enoki yahisemo kugurisha ibiyobyabwenge, icyakora ba nyir'ibiyobyabwenge bahise bahura na we, bamwirukankana hirya no hino mu Bwongereza na Gana. "}
{"id": "9354", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9354", "title": "Sankofa (film)", "text": "Sankofa ni filime yerekana ikinamico yakozwe na Etiyopiya yo mu 1993 iyobowe na Haile Gerima yibanze ku bucuruzi bw\u2019abacakara bwa Atlantike. Iyi nkuru igaragaramo Oyafunmike Ogunlano, Kofi Ghanaba, Mutabaruka, Alexandra Duah, na Afemo Omilami. Ijambo Sankofa ryakomotse ku rurimi rwa Akan rwo muri Gana risobanura \"gusubira inyuma, gushaka, no kubona ubwenge, imbaraga n'ibyiringiro\", nk'uko byavuzwe na Dr. Anna Julia Cooper. Ijambo Sankofa ryibanda ku kamaro ko umuntu atagendera kure cyane ya kahise kugirango atere imbere ejo hazaza. Muri filime, Sankofa agereranwa ninyoni n'indirimbo n'ingoma z'ingoma y'Imana. Filime ya Gerima yerekanye akamaro ko kutagira abantu bakomoka muri Afurika batandukana n\u2019imizi yabo. Gerima yakoresheje urugendo rwimico Mona kugirango yerekane uburyo imyumvire nyafurika yerekana indangamuntu harimo kumenya imizi yumuntu no \"gusubira aho yaturutse\" (Gerima).\nUmugambi.\nFilime itangirana numusaza Divine Drummer, Sankofa (yakinnye na Kofi Ghanaba), akubita ingoma nyafurika aririmba imvugo ngo \"Umwuka utinda w'abapfuye, haguruka.\" Ubu ni uburyo bwe bwo gushyikirana nabakurambere b'igihugu cya Afrika, cyane Gana. Yizera ko kuvuza ingoma ari ngombwa mu kugarura umwuka w'abakurambere be biciwe muri diaspora nyafurika. Inkuru ikomeza kugaragaza Mona (Oyafunmike Ogunlano), wabayeho Afurika na Amerika ntangarugero kuri film shoot muri Ghana. Afite isomo ku Kigo cya Cape Coast, atazi ko cyakoreshejwe mu mateka mu bucuruzi bw\u2019abacakara kubera ko kuva kera atandukanijwe n\u2019imizi ye yo muri Afurika. Mugihe Mona ari kumurongo wicyitegererezo, ahura numusaza wamayobera Sankofa wavuzaga ingoma mugutangira film. Sankofa akomeje kwibutsa Mona gusubira mu mateka ye kandi akaba umunyamahane cyane mu bijyanye no gukomeza ahantu h'abasekuruza bera, bityo agerageza kwirukana ba mukerarugendo b'abazungu mu kigo cy'abacakara. Iyo Mona ingingo kujya A Kureba imbere castle ubwe, Mona agerageza guhunga urugo rw'abacakara ahura na ba shebuja b'abaja bera agerageza gutekereza avuga ko akomoka muri Amerika kandi ko adakomoka muri Afurika. Ba shebuja b'abacakara ntibitaye ku byo Mona yavuze maze bamusunika ku muriro, bamwambura imyenda, bamushyira icyuma gishyushye ku mugongo."}
{"id": "9355", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9355", "title": "Sidechic Gang", "text": "Side Chick Gang ni ikinamico yo muri Gana ya 2018 / filime isetsa iyobowe na Peter Sedufia.\nInyandiko.\nInshuti eshatu z'abakobwa baretse akazi kabo nkabashitsi kugirango bakore akazi gahemba menshi kandi meza kuruta akazi kabo ka kera ako kazi bakise \"sidechic gang\". Agatsiko ka Sidechic gatanga serivisi kubagore gusa. Ibi bituma abagabo batishimira cyane gukundwa gutunguranye kwerekanwa ryabo. Akazi kabaha gukandamiza abagabo cyangwa abasore bakundana bashuka abagore babo cyangwa inshuti zabo. Agatsiko kafashe akazi kumutunzi ukize maze wamwungukamo menshi bitewe ningeso ye guca inyuma uwo bashakanye. Umukuru muri opposition yabo ni abagabo bababaye bungukiwe na serivisi za side chicks. "}
{"id": "9356", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9356", "title": "Single and Married", "text": "Single and Married ni filimi isekeje yasohotse muri 2012 ikorerwa muri Ghana na Nigeria, yakozwe na Yvonne Nelson afatanyije na Pascal Amanfo. Irimo Yvonne Nelson, Chris Attoh, Nadia Buari, Tana Adelana, Kofi Adjorlolo, Eddie Watson na Jane 'Efya' Awindor. Filime \"yibanze ku ikinamico, amayeri n'amabanga mato yanduye y'inshuti eshatu z'abagabo, ubuzima bwabo bw'imibonano mpuzabitsina, kuba ingaragu cyangwa bashakanye. Iyi filime yahawe ibihembo icumi muri Gana Movie Awards 2012 kandi yegukana ibihembo bine muri ibyo birori, birimo Ishusho Nziza, Ubuyobozi Bwiza (Ururimi rw'Icyongereza), Umukinnyi mwiza mu ruhare rwo gushyigikira (Icyongereza), na Sinema nziza. Urukurikirane, \"Ingaragu, Yubatse kandi rugoye\", rwasohotse mu 2014. \nUmugambi.\nJay (Chris Attoh), casanova, yatunguye inshuti ze, arasaba umukunzi we Kimora (Yvonne Nelson). Inshuti ya Jay, Raymond (Kweku Elliot) casanova ubu nawe yashakanye n'umwe mu nshuti za Kimora, Paula (Nadia Buari), ntabyitayeho. Andy (Eddie Watson), \"mubi\" muri batatu, atekereza ko Jay ari hafi gufungwa ubuzima bwe bwose.\nUmwaka umwe nyuma yubukwe, Jay araryamana na Judith (Jane Awindor), kandi ahora abeshya Kimora. Jay amaherezo aratandukana na we, kuko yamutunze cyane; asohoka mu nzu ye, Jay yikubita kuri Raymond, na we usohoka mu nzu ya nyirabuja, bityo amenya amabanga ya mugenzi we. Ikigaragara ni uko Paula, umunyamategeko, ahora ahugiye mu kazi kandi ntajya abona umwanya wa Raymond, mu gihe Kimora na we yanze guha Jay. Paula ahura Raymond na Yolanda (Itz Tiffany), inshuti ye ishaje, maze Raymond atangira gukundana nawe.\nKurekura.\nIyi filime yerekana filime yasohotse kuri YouTube ku ya 25 Nyakanga 2012, kuri ubu ikaba imaze kubona miliyoni zigera ku icumi, ikaba imwe mu zerekanwa cyane na Nollywood. Yasohotse muri Gana ku ya 22 Nzeri 2012, yerekanwe bwa mbere muri Sinema ya Silverbird, Ikirwa cya Victoria, Lagos ku ya 28 Nzeri 2012. \nIbihembo.\nSingle and Married ifite ibihembo icumi muri Gana Movie Awards 2012, harimo Umukinnyi witwaye neza mu ruhare runini (Icyongereza) kuri Nelson, Umukinnyi mwiza mu nshingano zunganira (Icyongereza) kuri Attoh, Ishusho nziza - Ubufatanye bwa Afurika, Guhindura neza, Ubuhanzi bwiza n'umuziki mwiza (Indirimbo y'umwimerere). Amaherezo yatsindiye Ishusho Nziza, Kuyobora neza (Ururimi rw'icyongereza), Umukinnyi mwiza mu nshingano zunganira (Icyongereza), na Sinema nziza."}
{"id": "9357", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9357", "title": "Sinking Sands", "text": "Sinking Sands ni filime yikinamico yo muri Gana yo mu 2010, yanditswe yakozwe kandi iyobowe na Leila Djansi, ikinwamo Jimmy Jean-Louis, Ama Abebrese, Emmanuel Yeboah A. na Yemi Blaq. Iyi filime yakiriye ibihembo icyenda kandi yatsindiye ibihembo 3 muri Afurika ya Movie Academy Awards 2011, harimo ibihembo bya \"Best Screenplay\" &amp; \"Best Makeup\". \nIkibanza.\nIyi filime ivuga amateka y'abashakanye, Jimah na Pabi, ishyingiranwa ryabo rikaba urugomo no guhohoterwa iyo Jimah ahindutse isura mu mpanuka yo mu rugo. \nKwakira.\nIyi filime yakiriwe neza nabantu benshi banenga firime nyafurika hamwe na NollywoodForever.com basoza bavuga ko \"Filime nziza nabatura mbikuye ku mutima. Ibi birerekana abo bantu bose bafite ibitekerezo bigufi bizera ko ukeneye glitz, glamour na brazilian kuboha kugirango ukore firime nziza utakora. Ubukorikori muri firime bwari buteye ubwoba no gushimwa. Gukina byari ingingo nkuko byari bimeze kuri sinema. \""}
{"id": "9358", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9358", "title": "Somewhere in Africa", "text": "Somewhere in Africa: The Cries of humanity ni film y'ikinamico yo muri Gana ya 2011, iyobowe na Frank Rajah Arase, yakinwe na Majid Michel, Martha Ankomah na Kofi Adjorlolo. Yakiriye kandidatire 7 mu bihembo bya 9 bya Afurika Movie Academy Awards harimo ibyiciro: Umukinnyi witwaye neza mu nshingano zambere, Ibyagezweho mu majwi, Ibyagezweho mu ngaruka ziboneka no kugerwaho na Make-Up. Majid Michel niwe wahawe igihembo cyonyine cya film.\nKwakira.\nNollywood Reinvented yayihaye amanota 43%, ashima amajwi yayo, cinematografi hamwe namashusho. \nIbihembo.\nYakiriye kandidatire 7 mu bihembo bya 9 bya Afurika Movie Academy Awards ku byiciro: Ibyagezweho mu Gushushanya Umusaruro, Ibyagezweho mu Gushushanya Imyambarire, Ibyagezweho muri Make-Up, Ibyagezweho mu majwi, Ibyagezweho mu mashusho, Umukinnyi mwiza / Umukinnyi utanga ikizere, n'umukinnyi mwiza muri Uruhare Rukuru. Majid Michel niwe wahawe igihembo cyonyine cya film."}
{"id": "9359", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9359", "title": "A Stab in the Dark (film)", "text": "Stab in the Dark ni filime yo mu Cyongereza yo muri 1999 yo muri Gana yakozwe na Bam Nemesia, Ltd ikayoborwa na Veronica Quarshie. Byari amafaranga kandi yatsinze bikomeye, yatsindiye Filime Nziza muri Gana Movie Awards mu 2000. \nUmugambi.\nUmugore agambaniwe mu gihe inshuti ye ikundanye na se nuko umuryango ukamufasha kumuzana mu rugo. Uru rukurikirane rwa firime eshanu (A Stab in the Dark 1,2, Ripples: A Stab in Dark 3, Ripples 2, and Ripples 3) ikurikira ubuzima bw'abakobwa bakiri bato mu makinamico yo murugo kandi byerekana itandukaniro ry'ibibazo byimibereho mu ikinamico. In A Stab in the Dark, umuntu nyamukuru, Effe, numukobwa mwiza cyane ukunda gukundana cyane, kandi mubisanzwe washakanye nabagabo. Effe yavuye mu rugo kugira ngo ahunge nyina anenga imyitwarire ye kandi agumana n'umuryango w'inshuti ye. Igihe yari mu rugo rw'inshuti ye Kate, Effe aryamana na se wa Kate kandi byangiza imbaraga z'uwo muryango. Amaherezo, muri film ya gatanu, Effe yahisemo guhindura ubuzima bwe aho kwangiza imiryango nubukwe, bifasha kurokora urugo no kongera kugirana ubucuti na Kate.\nIbikurikira.\nA Stab in the Dark niyo yambere mu rukurikirane rwa firime eshanu ngufi zose ziyobowe na Veronica Quarshie kandi zasohotse hagati ya 1999 na 2003. \nIsesengura.\n\"A Stab in the Dark\" hamwe n\u2019ibikurikira bizwiho kwibanda ku buhemu bw\u2019abagabo nk\u2019isoko y\u2019amakimbirane yo mu miryango, igikoresho cy\u2019umugambi kidakunze gukoreshwa muri sinema yo muri Gana na Nigeriya. \nKwakira.\n\"A Stab in the Dark\" hamwe nibisobanuro byayo bifatwa nkibimwe mubikorwa byiza bya Quarshie. \"A Stab in the Dark\" yatsindiye amafaranga kandi yatsindiye ibihembo byinshi, harimo na FIlm nziza muri ibihembo bya Gana Movie Awards mu 2000."}
{"id": "9361", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9361", "title": "Zinabu", "text": "Zinabu ni filime yo muri Gana yo mu 1987 iyobowe na William Akuffo na Richard Quartey. \nUmugambi.\nZinabu avuga amateka \"y'umupfumu winjiye mu bukristo.\" \nUmusaruro.\nFilime yafashwe mu 1985 ikoresheje kamera ya videwo, aho kuba kamera ya firime. Video yari igikoresho gishya muri kiriya gihe, ariko Akuffo yamenye ibyiza amashusho ya videwo yari afite kuri firime, kubera ko selile yari ihenze kandi itanga imbogamizi zo kuyikwirakwiza. \"Zinabu\" yabaye firime ya mbere yo muri Gana yakozwe kuri videwo. \nIkwirakwizwa.\nMu gihe cyo gutunganya \"Zinabu\", guverinoma ya Gana yashyizeho itegeko ribuza kureba amashusho, mu rwego rwo gukumira ingaruka mbi batekerezaga ko filime z\u2019Abanyamerika n\u2019Ubushinwa zitabifitiye uruhushya zigira ku muco wa Gana. Iri tegeko ryakuweho mu 1987, ahanini bitewe nakazi ka Akuffo. Filime yakiriye bwa mbere muri Globe Cinema. Kwerekanwa byari bigamije kwigana firime isanzwe: umukinnyi wa videwo ntabwo yabonaga abari aho, kandi Akuffo yari mucyumba cyo kwerekana. \nUmurage.\n\"Zinabu\" nicyo kintu cya mbere cyerekana amashusho yo muri Gana, gitangira uburyo bushya bwo gutunganya amafilime kavukire yakura mu ntangiriro ya za 90. Mu 1988, hasohotse filime ebyiri za videwo, ariko iyi zigera kuri zirindwi mu 1991, zirenga 50 muri 1993. Akuffo yakoze kandi ibisobanuro bitatu kuri \"Zinabu\". "}
{"id": "9362", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9362", "title": "Sandra Nkak\u00e9", "text": "Sandra Nkak\u00e9 (wavutse 15 Ugushyingo 1973) ni umukinnyi wa filime wo muri Kameruni akaba n'umuririmbyi\nUbuzima.\nNkak\u00e9 yavukiye i Yaound\u00e9, muri Kameruni mu 1973. Afite imyaka 12, yimukiye mu Bufaransa. Nkak\u00e9 yakundaga umuziki kuva akiri muto, cyane Prince yavumbuye akiri ingimbi. Icyakora, yifuzaga kuba umwarimu wicyongereza kandi yiga i Paris ahitwa Sorbonne. Igihe yari afite imyaka 20, yerekeje ibitekerezo kuri theatre, yerekana uruhare kandi aba umukinnyi. Nkak\u00e9 yagaragaye bwa mbere muri \"The Crucible\" mu 1994, iyobowe na Thomas Ledouarec. Umwaka ukurikira, yagize uruhare muri \"Le Dindon\". \nMu mwaka wa 2008, Nkak\u00e9 yasohoye alubumu ye ya mbere \"Mansaadi\", ashyigikira iyi nyandiko n'ibitaramo birenga 200 ku isi, birimo ingendo muri Afurika na Berezile. Yanditseho icyubahiro Donny Hathaway kuri Album ya St\u00e9phane Belmondo ya \"2011 Ever After\". Muri 2012 alubumu ye ya kabiri \"Nothing for Granted\" yasohotse, yandikiranye na mugenzi we Ji Dr\u00fb. Iyi alubumu yasohotse kuri label ya Jazz Village. Ijwi ryerekana Nkak\u00e9 ryamuteye kuba ikirangirire mu bugingo bwubufaransa. Yabonye igihembo cya Frank T\u00e9not mu birori bya Victoires du Jazz muri Nyakanga 2012. Muri Nzeri 2017, yasohoye alubumu ye ya gatatu \"Tangerine Moon Wishing\", akaba yarabonaga ko ari amateka ye bwite. "}
{"id": "9363", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9363", "title": "Koffi Gahou", "text": "Koffi Gahou (22 Ukwakira 1947 - 24 Kanama 2019) yari umuhanzi, umukinnyi wa filime, n'umuyobozi.\nUbuzima.\nGahou yavukiye i Cotonou ku ya 22 Ukwakira 1947. Yize kuva 1986 kugeza 1989 mu kigo cy\u2019ubushakashatsi bw\u2019ikinamico muri Kaminuza ya Sorbonne Nouvelle Paris 3, abona uruhushya rwo kwigisha. Kuva mu 1985 kugeza 1986 Gahou yakoraga umwuga wo kwimenyereza muri Conservatoire national sup\u00e9rieur d'art ikinamico i Paris maze mu 1988, yimenyereza umwuga muri Institut international de la marionnette. Guhera mu 1974, yize ubwe mu buhanzi bwa plastiki, imashini zometse ku rukuta, amashusho, ndetse n\u2019imbere. Gahou yinjiye mu bakozi ba Leta nk'umuhanzi kandi akora ibitaramo mu itsinda rya \"Cerveaux noirs\". Yashinze kandi itsinda ry\u2019ikinamico \"Zama Hara\", yagize imurikagurisha ryinshi ry\u2019ibikorwa bye muri Afurika, Uburayi, Cuba, na Amerika.\nGahou yakoze imyenda \"Yovo Helou e, Akowe helou e\" mu 1990. Irerekana imbata zifatanije amaboko inyuma, kandi byari byiza cyane. Mu 2000, Gahou yakinnye murumuna wa Boubacar, umuhinzi, muri film ya Jean Odoutan \"Barbecue Pejo\". \nMu mashusho ya videwo muri Mata 2019, Gahou yasabye ko yishyurwa miliyoni 30 z\u2019amafaranga CFA y\u2019umudepite wo muri B\u00e9nine yategetswe kumuha n\u2019Urugereko rwa 3 rw\u2019ubucuruzi rw\u2019urukiko rwa Cotonou. Iki kibazo cyaturutse mu marushanwa yo mu 2007 Gahou yatsinze ariko ntiyabona amafaranga yigihembo. Gahou yapfuye ku ya 24 Kanama 2019 i Abomey. Umuhango wo kumushyingura wabaye ku ya 25 Nzeri. "}
{"id": "9364", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9364", "title": "Faissol Gnonlonfin", "text": "Faissol Fahad Bolade Gnonlonfin (wavutse 1985) n'umuyobozi wa firime akaba n'umu producer.\nMu mwaka wa 2012, Gnonlonfin yakoze ifoto ye ya mbere, \"Obal\u00e9 le chasseur\", agaragaza umuturage wo muri B\u00e9nine winjiye mu itsinda ry\u2019abahigi. Yize kuriyi ngingo imyaka ibiri kandi yitegereza impaka hagati yabahiga gakondo nabashinzwe kubungabunga inyamaswa. Nk\u2019uko uwahoze ari umwarimu Jean-Fran\u00e7ois Hautin abitangaza ngo umuzungu ntabwo yashoboraga gufata amashusho neza umuhango w'abahiga. Filime ya kabiri ya Gnonlonfin \"Ni ici ni ailleur\" isuzuma icyerekezo cyo kurwanya ikoreshwa rya gaze ya shale muri Ard\u00e8che, ikayihuza no gukuramo umutungo muri Afurika. \nNyuma yo kwibanda ku documentaire, inyinshi muri zo zabonye ibihembo, Gnonlonfin yatangiye gukora ibihimbano mu 2014. Muri 2017, yakoranye na Berni Goldblat hamwe na sosiyete ikora Les Lesms du Djabadjah kuri \"Wallay\". Yasohowe cyane, itorwa mu iserukiramuco rya Filime rya Carthage 2017. Muri Werurwe 2018, Gnonlonfin yayoboye amahugurwa yo gutunganya amashusho muri Burkinafaso. Gnonlonfin yashinze isosiyete ikora Merveilles Production kugirango ishishikarize abakora firime. Yibera cyane mubufaransa ariko amara hafi amezi abiri mumwaka muri B\u00e9nin. "}
{"id": "9365", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9365", "title": "Am\u00e9d\u00e9e Pac\u00f4me Nkoulou", "text": "Am\u00e9d\u00e9e Pac\u00f4me Nkoulou (wavutse 1988) ni umuyobozi wa film muri Gabon.\nUmwuga.\nNkoulou yakiriye impamyabumenyi ye mu 2007 hanyuma ajya kwiga ibijyanye na sinema ndetse n\u2019amajwi yerekana amashusho muri Institut Sup\u00e9rieur de l'Imashusho et du Son muri Ouagadougou. Yagarutse muri Gabon mu 2011 akora akazi ko kwimenyereza umwuga mu mishinga myinshi. Yabaye umuyobozi wungirije kuri \"L'oeil de la cit\u00e9 ya\" Samantha Biffot (2012), Dialemi ya Nadine \"Otsobogo\" (2013) na \"Sans Famille ya\" Pauline Mv\u00e9l\u00e9 (2013). Muri 2014, filime ya mbere ya Nkoulou, \"Moane Mory\", iminota 20 ngufi, yasohotse nyuma yimyaka ibiri yo kwitegura. Ku nkunga yatanzwe n\u2019ikigo cya leta cya Gabon Igis, iyi filime yerekana inama yabereye mu imurikagurisha ry\u2019ubuhanzi hagati y\u2019umunyeshuri ukiri muto Isa na Jack, umurangi uri mu myaka 40, bikura mu rukundo. \"Moane Mory\" yatoranijwe mu iserukiramuco rya sinema ry\u2019iburayi ryabereye i Libreville no muri firime ngufi mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Cannes 2014. \nFilime ye ya kabiri, \"Une vie apr\u00e8s le bloc\", yasohotse mu 2016. Iyi documentaire isuzuma abaganga babiri bo muri Gabon bashiraho pacemakers na prostateque yivi. Filime ya mbere ya Nkoulou ngenge yitwa \"Boxe Libreville\", yasohotse muri 2018. Irerekana umusore wifuza guterana amakofe, Christ, igihe yitoza i Libreville hagati y\u2019amatora y\u2019umukuru w\u2019igihugu cya Gaboniya 2016. \"Umukinnyi w'iteramakofe Libreville\" yinjiye mu marushanwa mpuzamahanga ya Filime ngufi na Hagati muri Vision du R\u00e9el. Yabonye igihembo cya documentaire nziza muri Festival de cine africano de Tarif muri Espagne. Yerekanwe mu bindi birori byinshi bya firime, harimo Internationales Dokumentarfilmf Festival M\u00fcnchen na Ecrans Noirs muri Kameruni. "}
{"id": "9366", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9366", "title": "Samantha Biffot", "text": "Samantha Biffot (wavutse 1985) ni umwanditsi wa sinema wa Gabon-Igifaransa, utunganya amafilime akaba n'umuyobozi wa firime.\nUbuzima.\nBiffot yavukiye i Paris mu 1985. Yabayeho mu bwana bwe hagati ya Gabon, Koreya y'Epfo n'Ubufaransa, kandi uburere bwe butandukanye bwagize imico myinshi nyuma yo gukina film. Amaze kubona impamyabumenyi ye, yize muri \u00c9cole Sup\u00e9rieure de R\u00e9alisation Audiovisuelle i Paris aho yakuye impamyabumenyi ya sinema mu 2007. Amashuri arangije, Biffot yarangije kwimenyereza gukora kuri televiziyo na firime nyinshi mu Bufaransa. Biffot yasubiye muri Gabon mu 2010 aho yashinze isosiyete ya \"Princesse M Production\" hamwe na Pierre-Adrien Ceccaldi. Mu mwaka wa 2011, yateguye amahugurwa mu kwerekana amashusho, gukora, gushushanya no gutunganya mu rwego mpuzamahanga mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga ry\u2019inkiko z\u2019ishuri i Libreville. \nMu mwaka wa 2013, televiziyo ye \"L'\u0152il de la cit\u00e9\" (Ijisho ry'umujyi) yahawe igihembo cy'uruhererekane rwiza rwa Afurika mu Iserukiramuco rya Filime na Televiziyo bya Panafrican ya Ouagadougou. Uruhererekane rwasuzumye ibyaha by\u2019imihango n\u2019ibibazo by\u2019ibidukikije n\u2019imibereho, buri gice kigira imyitwarire irangiye. Yavuze ko yayobowe nuruhererekane \"rwabanyamerika Tales kuva muri Crypt\", kandi urukurikirane rwe rwakozwe na Institut Gabonais de l'Image et du Son. Mu mwaka wa 2016, Biffot yasohoye documentaire Africa Who Wanted to fly, yerekana ubuzima bwa shebuja wa Gabon kung fu, Luc Bendza. Iyi filime yahawe igihembo cyihariye cy\u2019abacamanza mu iserukiramuco Escales Socumentaires de Libreville ndetse no kuba Filime Nziza mu Iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga ry'i Burundi mu mwaka wa 2017. \"Africa Who Wanted to fly\" yanerekanwe muri Internationales Dokumentarfilmf Festival M\u00fcnchen no mu iserukiramuco rya sinema nyafurika ryabereye i New York. "}
{"id": "9367", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9367", "title": "Mwiseneza Josiane", "text": "Mwiseneza Josiane.\nmumwaka wi 2019 mu Rwanda mu marushanwa ya Nyampinga wu Rwanda nibwo hamenyekanye \nizina Mwiseneza Josiane ubwo yabaga miss popularity cyangwa umukobwa watowe nimbaga nyamwinshi\nyabatuye mu Rwanda.\nKwivuko.\nMwiseneza Josiane wabaye umukobwa watowe cyane nabantu cyangwa Miss popularity yavukiye mu mudugudu \nwa Ndengwa mu Kagari ka Kibirizi mu murenge wa Rubengera mu karere ka Karongi mu ntara y'iburengerazuba\nMwiseneza wavuzeko atakunze kubana na se umubyara cyane kuko se yabaga yagiye gushakisha imibereho\nmu gihugu cyabaturanyi cya Uganda ahubwo yakunze kubana na Nyina nabandi Bavandimwe be bavukanaga.\nKwambikwa impeta.\nMiss Mwiseneza Josiane yambitswe Impeta kugicamunsi cyo kuwa 15 Kanama ayambikwa nu umusore witwa\nTuyishimire Christian ayambikirwa mu Karere ka Musanze ibirori bya bereye muri Hotel Centre Pastoral notre dame de Fatima\nbyari ibirori byuje ibyishimo kuri Josiane n umukunziwe Tuyishimire kuko bari banashyigikiwe nabamwe mubakobwa \nbahataniraga ikamba rya Nyampinga wu Rwanda wa 2019 nka Nyampinga w'umurage n 'umuco Miss Ricca Michaelle Kbahenda\nna Miss Teta Angel Nicole ndetse nabandi benshi batandukanye inshuti n' umuryango.\nIkibabaje kuri Miss Josiane.\nNyuma yuko miss Mwiseneza Josiane abaye icyamamare mu Rwanda yaje gutangaza ko yabuze \numubyiwe umubyara papa we waguye muri Uganda azize uburwayi. yitabye Imana tariki \n22 nyakanga 2019.\nIbihuha kuri Josiane.\nMiss Mwiseneza nyuma ya amezi make yambitswe Impeta nuwari ya musezeranyije ko bazarushinga\nhaje kuvugwa inkuru nyinshi zirimo ko batandukanye.\nabandi batangaza ko Miss ya Twaye inda ndetse akanishyingra abandi batangaza ko nyuma yo kubengwa nuwo musore\nyabonye undi wo kumuhoza amarira murizo nkuru zose harimo byinshi Joisiane yahakaniye imbere y'itangaza makuru."}
{"id": "9368", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9368", "title": "The African Who Wanted to Fly", "text": "The African Who Wanted to Fly (French) ni filime yo muri Gabon ya 2016 iyobowe na Samantha Biffot. Igice gishingiye kubuzima bwa Luc Bendza. Filime yakozwe mu ndimi ebyiri, Igishinwa n'Igifaransa, kandi yari ifite insanganyamatsiko y'icyongereza. \nUmusaruro.\nThe African Who Wanted to Fly yakozwe na Neon Rouge, afatanije na Theatre Company Theatre (Ubufaransa). Scenese yafatiwe amashusho muri Gabon, no mu Bushinwa. Umuziki wari ugizwe nindirimbo zishinwa. \nUmugambi.\nUrebye filime Big Boss, umwana wo muri Gabon yavumbuye Kung Fu ahitamo kujya mu Bushinwa afite imyaka 15 gusa. Yize ko azaba umunyafrica wambere wize ibihangano bya Kung Fu. Ahinduka inararibonye muri yo."}
{"id": "9369", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9369", "title": "Idahosa Trails", "text": "Idahosa Trails ni film yikinamico yo muri Nigeriya 2017 yanditswe, yakozwe kandi iyobowe na Stanlee Ohikhuare. Irimo Charles Okafor, David Schifter, Liz Benson, Osas Ighodaro, Frank Donga. Ishingiye ku bunararibonye bw\u2019umunyamakuru w\u2019umunyamerika witwa Thomas Book (ugaragazwa na David Schifter) ushaka kubaza arikiyesipoki Benson Idahosa(ugaragazwa na Charles Okafor) ashingiye ku myumvire ye ku ruhare Idahosa yagize mu gukira mu buryo bw'igitangaza umuyobozi w'icyamamare muri Umujyi wa Benin, gukira kwe kwabayeho nyuma yimyaka itandatu muri koma. Iyi filime yasohotse mu mpera z'Ukwakira 2017 na Mighty Jot Studios mu mujyi wa Benin, muri Nijeriya. \nUmugambi.\nIgitabo cya Thomas kiri mu rugendo rugana mu mujyi wa kera wa B\u00e9nin, muri Nijeriya, kugira ngo ukore documentaire y\u2019iperereza ku mihango y'ibanga yakozwe mu gihe cyo kwimika Oba nshya. Ntiyashoboye kubona amakuru ahagije kubera urwego rwo hejuru rwibanga ruzengurutse imihango. Mugihe yitegura kuva mu mujyi, yumva inkuru yumukuru wamamaye waho wari umaze kubyuka muri koma yimyaka itandatu ahitamo kwandika inkuru. Yizeye ko inkuru izaba indishyi zimwe na zimwe kubera ko atabonye amakuru ku cyicaro gikuru, yahisemo kujya mu bitaro. Mu bitaro, umuforomo atanga ubufasha bwo gusobanura igihe abaza umugabo. Arashoboye kubaza ikibazo kimwe mbere yuko abagize umuryango wumugabo binjira kugirango bahagarike ikiganiro cye. Mu kiganiro kigufi, Thomas yashoboye kubona izina ryumugabo, izina Idahosa. Ageze mucyumba cye cya hoteri yumva izina rimwe kuri TV ya Idahosa World Outreach. Yibwira ko Idahosa igomba kuba yaragize uruhare runini mu gukira k'umusaza. Yandika aderesi na nimero ya terefone yerekanwe, maze yerekeza ku cyicaro gikuru cya Idahosa World Outreach mu mujyi wa Benin. Ageze mu rusengero, Thomas ahura n\u2019umupasitori ukiri muto uzwi ku izina rya Pasiteri Osas (Kunle Idowu) amusaba kugaruka bukeye kugira ngo abonane na Benson Idahosa. Pasiteri ukiri muto aha Thomas igitabo cyo gusoma kuri Idahosa. Kubera umunezero witerambere rishya, Thomas yongeye guhindura indege atangira kwitegura iyi nkuru nshya ya Idahosa. Ageze mu cyumba cye cya hoteri, Thomas yahinduye igitabo n'amaso asinziriye, maze agwa mu kantu maze yisanga mu kongera gushyira mu bikorwa inkuru ivugwa muri iki gitabo. Bukeye, Thomas ahura na Pasiteri Osas maze bahagarara ahantu henshi batatsinzwe ahantu hatandukanye aho pasiteri ukiri muto yasezeranije Thomas ko bazabona Idahosa bakabona inkuru ye. Iminsi ibiri irashize kandi Thomas ntashobora guhura na Idahosa ariko buri joro agarutse mucyumba cye cya hoteri, akomeza gusoma igitabo kuri Idahosa. Kimwe nijoro rya mbere, arasinzira asoma igitabo maze yibonera kongera gushyirwaho inkuru zerekanwa muri iki gitabo. Yakomeje gukurikira Pasiteri Osas agamije kujya kubaza Arkiyepiskopi Idahosa. Umunsi umwe mbere yuko Thomas ateganijwe kugenda, yatunguwe no kumenya ko Idahosa yapfuye. Ubu buvumbuzi buganisha ku guterana amagambo hagati ye na Pasiteri Osas biganisha ku maso. Mugihe ibintu bitunguranye, Thomas Yatewe nimpanuka isiga Pasiteri aryamye hasi nta bwenge. Yari afite amatsiko yo kumva uruhare rwa Idahosa mu gitangaza kigaragara cy'umusaza yabajije mu bitaro. Pasiteri Osas yatekereje ko Thomas azi urupfu rwa Idahosa maze akeka ko yashakaga gusa kubaza abantu ubuzima bwabo umurimo wa Idahosa wagize ingaruka nziza. Thomas, ubu urujijo agomba guhuriza hamwe ibimenyetso kuko abonye imbaraga zo gutangira urugendo rwo kuvumbura; kubona ukuri, kwizera n'agakiza."}
{"id": "9370", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9370", "title": "Tatu (film)", "text": "Tatu ni filimi yasohotse 2017 muri Nigeria iyoborwa na Don Omope. Yanditswe na Jude Idada kandi yahinduwe mu gitabo \"Tatu\", cyanditswe na Abraham Nwankwo mu 2014. Filime yakiriye ibihembo byinshi muri 2018 Magic Magic Viewers Choice Awards. Iyi filime kandi yahawe ibihembo byinshi muri Afurika Magic Choice Awards 2018. \nInyandiko.\nMuri Tatu, tubona ubuzima bw'umubyeyi no kugerageza gukiza igitekerezo cy'umukobwa we w'ikinege watanzwe nk'igitambo cyo guhongerera ibyaha. \nUmusaruro.\nTatu yarasiwe ahantu muri Lagos, na Abuja. Yafashwe amashusho mu gihe cy'amezi 12. \nKurekura.\nTatu yarekuwe bwa mbere mu ikinamico muri Nyakanga 2017 muri Nijeriya, kandi yerekanwe bwa mbere muri Eko Hotel Convention Centre, ku kirwa cya Victoria. Muri 2019, iyi filime yongewe ku rutonde rwa Netflix mu gihe iyi sosiyete yakomeje gushora imari mu nganda nyafurika. \nKwakira.\nTatu yakiriwe neza na rubanda. Kuri benshi mubareba, firime yari ifite ubushobozi butujujwe. Kuri Nollywood Reinvented, firime yari ifite amanota 52%. "}
{"id": "9371", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9371", "title": "Angela Aquereburu", "text": "Angela Aquereburu (wavutse ku ya 11 Mutarama 1977) ni umwanditsi wa sinema, atunganya amafilime akaba n'umuyobozi wa firime.\nUbuzima.\nAquereburu yavukiye muri Togo umubyeyi ukomoka muri Guadeloupe. Ashishikajwe n'ubuhanzi kuva akiri muto, yize muri Togo na Pointe-a-Pitre, Guadeloupe mbere yo kwimukira i Paris kwiga mu ishuri ry'ubucuruzi rya ESCP. Yabonye impamyabumenyi y'ikirenga mu kwihangira imirimo. Aquereburu yashakanye n'umukinnyi wa filime Jean-Luc Rabatel kandi akora mu bakozi imyaka myinshi. Mu mwaka wa 2008, ubwo yari mu biruhuko muri Togo, yamenye ko kuri televiziyo hari amakinamico gusa, maze afatanije n\u2019umugabo we bazana igitekerezo cyo gukurikiranya filimi yitwa motorcycle taxis. Umwaka ukurikira, Aquereburu na Rabatel bimukiye i Lom\u00e9 maze bashinga isosiyete ikora amajwi n'amashusho Yobo Studios. Igitekerezo cyabo cyo kwerekana tagisi cyashingiweho kuri \"Zem\", mini-serie ya episode 26 yiminota itanu, ifatanije na Canal + Afrique. \nUmushinga we ukurikira wari urukurikirane rugufi rwa filimi ya \"Palabres\". Muri 2017, yatangije \"ibitaro IT\", bikemura ibibazo byabaturage nka malariya no kwera uruhu kandi byibanda ku mico Idriss na Tania. Aquereburu yavuze ko yatewe inkunga n'inda ye ya kabiri yo gukora iki gitaramo. Grey's Anatomy yagize uruhare runini. Yatsindiye igihembo cy'uruhererekane rwiza mu iserukiramuco rya Vues d'Afrique i Montreal. "}
{"id": "9372", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9372", "title": "Amal Bedjaoui", "text": "Amal Bedjaoui (wavutse ku ya 27 Nyakanga 1963) ni umuyobozi wa filime yo muri Alijeriya, producer, n'umwanditsi.\nYavukiye muri Algiers, yize ibijyanye no gukina filime muri kaminuza ya New York. Yarangije muri Institut des hautes \u00e9tudes cin\u00e9matographiques hanyuma abona Master of Advanced Studies in Sinema muri kaminuza ya Paris 1 Pantheon-Sorbonne mu 1987. Amaze imyaka itari micye akora nk'umuyobozi wungirije akaba n'umuyobozi ushinzwe gutunganya ama filime kandi nk'umuyobozi wungirije ushinzwe ibikino. Filime ye ya mbere ngufi, \"Une vue imprenable\", yasohotse mu 1993. Filime ye ya kabiri ngufi, \"Shoot me Angel\", yasohotse mu 1995, ahabwa igihembo cya Panorama mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime rya Berlin. \nMu 2002, yashinze isosiyete ikora filimi ya ML Productions. Umwaka ukurikira, yayoboye kandi akora firime yiminota 58 \"Un Fils\".\"Un fils\" ivuga amateka ya Selim, indaya y'umusore n'umubano we na madamu mukuru. Igice kinini cya firime gihinduranya hagati y'umunsi usanzwe kumanywa, nka Selim guhura na se, hamwe nijoro aho ubushakashatsi bwerekeranye nigitsina. Yavuzwe nk \"icyitegererezo cy\u2019ubwenegihugu bushingiye ku gitsina.\" Bedjaoui ni umukobwa wumudiplomate akaba n'umunyapolitiki Mohammed Bedjaoui. "}
{"id": "9373", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9373", "title": "Rome Rather Than You", "text": "Roma wa la n'toura (Icyongereza: Rome Rather Than You; Igifaransa: Rome plut\u00f4t que vous) ni filime y\u2019ikinamico yo muri 2006 yakorewe muri Alijeriya-abafaransa n\u2019Ubudage iyobowe na Tariq Teguia ikinwamo na Samira Kaddour na Rachid Amrani nk\u2019urubyiruko babiri bashaka kuva muri Alijeriya n'intambara y'abenegihugu ya Alijeriya kugira ngo bagire ejo hazaza heza. Nibikorwa bya Teguia byerekanwe bwa mbere. (Yabanje gukora filime ngufi na documentaire ya 2002.) Filime yatsindiye igihembo cyihariye cyabacamanza mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime rya Friborg 2007. \nUmugambi.\nKamel w'imyaka 20 n'inshuti ye, Zina w'imyaka makumyabiri n'itatu, bashakisha muri Alijeriya Bosco ucuruza abantu kugira ngo babone pasiporo mpimbano kugira ngo bashobore kuva mu gihugu berekeza i Roma.\nKwakira.\n\"Abanenga ibinyamakuru bitandukanye,\" Robert Koehler yashimye \"Umukinnyi wa mbere wa Tariq Teguia... Nubwo ibihe bya nyuma biteganijwe, kugerayo ndetse na nyuma yacyo byerekana Teguia kuba umuyobozi w\u2019amasezerano akomeye \". Koehler yemeje kandi \"ibihangano bisanzwe, byoroshye imikorere\" ya Kaddoui na Amrani. Mu \"kinyamakuru Slant\", ariko, Eric Henderson yabonaga ko iyi filime \"yatekerejwe mu bwirasi, yiyitirira ko yakozwe, kandi ikaba ndende\". "}
{"id": "9374", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9374", "title": "Omo Ghetto", "text": "Omo Ghetto (English translation: Child of the Ghetto) ni filimi yasohotse 2010 muri Nigeria iyoborwa na Abiodun Olarenwaju, Star Funke Akindele, Rasheli Oniga, Taiwo Hassan, Yinka Quadri na Eniola Badmus. \nUmugambi.\nFilime ishingiye ku ngeso mbi za societe nitsinda ryiganjemo abagore.\nKwakira.\nOlusegun Michael wo muri \"Gana ya none\" yashimye uwo mugambi, gukina, insanganyamatsiko no gusobanura uruhare muri iyi filime, avuga ko ari filime \"idakora, ishimishije kandi ihishura\". Muri 2017, Azeezat Kareem wo mu kinyamakuru Encomium Magazine yashyize ahagaragara \"Omo Ghetto\" nka imwe muri filime ebyiri zatumye Eniola Badmus amenyekana cyane mu nganda za firime zo muri Nijeriya. Yashyizwe kandi muri Legit.ng film eshanu \"zitazibagirana\" za Funke Akindele. \nKurekura.\nIyi filime yerekanwe bwa mbere mu imurikagurisha, mu nzu mberabyombi y\u2019ubuhanzi, Iganmu ku ya 24 Ukwakira 2010. \nUrukurikirane.\nUrukurikirane rwa filime yitwa \"Omo Ghetto: Saga\" yasohotse ku ya 25 Ukuboza 2020."}
{"id": "9375", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9375", "title": "Tobong'u Lore", "text": "Tobong'u Lore, izwi mu Cyongereza nka Cultural Festival, ni umunsi mukuru w'umuco kavukire uba buri mpeshyi i Turkana, mu majyaruguru ya Kenya. Iri serukiramuco ryakiriwe n\u2019abaturage benshi b\u2019abasangwabutaka begereye ikiyaga, kandi rigamije guteza imbere amahoro, guhanahana umuco, n\u2019ubukerarugendo. Abantu ba El Molo bategura ibirori i Loiyangalani buri kwezi kwa Kamena, naho abaturage ba Turkana bakira ibirori i Lodwar muri Mata. Tobong'u Lore ifatwa nk'imwe mu minsi mikuru minini y\u2019umuco muri Kenya, ikaba yarabaye ikibanza cyo kugaragaramo abanyapolitiki bakomeye bo muri Kenya. \nUmwanya.\nMuri 2019 abayobozi ba Turkana bagabanije gukoresha amafaranga muri ibyo birori bava kuri miliyoni 70 Shillings yo muri Kenya bagera kuri 33, bakoresha amafaranga kugirango bakemure ikibazo cy\u2019amapfa yaho. \nIbikorwa.\nIri serukiramuco rigaragaza umuco waho, ibidukikije, n\u2019umurage wa kera. Abitabiriye amahugurwa bambara imyenda gakondo mugihe c'imihango. Ibikorwa birimo karnivali yiminsi itatu, hamwe numuziki n'imbyino ziva mumatsinda yaho, hamwe nijambo ryabayobozi baho. Bihuye n'imigenzo yaho, ibirori birakomeza kugeza izuba rirenze. Imurikagurisha riteza imbere ubukorikori bwaho n'ibiryo. Kurinda inyamaswa ni iyindi nsanganyamatsiko ivugwa mu munsi mukuru. \nKugaragara kwa politiki.\nAbayobozi benshi bo muri Kenya bitabiriye ibirori, kandi abanyapolitiki bamwe bakoresheje ibyo birori kugira ngo batangaze amatangazo ajyanye no kwiyamamaza kwa politiki. Muri 2019 iri serukiramuco ryitabiriwe n'uwahoze ari Minisitiri w\u2019intebe Raila Odinga na Visi Perezida William Ruto; muri 2020 Guverineri Kivutha Kibwana yakoresheje ibirori nk'ahantu ho gutangaza ko yifuza kuba perezida mu matora ari imbere. "}
{"id": "9376", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9376", "title": "Ismael Kanater", "text": "Ismail Abou El Kanater, wavutse 1957 ni umukinnyi wa filimi muri Maroc. Yagiye muri firime nyinshi za Maroc ndetse nizo mu mahanga.\nUmwuga.\nIsmail yatangiye umwuga we w'ubuhanzi abikesheje imyitozo muri Konserwatoriya i Casablanca, kandi yize hamwe na Aziz Saadallah, Khadija Asad n'abandi, kandi yitabira nk'umukinnyi mu ikinamico (Ghoul) na (Our Right to Land). Mu ntangiriro ya za mirongo irindwi, yitabiriye, hamwe n\u2019abanyeshuri ba Conservatoire, mu gushinga itsinda (Pocket Theatre) no gukora ingendo yikinamico muri Alijeriya. Mu 1973, yakoze mu ikinamico ya Tayeb Saddiki nka (Maqamat Badi Al-Zaman Al-Hamdani), (Sidi Abdel-Rahman Al-Majdoub) na (Al-Sufoud), no mu bishushanyo bimwe na bimwe bya tereviziyo byakozwe na nyakwigendera umuyobozi Hamid Bin Al-Sharif, yongeyeho ikinamico yitwa The Deserted Village, aherekejwe na Khadija Asad na Al-Shuaiba Al-Athrawi, Touriya Jabrane, na zhour maamri. Yitabiriye kandi ai kumwe n'umuyobozi Abd al-Rahman al-Khayyat mu ikinamico (Dirham al-Halal) ari kumwe na Naima al-Mashriqi, Aziz Mawhoub n'abandi, ndetse no muri filime ya televiziyo umuntu ufite uruhare rwe gusa we na Naima al-Mashriqi kandi iyobowe numugabo wanyuma.\nAmashusho.\nFilime "}
{"id": "9377", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9377", "title": "Amor Hakkar", "text": "Amor Hakkar (yavutse ku ya 1 Mutarama 1958), ni umukinnyi wa firime wo muri Alijeriya akaba na producer, umwanditsi wa sinema ndetse n'umukinnyi ukora ubu mu bucuruzi bwa firime mu Bufaransa. Afite isosiyete ikora firime \"Sarah Films\". \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse ku ya 1 Mutarama 1958 mu mudugudu w\u2019imisozi Aur\u00e8s mu karere ka Khenchela muri Alijeriya. Afite amezi 6, yageze mu Bufaransa ari kumwe n'ababyeyi be. Kuva icyo gihe, babaga i Besan\u00e7on, mucyaro, umujyi wa Founottes. Se Chays Hakkar yamugizeho ingaruka zo kwiga siyanse. \nUmwuga.\nMu 1990, Hakkar yayoboye filime ye ya mbere ngufi yise\"Teach me to count to infinity\". Noneho mu 1992, yakoze film yambere yise \"Bad Time for a Thug\". Wari umurimo ukorana na Pierre-Loup Rajot, Sylvie Fennec na Serge Giamberardino kandi wakozwe na sosiyete Rage au c\u0153ur film. \nMu 1994, yatangiye gufata amashusho mu Bufaransa no mu Butaliyani filime \"Ailleurs c'est beau aussi\" hamwe na Mado Maurin na Pierre Remund. Hanyuma mu 1998, Hakkar yimukiye mu karere kavukire ka Aur\u00e8s gushyingura ibisigazwa bya se, aho yafashe amashusho ya firime ya televiziyo yitwa \"Timgad, la vie au c\u0153ur des Aur\u00e8s\", documentaire y\u2019iminota 52 kuri TV 5 y\u2019Ubufaransa. Hagati aho, mu 2001, yatsindiye igihembo cya Marcel Aym\u00e9 kubera igitabo cyitwa \"La cit\u00e9 des fausses notes\". Mu 2005, Hakkar yashinze isosiyete ikora firime Sarah Films. \nMuri 2015, yayoboye filime \"Celle qui vivra\" hamwe na Meryem Medjkane, Muriel Racine, Nicolas Dufour, Hichem Berdouk na Caroline Fouilhoux. Iyi filime yatewe inkunga na sinema y'umwimerere na Florence Bouteloup ndetse na filime yasohotse mu makinamico mu 2017. Muri 2018, yayoboye filime \"Le Choix d'Ali\". "}
{"id": "9378", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9378", "title": "Urgent (film)", "text": "Urgent ni filimi yasohotse 2018 ikorerwa muri Maroke, yanditswe kandi iyoborwa na Mohcine Besri. filimi yagaragayemo Rachid Mustafa, Fatima Zahra Bennacer, Said Bey, Youssef Al-Alaoui, Ghalia Bin Zawia and Younes Bouab. Rachid Mustapha. filimi yakozwe na Elisa Garbar, Lamia Chraibi na Michel Merkt. Iyi filime yerekana uruhande rwijimye rw\u2019ibitaro bya Leta bya Maroc, bigaragazwa n\u2019ubwinshi bwa ruswa, kutita ku bantu, ubucucike bukabije n\u2019intege nke, no gucuruza imitima y\u2019abantu binubira ubukana bw\u2019ububabare.\nUmugambi.\nUmugabo ahagarara ku muyaga ku kiraro, ararusimbuka arangirira mu bitaro nyuma yo kuvunika. Idris n'umugore we Zahra bajya mu bitaro hamwe n'umuhungu wabo urwaye, kandi abo bashakanye barihebye kubera ko badashoboye gutanga amafaranga akenewe yo kubagwa. Hussain, umuvandimwe wa Idris ufite ibibazo, yahisemo kubaha amafaranga azabona ku bashakanye bo mu Busuwisi bazakira umwana we w'ejo hazaza. \nKwakira.\nIyi filime yerekanwe bwa mbere mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya filime rya Marrakech 2018 (MIFF). Nyuma muri 2019, yerekanwe bwa mbere mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya sinema rya Palm Springs no mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Tangier National 2019. \nIbihembo.\nIyi filime yatsindiye igihembo cya Al Husseiny Abou-Deif igihembo cya Filime nziza y'Ubwisanzure mu iserukiramuco rya Filimi rya Luxor. Yakiriye nomination esheshatu muri 15th Africa Movie Academy Awards."}
{"id": "9379", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9379", "title": "Athmane Ariouet", "text": "Athmane Ariouet yavutse ku ya 24 Nzeri 1948 ni umukinnyi wa sinema, ikinamico na filimi zica kuri televiziyo muri Alijeriya. Ariouet ufatwa nk'umwe mu bakinnyi beza kandi bazwi cyane muri sinema yo muri Alijeriya, yahawe ibihembo byinshi mu mwuga umaze imyaka irenga mirongo itanu. \nUbuzima bwite.\nAriouet yavutse ku ya 24 Nzeri 1948 i Amdoukal muri Barika, muri wilaya ya Batna. Yabanje kwitabira konserwatori ya Algiers kuva 1969 kugeza 1972.\nUmwuga.\nMugihe cyishuri, yari afite ishyaka ryo kuba umukinnyi wa filimi mwiza. Yemeje bose gutsindira igihembo cya mbere kubera inkoranyamagambo yakoze mu gifaransa. Yatinze, kuba umwizerwa mu gukina yatewe inkunga n\u2019umwarimu w\u2019igifaransa Henri Vangret. Nyuma yize ikinamico yicyarabu hamwe nabakinnyi bakomeye Mustapha Kasdarli, Taha La\u00e2miri na Allal Mouhib. Umukino we wa mbere wa sinema yakinnye muri 1963 \"Le R\u00e9sultat\". Mu 1981, yakinnye muri filime ya televiziyo \"The Executioner Cries\" iyobowe na Abder Isker. \nFilime ye yo mu bwoko bwa \"Carnaval Fi Dechra yo mu\" 1994, ifatwa nka filimi idahwema kwishyiriraho politiki. Iyi filime yayobowe na Mohamed Oukassi, ni filime isetsa yerekana umuryango wa Alijeriya usebanya. Icyakora, yabujijwe gukina nyuma ya filime. Mu 2002, yagarutse muri sinema akina na filime \"El Arch\" iyobowe na perezida. Ukuboza 2003, yasohoye filime ye ya mbere \"Er-roubla\" yakoranye na ENTV. \nMu 2004, yasezeye mu gukina nyuma ya filime \"Chronique des ann\u00e9es pub\" aho yahuye n\u2019ibibazo by\u2019amafaranga ndetse no guhagarika ikinamico. Icyakora, mu 2017 mu ihuriro rya buri munsi rya El Moudjahid, uwahoze ari Minisitiri w\u2019umuco Azzedine Mihoubi yavuze ko \u201ciyi filime yari mu cyiciro cyo gutunganya\u201d kandi amaherezo yasohotse mu 2018. Muri Nyakanga 2020, Ariouet yahawe imidari ya \u201cAchir\u201d yashyizwe ku rwego rw'igihugu iyobowe na Perezida wa Repubulika Abdelmadjid Tebboune. "}
{"id": "9380", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9380", "title": "Bullion (film)", "text": "Bullion ni filime yerekana ikinamico yo muri Uganda 2014 yakozwe na Henry Ssali kandi iyobowe na Phillip Luswata. Muri iyi filime hagaragaramo Allan Tumusiime, umukinnyi wa filime wo muri Kenya Ainea Ojiambo, umuririmbyi Juliana Kanyomozi na mushiki we Laura Kahunde, umunyamakuru wa radiyo na Veronica Tindi w\u2019uruganda rushimishije, umunyarwenya Anne Kansiime, Michael Wawuyo n'umuhungu we Michael Wawuyo Jr. ndetse no kugaragara k'umunyamideli n'umucuruzi. Sylvia Owori. \nIncamake.\nCollins Jjuuko, umushoferi wimodoka ya bullion arashaka cyane amafaranga yo guha umukobwa we ugiye kubagwa umutima mubuhinde. Yifatanije nitsinda ryabakozi ba banki bafite umururumba kwiba imodoka ya bullion. Nyuma y\u2019ubwo bujura, bagenzi be bamutwara amafaranga yose nuko arafatwa. Iyo avuye muri gereza, aba ashaka kwishyura. \nUmusaruro na premiere.\nFilime yakozwe na Henry Ssali munsi ya Ssali Productions. Niyo filime ye ya kabiri yakoze nyuma yo gukora Kiwani muri 2008. Yakozwe nubuyobozi w'umutunzi n'umucuruzi Sudhir Ruparelia nawe wari umuyobozi mukuru yabyaye Kiwani. gutunganywa ndetse no gukina filimi byatangiye mu 2009 mugihe amashusho yoherejwe hanze muri 2014. Icyo gihe yerekanwe bwa mbere muri Mata 2014 i Munyonyo Kampala. \nKasting.\nIgenzura ryabakinnyi ba film ryatangiye muri 2009. Allan Tumusiime, wigeze gukora kuri filime ya mbere ya Ssali Kiwani, yakinnye nka Collins Jjuuko. Umukinnyi wa filimi muri Kenya Makutano Ainea Ojiambo yatowe nkumuntu wanyuze kuri Phillip Luswata nawe wakoraga kuri Makutano. Ssali kandi yateye umuririmbyi Juliana Kanyomozi wari watangiye umwuga we wo gukina filime ye ya mbere Kiwani."}
{"id": "9381", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9381", "title": "Devil's Chest", "text": "Devil's Chest ni filime y'intambara yo muri Uganda yasohotse 2017 ivuga ku nyeshyamba za Lord Resistance Army mu majyaruguru ya Uganda. Yanditswe, yakozwe kandi iyobowe na Hassan Mageye hamwe nabakinnyi Hasifah Nande Nakitende na Samuel Rogers Masaaba mu nshingano zabo. Yerekanwe bwa mbere i Gulu mu Kwakira 2017 n i Kampala muri Gicurasi 2019. \nIncamake.\nMu gihe cya Lords Resistance Army (LRA) mu majyaruguru ya Uganda, umugore wo mu mudugudu ahatirwa kuba umugore w\u2019umuyobozi w\u2019inyeshyamba Joseph Kony, umugabo wishe umugabo we. Aba umusirikare kandi arwanira umudendezo. \nKwakira.\nFilime yakiriwe neza muri Uganda no muri Afrika yose kubera amateka yayo, gukina ndetse nicyerekezo. Yakiriye ibihembo byinshi (icyenda) mu bihembo bya 5 bya Uganda Film Festival Awards muri 2017 kandi yatsindiye ibihembo bine birimo Filime nziza n\u2019umuyobozi mwiza. Yatowe kandi mu bihembo bya Afurika Magic Viewers Choice Awards 2018 (AMVCA) ibihembo bya Filime Nziza yo muri Afurika y'Iburasirazuba na Filime Nziza Muri rusange. Bimwe mubice bya tekiniki, inkuru nibikorwa bya firime ariko byanenzwe. Collins Kakwezi wo mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Amakula yise iyi filime umushinga uteganijwe avuga ko ibikorwa byabuze kandi ko umuyobozi w'inyeshyamba, Joseph Kony yagaragajwe nk'umuntu mwiza binyuze ku mukinnyi Samuel Rogers Masaaba. "}
{"id": "9382", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9382", "title": "Bella Agossou", "text": "Bella Agossou wavutse 1981 ni umukinnyi wa filime wo muri B\u00e9nine muri sinema zo muri Esipanye. \nUmwuga.\nAgossou yatangiye umwuga we muri Benin nk'umukinnyi w'amafirime hamwe na sosiyete \"Sonangnon\" yaremye kandi itezwa imbere na we. Icyakora, nyuma yimyaka 4 ashinze isosiyete, yimukiye muri Espagne mu 2002. Nyuma yize indimi z'Igikatalani n'Icyesipanyoli kugira ngo akore umwuga wo gukina filime. Yakinnye muri filime \"Un cuento de Navidad\" (Christmas Tale) afite uruhare runini rw\u2019umugore ushakishwa na polisi kubera kubura impapuro nk\u2019abimukira batemewe. Nyuma, yakinnye cyane mu mafilime menshi yo muri Afurika no mu mahanga harimo \"Los Nuestros\", \"Moranetta\", \"A cuento ya Nadal\" na \"Palmeras en la Nieve\". Ku ya 13 Nyakanga 2017, Agossou yeretse abanyamakuru iduka ryitwa \"NOK\". "}
{"id": "9383", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9383", "title": "Adrienne Koutouan", "text": "Adrienne Ako Anomgbo Koutouan (wavutse 1969) numukinnyi wa filimi na comedi muri Cote d'Ivoire.\nUbuzima.\nKoutouan ni umwe mu baturage ba Tchaman kandi yavukiye mu mudugudu wa Abobo-T\u00e9 muri komine ya Abobo hafi ya Abidjan. Yifuzaga kuba umukinnyi wa filimi kuva akiri umwana, nubwo iki gitekerezo kitakiriwe neza n'ababyeyi be. Yatangiye umwuga we mu myaka ya za 1980 mu itsinda ry\u2019ikinamico \"F\u00e9tiche \u00e9burn\u00e9en\". Mu 1986, Koutouan yagizwe umubyinnyi mwiza muri ballet ya Coryte d'Ivoire. \nKoutouan yahawe ibihembo byinshi, harimo kwitwara neza mu bagore mu iserukiramuco rya Namur mu Bubiligi mu 1998, kwitwara neza mu bagore mu iserukiramuco rya M-Net ryabereye i Johannesburg mu 1999, ndetse n\u2019umukinnyi wa Afurika witwaye neza mu iserukiramuco rya Pabbah muri Nijeriya mu 2002. Mu mwaka wa 2006, Koutouan yahawe igihembo cya Gold Standard mu iserukiramuco rya Filime na Televiziyo bya Panafrican rya Ouagadougou kubera kwitwara neza mu rukurikirane rwa \"Quand les \u00e9l\u00e9phants se battent\". Azwi cyane muri Coryte d'Ivoire kubera uruhare rwe nka Rosalie mu rukurikirane rwa \"Faut pas f\u00e2cher\". Muri 2008, Koutouan yakinnye nka Infirmi\u00e8re Antoinette muri Dr. Boris ari kumwe na Ahmed Souaney. \nKu ya 14 Mata 2019, Koutouan yahawe icyubahiro mu birori byo kwizihiza imyaka 30 amaze ari umukinnyi wa filime, ahabwa itandukaniro riturutse kuri guverinoma. Yageze ku ntera ya ofisiye mu cyubahiro cy\u2019umuco, na Minisiteri y\u2019umuco na Francophonie. Umugatolika wubahaga Imana, Koutouan na we yagize misa mu cyubahiro cye. "}
{"id": "9384", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9384", "title": "Fran\u00e7oise Ellong", "text": "Fran\u00e7oise Ellong (wavutse 8 Gashyantare 1988) ni umuyobozi wa firime n'umwanditsi wa filimi muri Kameruni.\nUbuzima.\nEllong yavukiye Douala, muri Kameruni mu 1988. Afite imyaka 11, yimukiye i Brunoy kubana na nyirarume, maze yandika inkuru ye ya mbere. Ellong yitabiriye amarushanwa y'abanditsi bato bavuga igifaransa mu 2002. Kubera amarushanwa, yagize ubushake bwo kwandika amashusho. \nMu 2006, filime ye ya mbere ngufi, \"Les Colocs\", yarasohotse. Ellong yayoboye filime ye ya mbere yerekana, \"WAKA\", mu 2013. yanditswe na S\u00e9raphin Kakouang, bishingiye ku nkuru y'umwimerere ya Ellong. \"WAKA\" yahawe igihembo cyihariye cy\u2019abacamanza mu iserukiramuco du Cin\u00e9ma Africain de Khouribga, ndetse n\u2019igihembo cya Dikalo mu iserukiramuco rya Pan-African Cannes. Yerekanwe mugutangira ibirori bya Ecrans Noirs. Filime ye ya kabiri yerekana, \"Buried\", yasohotse muri 2020. Nibijyanye no guhura kwinshuti zo mu bwana numukino wagaragaje amabanga. Ifata amashusho mu mudugudu wa Nkassomo, yatewe inkunga na raporo yamakuru yabonye kuri tereviziyo.\nUsibye kwandika no kuyobora, Ellong yasohoye igitabo \"Journal Intime d'Un Meurtrier\" mu 2008. Muri 2016, yatangije blog \"Le Film Camerounais\", bituma ibihembo bya LFC. Ellong yasabye ko hajyaho inkambi z\u2019abakinnyi ba Thierry Ntamack mu 2020, Ntamack amaze kuvuga ko 10 ku ijana gusa by\u2019abakinnyi ba Kameruni ari beza. "}
{"id": "9385", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9385", "title": "Christiane Chabi-Kao", "text": "Christiane Chabi-Kao (wavutse ku ya 30 Kamena 1963) ni umuyobozi wa filime wo muri B\u00e9nine akaba n'umwanditsi.\nUbuzima.\nChabi-Kao yavukiye i Marseille mu Bufaransa mu 1963. Yize muri Kaminuza ya Reims Champagne-Ardenne kuva 1984 kugeza 1986. Mu 1990, Chabi-Kao yasubiye muri Afurika. Yasohokanye na filime ye ya mbere, \"Les enfants esclaves\", mu 2005, documentaire isobanura abana b'abacakara bigezweho. \nMu 2007, yayoboye filime \"Les inseparables\". Ivuga amateka y'abavandimwe Yawa na Abi, se bamugurisha ku mucuruza w'abana, maze nyina ajya mu ishami rishinzwe kurengera abana rya Polisi kugira ngo amenye uko byagenze. Iyi filime yakozwe na UNICEF na Radiyo na Televiziyo y'igihugu ya B\u00e9nin (ORTB), isohoka nk'uruhererekane rwa firime enye. Chabi-Kao yanditse iyi filime mu rwego rwo gukangurira no guhagarika icuruzwa ry'abana. Yakiriye igihembo nyafurika Numerique mu iserukiramuco rya Vues d'Afrique ryabereye i Montreal mu 2008, anahabwa igihembo cy\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu mu iserukiramuco rya Filimi na Televiziyo rya Panafrican 2009 rya Ouagadougou. Nyuma yo kumenyeshwa itegeko ribuza kwerekanwa ku buntu, Chabi-Kao yateguye kwerekana filime ku banyeshuri 300 ba Burkinabe. \nMu 2009, yasimbuye Monique Mbeke Phoba nk'umuyobozi w'ikirori cya Lagunimages i Cotonou. Nkumuyobozi, Chabi-Kao afasha kwambara iserukiramuco rya firime ryizina rimwe. Yakoreye iserukiramuco imyaka itari mike mbere yo kuba umuyobozi, ahabwa inkunga na Deutsche Welle Academy yo kwiga uko bategura ibirori. Chabi-Kao yanditse akanayobora ibiganiro bya televiziyo \"bigizwe n'ibice 14\" muri Les Chenapans muri 2013. Irerekana ubuzima nintambara byingimbi batanu bo muri B\u00e9nin, kandi ikoresha abakinnyi badafite umwuga. "}
{"id": "9386", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9386", "title": "Nyirarugero Dancille", "text": "Nyirarugero Dancille ni umunyarwandakazi w'umuhanga akaba yarabaye umwarimu muri kaminuza ndetse akaba yari umunyapolitiki aho yagizwe guverineri w'intara y'amajyaruguru y'U Rwanda muri werurwe 2021, ubu akaba yarakuwe kuri iyo mirimo akaba yaraginzwe Komiseri cyangwa umuyobozi wa Komisiyo y'Igihugu yo gusezerera no gusubiza mu buzima busanzwe abari Abasirikare. \nUbuzima bwabanje n'amashuri.\nNyirarugero Dancille ni mubyeyi wavutse mu mwaka wa 1970, akaba afite abana 4 harimo abakobwa batatu n'umuhungu umwe. Guverineri Nyirarugero Dancille yavukiye mu murenge wa muhoza, avukira mu karere ka Musanze mu ntara y'amajyaruguru, akaba yarashakanye na Nkundimana Fidele mu karere ka Nyabihu. \nNyirarugero Dancille yize amashuri abanza ku ishuri rya Rungu mu murenge wa Gacaca mu karere ka Musanze ayisumbuye ayigira muri Lyce Notre Dame de Citeaux i Kigali, yakomereje ikiciro cya kabiri cya kaminuza muri kaminuza ya Ines-Ruhengeri, kubera inyota yarafite yo kunguka ubumenyi yakomereje ikiciro cya gatatu cya kaminuza i kampala kuri kaminuza ya makelele yasoje muri 2009, Nyirarugero Dancille yaje gukomeza kw'iyungura ubumenyi mu budage muri 2017 aho yakuye indi myamyabumenyi y'ikiciro cya kabiri cya kaminuza.\nUmwuga.\nNyirarugero Dancille yahawe akazi ku bwarimu ko kuba umwarimu kuri kaminuza yigagaho ya Ines-Ruhengeri nyuma yo kugira amanota menshi, yakomereje imirimo ye mu ishuri rikuru rya Muhabura Integrated Polytechnic College(MIPC) Aho yarakuriye ishami rya Business Studies. Muri Werurwe 2021, nibwo Nyirarugero Dancille yahawe imirimo mishya yo kuba guverineri w'intara y'Amajyaruguru.\nGusenga.\nNyirarugero Dancille ni mubyeyi ubibonako rwose akunda gusenga, aho asanzwe asengera mu itorero Anglican muri Diyosezi ya Shyira Katedarali Yohani Umubatiza Wera, akaba ari umwe mu bagize Korali y\u2019ababyeyi yitwa Jyana Umucyo. Umwana wanjye mukuru yarangije Kamunuza, ukurukiyeho arangije umwaka wa mbere muri Kaminuza y\u2019u Rwanda, uwa gatatu ari mu mashuri yisumbuye mu mwaka wa gatandatu mu gihe bucura ari mu mwaka wa kane w\u2019amashuri yisumbuye\u201d.Uwo muyobozi wazindukiye mu kazi kuri uyu wa Kabiri aho yigisha mu ishuri rikuru rya MIPC."}
{"id": "9387", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9387", "title": "Mureshyankwano Marie Rose", "text": "Amavu n' amavuko.\nMureshyankwano Marie Rose yavutse 1968 mu Rwanda, ni umugore akaba umunyarwandakazi w'umunyapolitiki wo mu Rwanda. Mureshyankwano afite impanyabushobozi y'icyiciro cya kabiri cy'akaminuza mu byigisho by'iterambere. Kuva mu 1992 kugeza 1994, na none kuva 1997 kugeza 2001 akora akazi ko kwigisha mu mashuri abanza imyaka irenga 12 umwarimu mu mashuri abanza mu Karere ka Rutsiro. Kuva 2001 kugeza 2005 yari umwarimu mu ishuri ryisumbuye kuri Bumba Complex School. \nUmuryango.\nYavutse mu muryango w' abana icyenda: abakobwa batandatu n\u2019abahungu batatu, akurira mu muryango warimo amatungo, inka n\u2019ihene. Icyo gihe hari muri Komine Karago muri Gisenyi, ubu ni muri Nyabihu. Ubu bafite abana batatu, barimo babiri biga muri kaminuza. Yaje kujya mu muryango wa FPR Inkotanyi muri 2000. \nUmwuga.\nMureshyankwano muri 2005 yagiriwe icyizere cyo kuba umwe mu mutwe w\u2019abadepite. Yakomeje kuba umudepite kugeza mu 2016. Kuva mu 2016 kugeza 2018 yabaye Guverineri w'Intara y'Amajyepfo, naho muri 2018-19 akora nk'umujyanama mu bunyamabanga bukuru bwa FPR-Inkotanyi.\nSenateri Mureshyankwano Marie Jose yatanze ubuhamya bw'urugendo rwe mu mashyamba ya Congo ndetse asobanura neza uburyo nuko inkotanyi zarokoye\u00a0 umugabo we zikamukiza indwara y \u2018 ubuhutu.Ikiganiro cyabereye mwihuriro ry\u2019urubyiruko ryiswe \u201cIngano Cyungano'\u2019\nAmateka y'Umuryango wa Marie Rose Mureshyankwano.\nMu 2020 Gashyantare tariki ya 13 habayeho impanuka yabere mu Karere ka Kamonyi aho umugabo wa Senateri Mureshyankwano yaguye muriyo mpanuka.Impanuka yabaye yaturutse ku modoka ya Fuso yari ipakiye ibiti iva i Muhanga yerekeza i Kigali, yabuze feri maze ikagongana n\u2019imodoka itwara abagenzi ya coaster hapfamo batandatu harimo n'umugabo wa Senateri"}
{"id": "9388", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9388", "title": "M chantal rwakazina", "text": "Rwakazina M Chantal.\nRwakazina yatorewe kuyobora umujyi wa kigal afite imyaka 45 \nakaba yubatse afite umugabo n'abana 2 yatorewe kuyobora umugi wa kigal akaba yaratsindiye ku majwi 146\nyatowe asimbuye Pascal yarucyuye igihe \nAho Rwakazina yize.\nyize muri kaminuza y'urwanda ndetse aza no kuyigishamo kuva 2000-2008\nAho yakoraga.\nKuva 2013 kugeza ubu yakoraga mu muryango wabibumbye aho yari umuhuzabikorwa w'inkunga \nzabibumbye mu bikorwa bya leta yu Rwanda. mu mwaka wa 2003 kugeza muri 2004 yari umwarimu\nudahoraho muri Kaminuza ya Bagaturika Imuhanga mu Ishami ry' inyigisho ziterambere. kugeza ubu\nni Ambasaderi wa Repuburika yu Rwanda mugihugu cy' ubusuwisi. agahagararira umuryango uhoraho\nwabibumbye mu miryango yubucuruzi nindi miryango mpuzamahanga i geneve.\nAgashya.\nRwakazina yabaye umunyamabanga mukuru wungirije wi shyirahamwe ryabayobozi bo mu Rwanda(RALGA)\nndetse aba umwe mubagize inama yubutegetsi bu Rwanda(RGB)."}
{"id": "9389", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9389", "title": "Inyumba aloysia", "text": "Inyumba Aloysia.\nInyumba aloysia yari minisitiri witerambere ryu muryango mu Rwanda kuva mu mwaka 2011.\nnyakwigendera yabaye umwe mubari bagize ihuriro rya bagore bari muneko nshinga mategeko mu Rwanda.\nAmateka.\nInyumba yavutse ku itariki 28 ukuboza 1964. Inyumba yabaye umwe mu banyarwanda,\nbashinze umuryango wa FPR Inkotanyi ubwo yarari mubuhungiro mugihugu cya Uganda.\nInyumba yitabye imana mugitondo cyo kuwa 6 ukuboza 2012 azize uburwayi."}
{"id": "9390", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9390", "title": "Ignatienne nyirarukundo", "text": "NYIRARUKUNDO Ignatienne.\nNyirarukundo Ignatienne umujyanama mukuru ibiro bya Minisitiri w' intebe mu Rwanda mu kwakira 2019\nIgnatienne mu myaka ibiri ishize yahoze ari Umunyabanga wa leta muri Minisiteri y' Ubutegetsi bw' Igihugu ushinzwe imibereho myiza y' Abaturange (MINALOC).\namateka.\nNyirarukundo mbere yuko aba umudepeti aho yabaye umudepeti yakoze imirimo itandukanye aho yabaye umuyobozi w' umuryango w' Abasuwisi ushinzwe kurengera inyungu z'abana bari munsi y' imyaka 18 bafunze ndetse anakora muri komisiyo y' igihungu y' Ubumwe n' ubwigenge aho yariwe komiseri.Ignatienne yanakoze umuhuzabikorwa wa komite ishinzwe kurengera Abana nk' inzobere ya UNICEF muri Minisiteri y' Uburinganire n' iterambere ry' Umuryango."}
{"id": "9391", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9391", "title": "Nyinawamwiza Laetitia", "text": "Nyinawamwiza Laetitia yavutse \"tariki 17 ukuboza 1972,\" ni umunyarwandakazi, afite impamyabumenyi yikirenga mw' ishami ry' umusaruro w'inyamaswa (ubworozi bw'amafi) aribyo mu cyongereza bita PHD, in Animal Production (Aquaculture) ni umusenateri muri Guverinoma y'u Rwanda, yarahiriye iyi mirimo yatorewe yo kuba senateri kuwa kane tariki ya 17 Ukwakira 2019 ahagarariye intara ya majyaruguru, ni umwe muba senateri 20 bagize manda ya gatatu ya sena y'u Rwanda. \nIbigwi n'imirimo yakoze.\nDr. Nyinawamwiza laetitia ni Senateri akaba\u00a0n' umunyamuryango wa Komite ishinzwe iterambere ry'ubukungu n'imari\nYabaye Umuyobozi w'ishami ry'Umusaruro w\u2019\u2019amatungo, ishami ry'ubuhinzi muri kaminuza nkuru y'u Rwanda (kuva 2009 kugeza 2011)\nKuva 2010 Dr.Nyinawamwiza laetitia ni Umwarimu mukuru muri kaminuza y'u Rwanda, Ishuri Rikuru ry'Ubuhinzi.\nKuva 2011 kugeza 2013 yari Umuyobozi wungirije ushinzwe amasomo n'ubushakashatsi mu Ishuri Rikuru ry'Ubuhinzi n'ubworozi (ISAE-BUSOGO)\nkuva muri 2012 kugeza 2013 Dr.Nyinawamwiza Leatitia yabaye AG. Umuyobozi w'ishuri Rikuru ry'Ubuhinzi n'ubworozi (ISAE-BUSOGO)\nDr,Nyinawamwiza laetitia yabaye Umwe mu bagize komite ishinzwe kugenzura Inama Njyanama ya karere ka Africa y\u2019Uburasirazuba mu burezi mu mashuri makuru na kaminuza (kuva 2013 kugeza 2015)\nyabaye Umwe mubagize Inama y'Ubuyobozi y'inama y'igihugu ishinzwe amashuri makuru na kaminuza (kuva 2012 kugeza 2019)\nYabaye Umuyobozi wungirije w'inama y'Ubuyobozi y'Ikigo cya siyansi yakoreshejwe (Ines-Ruhengeri), (kuva 2012 kugeza 2019)\nYari Umuyobozi wungirije w'inama y'Ubuyobozi y'Ikigo cy'igihugu gishinzwe ubushakashatsi n'iterambere ry'inganda (NIRDA), (kuva 2016 kugeza 2019)\nYabaye Umuyobozi wungirije w'inama y'Ubuyobozi y'icyayi cy'u Rwanda (Inganda z'icyayi cya Rubaya-Nyabihu), (kuva 2018 kugeza 2019)\nYabaye Umunyamuryango w'Inama y'Ubuyobozi ya Rwanda mountain tea (Uruganda rw\u2019icyayi rwa Kitabi), (kuva 2018 kugeza 2019)\nYari Umuyobozi w'Ishuri Rikuru ry'Ubuhinzi, siyanse y'inyamaswa n'ubuvuzi bw'amatungo muri kaminuza yu Rwanda (kuva 2013 kugeza 2019).\nKuba muri Sena y'u Rwanda.\nMu mwaka w'i 2019 Dr. Laetitia Nyinawamwiza yatorewe kujya mu nteko ishinga amategeko y'u Rwanda, umutwe wa Sena.\nIbihembo.\nMu mwaka w'i 2017 Dr Laetitia Nyinawamwiza yahawe igihembo cy'umwe mu bagore bavuga rikijyana bari mu bucuruzi, imiromo ya leta ndetse n'uburezi muri Afurika, icyo gihembo kikaba cyaratanzwe na CEO-Global.\nYabaye indashyikirwa muri Kaminuza ishinzwe uburinganire mu Rwanda (kuva 2016 kugeza 2019)"}
