{"id": "9395", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9395", "title": "MADELEINE MUKAMABANO", "text": "MUKAMABANO Madeleine yavutse mu mwaka wi 1955 avukira mu Rwanda, yize amashuri abanza mu rwanda, 1973 yakomereje amashuri yisumbuye mu gihugu cya Uganda, mu gihe Uganda yari mubibazo bya politiqwe kubwa president ADIAMINI Dada. Madelene yaje gufashwa naba diplomate babafaransa bamutwara mu mujyi wa paris, aho yari ajyiye gutegerereza burse yo gukomereza amashuri mu gihugu cyubwongereza muri kaminuza ya stanford. Kubera imbogamizi nyinshi yahuye nazo, yafashe umwanzuro wo gukomeza icyiciro cyagatatu cya kaminuza muri Moderne letter in Sarbonne.\nYakomeje umwuga we muri mission yarafite muri Togo, yabaye umwarimu mu gihugu cya cote d'Ivoire ndetse yaje kuba umu consultant muri Ethiopie.\nMu mwaka wa 1999 yakoze kuri radio yumuco yabafaransa(radio france culture). Yakoranye umwete numurava bimuha amahirwe yo kugirwa umuyobozi wibiganiro mbarankuru kuri iyo radio. Yanditse raporo eshanu zivuga ku kugarura amahoro mubanyarwanda nyuma yibyabaye muri Genocide yakorewe abatutsi mu mwaka wi 1994.\nMu mwaka 2000,yakoze film mbarankuru kiuri Genocide yakorewe abatutsi mu mwaka wa 1994, ahura nabarokotse Genocide ndetse nabakoze genocide, iyi film yakunzwe nabenshi, ituma abanyarwanda bongera kwiremamo Icyizere Cyo Kubaho. Iyi film yaje guhabwa igihembo kizwi nka Bayeux Calvados-Normandie Prize for war correspondents.\nMu mwaka 2003 yabaye umujyanama mukuru wabatunganya inkuru kuri Radio France culture, bakorera kumugabane wa Africa. Yakomeje kuyobora ibiganiro ndetse ikizi nka African Debate. Iyi mirimo yose yayifatanyaga ninshingano yari afite muri European Union nindi mishinga itegamiye kuri leta. Mu mwaka wa 2010 Yagaritse Umwuga witangazamuakuru aho yari amaze imyaka 20 yose muri uyu mwuga."}
{"id": "9396", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9396", "title": "Jeanne D'arc MUKAKALISA", "text": "Mukakalisa Jeanne d\u2019Arc ni umwe mubategarugori bagize inteko Ishingamategeko umutwe wa Sena, akaba yaratorewe kuzajya mu inteko Ishingamategeko umutwe wa Sena nk\u2019uko byemejwe n\u2019inama nyunguranabitekerezo y\u2019imitwe ya Politiki mu Rwanda.aturuka mu Ishyaka PDC.Iyinama y\u2019iri huriro ry\u2019imitwe ya politiki yemewe mu Rwanda yateranye kuri uyu wa Kane tariki ya 20 Nzeri 2012, niyo yemeje uyu musenateri bashya.Uyu musenaterari akaba yarafatanyishe nabanyarwanda muri gahunda ya ndumunyarwanda akaba yemezako ndumunyarwanda ari urukingo rw'ejo heza h'u RwandaAkaba yarayoboye comite ya sena ishinzwe gutanga amakuru kubinyobwa bikorerwa mu Rwanda "}
{"id": "9398", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9398", "title": "Valentine Rugwabiza", "text": "RUGWABIZA Valentine.\nRUGWABIZA Valentine wavutse kuya 25 Nyakanga 1963 ni umunyarwandakazi\nakaba n' umunyapolitike uhagarariye u Rwanda mu muryango wabibumbye kuva mu mwaka wa 2016.\nIbyo yakoze.\nRugwabiza Valentine kuva mu mwaka wa 2005 kugeza muri 2015 yabaye umuyobozi mukuru wungirije w'umuryango \nw'ubucuruzi ku Isi. mbere yaho gato yabaye uhagarariye u Rwanda uhoraho muri Loni i Geneve na Ambasaderi \nudasanzwe mu Busuwisi. mugihe yari Ambasaderi yabaye umuhuza bikorwa w 'itsinda nyafurika ry'amasaderi muri\n(WTO). kandi yari umwe mubagize akanama ku ubukungu nimibereho myiza mubiro bya Perezida wu Rwanda i \" Kigali \"\nUmwihariko.\nAmbasaderi Rugwabiza Valentine ni umunyamuryango washinze ihuriro ry'abikorera kugiti cyabo mu Rwanda \nishyirahamwe ry'abagore ba Rwiyemezamirimo bo mu Rwanda hamwe n'abagore babayobozi bo mu Rwanda.\nAmbasaderi Rugwabiza yabaye umwe mubagize Inama y'ubuyobozi muri Kaminuza y'umuryango \nw' abibumbye ishinzwe Amahoro. Rugwabiza amaze imyaka irenga mirongo itatu akora kubibazo\nby'iterambere ry'Africa ndetse ni isi yose haba mu bigo no munzego za Leta.\nAmashuri yize naho yize.\nAfite impamya bumenyi yikiciro cyakabiri cya Kaminuza (Bacholor's) na Masters mu\nbukungu yakuye muri \nIndi mirimo ye.\nubwo ingabo zumuryango wabibumbye za Repubulika iharanira demokarasi ya Centre Africa Minusca zateranaga zikemera guhindura \numuyobozi mugihe kitarenze ukwezi nibwo umuyobozi wa ONU Antonio Gutteres yatangaga umu candita we ugomba gusimbura \nuwitwa Mankeur Ndiaye uzarangiza manda ye 28 Gashyantare 2022 atangaza ko yifuza ko yasimburwa na Valentine Rugwabiza\nuhasanzwe ahagarariye U Rwanda muri ONU hari ku kabiri tariki 22 gashyantare ubwo imyanzuro yakanama nkemura mpaka\nyabyemezaga.\nInshingano.\nkuwa 23 Gashyantare 2022 nibwo Rugwabiza Sendanyoye Vlentine yagizwe umuyobozi wa MINUSCA asimbuye Mnkeur Ndiaye\nwarangije manda te muri gashyantare 28 mumwaka wa 2022 ku itariki 18Mata nibwo Valentine yakiriwe muburyo bw'icyubahiro ningabo\nziri mubutumwa bwo kugarura amahoro muri centrafrica MINUSCA\nAmbasaderi Valentine Sendanyoye Rugwabiza yashakanye na Paulin Sendanyoye"}
{"id": "9401", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9401", "title": "Aisa Kirabo Kacyira", "text": "Kirabo Kacyira Aisa (yavutse muri 1964 apfa ku ya 12 Kanama 2025) ni umunyarwandakazi w'umunyapolitiki ndetse w'impuguke mub'ubuveterineri w'abigize umwuga. Kacyira akaba yarabaye n'umuyobozi wungirije wa UN HABITAT. \nAmashuri yize.\nKacyira afite Impamyabumenyi ihanitse m'ubumenyi bw'amatungo mubijyanye no kuvura ndetse no kwita ku amatungo, yakuye muri Kaminuza yitwa James Cook muri ositarariya. Kacyira kandi yize muri kaminuza ya Makerere iherereye muri gihugu cy' Ubugande, kandiKacyira yakuye impamyabumyenyi ihanitse ya Masters ku buvuzi. \nImirimo ye.\nKirabo Kacyira yabaye Guverineri w'intara y'iburasirazuba bw'u Rwanda. Intara nini ituwe n'abasaga million 2.5 z'abaturage. Kacyira kandi yabaye umu Diplomate w'u Rwanda arugaraiye mu bindi bihugu.\nKacyira kandi yabaye umuyobozi wungirije akaba nu munyamabanga mukuru w'Umuryango w'Abibumbye Habitat kuva mu gushyingo 2011, kugeza mu 2018, muri porogaramu n\u2019imishinga bya Minisiteri y\u2019Ubuhinzi n\u2019Ubworozi mu Rwanda (Minagri) ndetse n\u2019imiryango itegamiye kuri leta irimo Oxfam na Care International.Muri iyo mirimo ye yabaye umuyobozi mwiza mu ibyo yarashinzwe cyane no guteza imbere umujyi wa Kigali. \nIcyo akora ubu.\nDr Aisa Kirabo Kacyira kurubu ni Ambasaderi uhagarariye u Rwanda muri Ghana muri 2020, Kirabo Kacyira Aisa afite icyicaro muri icyo gihugu akabifatanya no kuruhagararira mu bihugu birimo Benin, Togo, Sierra Leone, kote divura na Liberiya. Rero umunyamabanga mukuru w\u2019Umuryango w\u2019Abibumbye, Guterres Antonio, yahaye Umunyarwandakazi, Kirabo Kacyira Aissa, inshingano zo kuyobora Ibiro by\u2019uyu muryango (United Nations Support Office in Somalia: UNSOS) bifasha Afurika Yunze Ubumwe mu butumwa bw\u2019amahoro muri Somaliya. Kirabo Kacyira yinjiranye muri izi nshingano ubunararibonye bw\u2019imyaka 30 akesha imirimo itandukanye yakoze yaba ifite aho ihuriye na dipolomasi, politiki ndeste n\u2019iyo yakoze mu miryango y\u2019iterambere cyangwa iy\u2019ubutabazi, imbere mu gihugu, ndetse no mu karere no ku rwego ruri mpuzamahanga. \nIndi mirimo.\nDr Kacyira kandi yayoboye Umujyi wa Kigali kuva muri 2006 kugeza muri 2011, akaba ari umwe mu mijyi yihuta cyane mu iterambere k'umuvuduko udasanzwe. Mugihe yari ayoboye umujyi wa Kigali, Aisa yahawe igihembo na UN HABITAT muri 2008, mu rwego rwo gushimira urwego rw'isuku,umutekano ndetse n'iterambere rirambye.\nUbuzima bwe bwite.\nDr Kirabo Aisa Kacyira ni umubyeyi wubatse kandi akaba afite abana bane. "}
{"id": "9403", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9403", "title": "Onechi Lwenje", "text": "Onechi Lwenje (wavutse 1985) ni umukinnyi wa sinema ya Zambiya. Usibye gukina, Onechi numwanditsi wamamaye, umukinnyi wa firime na producer. Kugeza ubu ayoboye Isosiyete y'Itangazamakuru yitwa 'Landmark Communications Limited'.\nUbuzima bwite.\nOnechi yavutse mu 1985 i Lusaka, muri Zambiya avuka ku munyamakuru w'inararibonye na nyina w\u2019umuhinzi mu muryango ufite barumuna be batatu. Se Patson Victor Robert Lwenje yakoraga mu biro bya diplomasi i Beijing mu Bushinwa, aho Onechi yari afite imyaka ibiri n'igice icyo gihe. Patson kandi yari umunyamakuru mu myaka ya za 1980, asesengura umuziki akaba n'umwanditsi w'imyidagaduro. \nOnechi yarangije amashuri abanza mu ishuri mpuzamahanga rya Beijing, Nkwazi Primary na Gospel Outreach Christian Academy. Nyuma yize mu ishuri ryisumbuye rya Kabulonga Boys ryisumbuye kandi arangiza amashuri mu 2002. Hanyuma, yakurikiranye amasomo mu micungire yamakuru muri ZCAS. Numushinga wa Microsoft Sisitemu yemewe kandi yakoraga muri NCC Phoneix Contractors hamwe na Mediterranean Shipping Company mumyaka mike. \nUmwuga.\nMu 1999, Onechi yifatanije nu mushinga wa Zambiya kugirango bakore ikinamico ishingiye ku nsanganyamatsiko yo kurwanya imiti n\u2019ibiyobyabwenge kandi ikinamico yiswe \"Don't\". Yakinnye muri ako gakino mu turere duturanye mu mashuri agera ku 10. Hagati aho, yatakaje imyaka mike yubuzima muri sosiyete itwara ibicuruzwa. Hanyuma mu 2005, yatangiye guhimba imivugo maze yinjira mu binyamakuru n'ibitabo byinshi birimo 'Nkhani Kulture' mu 2010 na 'Nkwazi In-Flight' muri 2013. \nMuri 2017, Onechi yinjijwe nka perezida wa 48 wa Rotary Club ya Lusaka Central abaye umuhererezi ufite uyu mwanya kugeza ubu. Nka perezida, yakoze imishinga igaragara nko kubaka ibitaro by\u2019amagufwa by\u2019Ubutaliyani, ikigo cy\u2019amahugurwa cy\u2019urubyiruko cya Kabulonga n\u2019umushinga wa Vita-Nov wo gutanga ibikoresho by\u2019ubuvuzi ku bitaro bya Chongwe n\u2019ibitaro by\u2019abana by\u2019ubuvuzi bya kaminuza (UTH) bivura indwara z\u2019umutima n\u2019umuriro.. Hanyuma yubatse icyumba cy'ishuri mu cyaro cy'akarere ka Chibombo. "}
{"id": "9404", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9404", "title": "Kenneth Yannick", "text": "Kenneth Yannick, (yavukiye: 30 Ukwakira 1995), ni umunyaBene ukina comedy. Niwe washinze Cotonou Comedy Club, ifatwa nkigitaramo cya mbere gihagaze neza muri Benin. \nUbuzima bwite.\nYannick yavutse ku ya 30 Ukwakira 1995 i Cotonou, muri B\u00e9nin aho yakuriye na nyina wenyine. Mugihe yize, yabanje gukora icyiciro cya gatanu cyerekeza kubinyabuzima kuko ubuvuzi aribwo yashyize imbere. Ariko, nyuma yaje guhindukirira imibare igana inzira. Hanyuma, Yannick yamaze umwaka mwishuri rya Polytechnic rya kaminuza ya Abomey-Calavi (EPAC) ryabaye ibyago. Yatangiye gukora videwo ngufi zisekeje muri 2013. Nyuma ya baccalaur\u00e9at, yarangije amasomo yubwubatsi. \nUmwuga wo gusetsa.\nMu mwaka wa 2008, yavumbuye igihagararo hamwe na \"Papa est en haut\", Gad Elmaleh yerekanaga aho ayireba kuri mudasobwa. Muri 2013, yatangiye gukora amashusho asetsa kuri interineti no ku mbuga nkoranyambaga. Amaze kubona impamyabumenyi y'ikirenga ya dogiteri muri physiologiya, yabaye umwarimu wa siporo, imwemerera kubona amafaranga ahagije yo kwishyura ubukode no gufasha umuryango we. Hanyuma, hagati ya 2015 na 2016, yagerageje gusetsa imbere yinshuti muminsi mikuru y'amavuko. \nMu mwaka wa 2016, Yannick yakoze igitaramo cye cya mbere cyo gusetsa imbere y\u2019abantu 600 batazi stand up comedy byabereye mu kigo cy\u2019ubuyobozi bw\u2019igihugu n\u2019ubucamanza (ENAM). Nibwo bwambere comedi ihagaze muri B\u00e9nin. Nyuma ku ya 4 Kanama 2017, yashinze Cotonou Comedy Club (CCC) ari kumwe n'inshuti Jean Morel Morufux (Morel) na Fadil Romxi. Ni ubwambere igitaramo cyahariwe guhaguruka gitangwa muri B\u00e9nin."}
{"id": "9405", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9405", "title": "Edgar-Yves", "text": "Edgar-Yves (Edgar-Yves Monnou Junior), umufaransa wavukiye muri B\u00e9nine ukina comedy. Ni umunyamuryango wa Golden Comedy Club ya Paris. \nUbuzima bwite.\nNi umuhungu w'umunyapolitiki wo muri B\u00e9nine Edgar Yves Monnou. Monnouh akiri umwana, umuryango we wimukiye mu Bufaransa kubera ko se yari ambasaderi wa Benin i Paris. \nUmwuga wo gusetsa.\nUbwa mbere, ntiyashakaga gukora urwenya. Icyakora, inshuti ze zamubwiye gukora amashusho kuri enterineti. Icyo gihe, yari i Nantes aho yiyandikishije na sosiyete ya caf\u00e9-th\u00e9\u00e2tre kugirango atezimbere gukina amashusho ye. Muri 2013, yashinze club yo gusetsa ya West Side i Nantes. Hamwe nimyiyerekano, akabari kuri caf\u00e9-th\u00e9\u00e2tre kuzura kandi buri wa gatatu hari abantu 120. Yakinnye igitaramo cye igihe cyose, gatatu mu cyumweru. \nYabaye inkingi kuri Rire &amp; Chansons muri 2017. Hagati aho, yahuye na producer wa Jeff Panocloc Philippe Delmas. Delmas yahaye Monnouh kuza i Paris kuri Theatre ya Apollo. Muri uwo mwaka, yimukiye i Paris maze akora ibitaramo byinshi byo gusetsa bihagaze mu makinamico atandukanye i Paris. Urugendo rwatangiye ku ya 22 Mata muri Com\u00e9die de Toulouse, nyuma yimukira ku ya 28 na 29 Mata i Metz kuri caf\u00e9-theatre Le Burlesque, ku ya 21 Gicurasi ahitwa Les Fous rires de Toulouse na 7 Kamena kuri Th\u00e9\u00e2tre de l'Ouest i Rouen."}
{"id": "9406", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9406", "title": "El\u00e9phant Mouill\u00e9", "text": "Pierre Zinko (wavutse 1969), uzwi cyane ku izina rye rya stage El\u00e9phant Mouill\u00e9, ni umuririmbyi wo muri B\u00e9nine, umunyarwenya n'umukinnyi. Ni umwe mu banyamuryango bashinze 'S\u00e8mako Wobaho theatre na sinema'. Ni n'umukinnyi uzwi cyane mu ikinamico no muri sinema.\nUbuzima bwite.\nZinko yavutse 1969 i Bohicon, muri B\u00e9nin.\nUmwuga.\nKu myaka 12, Zinko yatangiye ari umukanishi wa moto. Muri kiriya gihe, ibitaramo byayo byubuhanzi byagarukiraga mubyabaye gusa. Mu 1986, yabonye impamyabumenyi ye ya nyuma yo kwimenyereza umwuga. Hanyuma Wet Elephant yimukiye i Cotonou agamije gushinga amahugurwa ye. Ariko, atangira imishinga yubuhanzi muri Cotonou ubwo yahuraga na Pipi Wobaho.\nMu 1996, Wobaho ari kumwe n'incuti ye magara Simplice Behanzin uzwi ku izina rya Pipi Wobaho bashinze \"S\u00e8mako Wobaho ikinamico na sinema\" kugira ngo barusheho kunoza ireme rya sinema n'ikinamico. Ubufatanye bwabo buganisha kubikorwa byinshi byikinamico kuri B\u00e9nin. Mu mwaka wa 2010 hamwe n\u2019isosiyete S\u00e8mako Wobaho, babonye disiki ya zahabu ku nshuro ya 4 y\u2019ibirori \"Umunsi w\u2019Afurika\" babinyujije mu isosiyete yabo y\u2019imikino mu cyiciro cya firime za TV. Icyakora, baratandukanye mu 2013. Muri 2008, isosiyete yakoze firime izwi \"If it was you?\", urukurikirane ruva mubufatanye nabandi banyarwenya benshi bo muri B\u00e9nin. Muri 2012, aba S\u00e8mako Wobaho bombi bakoze film \"Capricious Apprentice\".\nWet Elephant yakoze ibitaramo birenga 500 muri B\u00e9nin. Afite umwuga yamamaye hanze kuva 1986 kugeza 2019 hamwe n'ibihembo birenga 100 ndetse no kugaragara 200 mumashusho yindirimbo zabahanzi. Yagaragaye kandi muri firime zigera kuri 41, muri zo 20 ziyobowe na we nk'umwanditsi-umuyobozi ndetse na producer.Muri 2019, yijihije imyaka 25 amaze akora umwuga w'ubuhanzi. "}
{"id": "9407", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9407", "title": "Yohann Kouam", "text": "Yohann Kouam (wavutse 1982), ni umukinnyi wa firime w\u2019Abafaransa kimwe na producer, umwanditsi wa sinema ukomoka muri Kameruni. Yakoze firime ngufi zamamaye cyane. \nUbuzima bwite.\nYohann numuyobozi wa firime y' ubufaransa. Se ni umucungamari naho nyina ni umunyamahoteri. \nUmwuga.\nYize gutunganya firime muri Institut des arts de diffusion i Buruseli, hanyuma yiga Ubuhinduzi mu Bufaransa. Nyuma yaje kuba umufasha wigisha mumashuri yisumbuye gutanga amasomo yindimi. \nMuri 2007, Kouam yakoze film ngufi \"Fragments de vie\". Yakiriwe neza, yakoze film ya kabiri ngufi ya \"Les dimanches de L\u00e9a\" mu 2010. Yaje gukora filime ngufi \"Yagarutse\" mu 2013, yamenyekanye ku rwego mpuzamahanga. Muri 2016, yakoze film \"Kuva San Francisco hamwe nUrukundo\"."}
{"id": "9408", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9408", "title": "Ariane Astrid Atodji", "text": "Ariane Astrid Atodji ;(yavutse 1980), ni Umukinnyi wa firime Kameruni ndetse akaba n'umwanditsi. Yakoze documentaire nyinshi zamamaye cyane harimo \"Koundi et le Jeudi national\" na \"La souffrance est une \u00e9cole de sagesse\". \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse mu 1980 i Nguelemendouka, muri Kameruni. Yarangije muri kaminuza ya Yaound\u00e9 hanyuma yitabira amahugurwa ya firime mu kigo cya Goethe muri Yaound\u00e9. Hanyuma yimukiye muri LN International Film School ya Yaound\u00e9 kugirango akomeze kwiga.\nUmwuga.\nMu mwaka wa 2010, yayoboye \"filime ye ya mbere ya Koundi et le Jeudi national\" yakozwe ku nkunga ya Goethe Institute. Yatsindiye igihembo cy\u2019abacamanza kidasanzwe mu iserukiramuco rya Filime rya Dubai (DIFF) kubera iyi filime. Muri 2014, yayoboye documentaire ya kabiri \"La souffrance est une \u00e9cole de sagesse\". "}
{"id": "9409", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9409", "title": "Josza Anjemb\u00e9", "text": "Josza Anjemb\u00e9 (wavutse 1982), ni umukinnyi w\u2019amafirime w\u2019umufaransa kimwe n\u2019umwanditsi akaba n\u2019umunyamakuru ukomoka muri Kameruni. Yakoze firime nyinshi zamamaye cyane zirimo \"Le bleu blanc rouge de mes\" \"cheveux\" na Baltringue. \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse mu 1982 i Paris mu Bufaransa na se wa Kameruni,; n'umubyeyi w'umufaransa akaba umuforomo. Josza afite musaza we w'impanga. Yakuriye i Bondy kugeza afite imyaka 7 hanyuma yimukira muri Les Lilas, Seine-Saint-Denis mu mijyi ya Pantin na Pr\u00e9-Saint-Gervais. \nUmwuga.\nNyuma ya baccalaur\u00e9at (igice cya ES), Josza yabonye impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu 2004 mu itumanaho muri kaminuza ya Paris 8 Vincennes-Saint-Denis. Kuva 2004, Josza yakoraga nkumunyamakuru wa TF1 hanyuma akorera Fance 5 na France 2. Hagati ya 2009 na 2011, yari umunyamakuru w'amashusho kuri televiziyo ya Afrika 24. Muri 2011, Josza yakoze documentaire, \"Massage \u00e0 la camerounaise\". Filime yatoranijwe na Festival International de Programs Audiovisuels (umunsi mukuru wa FIPA wa Biarritz), ndetse n'iya Montreal na Cr\u00e9teil. \nMuri 2012, yahawe inkunga ya Fondation Bleustein-Blanchet. Muri 2014, yitabiriye \"Talents en court\" ya Jamel Comedy Club, kikaba ari igikoresho yizeye ko azakora film ye ya mbere ngufi. Hagati ya 2013 na 2016, yakoze nk'umunyamuryango w'ibirori \"Buzzons kurwanya igitsina\". Muri 2014, yakurikiranye amahugurwa yungirije umusaruro mu kigo gishinzwe politiki mpuzamahanga y\u2019ibiribwa n\u2019ubuhinzi (CIFAP). Hanyuma yakurikiranye amasomo yo gusesengura amashusho muri Institut national de l'audiovisuel (INA). Muri Werurwe 2014, documentaire ikwirakwizwa no ku nteko ishinga amategeko. Muri 2012, yayoboye documentaire ya kabiri, \"KRUMP: amateka ya Krump mu Bufaransa\". Kuri firime, yakurikiranye itsinda ryababyinnyi imyaka ine. Filime yatoranijwe mu iserukiramuco ryimico yo mumijyi i Paris. Filime ishingiye kuri KRUMP (kuri \"Powerful praise of a radically elevated kingdom\", cyangwa \"IKingdom Radically Uplifted Mighty Praise\"), ni imbyino ihumekwa n \"imbyino ya clown\", yahimbwe mu 1992 na Thomas Johnson. "}
{"id": "9410", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9410", "title": "Charles Mensah", "text": "Charles Mensah yari umukinnyi wa firime wa Gabon, umwanditsi wa sinema akaba n'umuyobozi ushinzwe umusaruro. Azwi cyane ku izina rya \"The Gentleman of African Cinemas\", Mensah yagize uruhare muri documentaire nyinshi zamamaye cyane nka \"\u00c9quateur\", \"Les Couilles de l'\u00e9l\u00e9phant\" na \"Lybek, ipfunwe ry'abazima\". Yakoze nk'umuntu uharanira iterambere rya sinema yigenga yo mu majyepfo mu mwuga umaze imyaka irenga mirongo itatu. \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse mu 1948 i Ombou\u00e9, muri Gabon. Yapfuye ku ya 3 Kamena 2011, afite imyaka 63. \nUmwuga.\nMu 1976, yakoze ibihimbano bye bya mbere, \"Obali\" afatanya na Pierre-Marie Ndong. Hanyuma mu 1977 yakoze umushinga wa kabiri \"Ayouma\" afatanya na Ndong na Patience Dabany. Intsinzi yo gukora amafilime, Mensah yagize uruhare mu gutunganya, kuri iyi nshuro hamwe na filime \"\u00c9quateur\", yasinyiye Serge Gainsbourg. Hamwe n\u2019umukinnyi wa filime uzwi cyane Henri-Joseph Koumba Bididi mu 1995, Mensah yagize uruhare muri televiziyo \"L'Auberge du Salut\", filime yuzuye ya Gabon. \nNkumuproducer, Mensah yitabiriye ibikorwa byinshi birimo: \"Le Damier de Balufu Bakupu Kanyinda\" mu 1996, \"D\u00f4l\u00e8 (l'Argent)\" na Imunga Iwanga mu 2000, \"Les Couilles de l'\u00e9l\u00e9phant\" mu 2001 na \"N'Djamena City\" iyobowe na Issa Serge Coelo mu 2006. Yagize kandi uruhare muri documentaire ngufi kuri \"Lybek, le crunch du vivant\". Kugeza mu 2009, yari afite umwanya wo kuba Umuyobozi mukuru w'ikigo cy'igihugu cya Sinema ya Gabon (CENACI), ubu kikaba kizwi ku izina rya Gabonese Institute of Image and Sound (IGIS). Muri uwo mwaka, yabaye perezida w\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019abakora amafilime muri Pan-Afurika (FEPACI) ndetse no muri komisiyo ishinzwe ikigega cyo gufasha amafilime y\u2019umuryango mpuzamahanga w\u2019igifaransa. Muri 2011, yakoraga muri Bididi's \"Le collier du Makoko\" yamenyekanye ku rwego mpuzamahanga harimo na Cannes. "}
{"id": "9411", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9411", "title": "Henri-Joseph Koumba Bididi", "text": "Henri-Yozefu Koumba Bididi yavutse 15 Nyakanga 1957), ni umunya Gabo ukora filimi, akandika filimi ndetse anakora kuri Tv nka televiziyo manager umusaruro ahanini utaziguye muma documentary films. Yakoze documentaire nyinshi zamamaye cyane harimo \"na Necklace ya King\" na \"Le Singe Fou\". Usibye icyerekezo, yanakoze, yandika cyangwa ayobora inyandiko nyinshi kuri tereviziyo. \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse ku ya 15 Nyakanga 1957 i Ombou\u00e9, muri Gabon. Yarangije amashuri ya firime muri \u00c9cole sup\u00e9rieure d'\u00e9tudes cin\u00e9matographiques (ESEC) mu Bufaransa.\nUmwuga.\nMu 1983, Bididi yakoraga nk'umuyobozi ushinzwe gukina filime \"\u00c9quatur\" iyobowe na Serge Gainsbourg. Hanyuma mu 1986, yasinyiye muri firime ngufi \"Le singe fou\". Yahawe igihembo kubera kunenga abanyamakuru b'Abarabu mu iserukiramuco rya Filime rya Carthage ndetse anahabwa igihembo gikomeye cya Filime ngufi mu iserukiramuco rya Filime na Televiziyo rya 10 rya Panafrican rya Ouagadougou (FESPACO) mu 1987. \nKuva mu 1988 kugeza 1991, Bididi yari umuyobozi w'ishami rya radiyo na televiziyo byo mu karere ka ' Haut-Ogou\u00e9 '. Kuva mu 1991 kugeza 1994, Bididi yazamuwe kuba umuyobozi wungirije mushya wa Radio T\u00e9l\u00e9vision Gabonaise (RTG). Mu 2000, yakomeje gukora nk'umuyobozi wa tereviziyo akaba na producer wa filime ye ya mbere yakinnye, \"Les Couilles de l'\u00e9l\u00e9phant\". Iyi filime yerekanwe mu iserukiramuco rya Filime rya 17 rya Afurika ryabereye i Ouagadougou, Burkina Faso. Mu 1994, Bididi yayoboye ibice bibiri bya serivise ya \"L'auberge du Salut\". \nMuri uwo mwaka, yayoboye filime yerekana \"Le collier du Makoko\", iyi ikaba ari filime ihenze cyane muri Afurika yo munsi y\u2019ubutayu bwa Sahara yarashwe hamwe na miliyoni 4 z'amayero. Filime yateguwe mu myaka 4, aho gufata amashusho byatwaye amezi atatu. Iyi filime yakiriwe neza mu maserukiramuco mpuzamahanga ya filime kandi yegukana igihembo cy\u2019abacamanza kidasanzwe ndetse n\u2019igihembo cyo gusobanura abagabo mu iserukiramuco rya Khouribga 2012 ryabereye muri Maroc. Yatsindiye kandi igihembo cyo Gusobanura mu iserukiramuco rya Ecrans Noirs 2012 ryabereye muri Kameruni nk'icyo gihembo cy\u2019amajwi meza na posita nziza muri FESPACO 2013. Muri 2013, iyi filime yatsindiye igihembo cy'abari bitabiriye iserukiramuco rya Filime rya Masuku 2013 ryabereye i Gabon. "}
{"id": "9412", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9412", "title": "Manouchka Kelly Labouba", "text": "Manouchka Kelly Labouba, ni umukinnyi wa firime wo muri Gabon akaba n'umwanditsi wa sinema cyane cyane ayobora firime ngufi. Yakoze firime nyinshi zamamaye cyane zirimo \"Marty et la tendre dame\", \"Le guichet automatique\" na \"Le ubutane\". Usibye icyerekezo, ni n'umunyeshuri, umukinnyi wa sinema, umwanditsi akaba n'umukoresha wa kamera. \nUmwuga w'amasomo.\nMu 2005, yize Filime &amp; Media Studies muri kaminuza ya California, Santa Barbara. Hanyuma, mu 2007, yabonye Master de Recherche, Ubuhanzi muri kaminuza ya Bordeaux Montaigne. Nyuma yaje kurangiza impamyabumenyi ya MA Critical Studies hanyuma Ph.D. Kwiga Sinema n'Itangazamakuru muri kaminuza y\u2019amajyepfo ya Californiya kugirango abone kandi yarangije afite Impamyabumenyi mu bucuruzi bwimyidagaduro. \nUmwuga wa sinema.\nMu 2004, yakoze \"Bouch\u00e9es d'Amours\" ngufi. Yatoranijwe kumugaragaro mu iserukiramuco rya sinema ryabanyeshuri rya 2004 Chartres. Mu mwaka wa 2008, yatangiye gukina sinema ya mbere \"Le ubutane\", yamamaye cyane mu birori mpuzamahanga bya firime.yi minota 40 ngufi yashyizwe mu gutoranya ku mugaragaro mu iserukiramuco rya Filime rya Carthage mu 2008, gutoranya ku mugaragaro mu iserukiramuco rya Filimi na Televiziyo bya Panafrican 2009 rya Ouagadougou (FESPACO), guhitamo ku mugaragaro mu iserukiramuco rya Ecrans Noirs ryo mu 2009, guhitamo ku mugaragaro muri Filime Nyafurika y'Abagore ya Ouagadougou 2010 Umunsi mukuru. Yatoranijwe kandi mu marushanwa mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya Filime ngufi rya Abidjan 2010 (FFAA) na Iserukiramuco rya Filime ryigenga rya 2012. Yatsindiye kandi igihembo cyumuyobozi wambere witwaye neza muri 2009 Eacrans Noirs Festival. \nMuri 2010, yayoboye firime enye: \"B\u00e9b\u00e9 Portable\", \"Combien Ca Coute?\", \"Enfant De Ta M\u00e9re\", na \"Le Menteur &amp; Le Voleur\" aho nyuma yaje gushyirwa mu majwi mu iserukiramuco rya Ecrans Noirs 2010. Yakoze kandi nk'umuyobozi wungirije wa mbere muri filimi ngufi 3: \"La Particuli\u00e9re\", \"Les Bonnes Mani\u00e9res\", na \"La Guerre des Ordures\". Muri 2011 yayoboye \"Le guichet automatique\" yashyizwe mu guhitamo kumugaragaro mu iserukiramuco rya Ecrans Noirs 2011. \nUsibye gutanga icyerekezo, yakoze nk'umwanditsi wa firime nyinshi ngufi zirimo: \"Kuva DWG kugeza DWJr: The Black Man\u00d5s Burden\" (2006) na \"Michel Ndaot: Entre Ombres et Lumi\u00e9res\" (2008). "}
{"id": "9413", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9413", "title": "Waithira", "text": "Waithira, ni filime yo muri 2017 yo muri Kenya- Amajyepfo y\u2019Africa yerekana ubuzima bwa film yerekanwe na Eva Njoki Munyiri kandi yafatanije n\u2019umuyobozi ubwe hamwe na Stefan Gieren na Jean Meeran muri Team Tarbaby. Iyi filime ivuga ku mateka y\u2019umuyobozi Eva Njoki Munyiri n\u2019amasangano yayo n'amateka yibagiwe ya Kenya, umuco wa pop na diaspora. \nWaithira yakiriwe neza kandi yatsindiye ibihembo byinshi mu birori mpuzamahanga bya firime. Hari screened mikuru nka DIFF y'Epfo &amp; guhura, Iserukiramuco rya Filime Nyafurika, Iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime rya Cr\u00e9teil, n'ibindi Muri 2018, iyi filime yari ihagarariwe mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga ry'inyandiko rya Munich. "}
{"id": "9414", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9414", "title": "Marie-Cl\u00e9mence Paes", "text": "Marie-Cl\u00e9mence Andriamonta Paes (wavutse 1959), ni umukinnyi wa firime w\u2019Abafaransa wo muri Malagasi. Yakoze inyandiko nyinshi zamamaye cyane zirimo: \"Angano.\" \".\" \".\" \"Angano.\" \".\" \".\", \"Mahaleo\" na \"L'op\u00e9ra du bout du monde\". Usibye gutanga icyerekezo, ni producer numwanditsi. \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse mu 1959 kuri se w\u2019umufaransa na nyina wa Malagasy. Yarangije impamyabumenyi ihanitse muri Sociology na Marketing CELSA-Sorbonne Diploma.Yashakanye na C\u00e9sar Paes, akaba n'umuyobozi wa filimi uvuka muri Franco-Berezile. \nUmwuga.\nMu 1988, yatangije uruganda rwigenga rukorera i Paris rwitwa 'Laterit Productions' hamwe n'umugabo we C\u00e9sar. Isosiyete ikora ibicuruzwa yiyemeje gukwirakwiza no gutangaza. Hamwe numugabo we C\u00e9sar Paes, yanditse kandi akora documentaire nka \"Angano.\" \".\" \".\" \"Angano.\" \".\" \".\" \"Umugani wo muri Madagasikari\", \"Indirimbo n'amarira ya Kamere\", na \"Soup ya Awara\". \"Awara Soup\" yatsindiye ibihembo byinshi muri Cin\u00e9ma du R\u00e9el, Festival dei Popoli na Dok Leipzig. Filime ze nka \"Saudade do Futuro\", \"Mahaleo\", \"Opera yo mu nyanja y'Ubuhinde\" \"n'indirimbo za Madagasikari\" zasohotse mu ikinamico mu Bufaransa no muri Amerika. Muri documentaire ye, umuziki ni ikintu cyingenzi kandi umuziki ukoreshwa nkibintu byerekana inkuru. Amenshi muri firime ayobowe na Cl\u00e9mence yatsindiye ibihembo byinshi mu iserukiramuco rya Cin\u00e9ma du R\u00e9el. "}
{"id": "9415", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9415", "title": "Siatta Scott Johnson", "text": "Siatta Scott Johnson (yavutse 1974), ni umukinnyi wa firime wo muri Liberiya akaba n'umunyamakuru utangaza amakuru. Azwi cyane nk'umuyobozi wa documentaire izwi cyane \"Iron Ladies of Liberia\". Usibye gutanga icyerekezo, ni umunyamakuru ndetse na producer. Ni n'umunyamuryango washinze itangazamakuru rya Omuahtee Africa. \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse mu 1974 i Buchanan, muri Liberiya. Nyuma yakuriye mu cyaro cya Grand Bassa. Mu ntangiriro ya za 90, Johnson yahunze avuye muri Grand Bassa intambara itangira. Nyuma yaje gutura muri Monrovia mu gihe intambara yarangiraga mu 2003. \nAmashuri amaze gufungura nyuma y'intambara, Johnson yarangije icyiciro cya kabiri cya Bachelor of Arts mu itumanaho rusange yakuye muri kaminuza ya Liberiya. Hanyuma, yafashe impamyabumenyi muri raporo za politiki yakuye muri kaminuza ya Liberiya, nyuma mu bitangazamakuru avuye mu ihuriro ry\u2019abanyamakuru bo muri Liberiya ndetse n\u2019ubutumwa bw\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye muri Liberiya (UNMIL). Afite kandi impamyabumenyi mu itangazamakuru yakuye muri Liberia Institute of Journalism. Yakoze kandi nk'umunyamakuru akaba na producer muri Downtown Community Televiziyo Centre (DCTV). \nUmwuga.\nMu 2007, yakoze documentaire yamamaye cyane \"Iron Ladies yo muri Liberiya\" afatanije na Daniel Junge. Iyi documentaire yahawe icyubahiro mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime rya Dallas, Target Ten Filmmaker nka Documentaire nziza yuwo mwaka kandi ibaye Filime Nziza Yaturutse Isi Y\u2019Amashuri mu Iserukiramuco rya Filime Isi ryabereye i Prague. Usibye ibyo, film yanagaragaye mu birori mpuzamahanga bya firime. \nUsibye sinema, ni umunyamakuru uzwi cyane muri Liberiya aho yakoranye n'ishyirahamwe ry'abanyamakuru b'abagore bo muri Liberiya (FeJAL). Yakoze kandi muri Beyondmedia Education i Chicago, muri Amerika. Johnson amaze gusubira muri Liberiya, yakoze mu kubaka itangazamakuru ry\u2019urubyiruko rwo muri Liberiya. Nyuma yaje gukora ubuvugizi bw'itangazamakuru mu nama ishinzwe impunzi muri Noruveje (NRC) aho yateguye ibiganiro bya radiyo ku bagore bo mu cyaro mu mushinga witwa \u201cABAGORE B'UBWENGE\u201d. Yakoranye kandi na Medica Mondiale Liberia nk'ushinzwe itumanaho aho yorohereza impinduka mu myitwarire mu bagore bo mu cyaro batuye mu majyepfo y'uburasirazuba bwa Liberiya. Johnson yabaye producer wa gahunda ya tereviziyo yitwa 'Amajwi Yingenzi' yari gahunda kubakobwa b'ingimbi n'abangavu. Muri 2012, yabaye umuyobozi mukuru n\u2019umuyobozi uhanga muri Smart Media Liberia. Muri 2019, yongeye gutorerwa kuba perezida w'ishyirahamwe ry'abanyamakuru b'abagore bo muri Liberiya. "}
{"id": "9416", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9416", "title": "Kalifa Dienta", "text": "Kalifa Dienta (yavutse 1 Mutarama 1940), yari umukinnyi wa firime wo muri Mali. Yari azwi cyane nk'umuyobozi wa filime yakunzwe cyane \"A Banna\". Usibye gutanga icyerekezo, yari n'umwanditsi akaba n'umukinnyi wa sinema.\nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse ku ya 1 Mutarama 1940 i Macina, muri Mali, yitaba Imana ku ya 2021 i Bamako, muri Mali. Yize sinema i Moscou. \nUmwuga.\nMu 1980, yayoboye filime \"A Banna\" yakiriwe neza cyane n'abayireba kandi atoranywa mu minsi mikuru mpuzamahanga ya firime."}
{"id": "9417", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9417", "title": "Djibril Kouyat\u00e9", "text": "Djibril Kouyate (yavutse 1942), ni umukinnyi wa filimi ukomoka muri Mali. Azwi cyane nk'umuyobozi wa firime zamamaye cyane nka \"The Tieman\", \"Tiefing\" na \"Walaha\". \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse mu 1942 i Bamako, muri Mali.\nUmwuga.\nMuri 1969, yakinnye bwa mbere mubuyobozi bwa mbere na \"l'artisanat\". Hanyuma yakoze film \"Le retour de Tieman\" (1970), \"Le drapeau noir au sud du berceau\" (1976) na \"Le Mali aujourd'hui\" (1978). Nkumukinnyi, yakinnye muri firime: \"Verloren Maandag\" (1974), \"Ta Dona\" (1991), na \"Macadam tribu\" (1999). Mu 2000, yakinnye muri firime yitwa \"Code inconnu\" yamenyekanye cyane aho imico ye nka 'Youssouf' yashimiwe cyane."}
{"id": "9418", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9418", "title": "Awa Traor\u00e9", "text": "Awa Traor\u00e9, ni umukinnyi wa firime wo muri Mali. Usibye gutanga icyerekezo, Traor\u00e9 ni umuyobozi wungirije, uwahimba ndetse n'umwanditsiwa filimi.\nUmwuga.\nTraor\u00e9 yatangiye umwuga we muri film ya \"L'enfant noir\" 1995. Nyuma yaje kuba 'umuhigi' muri filime ngufi ya \"Denko yo\" mu 1993 iyobowe na Mohamed Camara. Iyi filime yakiriwe neza kandi yegukana Grand Prix mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya sinema mpuzamahanga rya Clermont-Ferrand, igihembo cya filime ngufi nziza mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya Friborg ndetse n\u2019igihembo cya Golden Danzante mu iserukiramuco rya Filime rya Huesca. "}
{"id": "9419", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9419", "title": "Ladji Diakit\u00e9", "text": "Ladji Diakit\u00e9, ni umukinnyi wa firime wo muri Mali. Azwi cyane nk'umuyobozi wa firime zamamaye cyane nka \"Duel \u00e0 Dafa\" na \"Fantan Fanga\". Usibye gutanga icyerekezo, Diakit\u00e9 ni umuyobozi wungirije hamwe nuwashushanyaga imyambarire. \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavukiye i Bamako, muri Mali. Diakit\u00e9 yabonye impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu buvanganzo yakuye muri Ecole Normale Sup\u00e9rieure. Yize kandi muri Centre national du cin\u00e9ma et de l'image anim\u00e9e (Ikigo cyigihugu gishinzwe gutunganya film). \nUmwuga.\nMu 1991, yinjiye muri filime \"Ta Dona nk'ushushanya\" imyambarire. Hanyuma mu 1997, yakoze muri film \"Taaf\u00e9 Fanga\" nk'umuyobozi wungirije.\nMu 2001, yayoboye filime \"yumukobwa La Rencontre des chasseurs\". Mu 2006, yagiye muri firime ya tele \"Duel a Dafa\". Hanyuma mu 2007, yayoboye \"Duel \u00e0 Dafa\" hanyuma \"Fantan Fanga\" afatanya na Adama Drabo mu 2009. Iyi filime yakiriwe ku mugaragaro iserukiramuco rya Filime na Televiziyo bya Panafrican rya Ouagadougou (FESPACO) 2009. Hagati aho, yabaye umuyobozi w\u2019ishami rishinzwe umusaruro w\u2019ikigo Centre de la cin\u00e9matographie du Mali (Ikigo cy\u2019igihugu cya Cinematografi ya Mali: CNCM). "}
{"id": "9420", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9420", "title": "C\u00e9sar Paes", "text": "C\u00e9sar Paes (yavutse 1959), ni umukinnyi wa filimi ukomoka muri Burezire ariko utuye mubufaransa. Yayoboye inyandiko nyinshi zamamaye cyane zirimo: \"Angano.\" \".\" \".\" \"Angano.\" \".\" \".\", \"Mahaleo\" na \"L'op\u00e9ra du bout du monde\". Usibye gutanga icyerekezo, ni numuproducer, umwanditsi akaba na cinematografi. \nUbuzima bwite.\nC\u00e9sar Paes yavutse mu 1955 i Campos, Rio de Janeiro, Burezili. Yashakanye na Marie-Cl\u00e9mence Andriamonta, akaba n'umuyobozi wa Franco-Malagasy. \nUmwuga.\nMu 1988, yatangije isosiyete yigenga itanga umusaruro ikorera i Paris yitwa Laterit Productions hamwe n'umugore we Marie. Isosiyete ikora ibicuruzwa yiyemeje gukwirakwiza no gutangaza. Hamwe numugore we Marie, yayoboye documentaire nka \"Angano.\" \".\" \".\" \"Angano.\" \".\" \".\" \"Umugani wo muri Madagasikari\", \"Ku barwanyi bacecetse\", \"Saudade do Futuro\" \"n'indirimbo za Madagasikari\" batsindiye ibihembo byinshi muri Cin\u00e9ma du R\u00e9el, Festival dei Popoli na Dok Leipzig.\nMu mwaka wa 2012, yafatanije kuyobora documentaire \"L'Op\u00e9ra du bout du monde\" ikaba ari inkuru yo gushiraho opera yo muri iki gihe kuva ku kirwa cya Reunion ivuga ko abapolisi ba Louis XIV bageze mu birwa byo mu nyanja y'Abahinde. "}
{"id": "9421", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9421", "title": "Kamal Hachkar", "text": "Kamal Hachkar (yavutse ku ya 25 Gashyantare 1977), ni umukinnyi wa firime ukomoka muri Maroke n'ubufaransa, akaba n'umuhanga. Kamal azwi cyane nk'umuyobozi wa filime \"yamamaye cyane Tinghir-Yeruzalemu: The Echoes of mellah\". \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse ku ya 25 Gashyantare 1977 i Tinghir, muri Maroc mu muryango wa Berber. Afite amezi atandatu gusa, yavuye muri Maroc ari kumwe na nyina yerekeza mu Bufaransa, aho se yakoraga nk'umukozi kuva mu 1968. Icyakora, yagiye asura Tinghir buri gihe mu biruhuko. Kamal yabonye impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu mateka yo hagati y\u2019isi y\u2019abayisilamu muri kaminuza ya Sorbonne. Mu 2005, yabaye umwarimu nyuma yo gutanga icyemezo cy'ubuhanga bwo kwigisha amashuri yisumbuye. \nUmwuga.\nMuri 2013, Kamal yakoze umushinga wa documentaire yambere, \"Tinghir-Yerusalemu: Les \u00c9chos du mellah\". Iyi filime yashyizweho mu gihe cyo kurinda Abafaransa muri Maroc ivuga ku buzima n\u2019imibereho y\u2019imiryango y\u2019abayisilamu ya Berber n\u2019abayahudi i Tinghir mu bihe bikomeye. Nubwo, byari ingingo itavugwaho rumwe muri Maroc, yanenzwe n\u2019abayisilamu. Nyuma, Ishyaka ry'Ubutabera n'Iterambere naryo ryinjiye mu kunegura bavuga ko ari ubutumire bwo guhuza umubano hagati ya Isiraheli. Icyakora, iyi filime yakiriwe neza ndetse n'ibihembo byinshi mu iserukiramuco rya sinema ry\u2019igihugu cya Maroc. "}
{"id": "9422", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9422", "title": "Hamid B\u00e9nani", "text": "Hamid B\u00e9nani (yavutse ku ya 5 Ugushyingo 1940), ni umuyobozi wa firime muri Maroc, umwanditsi wa sinema akaba n'umukinnyi wa sinema. Umwe mu bahanzi bubahwa cyane muri Maroc, B\u00e9nani yakoze filime nyinshi zamamaye cyane nka \"Wechma\", \"La pri\u00e8re des absents\" na \"L'enfant Che\u00efkh\". Ni n'umuproducer, umwanditsi n'umwanditsi.\nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse ku ya 5 Ugushyingo 1940 iMeknes, muri Maroc. Yize idini mu ishuri rya Koran. Nyuma, yarangije amashuri yisumbuye muri Poeymirau na Moulay Isma\u00efl yisumbuye. \nUmwuga.\nMu 1958, B\u00e9nani yakiriye imyitozo mu ikinamico n'amahugurwa yo guhanga no kwandika yateguwe na Minisiteri y'Urubyiruko na Siporo. Hanyuma mu 1964, yagiye mu ishami ry\u2019amabaruwa ya Rabat kugira ngo abone uruhushya muri filozofiya. Mu 1965, yatangiye kwiga amafilime muri Institut des hautes \u00e9tudes cin\u00e9matographiques (IDHEC) aho yahawe mu 1967 mu gice cyitwa \"Direction, production and management\". Hagati aho, yitabiriye amahugurwa y\u2019ikinamico yabereye i Sorbonne no muri EPHE2 yakozwe nabafilozofe Jacques Derrida,Roland Barthes na Paul Ric\u0153ur\nMu 1968, B\u00e9nani yinjiye kuri Televiziyo ya Maroc. Nyuma yaje kuba umuyobozi w'ishami rishinzwe ububanyi n'amahanga. Mu 1969, yeguye kuri Soci\u00e9t\u00e9 Nationale de Radiodiffusion et de T\u00e9l\u00e9vision (RTM). Mu 1970, yashinze isosiyete ikora ibicuruzwa yitwa \"Sigma 3\" ku bufatanye na Ahmed Bouanani,Mohamed Abderrahman Tazi na Mohamed Sekkat. Muri uwo mwaka, isosiyete ikora ibicuruzwa yakoze firime yambere ya \"Wechma\". Iyi filime yerekanwe muri federasiyo y\u2019amahuriro y\u2019amafirime ya Maroc (FMCC) kandi yegukana ibihembo byinshi ndetse n\u2019ishimwe mu minsi mikuru ya firime, aho iyi filime ifatwa nk\u2019amafilime yashinze ya sinema ya Maroc. \nNubwo iyi filime yakunzwe cyane mu banegura, B\u00e9nani yagombaga gutegereza imyaka igera kuri makumyabiri kugira ngo ayobore filime ye ya kabiri yakinnye, \"La pri\u00e8re des absents (Isengesho\" ry'Abadahari), ku ikubitiro yiswe 'Amabanga y'inzira y'amata'. Iyi filime yakuwe mu gitabo kizwi cyane cyanditswe n'umwanditsi Tahar Ben Jelloun. Mu 2011, yayoboye filime \"L'enfant Che\u00efkh\". Iyi filime yerekanwe bwa mbere mu iserukiramuco rya Tangier kandi ryakiriwe neza n\u2019abari bitabiriye ibirori. Kandi film yatsindiye igihembo kumashusho meza. \nUsibye icyerekezo, yasohoye igitabo yise \"Le dernier chant des insoumises\" (Indirimbo ya nyuma y'inyeshyamba) munsi y'ibendera rya Editions du Sirocco. Igitabo cyatsindiye igihembo cya Grand Atlas muri 2019. "}
{"id": "9423", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9423", "title": "We Could Be Heroes", "text": "We Could Be Heroes ni film ya siporo ya documentaire yo muri Maroc yo muri 2018 iyobowe na Hind Bensari kandi yakozwe na Habib Attia na Vibeke Vogel kuri Bullitt Films. Iyi filime yibanze ku buzima bwa Azeddine Nouiri, wabaye nyampinga w\u2019imikino Paralympique, watsinze imbogamizi z\u2019umubiri zatoranijwe mu mikino Paralympike ya Rio 2016 hamwe n\u2019inshuti ye Youssef akiri umwana. \nFilime yerekanwe bwa mbere ku ya 2 Gicurasi 2018 muri Theatre ya Scotiabank. Filime yakiriwe neza kandi yegukana ibihembo byinshi mubirori mpuzamahanga bya firime. Filime yatsindiye igihembo cya Jury mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya Documentaire Hot Docs. Iyi filime kandi yatsindiye \"Igihembo cyiza cya International Documentary Award\" mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime rya Toronto. Filime yatsindiye Grand Prix mu iserukiramuco rya Filime rya Tangier. "}
{"id": "9424", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9424", "title": "475: Break the Silence", "text": "475: Break the Silence, (Umutwe wumwimerere: \"475: Trenquem el Silenci\") ni Sinema yo muri maroke yo muri 2013 yerekana filime ngufi iyobowe na Hind Bensari. Iyi filime yibanze ku buzima bwa Amina Fillali, umukobwa w\u2019imyaka 16 ukomoka mu mujyi muto muri Maroc. Yiyahuye akoresheje umuti wicimbeba amaze gushyingiranwa n'umugabo wa musambanyije. Yerekanwe bwa mbere mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya filime ryita ku burenganzira bwa muntu mu 2014. \nFilime yakiriwe neza kandi yegukana ibihembo byinshi mu birori mpuzamahanga bya firime. iyi filimi Yagize uruhare mu myigaragambyo muri Maroke mu gushyiraho itegeko rishya ryemerera abagabo baregwa gufata ku ngufu gushyingiranwa n\u2019abo bahohotewe. Iyi filime yamamaye cyane mu kinyamakuru New York Times no mu muyoboro wa ARD wo mu Budage ndetse no kuri interineti. yashimishije abayireba kuri TV 2M muri Maroke kandi ikwirakwira mu bihugu birimo Danemark, Porutugali, Kanada igurishwa ku miyoboro irenga 20 ku isi."}
{"id": "9425", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9425", "title": "Hind Bensari", "text": "Hind Bensari (yavutse 1987), ni umukinnyi wa firime wa Maroc. Azwi cyane nk'umuyobozi wakoze firime ya documentaire yamamaye cyane: \"475: Break the Silence\" na \"We Could Be Heroes\". \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse mu 1987 i Casablanca, muri Maroc. Icyakora akiri muto cyane, yimukiye i Londres. Bensari yahawe impamyabumenyi mu by'ubukungu no mu burasirazuba bwo hagati yakuye muri kaminuza ya Edinburgh. Afite kandi impamyabumenyi mu bukungu mpuzamahanga bwa politiki yakuye mu ishuri ry\u2019ubukungu n\u2019ubumenyi bwa politiki i Londres. Yashakanye n'umucuruzi wo muri Danimarike, ubu akaba atuye muri Danimarike. \nUmwuga.\nMuri 2014, yagarutse muri Maroc kugirango akore filime ngufi ya documentaire ya mbere yari \"475: Break the Silence\". Yagize uruhare mu myigaragambyo muri Maroc kugira ngo ishobore gukuraho itegeko rishya ryemerera abagabo baregwa gufata ku ngufu gushyingiranwa n\u2019abo bahohotewe. Iyi filime yamamaye cyane mu kinyamakuru New York Times no mu muyoboro wa ARD wo mu Budage ndetse no kuri interineti. yemejeje kandi abayireba kuri TV 2M muri Maroc kandi isakaza mu bindi bihugu birimo Danemark, Porutugali, Kanada kandi igurishwa ku miyoboro irenga 20 ku isi. Ni n'umuvugizi wa TEDx. \nKu ya 2 Gicurasi 2018, yasohoye filime \"We Could Be Heroes\" yerekanwe bwa mbere muri 2018 Hot Docs yo muri Kanada Iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya Filime. Iyi filime ishingiye ku nkuru y\u2019inshuti ebyiri zamugaye, Azzedine na Youssef, barota kuva muri gereza bakazitabira imikino Paralympique ya Rio. Filime yatsindiye igihembo cya Jury mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya Documentaire Hot Docs. Iyi filime kandi yatsindiye igihembo cyitwa \"Best International Documentary Award\" mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya sinema rya Toronto, ibaye umukinnyi wa mbere wa Afurika wakiriye igihembo. Hanyuma film yatsindiye Grand Prix mu iserukiramuco rya Filime rya Tangier. "}
{"id": "9426", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9426", "title": "Sam Uche Anyamele", "text": "Sam Uche Anyamele, ni umukinnyi wa sinema yo muri Nigeriya. \nUbuzima bwite.\nAnyamele yavukiye Isolo, muri Lagos nk'imfura mu muryango hamwe na barumuna batandatu: abahungu batatu n'abakobwa batatu. Yarangije amashuri abanza mu ishuri ribanza rya Faronbi Isolo (1988 kugeza 1993) no mu gace ka Ukwa k'ubutegetsi bw'ibanze muri Leta ya Abia nyuma aza kwiga mu ishuri ry'ikibonezamvugo rya Isolo (1993 kugeza 1999). Yarangije icyiciro cya mbere mu burezi bw\u2019ubucuruzi mu 2007 n\u2019iyamamaza n\u2019icyiciro cya kabiri cya kaminuza mu kuzamura imiyoborere muri 2009 muri kaminuza ya Lagos. Yashakanye n'umukunzi umaze igihe, Osarhieme Edokpolor, aho ubukwe bwizihije ahitwa Off Ugbor Village Road muri GRA. \nUmwuga.\nYakundaga gucuranga ibikoresho bya muzika mu Itorero ry'Inteko y'Imana. Mu 2004, yagaragaye kuri tereviziyo ya mbere hamwe ninkuru ya Wale Adenuga \", No pain No Gain\"\".\". Mu mwaka wa 2006, yatsindiye igihembo cya Afurika Movie Academy Academy (AMAA) ku bakinnyi bafite ibyiringiro byinshi kubera uruhare mu \"munsi w\u2019impongano\". Yakoze kandi nk'umunyamabanga mukuru w'ishyirahamwe ry'igihugu ry'abakora umwuga wo gukina ibihangano bya Nigeriya. \nMuri 2019, Anyamele yagizwe ambasaderi w\u2019ikirango cya Max Garden Estate. Nyuma muri uwo mwaka, yatangajwe ko yakiriye Mykmary Fashion Show yabaye ku ya 31 Kanama 2019. "}
{"id": "9427", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9427", "title": "Ifeanyi Onyeabor", "text": "Ifeanyi OnyeaboIfeanyi Onyeabo (1971\u20132019), yari umukinnyi wa firime wo muri Nigeriya. Azwi cyane muri firime\"My Mother\u2019s Heart,5 Apostles\", \"Darkest Knight\" and \"One Good Turn\". \nAfatanije na mugenzi we Steve James, yashinze isosiyete ikora ibicuruzwa, SIC Entertainment Production Nigeria Limited. Yahawe igihembo muri African Film Academy Award (AMAA) kubera filime ye \"New Jerusalem\". \nMuri Nyakanga 2014, Onyeabor yongeye gufungirwa muri Kirikiri Maximum Prisons n'Urukiko Rwisumbuye rwa Lagos rwicaye i Ikeja kubera uburiganya bivugwa ko miliyoni 8.8. Nk\u2019uko amakuru abitangaza, yakusanyije miliyoni 88.8 zose hamwe na Steve-James mu Kuboza 2008, agamije gukora firime ebyiri; \"Young Amazone\" and \"Tribes\"\".\" "}
{"id": "9428", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9428", "title": "A\u00efcha Macky", "text": "A\u00efcha Macky (8 Mutarama 1982), ni umukinnyi wa firime wo muri Nigeriya ndetse na sociologue. Azwi cyane nkumuyobozi wa documentaire\"\".\nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse ku ya 8 Mutarama 1982. Igihe yari afite imyaka itanu, nyina yapfuye amaze kubyara. Yabonye impamyabumenyi ya Master I muri Audiovisual and Creative Documentary muri Institut de Formation aux Techniques de l'Information et de la Communication (Training Institute for Information and Communication Technologies: IFTIC) muri Nigeriya nyuma arangiza icyiciro cya kabiri cya Master II muri Sociology no muri Gukora Film documentaire muri Kaminuza ya Gaston Berger muri S\u00e9n\u00e9gal muri 2013. \nUmwuga.\nMu mwaka wa 2011, Macky yerekanye bwa mbere bugufi \"Moi et ma maigreur\" yari yerekeranye n'imyumvire yoroheje y'abatuye Nigeriya. Amaze gutsinda bwa mbere, yakoze bwa kabiri bugufi bwa \"Savoir faire le lit\", butera kwibaza ku makimbirane hagati y'ababyeyi n'abakobwa bo muri Nigeriya ku bijyanye n'uburere bw'imibonano mpuzabitsina. Mu mwaka wa 2016, yakoze filime ye ya mbere yerekana filime \"L'Arbre sans imbuto\" yibanze ku rugamba rw\u2019umugore ufite ubugumba, guhuza ubuzima bwe. Iyi filime yarashimiwe kandi yegukana ibihembo birenga 50 mu birori ku isi. Nyuma yaje kugurwa mbere numuyoboro wa NHK wu Buyapani. Muri Kamena 2016, filime yatsindiye igihembo cya documentaire muri Afrika Movie Academy Awards (AMAA). \nUsibye gukora firime, ni n'umwarimu w'abarimu muri sinema igendanwa. Ayobora abakiri bato kuzamura ireme muri firime ngufi zivuga ku makimbirane nyayo mu bihugu bihana imbibi nka Nijeriya, Libiya, Kameruni, Burkina Faso na Mali. Yatsindiye igihembo cya Alumni of Young African Leaders Initiative (YALI), iyi ikaba ari gahunda y'Abanyamerika yatangijwe n'uwahoze ari perezida Barack Obama. Nyuma yaje guhabwa izina rya Ordre des Arts et des Lettres na minisitiri w\u2019umuco wa Repubulika y\u2019Ubufaransa kubera ubwitange yagize mu mibereho myiza y\u2019abaturage ba Nigeriya na sinema. \nMacky yazamuwe mu ntera ya Knight of Academic Palms yo muri Repubulika ya Nigeriya hanyuma Knight of Arts. Yakoze kandi nka Ambasaderi-wagenwe na Oasis Niger incubator center ishinzwe kongerera ubushobozi abagore n\u2019abakobwa. Hagati aho, ni umwe mu bagize komite mpuzamahanga ishinzwe umurage wa sinema nyafurika (CPCA). "}
{"id": "9429", "revid": "13866", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9429", "title": "Akounak Tedalat Taha Tazoughai", "text": "Akounak Tedalat Taha Tazoughai, ni filime yumuziki yo muri Nigeri ya 2015 iyobowe na Christopher Kirkley yakozwe na Sahel Sounds, L'Improbable na Tenere Films. Niyo filime yambere yisi ya Tuareg -ururimi rwimpimbano. Filime ishingiye kubintu byabayeho mubuzima bwa Mdou Moctar. \nFilime yafatiwe ahitwa Agadez, muri Nijeri. Filime yakiriwe neza kandi yegukana ibihembo byinshi mubirori mpuzamahanga bya firime. Nibyunvikiro byikinamico ya Prince yo mu \"1984 Imvura yumutuku\"."}
{"id": "9430", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9430", "title": "100 Bucks", "text": "100 Bucks ni filime ngufi yo muri Namibiya 2012 yayobowe na Oshosheni Hiveluah, yunganirwa na Cecil Moller, hamwe na Mutaleni Nadimi. Filime yibanze ku nkuru note y'amadolari 100 ya Namibiya, iva mu maboko y'ubutunzi ikajya mu maboko y'abatishoboye kandi binyuze mu maboko yibye. \nFilime yakiriwe neza kandi yegukana ibihembo byinshi mu birori mpuzamahanga bya firime. Iyi filime yatsindiye igihembo cya Audience Choice muri 2012 Namibia Film na Theatre Awards. Mu 2011, Oshosheni yakiriye Focus Features Afurika muri gahunda ya Prize \"100 bucks.\" 100 bucks yatsindiye kandi igihembo cya Namibian Theatre 2012 na Film Audience Choice. \"100 bucks\" yerekanwe i Londres n\u2019umuryango udaharanira inyungu AfricAvenir Windhoek ndetse no muri New York mu 2012 mu Iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime rya Diaspora"}
{"id": "9431", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9431", "title": "Tjitji: The Himba Girl", "text": "Tjitji: Umukobwa wa Himba, ni filime ngufi ya Namibiya yasohotsemuri 2015 iyobowe na Oshosheni Hiveluahkandi yakozwe na Virginia Witts. Iyi filime yibanze ku buzima bwa Tjijandjeua 'Tjitji', umunyeshuri ukiri muto, watsinze kandi wifuza cyane Himba ufite inzozi z\u2019ibanga zo kuzaba icyamamare 'Talk Show Host'. Iyi filime yamenyekanye kubera guca imyumvire ku bagore. \nFilime yakiriwe neza kandi yegukana ibihembo byinshi mubirori mpuzamahanga bya firime. Iyi filime yari ifite nomination mu byiciro Umuyobozi mwiza, Amashusho yumwimerere meza, amanota meza yumuziki wumwimerere, Cinematografi nziza, na Filime Nziza Nziza muri Namibian Theatre na Film Awards 2014 yabereye muri Theatre yigihugu ya Namibiya (NTN). Nyuma, yatsindiye ibihembo bya cinematografi na firime yerekana inkuru muri Namibian Theatre na Film Awards muri 2014. Yakiriwe neza mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Bangalore ryabereye i Bangalore, mu Buhinde mu 2015. \"Tjitji Umukobwa wa Himba na we\" yari filime ngufi ku mugaragaro mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya Afurika muri 2015. "}
{"id": "9432", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9432", "title": "Salute! (film)", "text": "Ndabaramukije!, ni Sinema ya Namibiya yasohotse muri 2017 iyobowe na Philippe Talavera kandi yakozwe nka firime ya Ombetja Yehinga (OYO). Irimo Adriano Visagie, Odile Muller, David Ndjavera mu nshingano zabo hamwe na Monray Garo\u00ebb. Iyi filime yibanze ku buzima bwa Carlito 'Kado', wakatiwe igifungo cy\u2019imyaka itatu kubera uburiganya, asiga umukobwa w\u2019umukobwa utwite kugira ngo yirwaneho ku isi. \nFilime yerekanwe bwa mbere mu Kwakira 2017 mu nzu yububiko. Filime yakiriwe neza kandi yegukana ibihembo byinshi mubirori mpuzamahanga bya firime. Ku ya 30 Ugushyingo 2019 muri Canal Olympia Ouaga 2000, i Ouagadougou, Burkina Faso, umukinnyi wa mbere Adriano Visagie yatsindiye igihembo cya Sotigui nk'umukinnyi witwaye neza muri Afurika y'Epfo. Yatowe kandi nka filime nziza muri Afurika yepfo muri 2018 Afurika Magic Viewers Choice Awards (AMVCA) ndetse no gutoranywa muri sida 2018 i Amsterdam. "}
{"id": "9433", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9433", "title": "Krischka Stoffels", "text": "Krischka Stoffels, ni umukinnyi wa firime wo muri Namibiya. Krischka yakoze firime nyinshi zizwi cyane harimo \"Gesie muri die glas\" na \"Tjiraa\". Usibye icyerekezo, ni na producer, umwanditsi, cinematografi akaba n'umwanditsi.\nUbuzima bwite.\nShe was born in Windhoek, Namibia.\nCareer.\nMu mwaka wa 2010, yakoze filimi ngufi, \"Gesie muri die glas\", yatsindiye igihembo kidasanzwe cyo kuvuga muri Namibian Film and Theatre Awards. \"Nitsinzi\", yakoze Tjiraa ye filimi ya kabiri ngufi. Iyi filime ikurikira Vezuva, umukobwa ukiri muto wa Ovaherero wagarutse avuye kwiga mu mahanga, mu Budage, gusa yaje kubona ko mubyara we washatse yitabye Imana, kandi ko nk'uko bisanzwe, biteganijwe ko azashyingira umupfakazi wa mubyara we. Iyi filime yatewe inkunga na komisiyo ishinzwe amafilime ya Namibiya kandi yatoranijwe kugira ngo yerekanwe mu birori mpuzamahanga bya filime, harimo iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya filime rya Afurika Diaspora. "}
{"id": "9434", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9434", "title": "Perivi Katjavivi", "text": "Perivi John Katjavivi, ni umukinnyi wa firime w'Abongereza na namibiya. Yakinnye filime nyinshi harimo \"Eembwiti,\" unseen na \"Film Festival Film.\" Usibye gutanga icyerekezo, ni numuproducer, umwanditsi, ukora kamera, umukinnyi, cinematografi akaba n'umwanditsi. \nUbuzima bwite.\nKatjavivi yavukiye Oxford mu Bwongereza kandi afite barumuna be batanu. Se Peter Katjavivi ni umunyapolitiki n'umudipolomate wa Namibiya, currently umuvugizi w'Inteko ishinga amategeko ya Namibiya, nyina ni Umwongereza Jane Katjavivi. \nUmwuga.\nMuri 2016, Katjavivi yakoze filime ye yambere \"The Unseen\". Iyi filime yerekanwe mu birori byinshi bya firime harimo na Busan, mu marushanwa yabereye i Durban. Filime yatsindiye igihembo cya Filime Nziza muri Innsbruck no muri Otirishiya. Muri 2019, yakoze \"Filime ngufi ya Film Festival\", afatanya na Mpumelelo Mcata. Filime ifite Premiere yisi kuri 69 ya Berlinale muri Gashyantare 2019. Usibye sinema, yanditse kandi byinshi kuri \"Windhoek Indorerezi\", \"Afurika ni Igihugu\" na \"OkayAfrica\". "}
{"id": "9435", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9435", "title": "Mabata Bata", "text": "Mabata Bata, ni filime yerekana ikinamico ya Mozambike yo muri 2017 iyobowe na Sol de Carvalho ikaba yarayikoranye hamwe na Rodrigo Areias na Ricardo Freitas kuri Bando \u00e0 parte Promarte Films. Filime yakuwe mu nkuru ngufi \u201cThe Day Mabata Bata Exploded\u201d yanditswe n'umwanditsi wa Mozambike Mia Couto. Filime isobanura ubuzima bwa Azariya, umwungeri ukiri muto wimfubyi wita ku bushyo bwinka. Nubwo arota kujya mwishuri, nyuma aherekejwe na Mabata Bata, impfizi nini yubushyo kugirango akomeze ubuzima bwe. \nAmashusho ya firime ya TV yasohotse ku ya 30 Mata 2017 muri Porutugali na 1 Gicurasi 2017 muri Berezile. Ku ya 30 Mutarama 2019, iyi filime yasohotse mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya Filimi Rotterdam mu Buholandi. Filime yafatiwe hirya no hino muri Chibuto, Gaza na Mozambique. "}
{"id": "9436", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9436", "title": "Shyaka Kagam\u00e9", "text": "Shyaka Kagame (yavutse 1983), ni umunyaRwanda uba muri Swiss. Azwi cyane nk'umuyobozi wa firime \"Bounty\" ishimwa cyane. \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse mu 1983 i Geneve mu Busuwisi ku babyeyi b'u Rwanda. \nUmwuga.\nMbere yo kwinjira muri sinema, yize siyanse(science) ya politiki. Mu 2009, Kagame yatangiye umwuga we wa filime nk'umuyobozi wungirije hamwe n\u2019umukinnyi wa firime wa Geneve Fr\u00e9d\u00e9ric Baillif. Muri Kamena 2017, Kagame yerekanye bwa mbere \"Bounty\". Filime yakiriwe neza kandi yerekanwa mu birori byinshi bya firime. Inyandiko irihariye kubera nta majwi arenga, kubazwa cyangwa isura ya kamera. Filime ivuga kubibazo bijyanye numwirondoro wabirabura babasuwisi. "}
{"id": "9437", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9437", "title": "S\u00e9bastien Kamba", "text": "S\u00e9bastien Kamba (wavutse ku ya 25 Ukuboza 1941), niUmukinnyi wa firime muri Kongo. Umwe mu bakora amafilime yambere mu nganda za firime zo muri congo, yayoboye filime ngufi ku bufatanye n\u2019abakora amafilime y\u2019Abafaransa. \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse ku ya 25 Ukuboza 1941 i Brazzaville, muri Repubulika ya Kongo.\nUmwuga.\nYimukiye mu Bufaransa, yiga mu biro bishinzwe ubufatanye bwa Radiofonique. Nyuma yaje kwimenyereza umwuga kuri tereviziyo i Paris ndetse anaba umwarimu. Mu 1964, Kamba yakoze filime yambere yimpimbano ya congo, film ngufi ya politiki \"Le Peuple du Congo-L\u00e9o vaincra\". Yakozwe ku bufatanye n\u2019itangazamakuru rya tereviziyo.\nMu 1966, yakoze \"Kaka yo nayo ngufi\" hanyuma \"Mwana keba\" muri 1970. Mu 1973, Kamba yayoboye filime ya mbere yagaragaye muri Repubulika ya Kongo: \"Al Ran\u00e7on d'une alliance\", yakuwe mu gitabo cyitwa 'La l\u00e9gende de Mfoumou Ma Mazono' cyanditswe na Jean Malonga. Mu 1992, yasohoye igitabo \"Cin\u00e9matographique et Parti Unique\" (Cinematographic Production and Unique Party. Urugero rwa Kongo). \nKu ya 1 Gashyantare 2019, i Brazzaville habereye igikombe cya mbere cy\u2019ibikombe bya sinema muri Congo cyiswe \"Les Kamba's Awards\" mu rwego rwo guha icyubahiro Kamba. "}
{"id": "9438", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9438", "title": "Imoh Umoren", "text": "Imoh Umoren (wavutse ku ya 13 Kanama 1982), ni umukinnyi wa firime wo muri Nigeriya ukora cyane cyane firime zo mu Buhinde. Azwi cyane nk'umuyobozi wa film ya 2017 \"Abana b'ibyondo\". Umoren afatwa nkumukinnyi wa mbere wakoze firime wicecekeye wumukara numweru mubikorwa bya firime ya Nollywood. \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse ku ya 13 Kanama 1982 muri Nijeriya. Se yari umunyapolitiki naho nyina yari umwarimu wa kaminuza. Umoren avuga ko nyina yagize uruhare mu mwuga we wo gukina filime. Ababyeyi be bombi bapfuye akiri ingimbi, kandi yarezwe na bene wabo kugeza ubwo yikubise wenyine afite imyaka 16. \nUmwuga.\nAfite imyaka 9, Umoren yatangiye kwandika urukurikirane rusekeje rwitwa \"The Wickeds\" hamwe ninshuti ye magara Richie. Yinjiye nka producer muto muri 'Common Ground Production' kandi akora kumurongo mpuzamahanga witwa \"The Station\". Nyuma, yinjiye mubikorwa bya TV bya francise nka \"Project Fame\", \"MTV yo kuburira mbere\", \"Ntuzibagirwe Amagambo\" \"n'imbyino za Street Guinness\". \nAfite imyaka 26, yakoze filime ye ya mbere yerekana \"Lemon Green\" Filime yamenyekanye cyane. Hanyuma muri 2010, yayoboye film ngufi \"All Sorts Of Trouble\". Muri 2013, filime ye ya TV Yagize \"Umunsi\" mwiza yatowe nka Cinematografi nziza. Muri 2015 yayoboye firime black and white silent movie \"Hard Times\", imutsindira AMVCA yambere. Kuri filime ye y\u2019ibyago \"The Happyness Limited\", umukinnyi wa mbere Tope Tedela yatowe nkumukinnyi mwiza muri Afurika muri Afrika Magic Viewers 'Choice Awards (AMVCA). \nUmoren yaje kwandika no kuyobora film yamamaye cyane\"Children of Mud\" ishingiye ku nkuru ifatika. Filime yakiriye nomination 7 mubirori mpuzamahanga bya firime zitandukanye zirimo: (NEA) na AMVCA. Filime ye y'ibyago yakurikiyeho \"Dear Bayo\" yerekanwe mu birori 11 bya firime kandi yatsindiye ibihembo 6 mu iserukiramuco rya Nollywood mu Bwongereza andi maserukiramuco mpuzamahanga ya firime. Umoren yayoboye kandi filime \"Lagos:\" \"Sex, Lies &amp; Traffic\" yafatanije na Gbemisola Afolabi.\nNyuma yarangije gutunganya ikinamico yigihe \"The Herbert Macaulay Affair\", biopic ivuga kuri Herbert Macaulay, muri 2018. Muri 2020, yakoze urukurikirane rw'ikinamico \"Umuyoboro wa 77\". "}
{"id": "9439", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9439", "title": "Tunde Babalola", "text": "Tunde Babalola, ni umwanditsi muri sinema yo muri Nigeriya na televiziyo yo mu Bwongereza. Azwi cyane mu kwandika inyandiko zerekana filime zishimwa cyane nka \"Last Flight to Abuja,Critical Assignment\", October 1 na \"Citation\". \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavukiye kandi akurira mu Bwongereza. Nyuma yaje kwimukira muri Nijeriya hamwe n'ababyeyi n'abavandimwe. Se yari umucungamari naho nyina akora muri Banki Nkuru. Babalola iyobowe na nyirarume, Liyetona-Koloneli mu ngabo za Nijeriya, Babalola yahatiwe gusaba ishuri rikuru ry'ingabo rya Nijeriya (NDA). Icyakora, nyina ntiyamuhaye uruhushya. Niyo mpamvu, yemerewe kwiga Dramatic Arts muri kaminuza ya Obafemi Awolowo. \nUmwuga.\nAfite imyaka 14, yanditse inyandiko ye ya mbere ya firime in \"The Raw\". Amaze gusubira mu Bwongereza, yinjiye mu muyoboro wa 4 maze yandika ikinamico ya sitcom ikurikirana yitwa \"In Exile\". Nyuma yaje gukorana n'imiyoboro myinshi: BBC, Televiziyo ya Carlton na Televiziyo ya Chrysalis. \nMuri 2015, yinjiye nk'umwanditsi akaba na producer wa comediyo yerekana urwenya \"Rib Busters: Urwenya\". Muri 2015, Babalola yatsindiye ibihembo byumwanditsi mwiza w\u2019urwenya kuri filime \"Inama\" n\u2019umwanditsi w\u2019ikinamico mwiza wa filime October 1 muri Afurika Magic Viewers 'Choice Awards. "}
{"id": "9440", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9440", "title": "Pat Nebo", "text": "Pat Nebo, (?-2023) ni umuhanzi wo muri Nigeriya wapanze umusaruro nkumuyobozi wubuhanzi. Yakoze nk'umushinga wo gutunganya amashusho muri firime harimo\"October 1\", \"\"76\", \"Being Mrs Elliot\" and \"Okafor's Law\". Yakoze kandi nkuwashushanyije muri firime nke. \nMu 1993, yatangiye umwuga we wo gutunganya ibicuruzwa hamwe na firime yo murugo \"Ti oluwa ni ile\". Muri uwo mwaka, yakoze mu bice bibiri bya \"Ti oluwa ni ile\". Mu mwaka wa 2009, yagaragaye muri sinema ya mbere muri filime yitwa \"Figurine\" aho yakinnye nka 'Umubitsi w'ishyingirwa'. Icyakora, yakomeje gukora \"nkuwashushanyije\" muri firime nyinshi nka Araromire, \"Arugba\", \"Symphony ya Alero\" na \"Kuba Madamu Elliot\". Usibye gushushanya umusaruro, yanakoze nk'umuyobozi wubuhanzi muri firime: \"The Figurine\", \"Terefone Swap\", \"IHalf of a Yellow Sun\" na \"76\"."}
{"id": "9441", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9441", "title": "Branwen Okpako", "text": "Prof. Branwen Kiemute Okpako (yavutse 25 Gashyantare 1969), yavukiye muri nijeriya gusa akorera umwuga wo gutunganya amaflimi mu budage. Azwi cyane nkumuyobozi wa firime zizwi cyane\"The Education of Auma Obama\", \"Dirt for Dinner\" and \"Landing\".. Usibye gutanga icyerekezo, ni n'umwanditsi, producer, sinema, umwanditsi wa firime ndetse numwarimu. \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse ku ya 25 Gashyantare 1969 i Lagos, muri Nijeriya. Afite imyaka 16, yimukiye i Wales. Mu 1991, Okpako yabonye impamyabumenyi ya B.Sc. mu bumenyi bwa politiki yakuye muri kaminuza ya Bristol, mu Bwongereza nyuma akaza gukurikira amasomo ya MFA ahwanye na filime iyobowe na Academy ya Filime na Televiziyo yo mu Budage Berlin GmbH, Berlin (DFFB) mu 1999. \nYashakanye na Johannes Brandrup, nyuma baza gutandukana.\nUmwuga.\nMugihe mu mwaka wa nyuma wa DFFB, yakoze firime ye ya mbere ya \"Dreckfresser\" mu 2000. Filime yibanze ku bapolisi ba mbere b'abirabura mu Budage bw'Iburasirazuba. Filime yatsindiye ibihembo byinshi mpuzamahanga harimo Intambwe Zibanza: Igihembo cy\u2019Abadage Newcomer Igihembo cya Film Documentary 2000, IG Media Award i Dok Leipzig mu 2000, Igihembo cyatanzwe kuva kugurisha 2000. Yatsindiye kandi igihembo cyiza cya Filime nziza mu cyumweru cya 24 cya Duisburg. Mu 2001, iyi filime yahawe igihembo cya Leta ya Bavariya Igihembo cyiswe \u201cIntare ikiri nto\u201d ndetse na filime nziza yo gutanga impamyabumenyi mu iserukiramuco rya Docs Dubrovnik. Usibye sinema, Okpako ni Umwarimu wungirije mu ishami rya Sinema n\u2019itangazamakuru rya Digital muri kaminuza ya California, Davis. "}
{"id": "9442", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9442", "title": "Andy Amadi Okoroafor", "text": "Andy Amadi Okoroafor numukinnyi wa firime wo muri Nigeriya nkumuvugizi wa TED. Azwi cyane nk'umuyobozi wa film ya \"Relentless ya\" 2010. Usibye gutanga icyerekezo, ni umwanditsi, producer numuyobozi wubuhanzi. Niwe washinze sitidiyo yo guhanga 'Clam'.\nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse ku ya 8 Gashyantare 1966 i Bauchi, mu majyaruguru ya Nijeriya. Yari afite umwaka umwe igihe intambara yatangiraga i Biafra. Nyuma yaje kwimukira i Paris mu Bufaransa maze akora nk'umuyobozi ushinzwe ubuhanzi mu kwamamaza, imideli n'amashusho y'indirimbo. Ni na TED-Mugenzi. \nUmwuga.\nMu Bufaransa, Okoroafor yamaze imyaka 5 yubuhanzi ayobora amashusho yindirimbo, kuva kuri alubumu kugeza ku mashusho yindirimbo. Yashinze sitidiyo yo guhanga yitwa 'Clam' na 'Clam magazine' mu 1999. Iki kinyamakuru gisohoka kabiri mu mwaka mu Buyapani, Amerika, Uburayi, na Berezile. Mu imurikagurisha rya 2017, yayoboye igitaramo \"show Never Surrender\", i M. Bassy i Hamburg, mu Budage. Muri iki gitaramo harimo gufotora no kwerekana amashusho murukurikirane, \"Aphrike Yinshi\". Hamwe nuruhererekane, yakoranye na mugenzi we bafotora hamwe nuwakoze firime, Andrew Dosunmu. \nMu mwaka wa 2010, Okoroafor yakoze filime \"Relentless\", filime ye ya mbere. Mu Kwakira 2010, iyi filime yatoranijwe mu iserukiramuco rya sinema ryabereye i Londres, ryerekanwa ku ya 6 Ukuboza 2010 mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya Afurika ryabereye i Port Harcourt ku nshuro ya mbere muri Afurika. "}
{"id": "9443", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9443", "title": "Anne Njemanze", "text": "Anne Njemanze, ni umukinnyi wa sinema muri Nigeriya. Azwi cyane ku ruhare muri filime \"Domitila\", \"Tinsel\", \"\u00ccr\u00e8t\u00ed\" na \"Colorless\". \nUbuzima bwite.\nYashakanye na mugenzi we ukina filime muri Nollywood, Segun Arinze, nyuma biba ubukwe bw'igihe gito. Abashakanye bafite umukobwa umwe, Renny Morenike, wavutse ku ya 10 Gicurasi. \nUgushyingo 2013, yongeye gushaka Silver Ojieson. Icyakora, yamaze kandi amezi atarenze umunani kugeza muri Nyakanga 2014 kubera ibibazo by'ihohoterwa rikorerwa mu ngo. \nNyuma gato yo gutandukana nubukwe bwa mbere, yahuye nimpanuka yabereye i Calabar, muri leta ya Cross River. Kubera iyi mpanuka, Owerri wavukiye muri leta ya Imo yangiritse cyane mu gihe Njemanze yagumye ku ngoyi imyaka 2.\nUmwuga.\nMu 1995 yatangiye gukina na firime yo mu rugo \"Rattle Snake\". Nyuma yaje kuba umukinnyi w'amafirime uzwi cyane hamwe na filime gakondo yo murugo \"Domitilla\" na \"Domitilla II\" afite uruhare runini. Nyuma yaje gukina muri firime \"Yukuri Kwatura\" aho hamwe na Liz Benson.\u00a0"}
{"id": "9444", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9444", "title": "Sophie Alakija", "text": "Sophie Rammal Alakija (wavutse 7 Gashyantare 1985), ni umukinnyi wa sinema muri Nigeriya. Azwi cyane kubera uruhare muri \"Halita\" na \"Assistant\" Madams.\nUbuzima bwite.\nAlakija yavutse ku ya 7 Gashyantare 1985 mu muryango wa kisilamu ukomoka muri Efik (umuryango wo mu bihugu byambukiranya igihugu cya Calabar) ukomoka muri Libani. \nUmwuga.\nYagaragaye muri \"Holla kuri\" videwo y'indirimbo y'umuhungu wahoze ari umukunzi we Wizkid nk'umubyinnyi wa mbere mu mwaka wa 2010. \nYakinnye muri firime nyinshi zizwi cyane, zirimo:\"Drawing Strands\", \"Getting over him\", and \"Small Chops\". Muri 2017, yakinnye muri \"serivise za Scandals\", ni ubufatanye hagati ya Gana na Nijeriya. Muri 2019, yakinnye muri \"serivise ya Halita\" hanyuma akurikirana ibiganiro bya TV \"Assistant Madams\". Yakinnye kandi mu mugore \"w\u2019umuyisilamu\" wa Timini Egbuson mu 2020. "}
{"id": "9445", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9445", "title": "Uju Okeke", "text": "Obianuju Blessing Okeke, uzwi cyane ku izina rya Uju Okeke, ni umukinnyi wa sinema muri Nigeriya. Yagize uruhare muri \"Mission to No Where\" and \"the Barrister\".\nUbuzima bwite.\nAnyamele yavukiye muri Leta ya Anambra. Yize mu buhanzi bwa teatre yakuye muri Kaminuza ya Nnamdi Azikiwe. Mu 2012, yashakanye n'umukunzi we kuva kera, Melekh. Ibirori byera byabereye mu rusengero rwa Saint Barth Anglican i Lagos.\nUmwuga.\nMu 2006, Okeke yakinnye nk'umukozi muri firime ya Teco Benson \"yise Mission to No Where\". Mu 2007, yatsindiye igihembo cy\u2019umukinnyi wa Nest uzaza muri Ibihembo bya African Movie Academy Awards (AMAA) kubera uruhare rwe rwiza muri iyo filime. Muri 2018, yahawe icyubahiro n\u2019ishami ry\u2019ikinamico n\u2019ubushakashatsi bwa firime, kaminuza ya Nnamdi Azikiwe, Awka, muri Leta ya Anambra. "}
{"id": "9446", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9446", "title": "Aline Munezero", "text": "Aline Munezero (yavutse mu 1994) ni umukinnyi wa filime w'Umunyarwandakazi. Azwi ku izina rya \u00abBijoux\u00bb mu rukurikirane rwa filime \"Bamenya\". Azwi kandi ku izina rya \u00abMilika\u00bb.\nAline Munezero yatangiye gukina filime mu 2016. Yari umwe mu bahataniraga igihembo cy'umukinnyi wa filime ukunzwe cyane wa 2016 muri Rwanda Movie Awards.\nUbuzima.\nUbwana n'intangiriro.\nAline Munezero yavutse mu 1994, i Kigali. Ni imfura mu bana batanu. Umuryango we utuye mu Murenge wa Kimironko, mu Akarere ka Gasabo. Akiri umwana, yayoboraga abandi bana mu mikino.\nUmwuga.\nAline Munezero yatangiye gukina filime mu 2016. Mu 2017, yavuze ko yari amaze gukina muri filime zigera ku munani. Muri zo harimo \"Gica\", \"Umugabo wanjye\", \"Nyirabayazana\", \"Sakabaka\", \"Bazirunge\" na \"City Maid\". Icyo gihe yari azwi ku izina rya \u00abMilika\u00bb.\nYari umwe mu bakinnyi 10 b'abagore bahataniraga igihembo cy'umukinnyi wa filime ukunzwe cyane wa 2016 muri Rwanda Movie Awards. Ibi bihembo byateguwe na Ishusho Arts.\nNyuma yamenyekanye ku izina rya \u00abBijoux\u00bb mu rukurikirane rwa filime \"Bamenya\". \"Bamenya\" itambuka kuri YouTube. Aline Munezero yagaragaye kandi muri filime za televiziyo no mu mashusho y'indirimbo."}
{"id": "9447", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9447", "title": "Musanase Laura", "text": "Musanase Laura (wavutse 1993), ni umukinnyi wa filimi mu Rwanda. Umwe mu bakinnyi ba filime bazwi cyane mu Rwanda, Laura azwi cyane ku ruhare 'Nikuze' muri televiziyo izwi cyane yo mu Rwanda \"City Maid\". \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse mu 1993 muri Tanzaniya, yakuriye mu Rwanda mu muryango ufite barumuna be batandatu. Yarangije amashuri abanza mu ishuri ribanza rya Bright Academy mu Karere ka Nyagatare. Nyuma yaje kwiga i Lycee de Kigali amashuri yisumbuye arangiza amashuri avuye mu ishuri ry\u2019abakobwa rya FAWE. Kuri ubu atuye mu karere ka Gasabo mu murenge wa Gisozi.\nUrugendo mu iterambere.\nLaura, mukinyamakuru kitwa new times yasobanuye ko yatewe imbaraga zokuba umukinyi wa filime namugenziwe warusazwe akina filime ndetse ahabwa incingano zikomeye zo gucyina city maid.aho yatangiye akina arumukozi wo murugo hanyuma azakwamamara abumukinyi mwiza wa filime aho yaje no gukina muri filime yitwa ejo sikera kandi we mubyukuri nago yacyekagako yabasha gukina filimeariko yaje gukina neza kandi anabyiyumvamo.https://www.newtimes.co.rw/section/read/209427\nUmwuga.\nYatangiye gukina bwa mbere kuri televiziyo sitcom \"City Maid\" afite uruhare runini 'Nikuze'. Uruhare rwe rwamamaye cyane muri rubanda. Yaretse iyo nshingano imyaka mike, aho abafana bagaragaje akababaro kabo. Icyakora, nyuma yaje kwemeza ko, azagaruka serial vuba. Yatoranijwe kandi mu cyiciro cy\u2019abakinnyi beza muri Rwanda Movie Awards."}
{"id": "9448", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9448", "title": "Philbert Aim\u00e9 Mbabazi", "text": "Philbert Aim\u00e9 Mbabazi Sharangabo (wavutse 1990), ni umukinnyi wa firime wo mu Rwanda. Yakoze filimi nyinshi harimo, \"The Liberators,\" \"Versus\" and \"I Got My Things And Left.\" \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse mu 1990 i Kigali, mu Rwanda.\nUmwuga.\nMbabazi yabonye impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya kabiri cya kaminuza mu ishami rya sinema yakuye muri kaminuza y\u2019ubuhanzi n\u2019ubushakashatsi i Geneve (UMUTWE - Gen\u00e8ve, Haute \u00e9cole d'art et de design). Mugihe cyishuri, yakoze firime ebyiri \"The Liberators\" na \"Versus\". Filime zombi zerekanwe mu birori byinshi bya firime birimo Vision du R\u00e9el Nyon, Internationale Kurzfilmtage Winterthur, Tampere, Oberhausen na Uppsala Festival Festival. Amaze kubona impamyabumenyi muri 2017, yasubiye mu Rwanda.\nMuri 2019, yayoboye filime ngufi\"I Got My Things And Left\" yatsindiye igihembo kinini mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime rya Oberhausen. Iyi filime yerekanwe mu iserukiramuco rya firime rirenga 20 nk'Iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya Filimi rya Rotterdam, International Kurzfilmtage Winterthur, Internationale Kurzfimtage Winterthur, Genda Nijmegen, Indie Lisboa na ISFF Hamburg, FIFF Namur n'ibindi. yatangije isosiyete ikora firime yitwa 'Imitana Productions' ifite icyicaro i Kigali, mu Rwanda. Nyuma yaje gukora filime ye ya mbere ya \"Republika\" (Spectrum). "}
{"id": "9449", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9449", "title": "Bounty (2017 film)", "text": "Bounty, ni film documentaire yu Rwanda yo muri 2017 iyobowe na Shyaka Kagam\u00e9 kandi yakozwe na Florence Adam muri Les Productions JMH. \nFilime yakiriwe neza kandi yegukana ibihembo byinshi mubirori mpuzamahanga bya firime. Filime yakiriwe neza kandi yerekanwa mu birori byinshi bya firime. Inyandiko irihariye kubera nta majwi arenga, kubazwa cyangwa isura ya kamera. Filime ivuga kubibazo bijyanye numwirondoro wabirabura baba mubusuwisi \nUmugambi.\nIyi filime ivuga ku buzima bwa buri munsi bwabantu batanu baturutse mu nzego zitandukanye: Bacary, Winta, Jeffrey, Rili na Ayan aho bose bavukiye cyangwa bakuriye mu Busuwisi.. "}
{"id": "9450", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9450", "title": "Kickin' It with the Kinks", "text": "Kickin 'It With The Kinks, ni filimi ngufi yo mu Rwanda yo mu 2016 iyobowe na Cynthia Butare nka filime yatewe inkunga na Mundia Situmbeko na Selina Thompson. \nMuri 2011, Butare yakoze \"Kickin 'It With The Kinks\" kumushinga we wa kaminuza. Filime yakira igihembo cya documentaire nziza mu ishami rye. Nyuma mu 2016, Cynthia ari kumwe n'inshuti ye Mundia, bahisemo gukora verisiyo ndende ya firime. Iyi filime yakiriwe neza kandi yerekanwa mu birori mpuzamahanga bya firime. Filime yakiriwe neza kandi yegukana ibihembo byinshi mubirori mpuzamahanga bya firime. "}
{"id": "9451", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9451", "title": "Imfura", "text": "Imfura, ni filime ngufi yo mu Rwanda yo muri 2017 iyobowe na Samuel Ishimwe ikaba yarayikoranye na Daniel Schweizer na Jean Perret kuri Haute \u00c9cole d'Art et de Design (HEAD) na Imitana Productions. Muri iyi filime hagaragaramo Moses Mwizerwa mu mwanya wa mbere hamwe na Kijyana Yves na Nyirababikira Hadidja mu nshingano zabo.\nFilime yakiriwe neza kandi yegukana ibihembo byinshi mubirori mpuzamahanga bya firime. Bibaye umusaruro wambere wu Rwanda washyizwe mumarushanwa ya Berlinale Short. Muri make yatsindiye icyiciro cya silver Bear Jury Igiciro cya Berlin International Festival Festival. \nUmugambi.\nIyi filime ivuga ku nkuru yashyizwe mu Rwanda nyuma ya jenoside. "}
{"id": "9452", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9452", "title": "Samuel Ishimwe", "text": "Samuel Ishimwe Karemangingo (wavutse 1991), ni umukinnyi wa firime wo mu Rwanda. Azwi cyane nk'umuyobozi wa firime ngufi \"Imfura i\", aho abaye umukinnyi wa mbere w\u2019amafirime u Rwanda uhagarariye Berlinale. Usibye kuba umuyobozi, ni n'umukinnyi wa sinema, umwanditsi, injeniyeri y'amajwi, umwanditsi wa sinema na producer.\nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse mu 1991 i Kigali, mu Rwanda. Nyina yamusize akiri uruhinja abura ababyeyi be n'umuryango we mugihe cya jenoside yo mu Rwanda. \nUmwuga.\nNyuma yo kurangiza amashuri yisumbuye muri 2010, Ishimwe yatangiye gukora nkumunyamakuru nabafotora kuri 'igitekerezo.com'. Mu mwaka wa 2011, yakoze filime ngufi ya mbere \"Paying debts\" yerekanwe mu iserukiramuco rya sinema mu Rwanda. Muri uwo mwaka, yitabiriye amahugurwa ya documentaire muri Uganda yakozwe na Maisha Film Lab. Igihe yari muri Uganda, yakoraga nka producer wungirije kuri documentaire ngufi \"Invisible soul\". Nyuma mu 2011, yitabiriye amahugurwa yerekanwe kuri firime yitwa 'K-dox' yakozwe na James Longley. Muri kamena 2012, Ishimwe yarangije amezi 3 yibanda cyane kubijyanye no gukina film muri Kwetu Film Institute. Hanyuma muri Nzeri 2012, yitabiriye gahunda yo kwandika no kuyobora yitwa 'A Sample of Work'. \nYanditse inyandiko ya \"Crossing Line\" kandi yatsindiye igihembo mumarushanwa yo kwandika inyandiko yateguwe na Goethe Institut Rwanda. Nyuma yaje gukora nk'umunyamakuru n'umufotozi nyuma yo kurangiza muri kaminuza nkuru y'u Rwanda. Hanyuma yagiye mu Busuwisi kugira ngo akomeze kwiga. Muri kamena 2017, Ishimwe yabonye impamyabumenyi ya firime muri Haute \u00e9cole d'art et de design (Ishuri ry\u2019ubukorikori n\u2019ubushakashatsi rya Geneve - UMUTWE). \nMuri 2017, yakoze \"Imfura\" bisobanura ngo \"First Born'. Iyi filime ivuga ku nkuru yashyizwe mu Rwanda nyuma ya jenoside. Nibikorwa byambere byu Rwanda byashyizwe mumarushanwa ya Berlinale Short. Muri make yatsindiye igiciro cya silver Bear Jury Igiciro cya Berlin International Festival Festival. Filime ye iragenda kandi yatsindiye ibihembo byinshi mubirori bikomeye bya firime kwisi; Ishimwe yahise yigaragaza nk'inyenyeri igaragara ya sinema yo mu Rwanda. "}
{"id": "9453", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9453", "title": "Armand Kajangwe", "text": "Armand Kajangwe, ni umunyarwanda - umukinnyi wa firime wo mu Busuwisi. Azwi cyane nk'umuyobozi wa firime nka \"The Asylum\", na \"Dirty Singles\". \nUmwuga.\nKu ya 7 Mata 2009, Kajangwe yinjiye mu isosiyete ikora ibicuruzwa byuzuye yitwa 'Crooked Seas Inc.' yashinzwe na Craig Leblanc ifite icyicaro i Ontario, muri Kanada. Yakoze nk'umuyobozi, umuyobozi w'amafoto, n'umuyobozi ushinzwe imbuga nkoranyambaga. \nMuri 2016, Kajangwe yagize uruhare mu gutangiza urubuga rwa mbere rwa videwo muri Afurika. Ihuriro rizwi ku izina rya 'www.journal.rw' ryatunganijwe kandi rikoreshwa na Village Innovation, uruganda ruhanga ruherereye mu Rwanda aho Kajangwe ari umuyobozi mukuru. Ihuriro rirashobora gutanga inzira yo gusangira ibisobanuro bihanitse bya videwo. "}
{"id": "9454", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9454", "title": "Cynthia Butare", "text": "Cynthia Butare, numunyarwanda - umukinnyi wa firime wu Busuwisi kimwe naba videwo. Azwi cyane nk'umuyobozi wa firime \"Kickin 'It With The Kinks\". \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavukiye i Geneve mu Busuwisi. Yabaye i Geneve kugeza arangije amashuri yisumbuye hanyuma yimukira mu Bwongereza kwiga amashuri makuru. \nUmwuga.\nYabonye impamyabumenyi ihanitse muri Digital Media and Communication nyuma arangiza Master's in Documentary Practice muri kaminuza ya Manchester Metropolitan.Muri 2011, yakoze \"Kickin 'It With The Kinks\" ku mushinga wa kaminuza. Filime yakira igihembo cya documentaire nziza mu ishami rye. Nyuma mu 2016, Cynthia ari kumwe n'inshuti ye Mundia, bahisemo gukora verisiyo ndende ya firime. Iyi filime yakiriwe neza kandi yerekanwa mu birori mpuzamahanga bya firime. Muri uwo mwaka, yatangije isosiyete ye bwite, 'CB Production'. \nAkiri ingimbi, yatangiye kwandika mu 2003. Nubwo yahagaritse kwandika nyuma yimyaka itatu, yatangiye blog 2012. Muri 2013, Butare yahawe igihembo cya Blog nziza y'umwaka na BEFFTA. Icyakora, yimukiye mu Rwanda mu 2014. Igihe yari mu Rwanda, yakoze filime ye ya kabiri ya documentaire, \"Ishimwa: Kuva Amaraso Yera Kuri Grace\". Yerekanwe mu rwego rwo kwerekana iserukiramuco rya sinema mu Rwanda. Kuri ubu arimo gukora umushinga witwa \"The Return\". "}
{"id": "9455", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9455", "title": "Jean-Luc Habyarimana", "text": "Jean Luc Mitana (yavutse 29 Nzeri 1983), ni umunyarwanda ukina filimi. Yabaye umukinnyi wa sinema muri firime zitandukanye zirimo \"Behind the Word\", \"Kai the Vendor\" and \"Strength in Fear\". \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse ku ya 29 Nzeri 1983 i Kigali, mu Rwanda. \nUmwuga.\nMu 2006, yinjiye mu itsinda rya Almond Tree Films Collective maze mu 2009, Mitana akora kuri filime izwi ku izina rya \"Maibobo\" iyobowe na Yves Montand Niyongabo kandi yerekanwe bwa mbere mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya Filimi rya Rotterdam mu 2010. Yatanzwe mu iserukiramuco rya Sinema Africano d'Asia e Amerika Latina ya 2011 i Milan, mu Butaliyani. Yayoboye \"SAA-IPO\" mu 2010. Yafatiwe amashusho i Kigali iterwa inkunga na Tribeca Film Institute. Iyi filime yerekanwe bwa mbere mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Tribeca 2011 hanyuma ryerekanwa mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya Filime rya Durban 2011 na AfryKamera International Film Festival, Polonye mu 2011. Hanyuma muri 2014, yakoze muri documentaire \"Inyuma y'Isi\" iyobowe na Marie-Clementine Dusejambo. Muri 2014, yitabiriye impano ya Berlinale, aho yari muri Studio yo gutunganya. "}
{"id": "9456", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9456", "title": "Lansana Mansaray", "text": "Lansana Mansaray (wavutse 1992), bakunze kwita Barmmy Boy, ni umukinnyi wa firime wo muri Siyera Lewone. Umwe mu bakora amafilime azwi cyane muri sinema ya Siyera Lewone, Mansaray azwi cyane muri filime zizwi cyane \"Youth\", \"Charity\" and.. Usibye gukora firime, anatunganya firime, umukinnyi wa cinemateri numuraperi. \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse mu 1992 i Freetown, muri Siyera Lewone. \nUmwuga.\nMansaray ni we washinze WeOwnTV akaba n'umuyobozi ushinzwe umusaruro muri Freetown Media Center. Hamwe na WeOwnTV, yakoranye n\u2019imiryango myinshi irimo: Defence for Children International, Studios ya NOVA (UK), Inama y\u2019Ubwongereza Siyera Lewone, UNICEF Sierra Leone, Save the Children Sierra Leone, Ivuriro ry\u2019umugore n\u2019umugi wa Hull UK 2017. \nMu mwaka wa 2010, yayoboye filime ye ya mbere \"Youth\". Muri uwo mwaka, yakoze nk'umukinnyi wa sinema muri filime \"y'abagiraneza\". Yakomeje gukora nka cinematif mu myaka iri imbere muri firime; \"Barwanyije\" (2011) kandi \"Ubumuga ni Ubushobozi\". \nUsibye bo, yakoze nk'umukinnyi wa sinema mu bikorwa byinshi byegukanye ibihembo \"nka\" \"Decisions\" in 2011, \"Girl Rising\" in 2013, \"They Are We\" in 2014, and \"Meet the Africans: Many Rivers to Cross\" in 2013, aho nyuma yatsinze Igihembo cya Emmy. Mu mwaka wa 2014, yasuye u Bwongereza kugira ngo abonane n'incuti zimwe na zimwe, ariko byabaye ngombwa ko yongerera igihe cy'amezi atanu kubera icyorezo cya Ebola muri Siyera Lewone. \nMuri 2018, yayoboye filime documentaire \"Survivors\", ishingiye ku kibazo cya Ebola. Nyuma yaje gutorwa muri Emmy's Best Social Issue Documentary, aho ibaye filime ya mbere yo muri Afrika yuburengerazuba yakiriye ishimwe. "}
{"id": "9457", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9457", "title": "Bolot Feray", "text": "Bolot Feray, ni filime yo gusetsa ya Seychellois yo mu 1995 iyobowe na Jean-Claude Matombe kandi yakozwe na Marie-Therese Choppy. Muri iyi filime hagaragaramo Alain Belle mu ruhare rw'icyubahiro aho nka Charles DeCommarmond, Jenita Furneau, Antonia Gabriel na Marie Lista bagize uruhare runini. yari ishingiye ku ikinamico kandi yerekana umuryango gakondo wa Seychellois. \nFilime yakiriwe neza kandi yegukana ibihembo byinshi mubirori mpuzamahanga bya firime. Filime ifatwa nkimwe muma firime meza yo muri Afrika. Ikinamico yabanje kwandikwa na Geva Ren\u00e9. "}
{"id": "9458", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9458", "title": "Selbe: One Among Many", "text": "Selbe: One Among Many (mu ntangiriro nka Selb\u00e9 et tant d'autres, ni filime ya documentaire yo muri Senegal yo mu 1983 iyobowe na Safi Faye kandi yakozwe na Pierre Hoffmann kuri Faye Films. \nFilime yakiriwe neza kandi yegukana ibihembo byinshi mubirori mpuzamahanga bya firime.\nUmugambi.\nIyi filime izenguruka ku buzima bwa buri munsi bw\u2019umugore wo mu mudugudu wa Senegal, S\u00e9lbe, ikanasuzuma uruhare rw\u2019ubukungu n\u2019imibereho y\u2019abagore bo muri Afurika bo mu cyaro. "}
{"id": "9459", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9459", "title": "Ousmane William Mbaye", "text": "Ousmane William Mbaye (yavutse 1952), yavukiye muri Senegal azwi mu gukora filimi. Mbaye azwi cyane nk'umuyobozi wa documentaire \"M\u00e8re-Bi\" \"ishimwa cyane\" na film Doomi Ngacc, \"Fresque\" na \"Kemtiyu, Cheikh Anta\". Usibye gukora amafilime, ni numu producer mukuru, utunganya umurongo, umwanditsi wa sinema, producer wamahanga, umuyobozi wamafoto, uwandika amajwi, umuyobozi ushinzwe umusaruro, umwanditsi, na producer. \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse mu 1952 i Paris, mu Bufaransa. Nyina, Annette Mbaye d'Erneville akomoka muri senegali. \nUmwuga.\nMbaye yahuguye muri Conservatoire Libre du Cin\u00e9ma Fran\u00e7ais (Konserwatori Yubusa ya Sinema y'Abafaransa). Nyuma yize muri kaminuza ya Paris 8 Vincennes-Saint-Denis aho yatangiriye gukina amashusho. Amaze kubona impamyabumenyi, yimukiye muri Senegali. Nyuma yaje kuba umuyobozi wungirije. Kuva 1990 kugeza 1997, yabaye umuhuzabikorwa nuwashinze Rencontres Cin\u00e9matographiques ya Dakar (RECIDAK). \nMu 1979, yakoze kandi ayobora filime ye ya mbere ya \"Doomi Ngacc\". Mugufi yatsindiye Bronze Tanit mu iserukiramuco rya Filime ya Carthage. Kuva mu 2000, yatangiye gukora documentaire nka \"Pr\u00e9sident Dia\" na \"Kemtiyu, Cheikh Anta\". Mu 2003, yakoze documentaire ngufi \"Xalima la plume\" yerekeye umucuranzi wa Senegal Seydina Insa Wade. Nyuma yaho gato yatsindiye igihembo cya Documentaire muri Festival ya Milan. Mu 2005, yayoboye documentaire \"Fer et verre\", yibanze ku muhanzi wa plastiki wo muri Senegal Anta Germane Gaye. Muri 2008, yakoze \"M\u00e8re-Bi\" ngufi, ishingiye kuri nyina. \nMu mwaka wa 2016, yakoze documentaire yerekana ubuzima bwa \"Kemtiyu, Cheikh Anta\" ivuga ku buzima bw\u2019amateka ya Senegal, umuganga, n\u2019umunyapolitiki Cheikh Anta Diop. Iyi filime yakiriwe neza n'abayinenga kandi yerekanwa mu birori mpuzamahanga bya firime. Yahawe igihembo cya EU / ACP mu iserukiramuco rya Filime na Televiziyo bya Panafrican rya Ouagadougou (FESPACO) 2017. "}
{"id": "9460", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9460", "title": "Saphine Kirenga", "text": "Saphine Kirenga ni umukinnyi wa filime wo mu Rwanda. Ni n'umuforomo. Azwi ku ruhare rwa Kantengwa muri filime y'uruhererekane \"Seburikoko\".\nSaphine Kirenga yatsindiye kenshi igihembo cy'umukinnyi w'umugore mwiza muri Rwanda Movie Awards.\nUbuzima.\nUbwana n'amashuri.\nSe wa Saphine Kirenga ni Kirenga Louis. Yari umunyezamu w'Amavubi na Rayon Sports. Yapfuye Saphine akiri muto. Saphine Kirenga yize ubuforomo mu mashuri yisumbuye. Aho ni ho yavumburiye impano yo gukina filime.\nUmwuga.\nSaphine Kirenga yakinnye filime ye ya mbere mu 2012. Iyo filime yitwa \"Amapingu y'Urukundo\". Nyuma yamenyekanye ku ruhare rwa Kantengwa muri \"Seburikoko\". Yatsindiye igihembo cy'umukinnyi w'umugore mwiza muri Rwanda Movie Awards imyaka itatu ikurikiranye.\nMuri Werurwe 2020, Rwanda International Movie Awards zatanzwe bwa mbere. Saphine Kirenga yatsindiye igihembo cy'umukinnyi w'umugore mwiza (\"Best Actress\"), kubera filime \"Shady Commitment\". Iyo filime yatsindiye kandi igihembo cya filime ndende nziza."}
{"id": "9461", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9461", "title": "Uwamwezi Nadege", "text": "Uwamwezi Nadege (yavutse 1993), ni umukinnyi wa filimi mu Rwanda. Umwe mu bakinnyi ba filime bazwi cyane muri filimi zo kuri televiziyo mu Rwanda, Nadege azwi cyane ku mazina nka Nana cyangwa Catherine mu biganiro bya televiziyo, nka \"City Maid\". Usibye gukina, ni n'umuririmbyi n'umunyamideri.\nUbuzima bwite.\nUwamwezi Nadege Yavutse mu 1993 mu Rwanda. Yafunguye butike yitwa 'Nana Fashion Shop' ifite izina rye. Afite umwana umwe w'umuhungu umwe kuva yashyingirwa bwa mbere, witwa Ganza Benny Lucky. Nk\u2019uko ibihuha bivugwa, ngo yaba akundana n'umuririmbyi Kizito Mihigo. Ariko nyuma yaje kubihakana, avuga ko ari inshuti gusa. Icyakora, vuba aha byavuzwe ko bategura ubukwe. Icyakora, yongeye guhakana ibyo aregwa. Uwamwezi Nadege nibwo muri 2021, ahari mu kwezi ku gushyingo, aha nibwo Nana yafashe indege yerekeza mu Bubiligi ku mugabane w'iburayi, aho niho ndetse aho umugabo bashakanye aba ndetse atuye ndetse anakorera. Mu kiganiro yagiranye n'itangazamakuru nuko Nana yavuze ko ibintu ahanini urebye byamugoye kumva ageze i Burayi ari byinshi bitandukanye ariko cyane cyane n' ibiryo, ikirere no kuba nta bantu baziranye, ibaze nawe se nkubu uyu muturanyi waha dutuye ntabwo rwose yagusuhuza, ariko iwacu mu Rwanda umuturanyi aba ari nk\u2019umuvandimwe wawe agutira ikintu na we akagutiza ikindi ariko hano rwose umuntu aranapfa ukigira ku kazi ke ahubwo agahamagara polisi ngo ko murimo kugufungira umuhanda wabo. \nAmashuri yize.\nUwamwezi Nadege yize amashuri yisumbuye muri APAKAPE, aho yize ibijyanye na Computer Science and Management, aho yabonye impamwabumenyi ya A2, aho mbere yo kwinjira muri Filime muri 2013. \nUmwuga.\nMbere yo gukina, Nadege yari umuririmbyi waririmbye ku izina rya 'Queen Nadege'. Yari mu itsinda ryitwa 'The Queens' aho baririmbaga 'Ryajambo' mu 2009. Yinjiye muri Kwetu Film Institute yiga ikinamico. Nyuma, yamenyekanye gukina na Kennedy Mazimpaka, amaze kubona ubuhanga bwe bwo gukina i Kwetu. Mazimpaka yamuhaye uruhare ruto muri filime \"Rwasibo\", yaje kuba umukinnyi wa mbere wa sinema. Mu mwaka wa 2016, yakinnye muri filimi ica kuri televiziyo \"Mutoni\" nk'uruhare rwo kuyobora. Nyuma, yakinnye muri firime nyinshi zizwi cyane na zirimo, \"Catherine\" na \"Nkubito ya Nyamunsi\". Muri 2016, yakinnye muri \"City Maid\". filimi imaze kumenyekana cyane m'ubantu kandi yakundaga kwitwa Nana. "}
{"id": "9462", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9462", "title": "Mukakamanzi Beatha", "text": "Mukakamanzi Beatha numukinnyi wa filimi mu Rwanda. Umwe mu bakinnyi ba filime bazwi cyane mu Rwanda, Beatha azwi cyane ku ruhare rwe nka 'Rosine', naho muri \"Giramata\" nka 'nyina wa Giramata'. \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavukiye mu Karere ka Gatsibo.\nUmwuga.\nFilime ye ya mbere yakinnye yaje muri firime \"The Deadly Spear.\" Nyuma ya firime, yakinnye muri firime nyinshi zizwi nka \"Rwasibo\", \"Intare yinngore\", \"Giramata n'inzindi\", \"It's Not the End\", \"Dreams\", \"Enemy of Love\", \"Conclusion\", and \"Make Milk\".. Hanyuma yinjiye muri serivise izwi cyane ya \"City Maid\". "}
{"id": "9463", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9463", "title": "Didier Kamanzi", "text": "Didier Kamanzi (yavutse ku ya 11 Ugushyingo 1985) ni umukinnyi wa filime wo mu Rwanda. Azwi ku izina rya Max Well, umupolisi yakinnye muri filime \"Rwasa\".\nDidier Kamanzi akina kandi rugby mu ikipe y'igihugu y'u Rwanda. Ni n'umunyabugeni.\nUbuzima.\nUbwana.\nDidier Kamanzi yavutse ku ya 11 Ugushyingo 1985, mu Uburundi. Ni umwana wa gatatu mu muryango w'abana batandatu. Nyuma yatahutse mu Rwanda. Mu 2017, yari atuye i Nyamirambo, mu mujyi wa Kigali.\nUmwuga.\nDidier Kamanzi yatangiye gukina filime mu 2010. Yamenyekanye muri filime \"Rwasa\", aho yakinnye ari umupolisi witwa Max Well. Yakinnye kandi muri filime nyinshi, nka \"Ryangombe\", \"Rwasibo\", \"Igitekerezo\", \"Catherine\", \"Urugamba\" na \"City Maid\".\nMu 2017, Kamanzi yari mu bakinnyi 10 b'abagabo bahataniraga igihembo cy'umukinnyi ukunzwe cyane wa 2016 muri Rwanda Movie Awards.\nDidier Kamanzi akina rugby. Mu 2011, yari kapiteni w'ikipe y'igihugu y'u Rwanda, Silverbacks, mu mukino wa rugby w'abakinnyi 15. Mu 2017, yakiniraga ikipe ya Thousand Hills RFC. Ni n'umunyabugeni ushushanya amashusho."}
{"id": "9464", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9464", "title": "Satanskoraal", "text": "Satanskoraal ni filime y'ibikorwa yo muri Afurika y\u2019Epfo 1959 iyobowe na Elmo De Witt kandi yakozwe na Jamie Uys kuri Jamie Uys Filmproduksies. Niyo filime ya mbere yo muri Afrika yepfo yafashwe amashusho mumazi.\nUmugambi wa firime uzenguruka umukinnyi ukize ninzobere muri korali ifasha abahanga kuvumbura uduce twa korali yabuze ku nkombe za Mozambike. Muri iyi filime hagaragaramo Ponie de Wet mu mwanya wa mbere hamwe na Tessa Laubscher, Gabriel Bayman na Lindea Bosman mu nshingano zabo. "}
{"id": "9465", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9465", "title": "The Great Kimberley Diamond Robbery", "text": "The Great Kimberley Diamond Robbery(Die Groot Diamantroof van Kimberley), na none mu ikinamico nka The Star of the South, ni filime yo mu 1911 yo muri Afurika y'Epfo y'Abirabura n'umweru byicecekeye iyobowe na RCE Nissen kandi ikorwa na Rufe Naylor muri sosiyete ya Springbok. Iyi niyo filime yambere yikinamico yo muri Afrika yepfo mumateka ya sinema yo muri Afrika yepfo. "}
{"id": "9466", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9466", "title": "Man in die Donker", "text": "Man in die Donker (Man in the Dark), ni filime yo mu 1962 yo muri Afurika y'Epfo y'Abirabura n'abazungu Neo-noir iyobowe na Truida Louw Pohl ikaba yarayikoranye na Aletta Gericke, Truida Louw na Ren\u00e9e van der Walt kuri Trio-Films. Iyi niyo filime yambere yo muri Afrika yepfo iyobowe numugore mumateka ya sinema yo muri Afrika yepfo. Muri iyi filime hagaragaramo Babs Laker na Dawid van der Walt mu mwanya wa mbere hamwe na Cor Nortj\u00e9, Mathilde Hanekom na Elsa Fouch\u00e9 mu nshingano zabo. "}
{"id": "9467", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9467", "title": "Majuba: Heuwel van Duiwe", "text": "Majuba: Heuwel van Duiwe (Majuba: Hill ya inuma), ni filimi yakozwe muri 1968 muri Afurika y'Epfo iyi film iyoborwa na Dawidi Millin afatanyije na Roscoe C. Behrmann na Hyman Kirstein. Muri iyi filime hagaragaramo Roland Robinson, Reinet Maasdorp, na Patrick Mynhardt mu bakinnyi ba mbere hamwe na Siegfried Mynhardt, Anna Neethling-Pohl na Morn\u00e9 Coetzer mu nshingano zabo. \nFilime yatewe inkunga nibyabaye mu Ntambara ya mbere ya Anglo-Boer, Intambara yo ku musozi wa Majuba\nFilime yakiriwe neza kandi yegukana ibihembo byinshi mubirori mpuzamahanga bya firime. Filime yumwimerere yo gusohora sinema yakoresheje amasaha agera kuri atatu nyamara abayagurisha baho bagabanije firime kugirango berekane burimunsi kuko yari ikunzwe cyane: verisiyo yagufi ni ibisigaye byose byaciwe mbere kandi amashusho ntiyigeze abikwa."}
{"id": "9468", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9468", "title": "The Fourth Reich (film)", "text": "The Fourth Reich (El Cuarto Reich), ni filime yerekana ikinamico yo muri Afurika y'Epfo mu 1990 iyobowe na Manie van Rensburg ikaba yarayikoranye na Gert Basson, Mark Jaffee, David Selvan, Bill Shapter na Reg Wessels muri Zastron films. Muri iyi filime hagaragaramo itsinda ry\u2019abakinnyi ba Afurika yepfo, Ryno Hattingh yakinnye nka Robey Leibbrandt. Abakinnyi bashyigikiwe barimo Marius Weyers, Grethe Fox na Percy Sieff. Inkunga nayo yari nyinshi bakina amakinamico yo muri Afrika yepfo. \nIyi filime ivuga ku buzima Robey Leibbrandt, umukinnyi w'iteramakofe wo muri Afurika y'Epfo witabiriye imikino Olempike yo mu 1936 yabereye i Berlin. Mugihe mu mikino yakundwaga nabanazi agerageza kumushakira umukozi muri Afrika yepfo. Leibbrandt yakiriye ingengabitekerezo y'Abanazi, byaje kurangira abaye umukozi wa Abwehr kuri Reich ya gatatu. Nkumukozi wa Abwehr, mu 1939 Leibbrandt yayoboye igikorwa cyo guhirika guverinoma y\u2019Afurika yepfo ishyigikiye ubumwe, ndetse no kwica Jenerali Jan Smuts, icyo gihe akaba yari Minisitiri w\u2019intebe w\u2019ubumwe bwa Afurika yepfo.The Fourth Reich niyo yakozwe muri firime ihenze cyane mumateka ya sinema yo muri Afrika yepfo. The Fourth Reich yakinnye neza mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime kandi yakiriwe neza kandi isubirwamo neza."}
{"id": "9469", "revid": "13251", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9469", "title": "Die Rebellie van Lafras Verwey", "text": "Die Rebellie van Lafras Verwey, ni filime yerekana ikinamico yo muri Afurika y\u2019Epfo yo muri 2017 iyobowe na Simon Barnard ikaba yarayikoranye na Katinka Heyns na Genevieve Hofmeyr muri Sonneblom Films and Moonlighting Films Muri iyi filime hagaragaramo Tobie Cronje mu mwanya wa mbere hamwe na Chantell Phillipus, Neels van Jaarsveld na Cobus Visser mu nshingano zunganira. Iyi filime isobanura ubuzima n'umwuga bya Lafras Verwey wakoze nk'umwanditsi mu bakozi ba Leta muri Pretoriya imyaka mirongo itatu. Filime yakiriwe neza kandi yegukana ibihembo byinshi mubirori mpuzamahanga bya firime. "}
{"id": "9470", "revid": "6702", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9470", "title": "Die Storie van Klara Viljee", "text": "Gupfa Storie van Klara Viljee (The Story of Klara Viljee), ni filimi yasohotse muri 1992 muri Afurika y\u2019Epfo iyoborwa na Katinka Heyns na vyahinguwe n'Ivyabona Chris Barnard kuko Sonneblom Films. Muri iyi filime hagaragaramo Anna-Mart van der Merwe mu mwanya wa mbere hamwe na Regardt van den Bergh, Hennie Oosthuizen na Trix Pienaar mu nshingano zabo. \nIyi filime ivuga ku buzima bwa Klara Viljee, umukobwa wo mu mudugudu muto wo kuroba igihe yabuze se n'umukunzi we mu nyanja. Filime yakiriwe neza kandi yegukana ibihembo byinshi mubirori mpuzamahanga bya firime."}
{"id": "9471", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9471", "title": "Debbie (film)", "text": "Debbie, ni Sinema yo muri Afrika yepfo yasohotse muri 1965 iyobowe na Elmo De Witt kandi yakozwe na Jamie Uys kuri Jamie Uys Filmproduksies. Muri iyi filime hagaragaramo Suzanne van Oudtshoorn mu mwanya wa mbere hamwe na Leon le Roux, Gert van den Bergh na Dawid van der Walt mu nshingano zabo. \nFilime irazenguruka umukobwa wumwangavu Debbie Malan wagiye mumujyi agasama atashyingiranywe. Filime yakiriwe neza kandi yegukana ibihembo byinshi mubirori mpuzamahanga bya firime."}
{"id": "9472", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9472", "title": "Daryne Joshua", "text": "Daryne Joshua (wavutse 1992), ni umukinnyi wa firime wo muri Afrika yepfo. Azwi cyane nk'umuyobozi wa firime \"zamamaye cyane Noem My Skollie\" na \"Ellen: Die storie van Ellen Pakkies\". Usibye gukora firime, ni n'umugiraneza, umwanditsi, uwashushanyije animasiyo, uwashushanyije amajwi, itangazamakuru n'umuyobozi ushinzwe itumanaho. \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavukiye kandi akurira i Cape Town. Yize mu ishuri ryisumbuye rya Livingstone. Ni umwarimu kuri Sinema n\u2019Ubushakashatsi bwa Sinema muri Cape Peninsula, Kaminuza y\u2019ikoranabuhanga. \nUmwuga.\nAfite imyaka irindwi, yatangiye gukina muri filimi ngufi. Muri kiriya gihe, yakoze no kugurisha imigani mu inshuti ze muri Bridgetown. Nyuma yaje kwiga muri AFDA, Ishuri ryubukungu bwo guhanga no kubona impamyabumenyi itandukanye. Niwe washinze, umwanditsi akaba n'umuyobozi wa Gambit Films yashinze akimara kurangiza. Gambit Films yakoze ikinamico ya mbere ya Afrikaans ya Cape Town, \"Suidooster\" ica kuri DSTV na Kyknet. \nMuri 2016, yayoboye filime ye ya mbere \"Noem My Skollie\". Filime yatoranijwe nkuwinjiye muri Afrika yepfo muri Filime nziza y\u2019ururimi rw\u2019amahanga mu bihembo bya 89 bya Academy. Iyi filime yatsindiye ibihembo bya RapidLion kubera amashusho meza na Filime nziza yo muri Afurika y'Epfo muri 2017. Intsinzi ya firime, yakoze film ye ya kabiri yerekana \"Ellen: Die storie van Ellen Pakkies\". Byari bishingiye ku nkuru y'impamo ya Ellen Pakkies. Iyi filime yerekanwe bwa mbere ku isi mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya Filimi Rotterdam (IFFR) ku ya 27 Mutarama 2018 kandi ryishimiwe cyane. Yasohotse muri Afurika y'Epfo ku ya 7 Nzeri 2018. Muri 2018, yanditse inyandiko ya firime ngufi \"nimero 37\" iyobowe na Nosipho Dumisa. Inyandiko yaje gutsindira igihembo cya Afurika yepfo Filime na Televiziyo (SAFTA). "}
{"id": "9473", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9473", "title": "Dirk de Villiers", "text": "Dirk de Villiers (26 Nyakanga 1924 - 28 Ukuboza 2009), yari umukinnyi wa filime wo muri Afurika y'Epfo. Ufatwa nk'umukinnyi wa filime wamamaye cyane na 'Godfather' mu nganda za firime zo muri Afurika y'Epfo, de Villiers yakoze filime nyinshi zishimwa cyane mu mwuga umaze imyaka irenga mirongo itandatu. \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse ku ya 26 Nyakanga 1924 mu isambu ya Villieria i Douglas, mu majyaruguru ya Cape, muri Afurika y'Epfo mu muryango ufite barumuna be batanu. Nyina yapfuye afite imyaka ine naho se ni umuhinzi wakomeje guhinga yarazwe na Cornelius Valkenburg de Villiers. Nyina amaze gupfa, Dirk na murumuna we Niel boherejwe kwa nyirasenge. Nyuma yaje gukurira ku nkombe z'umugezi wa Vaal aho yagiye mu mashuri menshi yo muri Jagersfontein, Marquard na Betelehemu. \nYashakanye n'umukinnyi wa filime Addy kuva 1950 kugeza yahukanye mu 1973. Abashakanye babyaranye abana batanu barimo Gys de Villiers. Gys kandi ni umukinnyi w'icyamamare akaba n'umwanditsi w'amakinamico muri sinema no muri Afurika y'Epfo. Yagiranye umubano na Miems Swanepoel imyaka mike kuva 1992. \nKu ya 24 Ukuboza 2009, yahuye n'indwara y'umutima maze yihutira kujya mu bitaro by'Urwibutso rwa Chris Barnard i Cape Town. Icyakora, yapfuye ku ya 28 Ukuboza 2009 afite imyaka 89, azize indwara y'ibihaha no kunanirwa k'umutima. \nUmwuga.\nMu 1942, de Villiers yatangiye gukina amakinamico menshi ya Johannesburg Afrikaans Amateur Abakinnyi (JAATS). Hanyuma yashinze ishyirahamwe ryamakinamico hamwe na Schalk Theron. Hamwe n'ikinamico, yize ibijyanye n'ubukanishi, aho yaje gukorera ku cyambu cya Cape Town. Hanyuma yagiye i Londres mu masomo y\u2019ubuhanga bwo mu nyanja. Amaze kugaruka, yabaye injeniyeri w'ubwato.\nYatangiye umwuga wa film nkumukinnyi wa film \"Kruger Millions\" iyobowe na Ivan Hall. Muri filime, yakinnye nk'umuhemu wo mu mutwe wa Cavalier wiyahuye. Yakinnye kandi muri firime,, Kniediep, Kruger miljoene en Stadig oor die klippe. \"Tunga niggie yanjye\", \"Kavaliers\". Yayoboye filime ye yambere \"yumukobwa Jy Is My Liefling\". Iyi filime yakinnye na Franz Marx mu nshingano ze za mbere na Min Shaw. Nyuma yo gutsinda mubucuruzi muri firime, yakoze firime \"zamamaye, Die Geheim Van Nantes\". Filime yahinduwe na serivise izwi cyane ya Springbok Radio, ikinwamo amajwi yose. Mu 1968 yakoze firime ye yambere yuzuye, \"You Are My Darling\" kandi ashingwa nkumukinnyi wa firime wabigize umwuga. \nMu 1972, de Villiers yakoze firime ishimishije \"My Broer Se Bril\". Hanyuma mu 1974, yayoboye filime ebyiri \"Met Liefde Van Adele\" na \"Nyiricyubahiro\". Hagati aho, mu 1976, yakoze filime ye ya mbere \"yamamaye ku\" \"rwego mpuzamahanga Glenda\" na Die diamantjagters. Mu 1978, yakoze ikinamico \"yerekanwe na euthanasiya yitwa Besluit om te sterf\". Hagati aho, de Villiers yashinze Roodepoort Amateur Theatre Organisation (RATO). Zimwe muri firime yakunzwe cyane zirimo: \"Geheim van Nantes\", \"Kalahari Harry\", \"Die Spaanse Vlieg\", \"Daan en Doors op die dieggins\", \"Broer se bril\", \"Tant Ralie se losieshuis\", \"Die lewe sonder jou\", \"Die drie Van der Merwes\", \"Met liefde van Ad\u00e9le\", \"My naam ni Dingetjie\", \"Witblits en Peach Brandy\", \"Dingetjie en Idi\", \"Die wit sluier en Kaalgat tussen bapfa daisies\". "}
{"id": "9474", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9474", "title": "Arende (film)", "text": "Arende, ni Sinema yo muri Afurika y\u2019Epfo 1994 iyobowe na Dirk de Villiers. Muri iyi filime hagaragaramo Ian Roberts na Gavin van den Berg mu mwanya wa mbere hamwe na Diane Wilson, Keith Grenville na Percy Sieff mu nshingano zabo. \nIyi filime ivuga ibyerekeranye n\u2019Intambara ya Anglo Boer nubuzima bwumuhinzi wigometse Boer Sloet Steenkamp na Kapiteni wingabo zUbwongereza James Kerwin. Filime yakiriwe neza kandi yegukana ibihembo byinshi mubirori mpuzamahanga bya firime. "}
{"id": "9475", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9475", "title": "Raouf J Jacob", "text": "Raouf J. Jacob (wavutse 1988 muri Siyera Lewone, Afurika y'Iburengerazuba), ni umukinnyi wa firime, producer akaba n'umuyobozi wa firime. Jacob azwi cyane kubera filime nyinshi yatsindiye ibihembo muri filime za \"Siyera Lewone:\" \"A Culture of Silence\". Ni n'Umuyobozi Nshingwabikorwa &amp; Rurema akaba n'uwashinze sitidiyo / filime za Worldwide Cinema Frames LLC hamwe na Global Cinema Film Festival ya Boston (GCFF) yashinze mu 2006. \nUmwuga.\nMu 2005, yakoze filime CRY\",\" \"America\", yakoze ubushakashatsi ku byago bibabaje no gukurikira. Yakoze kandi urukurikirane \"a Blind World\"\".\". Uruhererekane rwasesenguye Umunyagitugu w\u2019Abanazi Adolf Hitler ' Igisubizo cya nyuma cy\u2019ikibazo cy\u2019Abayahudi ', Jenoside yo mu Rwanda yo mu 1994, itsembabwoko rya Darfur muri Sudani, itotezwa ry\u2019umuryango wa Baha'i muri Irani ndetse n\u2019ingoma y\u2019uwahoze ari intwazangabo Pablo Escobar muri Kolombiya. \nMuri 2014, Jacob yashyize ahagaragara film documentaire \":\" \"A Culture of Silence\" Yabaye umuyobozi, umwanditsi, producer, umukinnyi wa cinemateri, umwanditsi hamwe nivanga amajwi ya firime. Iyi filime yatsindiye ibihembo byinshi, harimo Filime nziza mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya Filime rya New York City 2014, iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime rya Boston 2014, ndetse n\u2019iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya Roxbury 2014. Iyi filime kandi yerekanwe ku Isoko rya Filime rya Cannes 2014 (March\u00e9 du film de Cannes), Iserukiramuco rya Filime rya Afurika rya Silicon n'ibindi! "}
{"id": "9476", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9476", "title": "Survivors (2018 film)", "text": "Survivors, ni filime ya documentaire ya Siyera Lewone yo muri 2018 - iyobowe na Banker White, Anna Fitch, Lansana Mansaray, na Arthur Pratt. Iyi filime yakozwe n'abayobozi bane ubwabo hamwe na Sara Dosa, Samantha Grant, Justine Nagan, na Chris White. Iyi filime ikurikira icyorezo cya Ebola gikwirakwira muri Siyera Lewone cyanduye abantu 8.704 ikica 3.589 n'uburyo intwari za Siyera Lewone zirandura iki cyorezo. \nFilime yakiriwe neza kandi yegukana ibihembo byinshi mubirori mpuzamahanga bya firime. Iyi filime yatorewe kuba Emmy's Best Social Issue Documentaire mu 2018, ibaye filime ya mbere yo muri Afurika y'Iburengerazuba yakiriye igihembo. "}
{"id": "9477", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9477", "title": "Wako (film)", "text": "Wako, ni Sinema ya Uganda yasohotse 2015 iyobowe na Zziwa Aaron Alone kandi yafatanije n\u2019umuyobozi ubwe hamwe na Natuhwera Brighton na Wamasebu Eric kuri Zaron Motion Pictures, Brina Motion Pictures na Punchside Filmz. Nibisobanuro bya firime yambere \"Hadithi za Kumekucha: TUNU\". Muri iyi filime hagaragaramo Geoffrey Echakara mu mwanya wa mbere mu kuyobora hamwe na Natuhwera Brighton, Robert Ernest Bbumba na Zziwa Aaron Alone mu nshingano zabo. \nIyi filime yafashwe amashusho hagati ya 2014 kugeza hagati ya 2015 mucyaro no mu mijyi ya Kampala. Iyi filime ivuga ku nkuru y\u2019umugizi wa nabi w\u2019igitsina gabo w\u2019imyaka 23 witwa Wako wavuye muri gereza akabahambiriye gutangira ubuzima bushya, ariko yaje kumenya ko mushiki we arwaye kanseri. \nfirime yagiye ahagaragara binyuze ku mbuga nkoranyambaga. Iyi filime yerekanwe bwa mbere ku ya 1 Ukwakira 2016 muri Theatre La'bonita. Iyi filime yakiriwe neza kandi yegukana ibihembo byinshi mu birori mpuzamahanga bya firime. Muri 2015, iyi filime yatsindiye igihembo cya Filime nziza cyane mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya filime rya Arusha muri Tanzaniya."}
{"id": "9478", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9478", "title": "Albert Samama Chikly", "text": "Albert Samama Chikly (24 Mutarama 1872 - 28 Ukuboza 1934), yari umukinnyi wa firime akaba n'umufotozi. Ufatwa nk'imwe mu nkingi za mbere muri Sinema y'isi, Albert yari umufotozi, umukinnyi wa firime, technophile, adventure, umunyonzi w'amagare akaba n'umupayiniya wa Seventh Art.i. \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse ku ya 24 Mutarama 1872 i Tunisi, muri Tunisiya, avukira mu muryango ukize wa Tunisiya ukomoka mu Bayahudi. Se David Samama, yari umunyamabanki wa Bey washinze ikigo cya banki nyuma gihinduka Banki ya Tuniziya. Nyina yari umugore wo mu rugo. Albert yakomereje amasomo ye hamwe na Charles Lavigerie hanyuma akorana n'Abayezuwiti i Marseille. Yari ingenzi yagiye muri Cape Horn, Ubushinwa na Ositaraliya kenshi ndetse akiri muto. Yakiriye izina rye 'Chikli' mu buvandimwe bw'abashinzwe kuzimya umuriro bo ku kirwa cya Chikly, ikirwa gito ku kiyaga cya Tuniziya. \nYashakanye na Bianca Ferrero, umugore wavukiye mu Butaliyani ukomoka i Savoy, wari umucuranzi. Abashakanye bari bafite umukobwa umwe Hayd\u00e9e Tamzali. Nyuma yaje kubona ubwenegihugu bw'Ubufaransa maze yinjira mu idini rya Isilamu n'umuryango we. Albert yapfuye mu 1934 muri Tunisiya afite imyaka 62 ashyingurwa mu irimbi rya Borgel.\nUmurage.\nMu 1996, filime ngufi ya biografiya \"Albert Samama Chikli, yafashe amashusho yimashini zisekeje\" yayobowe na Mahmoud Ben Mahmoud mu cyubahiro Albert Samama."}
{"id": "9479", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9479", "title": "Assouma Adjik\u00e9", "text": "Sanni Assouma Adjik\u00e9, ni umukinnyi wa firime wa Togo. Azwi cyane nk'umuyobozi wa firime ngufi \"Le Dilemme d'Eya\". \nUmwuga.\nMu 1995, Assouma Adjik\u00e9 yayoboye filimi ngufi ebyiri: \"L'Eau sacree\" na \"Femmes Moba\". Yakoze filime ye ngufi \"Le Dilemme d'Eya\" mu 2002. Iyi filime yakozwe na UNESCO ihabwa ibihembo bibiri bidasanzwe by\u2019abacamanza: Union Economique et Mon\u00e9taire Ouest Africaine (UEMOA) na Plan International mu iserukiramuco rya Filimi na Televiziyo bya Panafrican rya Ouagadougou (FESPACO). Muri Gicurasi 2003, filime yatoranijwe kugirango yerekanwe mu nama mpuzamahanga ya televiziyo ya Leta (INPUT). "}
{"id": "9480", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9480", "title": "Fatuma (film)", "text": "Fatuma (mu ikinamico nka Hadithi za Kumekucha: Fatuma), ni Filime yikinamico yo muri Tanzaniya 2018 iyobowe na Yorodani Riber kandi ikaba yarakozwe n\u2019umuyobozi ubwe hamwe n\u2019ababyeyi be; John Riber na Louise Riber. Nibisobanuro bya firime yambere \"Hadithi za Kumekucha: TUNU\". Muri iyi filime hagaragaramo Beatrice Taisamo mu mwanya wa mbere hamwe na Ayoub Bombwe na Cathryn Credo mu nshingano zabo.\nIyi filime ivuga ku buzima bwo mu cyaro bw\u2019umugore n\u2019umukobwa we aho ahura n\u2019ibibazo byinshi iyo umugabo abangamiye ubuzima bwumukobwa we. Yafatiwe amashusho mu karere ka Arusha muri Tanzaniya. Iyi filime kandi yayobowe na radiyo 'Kumekucha' yanyuze muri Tanzaniya muri 2016 na 2017. \nIyi filime yakiriwe neza kandi yegukana ibihembo byinshi mu birori mpuzamahanga bya firime. Iyi filime yatsindiye ibihembo bine mu cyiciro cyihariye cya Filime z'Igiswahiri mu iserukiramuco rya Filime rya Zanzibar 2018 ryerekana amashusho meza, Umukinnyi mwiza, Umuyobozi mwiza, na Sinema nziza. Umukinnyi wa filime Catherine Credo yatsindiye igihembo cyumukinnyi witwaye neza naho Jordan Riber yegukana igihembo cyumuyobozi mwiza. "}
{"id": "9481", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9481", "title": "Thembi Mtshali-Jones", "text": "Thembi Mtshali-Jones (yavutse 7 Ugushyingo 1949), ni umukinnyi wa filime wo muri Afurika yepfo. Ufatwa nk'umwe mu bahanzi bazwi cyane muri Afurika y'Epfo, Thembi azwiho kuba afite uruhare mu biganiro byinshi bya televiziyo bizwi cyane nka \"Sgudi 'Snaysi\", \"Stokvel\", \"Umutangabuhamya\" \"ucecetse\" na Imbewu. Usibye gukina, ni n'umuririmbyi uzwi cyane, umwanditsi w'amakinamico akaba n'umuhanzi wungirije ushinzwe kwigisha muri Global Arts Corps muri Kosovo ndetse n'umutoza muri Kamboje.\nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse ku ya 7 Ugushyingo 1949 i Sabhoza, umudugudu uri hafi ya Ulundi, Durban, Afurika y'Epfo. Ababyeyi be baratandukanye nyuma gato yo kuvuka kwe. Nyuma yaje gukurira mu mujyi wa KwaMashu aho yarangirije amashuri ye. Mu gihe cy\u2019ishuri, yarasamye bityo ahatirwa kuva ku ishuri. \nMu 1998, yigaga muri kaminuza ya Gallaudet i Washington DC, muri Amerika nyuma aza muri kaminuza ya Louisville, muri Amerika mu 2004. Umusanzu mu bijyanye n'ubuhanzi, yagizwe umuturage w'icyubahiro wa Louisville na Meya maze ahabwa amajwi yo gushimira na Sena ya Kentucky. Nyuma guverineri wa Kentucky yamuhaye izina rya Cyubahiro Kentucky Colonel, icyubahiro cyinshi muri Kentucky. \nUmwuga.\n\"Impano\" ye yo gukina yavumbuwe na Welcome Msomi aho Thembi yakoreye muri Umabatha yumwimerere. Nyuma yinjiye muri 'Musical Ipi Tombi', maze aba umugore wambere nka 'Mama Tembu'. Yakoze ingendo mpuzamahanga nyinshi zirimo West End na Broadway. Nyuma yaje kujya muri Amerika kuzamura umwuga we wa muzika aho yahuye nabacuranzi bakunzwe Hugh Masekela na Miriam Makeba. Bazengurutse u Burayi na Afurika imyaka myinshi. Mu 1987, Thembi yagarutse muri Afurika y'Epfo yinjira mu Isoko ry'ikinamico. Ku ikinamico, yabonye amahirwe yo gukorana na Janice Honeyman muri Black Follies. \nMu Gushyingo 2019, Thembi yahawe igihembo cyitwa The Living Legend Award mu iserukiramuco ry\u2019amakinamico ry\u2019abirabura ryabereye muri Carolina y'Amajyaruguru, muri Amerika kugira ngo atandukanye serivisi yakoreye sinema yo muri Afurika y'Epfo. Muri uwo mwaka, yakinnye mu bicuruzwa byamamaye cyane \"Mama kuri Mama\" mu iserukiramuco ry\u2019imikino ry\u2019abirabura. Ikinamico yari ishingiye ku gitabo cyanditswe na Sindiwe Magona. Nyuma Magona yanditse igitabo kivuga ku mibereho 'Theatre Road: Inkuru yanjye ni inkuru ishishikaje ya Thembi Mtshali-Jones', yasohotse kugira ngo ihure n'imyaka 70 ya Mtshali-Jones. "}
{"id": "9482", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9482", "title": "Tajouj", "text": "Tajouj, ni filime y\u2019urukundo rw\u2019amateka ya Sudani yo mu 1977 iyobowe na Gadalla Gubara. niyo filime yambere yerekana ishusho ya filimi muri Sudani. Ivuga ku nkuru itangaje ivuga ku rukundo rudashimishije rw\u2019abakunzi babiri bagana intwari, yashyizwe mu cyaro cya Sudani y\u2019iburasirazuba, ikanagaragaza umukinnyi uzwi cyane Salah bin Albadya. Ifatwa nka imwe muri firime nziza muri cinema nyafurika. \nFilime yakiriwe neza nabayinenga. Iyi filime yatsindiye Sitati ya Nefertiti, igihembo kinini cya Egiputa mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime rya Cairo mu 1982, inegukana ibihembo mu birori bya firime byabereye muri Alegizandiriya, Ouagadougou, Tehran, Addis Ababa, Berlin, Moscou, Cannes na Carthage. "}
{"id": "9483", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9483", "title": "Xolile Tshabalala", "text": "Xolile Tshabalala (yavutse ku ya 9 Mata 1977) ni umukinnyi wa Afurika yepfo. Azwiho uruhare muri serivise nyinshi za tereviziyo zizwi cyane zirimo \"4Play:Sex Tips for Girls\", \"Secrets &amp; Scandals\", \"Blood &amp; Water\" and \"Housekeepers\". \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavukiye i Vrede, muri Leta y'Ubuntu.\u00a0 Yiswe na nyirakuru ubyara se. Yarangije mu Ishuri Rikuru ry\u2019Ubuhanzi afite icyubahiro ndetse na 'Best Performer Performer'. \nUmwuga.\nMu masomo ye mu ishuri ry\u2019igihugu, Xolile yagize amahirwe yo gukina na Thembi Mtshali-Jones, ari naho yamubereye umujyanama. Bakinnye hamwe mu ikinamico \"Crucible\" yerekanwe ku Isoko ry'Isoko. Uyu mukinnyi wa filime nawe yakinnye. Yakinnye kandi mubikorwa byinshi bya Televiziyo nka, na Soul City season 7, aho yakinnye mushiki we Zama. Ntabwo bigarukira gusa kuri ecran, Xolile yakinnye kandi mumikino itandukanye irimo \"Undi Mwana\". \nMu 2005, yafashe ikiruhuko cyo gukina. Nyuma yagiye muri Amerika kwitabira ishuri rya Filime rya New York. Yagarutse muri Afurika y'Epfo mu mwaka wa 2010 akina 'Noma' muri televiziyo ya \"4Play: Sex Tips for Girls.\" Hanyuma yakinnye cyane yerekana 'Mandi Mbalula' muri serial \"Fallen\", ikinamico yo mu 2011. Muri 2013, Xolile yagaragaye nka 'Gugu' muri \"High Rollers\" yacaga kuri SABC 3. "}
{"id": "9484", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9484", "title": "Winnie (2017 film)", "text": "Winnie, ni filime yerekana ubuzima bwa Sinema yo muri Afrika yepfo yasohotse muri 2017 yayobowe na Pascale Lamche ikanakorwa na Christoph J\u00f6rg na Steven Markovitz kuri Pumpernickel Films, Submarine Films, Big World Cinema. \nIyi filime ivuga ku buzima bwa Winnie Madikizela-Mandela n'urugamba rwe adacogora rwo gukuraho Apartheid muri Afurika y'Epfo. Iyi filime yerekanwe mu rwego rwo kwerekana iserukiramuco ry'uburenganzira bwa muntu 2019. Muri uwo mwaka, Lamche yatsindiye igihembo cy'umuyobozi mwiza wa documentaire mpuzamahanga mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Sundance. Yatowe kandi muri Afurika Movie Academy Awards ibihembo bya Documentaire nziza."}
{"id": "9485", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9485", "title": "Pascale Lamche", "text": "Pascale Lamche (yavutse Nyakanga 1960), ni Umufaransa -Umukinnyi wa firime muri Afrika yepfo. Azwi nk'umuyobozi wa firime nyinshi zizwi cyane harimo \"Stalingrad\", \"Black Diamond\", \"Pakisitani Zindabad\", \"Ubwiza bw'Abafaransa\", \"Ushinjwa # 1: Nelson Mandela\", \"Sophiatown\" na \"Winnie\". Usibye gukora firime, ni na producer, umwanditsi akaba n'umukinnyi wa sinema. \nUmwuga.\nYabonye icyiciro cya mbere cyicyubahiro BA impamyabumenyi yamateka ya none yakuye muri Kaminuza ya Sussex na Sorbonne. Yatangiye umwuga wa firime i Londere mu kigo cyigenga cya firime, Cinema Action, akora mu kigega cy\u2019iburayi cyandika mu 1989. Icyakora, nyuma yaje kwimukira i Paris gushinga ICONE, umushinga wo gukorana na firime na televiziyo. Yagize amahirwe yo gukorera i Londere na Paris nk'umuproducer n'umuyobozi wigenga. Aherekeza hamwe na societe \"ntoya\" yo gukora documentaire. Nyuma yinjiye muri 'La Cie Phares et Balises' maze aba umuyobozi wa International Co-Productions for Kamera Continentales. \nMuri 2017, yakoze filime documentaire \"Winnie\", ivuga ku buzima bwa Winnie Madikizela-Mandela n'urugamba rwe rwo gusenya Apartheid muri Afurika y'Epfo. Iyi filime yerekanwe mu rwego rwo kwerekana iserukiramuco ry'uburenganzira bwa muntu 2019. Muri uwo mwaka, yatsindiye igihembo cy'umuyobozi mwiza wa documentaire mpuzamahanga muri Sundance Festival. Muri Mata 2018, Lamche yasobanuye ko uwahoze ari minisitiri w\u2019umutekano n\u2019umutekano Sydney Mufamadi mu kiganiro n'abanyamakuru. "}
{"id": "9486", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9486", "title": "Jeanne d'Arc Mujawamariya", "text": "Jeanne d'Arc Mujawamariya yavukiye i Kigali, Nyarugenge. Ni umunyapolitiki wo mu Rwanda, kuri ubu akaba ari Minisitiri w\u2019ibidukikije. Yahoze ari Minisitiri w\u2019Uburezi (mu buryo busanzwe, Minisitiri w\u2019Uburezi, Ubumenyi, Ikoranabuhanga n\u2019ubushakashatsi) muri guverinoma y\u2019u Rwanda ndetse na Ambasaderi w\u2019u Rwanda mu Burusiya.\nUmwuga wa politiki.\nKuva mu 2003 kugeza 2005, yabaye umunyamabanga wa Leta ushinzwe amashuri abanza n'ayisumbuye muri guverinoma y'u Rwanda maze mu 2005 aba umunyamabanga wa Leta ushinzwe amashuri makuru muri minisiteri imwe. Kuva mu 2006-Werurwe 2008, yabaye Minisitiri w\u2019uburezi. Muri Mutarama 2008, Mujawamariya yitabye komisiyo y'inteko ishinga amategeko y'u Rwanda ikora iperereza ku gukomeza \"ingengabitekerezo ya jenoside\" mu mashuri yo mu Rwanda. Abadepite benshi bari muri iyo komisiyo banenze Mujawamariya na Joseph Murekeraho, umunyamabanga wa Leta ushinzwe amashuri abanza n'ayisumbuye, kubera ko bafashe ibihano bidahagije ku barimu ndetse n'abashinzwe gutegura integanyanyigisho bakwirakwiza imyumvire yo kurwanya abatutsi mu mashuri. Muri Werurwe 2008, Mujawamariya yagiye kuba Minisitiri mu biro bya Minisitiri w\u2019intebe ushinzwe uburinganire n\u2019iterambere ry\u2019umuryango, uyu mwanya yari afite kugeza muri Werurwe 2011 ubwo yabaga umuyobozi wungirije / umuyobozi w\u2019ikigo cy\u2019ubumenyi n\u2019ikoranabuhanga cya Kigali kizwi cyane mu Rwanda nka KIST.. Mujawamariya yari ku buyobozi bw'ikigo kugeza ku ya 1 Werurwe 2013, ubwo yagenwaga na Perezida w'u Rwanda kuba Ambasaderi mu Burusiya. Ugushyingo 2019, yabaye Minisitiri w\u2019ibidukikije. \nAmasomo.\nMujawamariya yabonye impamyabumenyi y\u2019icyiciro cya kabiri cya kaminuza yakuye muri maze mu 1997 ahabwa impamyabumenyi y\u2019ubumenyi muri chimie yakuye muri kaminuza imwe. Yakomeje kubona impamyabumenyi y'ikirenga. muri chimie physique mu 2001. Arubatse, afite abana batatu n'umugabo we. Azi neza cyane Ikinyarwanda nk'ururimi kavukire, akamenya neza Icyongereza, Ikirusiya, Igifaransa; Igiswahili akivuga neza biringaniye "}
{"id": "9488", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9488", "title": "Depite C\u00e9cile Murumunawabo", "text": "C\u00e9cile Murumunawabo Yavutse 1968 akaba ari umunyapolitiki wo mu Rwanda. Yatorewe kuba mu mutwe w\u2019abadepite mu Nteko ishinga amategeko y\u2019u Rwanda mu 2013. Ni umunyamuryango wa Rwanda Patriotic Front (FPR), uhagarariye Umujyi wa Kigali akaba n'umunyamabanga wa kongere y'abagore ba FPR.\nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nMurumunawabo yavutse 1968 kandi afite Masters mubyigisho byiterambere. \nUmwuga.\nMurumunawabo ni umwe mu bagize urugaga rwo gukunda igihugu cy'u Rwanda (FPR) kandi yatorewe kuba Umutwe w'Abadepite mu Nteko ishinga amategeko y'u Rwanda mu 2013. Mbere, yakoraga mu biro bya Madamu wa Perezida w'u Rwanda. Muri 2013, Murumunawabo yagizwe umunyamabanga wa kongere y\u2019abagore ya FPR. Yongeye gutorerwa kuba umunyamabanga muri 2019 n'amajwi 85.3 ku ijana. "}
{"id": "9489", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9489", "title": "Nyirasafari Esp\u00e9rance", "text": "Nyirasafari Esp\u00e9rance ni umunyamategeko akaba n'umunyapolitiki mu Rwanda, akaba umwe muri ba Visi Perezida ba Sena y'u Rwanda, guhera ku ya 17 Ukwakira 2019. Yashyizweho muri Sena na Perezida w'u Rwanda, ku ya 22 Nzeri 2019. \nMbere yibyo, yabaye minisitiri muri Minisiteri ya Siporo n\u2019umuco, kuva ku ya 18 Ukwakira 2018, kugeza ku ya 22 Nzeri 2019. Mbere yibyo, kuva 5 Ukwakira 2016 kugeza 18 Ukwakira 2018, yari Minisitiri w\u2019uburinganire n\u2019iterambere ry\u2019umuryango. \nAmavu n'amavuko.\nEsp\u00e9rance yavukiye mu Rwanda ku babyeyi babanyarwanda; bombi bishwe muri Jenoside yo mu Rwanda muri 1994, akiri muto. Nyirasafari Esp\u00e9rance ni umubyeyi wubatse akaba nyina w\u2019abana bane barimo abahungu batatu n\u2019umukobwa umwe, Nyirasafari yanabaye umudepite mu nteko ishinga amategeko y\u2019u Rwanda. \nUmwuga.\nMu 2009, yabaye umunyamabanga uhoraho muri minisiteri y\u2019ubutabera mu Rwanda., ku ya 5 Ukwakira 2016, bivugwa ko yari umwe mu bagize Inteko ishinga amategeko y'u Rwanda. Yasimbuye Diane Gashumba aba minisitiri muri Migeprof, wabaye Minisitiri w\u2019ubuzima mu Rwanda. Mu ivugurura ry\u2019abaminisitiri ryo ku ya 31 Kanama 2017, Esp\u00e9rance Nyirasafari yagumanye inshingano ze muri Migeprof. Nka minisitiri ashyigikiye kubahana hagati y\u2019abashakanye kugira ngo bateze imbere umuryango. \nMu ivugurura ry\u2019abaminisitiri ku ya 18 Ukwakira 2018, Esp\u00e9rance Nyirasafari yagizwe Minisitiri w\u2019imikino n\u2019umuco. Yinjiye muri guverinoma ivuguruye ya Perezida Paul Kagame wagabanije abagize guverinoma kuva kuri 31 bakagera kuri 26. Inama y'Abaminisitiri ni abagore 50%, ikora u Rwanda, hamwe na Etiyopiya, ibihugu bibiri bya Afurika byonyine bifite uburinganire muri guverinoma zabo. \nUmuntu ku giti cye.\nEsp\u00e9rance Nyirasafari numubyeyi wubatse. Nyirasafari yigeze kuba umushinjacyaha mukuru wa Repubulika. Esp\u00e9rance Nyirasafari yavuze ko yakoze amahano kubera kwitabira umuhango w'iyimikwa ry\u2019umutware w\u2019Abakono, mu nyandiko yatangaje kuri Twitter isaba imbabazi Perezida Paul Kagame. Kuko abarizwa mu Ishyaka rya FPR-Inkotanyi. "}
{"id": "9490", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9490", "title": "P\u00e9lagie Uwera", "text": "P\u00e9lagie Uwera (wavutse 1974) ni umunyapolitiki wo mu Rwanda, kuva mu 2019 akaba umwe mu bagize Sena y'u Rwanda, atorerwa kuba Senateri uhagarariye iNtara y'Amajyepfo. \nUmwuga.\nP\u00e9lagie Uwera yahawe impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu bumenyi bw'imibereho n'impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu bushakashatsi bwiterambere yakuye muri kaminuza yigenga ya Kigali. Kuva mu 1998 kugeza 2009 yari umwarimu w'ishuri ryisumbuye.\nKuva 2012 kugeza 2019 Uwera yari Komiseri wa komisiyo y'igihugu ishinzwe amatora mu Rwanda. Umwe mu bagize Komisiyo barindwi, yabaye indorerezi ya Commonwealth mu matora rusange ya Botswana 2014. Muri 2018 yongeye kuba indorerezi ya Commonwealth mu matora rusange ya Siyera Lewone ya 2018. \nMuri 2015 yahataniraga itike y'Ishyaka Riharanira Demokarasi no Kurengera Ibidukikije nk'umukandida mu Nteko ishinga amategeko umutwe w'Afurika y'Iburasirazuba, ariko yatsinzwe na Francois Xavier Kalinda. \nMu bakandida 23 bo mu Ntara y\u2019Amajyepfo mu matora y\u2019Abasenateri 2019, Uwera yari umwe mu bakandida batatu batorewe guhagararira Intara. Mu Kwakira 2019, yatorewe gukorera muri komite ishinzwe imyitwarire ya senateri, nk'umuyobozi wungirije wa Chrysologue Karangwa. Mu Gushyingo 2019, Uwera na senateri John Bonds Bideri batowe nta guhatanira guhagararira u Rwanda mu Nteko ishinga amategeko ya Pan-Afrika. "}
{"id": "9491", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9491", "title": "Ahishakiye M\u00e9diatrice", "text": "M\u00e9diatrice Ahishakiye (yavutse 1978) ni umugore akaba umunyarwandakazi, umunyapolitiki wo wu Rwanda, ubu ari mu bagize Umutwe w'Abadepite mu Nteko Ishinga Amategeko y'u Rwanda..Ahishakiye ahagarariye Intara y'Amajyepfo naho akarere ke ni Akarere ka Huye. Ahishakiye mbere yakoraga nk'umwarimu, umunyamabanga w'inama njyanama y'akarere ka Gisagara, ndetse akaba n'umwe mu bagize njyanama y'akarere ka Gisagara mu ntara y'amajyepfo. Mu matora y\u2019abadepite yo mu 2018, Ahishakiye yatorewe kuba mu mutwe w\u2019abadepite nk'uhagarariye abagore mu Nteko ishinga amategeko y'u Rwanda."}
{"id": "9492", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9492", "title": "Speciose Ayinkamiye", "text": "AYINKAMIYE Speciose ni umunyarwandakazi wavukiye mu Rwanda akaba umunyapolitiki wo mu Rwanda, kuri ubu akaba ari umwe mu bagize umutwe w\u2019abadepite mu Nteko ishinga amategeko y\u2019u Rwanda. Ayinkamiye ahagarariye Intara y'Iburengerazuba akaba ahagaririye akarere ka Rubavu ari naho havukiye. Kuva mu mwaka wa 2000 kugeza mu mwaka 2001, AYINKAMIYE yari umwarimu. Kuva mu mwaka 2002 kugeza mu mwaka 2018, yakoraga mu myanya itandukanye mu Nteko ishinga amategeko y'u Rwanda. Muri Nzeri 2018, AYINKAMIYE yatorewe kujya mu mutwe w'Abadepite mu nteko ishinga amategeko y'u Rwanda. AYINKAMIYE ari mubuyobozi bwa KCB Bank Rwanda Limited iyi banki ifite inkomoko ni ikicaro gikuru muri Kenya. "}
{"id": "9493", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9493", "title": "Alvera Mukabaramba", "text": "Alvera MUKABARAMBA ni umunyarwandakazi wavukiye mu Rwanda kuwa 9 Werurwe 1960, ni umuganga w'abana ndetse akaba n'umunyapolitike kuva mu mwaka 1999 kurubu atuye mu murwa mukuru wa Kigali mu Rwanda.\nAmashuri yize.\nHon. Alvera Mukabaramba afite impamyabumenyi y'ikirenga (Doctorate) mu buganga yakuye muri kaminuza ya, iri mu mujyi wa mu igihugu cy' Uburusiya. Ni inzobere mu ubuganga no kwita k'umikurire y' abana (PhD in) ndetse kaminuza yamuhembye impamyabumenyi y'ikirenga (doctorate) muri Philosophy.\nAkazi (umwuga).\nHon. Alvera Mukabaramba yinjiye muri politic y'u Rwanda mu 1999, icyo gihe yari abaye umwe mubagize inteko y'inzibacyuho y'ighugu (National Transitional Assembly) kugera mu mwaka wa 2003. Kuva muri uwo mwaka wa 2003 kugera mu kwezi k' ukwakira 2011, yari umusenateri mu inteko ishinga amategeko y'u Rwanda (Rwanda's bicameral parliament). Kuva tariki ya 10 Ukwakira 2011 yagizwe minisitiri wa leta ushinzwe imibereho myiza n'iterambere muri minisiteri y'ubutegetsi bw'ibanze (Ministry of local government) aho yari asimbuye wari umuze kwitaba Imana mu ibitaro by'Iburuseli mu Bubiligi, kuva icyo gihe, yagumishijwe muri guverinoma kandi agumana inshingano ze mu ivugurura ry'abaminisitiri, harimo n'iryo kuri 31 Kanama 2016, hanyuma akomerezaho kuba umunyamabanga wa leta ushinzwe imibereho myiza y'abaturage kugera mu mwaka wa 2019. Ubu ni umusenateri akaba na visi perezida sena ushinzwe imari n'ubuyobozi kuva 2019 kuzagera 2024 aho manda yabo izaba irangiye."}
{"id": "9494", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9494", "title": "Christine Muhongayire", "text": "Christine Muhongayire (yavutse 1978) ni umunyapolitiki mu Rwanda, ubu ari mu bagize Umutwe w'Abadepite mu Nteko Ishinga Amategeko y'u Rwanda. \nMuhongayire ahagarariye Intara y'Amajyepfo kandi ni umunyamuryango wa Rwanda Patriotic Front. akarere ke ni Akarere ka Nyaruguru. \nMuhongayire ni umuyobozi wa komite ishinzwe imibereho myiza mu mutwe w\u2019abadepite. "}
{"id": "9495", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9495", "title": "Mukabagwiza Edda", "text": "Mukabagwiza Edda (wavutse 1968) yari umunyapolitiki wo mu Rwanda kandi yahoze ari umudipolomate. Kuva 2013, yabaye umudepite mu Nteko Ishinga Amategeko y'u Rwanda. \nMukabagwiza mbere yari minisitiri w\u2019ubutabera muri guverinoma y\u2019u Rwanda (2003\u20132006), kandi yari Komiseri Mukuru akaba na Ambasaderi wa Repubulika y\u2019u Rwanda muri Kanada na Cuba (2007-2013). \nYatorewe bwa mbere mu mutwe w\u2019abadepite mu 2013, yongera gutorwa muri 2018. Ni umwe mu bagize ishyaka rya FPR-Inkotanyi. Muri 2018, Umutwe w\u2019abadepite wamutoye nka Visi Perezida wungirije ushinzwe kugenzura no gushyiraho amategeko.\nMuri politiki.\nEdda Mukabagwiza n'umuntu uzwi muri politiki y'u Rwanda no mu mirimo rusange. Yakoze mumyanya itandukanye muri guverinoma y'u Rwanda kandi yagize uruhare mugukemura ibibazo bya diplomasi., Yabaye Ambasaderi w'u Rwanda mu Bwongereza. Muri urwo rwego, yari ahagarariye inyungu z\u2019u Rwanda kandi ashinzwe umubano w\u2019ububanyi n\u2019amahanga na guverinoma y\u2019Ubwongereza ndetse n\u2019abandi bafatanyabikorwa mpuzamahanga., Yabaye umunyamabanga wa Leta ushinzwe imibereho myiza muri Minisiteri y\u2019ubutegetsi bw\u2019igihugu,byumwihariko yari ashinzwe kugenzura gahunda n\u2019imibereho myiza y\u2019abaturage ku nzego z\u2019ibanze.\nImirimo muri politiki.\nHon. Mukabagiwiza Edda ni Visi Perezida wungirije ushinzwe ibibazo by'Inteko Ishinga Amategeko kuva ku ya 19 Nzeri 2018.\u00a0 Mbere yiki gikorwa, yari Umudepite, Umutwe w\u2019abadepite kuva Ukwakira 2013 kugeza Kanama 2018.\nMbere, Hon. Mukabagiwiza yabaye Komiseri Mukuru akaba na Ambasaderi wa Repubulika y'u Rwanda muri Kanada na Cuba (2007-2013); Umuyobozi w'itsinda rya Commonwealth ry'abakomiseri bakuru muri Kanada (2012-2013); na Perezida w'ihuriro ry'Abadipolomate b'Abanyafurika (AWDF) muri Kanada (2012-2013).\nYabaye kandi Minisitiri w\u2019ubutabera, Guverinoma y\u2019u Rwanda kuva mu Kwakira 2003 kugeza Kanama 2006; Umunyamabanga mukuru wa Minisiteri y'Ubutabera n'imibanire y'inzego (Ugushyingo 2000-Ukwakira. 20030); Umunyamabanga Nshingwabikorwa w\u2019ishyirahamwe rya \u201cHAGURUKA (1999-2000) n\u2019umujyanama mu by'amategeko muri Minisiteri y\u2019ubutabera n\u2019ububanyi n\u2019inzego (1997-1999).\nHon. Mukabagiwiza yakoraga nka \u201cIn ishinzwe amategeko ya\u201d muri minisiteri y\u2019ubuhinzi n\u2019ubworozi (1996-1997) ndetse na Visi Perezida wa Pro-Femmes/Twese Hamwe (1999-2000)\nMubuzima bwe bwose, Mukabagwiza yitangiye gukorera abaturage b\u2019u Rwanda no guteza imbere inyungu zabo haba mu gihugu ndetse no hanze yacyo. Uruhare rwe muri guverinoma na diplomasi rwagaragajwe n'ubushake bwe bwo guteza imbere gahunda y\u2019iterambere ry\u2019u Rwanda no gushimangira umubano n\u2019ibindi bihugu."}
{"id": "9496", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9496", "title": "M\u00e1rio Bastos", "text": "M\u00e1rio Bastos (wavutse 1986), uzwi cyane ku izina rya stage Fradique, ni Umukinnyi wa firime muri Angola. Azwi cyane nk'umuyobozi wa firime \"zizwi\" cyane Alambamento, \"Independ\u00eancia\" na \"Ar Condicionado\". Usibye kuyobora, ni n'umwanditsi, producer, umuyobozi wungirije hamwe n'umwanditsi.\nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse mu 1986 i Luanda, muri Angola. \nUmwuga.\nMu mwaka wa 2008, Fradique yize muri New York Film Academy maze ahabwa impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu buhanzi bwiza (kuyobora) muri Academy ya Art University i San Francisco. Muri 2009, yakoze film ye ya mbere ngufi, \"Alambamento\". Iyi filime yatsindiye igihembo cya Filime ngufi nziza mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya sinema rya Luanda kandi yari ihitamo ryemewe mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime rya Vancouver ndetse na Tenerife International Film Festival. \nMu mwaka wa 2010, Fradique yashinze isosiyete ikora filimi Gera\u00e7\u00e3o 80 hamwe na Jorge Cohen na Tchiloia Lara. Muri 2011, yize muri Berlinale Talent Campus kugirango akomeze amasomo. Kuva mu 2010 kugeza 2015, yakoze kuri documentaire ye ya mbere yuzuye, \"Independ\u00eancia\". Iyi filime yibanze ku rugamba rwo kwibohora rwa Angola nyuma iza gutsindira igihembo cy\u2019umuco wa Angola ku rwego rwa Sinema. Ifatwa nkimwe muma firime meza yibihe byose muri cinema nyafurika.\u00a0] Iyi filimi kandi ngo yabonye iki gihembo kuko Best documentaire muri Cameron International Film Festival no yari guhitamo Official ku Durban International Film Festival, iLuxor Film Festival Afurika Pan African Film Festival. \nYayoboye kandi amashusho yindirimbo zubuhanzi-abahanzi bo muri Angola nka N\u00e1stio Mosquito na Aline Fraz\u00e3o. Muri 2020, yakoze filime ye yambere yimpimbano, \"Ar Condicionado\", ikaba Iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime rya Rotterdam. Nibwo bwatoranijwe kumugaragaro muri Uganda mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime rya Friborg mu 2020. Yakiriwe neza mu birori mpuzamahanga bya firime. "}
{"id": "9497", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9497", "title": "Kanziza Epiphanie", "text": "Hon. Kanziza Epiphanie ni umunyarwandakazi wavutse mu mwaka 1972 avukira mu muryango w\u2019abana 7 mu murenge wa Gatunda mu karere ka Nyagatare mu intara y'uburasirazuba.\nAmashuri yize.\nKanziza Epiphaie yize amashuri abanza kuva mu mwaka wi 1979-1987 kuri Groupe scolaire Mutumba Nyagatare, bimwe mubyaranze imyigire ye mu ishuri ribanza ni ugutsinda neza amasomo ndetse yatsindwa akababara cyane, ibi\u00a0byamufashije gutsinda neza ibizamini bya leta, bityo akomereza mu mashuri yisumbuye muri Notre Dame du Bon Conseil Byumba ishami\u00a0rya normal technique maze abona amanota meza mu ibizamini bisoza amashuri yisumbuye 77% mu mwaka 1996, akomereza muri Kaminuza yigenga ya Kigali (ULK) mu ishami rya Relation Internationale (Imibanire y\u2019Ibihugu).\nAkazi (umwuga).\nKanziza Epiphaie mu mwaka 1995 yabaye Field Officer in International Red Cross Committee (CICR), 1996 kugera 2004 yigishije muri groupe scolaire Cyabayaga I Nyagatare, mu mwaka 1999-2004: yabaye Coordinator wa CNF Mimuli Sector, Nyagatare District, nyuma yakomeje akazi k'uburezi muri groupe scolaire Bibare I Gatsibo kuva 2005 kugera 2008. 2008-2010: yakoze mu mushinga African Initiative for Mankind Progress Organization (AIMPO) ashinzwe imibereho myiza y\u2019abaturage mu karere ka Musanze. 2010-2014: Minisiteri y\u2019Ubutegetsi bw\u2019Igihugu MINALOC yarihiye abanyeshuri muri Kaminuza ihereye ku bagize amanota menshi nawe azamo yiga Relation Internationale (Imibanire y\u2019Ibihugu). 2016-2018: Mediator Committee Ruhango Cell, Gisozi Sector, Gasabo District. 2012-2020: Coordinator of Women\u2019s Organization for Promoting Unity (WOPU)\nreferences.\n7. https://www.kigalitoday.com/politiki/amakuru/Perezida-Kagame-yakiriye-indahiro-z-Abasenateri-bashya-Amafoto"}
{"id": "9498", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9498", "title": "Eddy Munyaneza", "text": "Eddy Munyaneza (yavutse 24 Ukwakira 1981) ni Umukinnyi wa firime mu Burundi. \"Munyaneza ufatwa nk'umwe mu bakora amafilime akomeye\" mu Burundi, azwi cyane nk'umuyobozi wa documentaire zizwi cyane \"Le troisi\u00e8me vide\" na Lendemains. Usibye gukora firime, ni umwanditsi, producer n'umwanditsi. \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse ku ya 24 Ukwakira 1981 mu mudugudu muto wegereye umujyi wa Gitega mu Burundi. Yarangije amashuri mu 2002. Nyuma yaje kurangiza icyiciro cya gatatu cya kaminuza muri sinema i Saint-Louis, muri Senegali. \nUmwuga.\nMu 2004 yabonye amahirwe yo gukorana na sosiyete yitwa 'Menya M\u00e9dia' aho yatoje ibijyanye no gutunganya amajwi n'amashusho. Muri 2009, yitabiriye nk'umukanishi muri filime ngufi \"Na Wewe\", iyobowe na Ivan Goldschmidt. Iyi filime yaje gutorwa muri Oscars mu 2011. \nMu mwaka wa 2010, yasohoye filime ye ya mbere yerekana \"amateka ya Histoire d'une haine manqu\u00e9e\". Iyi documentaire ivuga inkuru yukuntu barumuna be batutsi na we ubwe yakijijwe nabaturanyi babo b'Abahutu mugihe cya jenoside yo mu Burundi mu 1993. Filime yatsindiye ibihembo byinshi muri Festival International du Cin\u00e9ma et de l'Audiovisuel du Burundi (FESTICAB). Muri uwo mwaka, yahawe igihembo cya Prix Sp\u00e9cial kubera uburenganzira bwa muntu mu Iserukiramuco rya Filime na Televiziyo bya Panafrican ya Ouagadougou (FESPACO). Hagati aho, yahawe igihembo cy'ishimwe na perezida w'u Burundi, Pierre Nkurunziza, i Kirundo. Icyakora, yanenze perezida Nkurunziza kuba yarahataniraga manda ya gatatu. \nMuri 2016 yasohoye film ye ya kabiri ya documentaire, \"Le troisi\u00e8me vide\". Harimo amajwi y\u2019imyivumbagatanyo ikaze y\u2019imyaka ibiri ya guverinoma ya Nkurunziza aho abantu bari hagati ya 500 na 2000 bakorerwa iyicarubozo bakicwa, naho 400.000 bakajyanwa mu bunyage. Amaze gusohora filime, yakiriye telefoni itazwi akangishwa urupfu. Ni yo mpamvu yahunze igihugu mu mpera za 2016 maze atandukana n'umugore we n'abana batatu. Icyakora, yasubiye mu Burundi muri Nyakanga 2016 no muri Mata 2017 kugira ngo abone andi mashusho ya \"videwo ya Le troisi\u00e8me\". Nyuma yumwaka, film yahawe igihembo cyinyandiko nziza muri Guido Huysmans Young African Makers Award (YAFMA). "}
{"id": "9499", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9499", "title": "Vivienne Roumani", "text": "Vivienne Roumani-Denn n'umukinnyi wa firime wumunyamerika. Azwiho kuba umuyobozi wa firime zishimirwa \"Abayahudi ba nyuma bo muri Libiya\" no \"hanze\". Usibye gukora amafilime, ni n'umuhanga mu kuvuga amateka, producer, umukinnyi wa sinema, ushushanya kuvuga n'umwanditsi."}
{"id": "9500", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9500", "title": "Roues libres", "text": "Roues libres (ikidage: Nachtfahrt), ni filime yerekana ikinamico yo muri Cote d'Ivoire 2002 iyobowe na Sidiki Bakaba ikaba yarayikoranye na Ayala Bakaba na Berti Dichi. Muri iyi filime hagaragaramo Adama Dahico, Placide Bayoro, Daouda Traor\u00e9 na Michel Gohou mu nshingano zabo. \nYafashwe amashusho yose muri Abidjan, C\u00f4te D'Ivoire. Iyi filime yakiriwe neza kandi yegukana ibihembo byinshi mu birori mpuzamahanga bya firime harimo umuyobozi mwiza muri l'Association des Professionnels du cin\u00e9ma de C\u00f4te d'Ivoire. "}
{"id": "9501", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9501", "title": "Zeresenay Berhane Mehari", "text": "Zeresenay Berhane Mehari (wavutse 1974), ni umukinnyi wa firime wo muri Etiyopiya. Azwiho kuba umuyobozi wa firime \"zizwi\" cyane Difret na \"Sweetness in Belly\". \nUsibye sinema, ni umwe mu bashinze kandi akaba n'Umuyobozi w'Ibintu by'umwimerere kuri Televiziyo ya Kana, Televiziyo ya mbere yashyizwe ku buntu ku kirere, yigenga muri Etiyopiya. \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavukiye i Addis Abeba, muri Etiyopiya mu muryango ufite barumuna barindwi. Nyuma yaje kwimukira muri Amerika mu gihe murumuna we na mushiki we bimukiye mu Buholandi, undi muvandimwe akaba muri Suwede. \nUmwuga.\nNyuma yo kwimukira muri Amerika, Mehari yize filime muri kaminuza y\u2019amajyepfo ya California School of Cinematic Arts arangiza impamyabumenyi ya Bachelor of Arts. Mugihe yiga, yashinze isosiyete ikora 'Haile - Addis Pictures'. \nYatangiye gukora nkumufasha wibikorwa mubice bibiri: \"Byose kuri Eva\" na \"The seven Year Itch\" muri 2000 ya tereviziyo ya \"Backstory\". Noneho yabaye umufasha wibikorwa byigice \"M * A * S * H: Comedy Under Fire\" muri 2001 Urutonde \"rwamateka vs.\" \"Hollywood\". Nyuma muri 2006, yabaye producer wa \"Leila\" ngufi iyobowe na Hanelle M. Culpepper. Nyuma yumwaka, yakoze firime ye ya mbere \"Coda\". \nMu 2005 yamenyeshejwe na avoka Meaza Ashenafi na murumuna we. Hanyuma hamwe na we, bavumbuye ikibazo cya Hirut Assefa n'umuco wa \u201ctelefa\u201d mugihe bakora ubushakashatsi kuri Meaza no gukorera mumuryango we. \"akoresheje\" ibyabaye, yayoboye filime yumukobwa yitwa Difret muri 2014, yungutse ibitekerezo byiza. Umuyobozi mukuru wa firime yari umukinnyi wa filime uzwi cyane muri Hollywood, Angelina Jolie. Nubwo yagize amahirwe yo gufata amashusho muri 2009, nyuma yaje gutegereza kugeza muri 2012 gufata amashusho kubera ibibazo byo gukina. Iyi filime yagaragaye bwa mbere muri Sundance Film Festival muri Mutarama 2013. Filime yatsindiye ibihembo byabitabiriye iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Sundance, iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Berlin, iserukiramuco rya muzika rya Park City, iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Amsterdam ndetse no mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Montreal. Icyakora, muri Nzeri 2014, muri Etiyopiya herekanywe bwa mbere ku mugaragaro abayobozi ba filime bavuga ko iyi filime yahaye Meaza 'inguzanyo nyinshi'. Ariko, nyuma yaje kurekurwa n'imanza ebyiri kandi ifite ibigwi muri Etiyopiya. \nMuri 2019, yakoze igice cya kabiri, \"Sweetness in the Belly\", film ya kabiri yakinnye na Dakota Fanning na Yahya Abdul-Mateen II. Cyari gifite umwanya wambere mugice cya Discovery cyumunsi mukuru wa firime ya Toronto. Filime yahinduwe nigitabo cyizina rimwe ryanditswe na Camilla Gibb. "}
{"id": "9502", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9502", "title": "Umshana", "text": "Umshana (lit.\u2009'The ' ni filimi yo muri Eswatini black and white drama film iyoborwa na Bi Phakathi na vyahinguwe n'Ivyabona BIP Films isohoka muri 2015. Muri iyi filime hagaragaramo Mbali Dlamini na Delani Dlamini mu nshingano zabo hamwe na Lisa Mavuso, Temakhosi Nkambule, Fineboy Mhlanga mu nshingano zabo. \nNibintu byambere byose- Siswati yerekana firime kandi yafashwe amashusho mubwami bwa Eswatini."}
{"id": "9503", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9503", "title": "Dhalinyaro", "text": "Dhalinyaro (\"Urubyiruko\") ni filime yikinamico ya Djiboutian 2017 iyobowe na Lula Ali Isma\u00efl aho yabaye umuyobozi wa mbere wa firime ya Djiboutian. Yakozwe na diregiteri ubwe hamwe na Alexandra Ramniceanu, Jean-Fr\u00e9d\u00e9ric Samie na Gilles Sandoz kuri Samawada films. Muri iyi filime hagaragaramo Amina Mohamed Ali, Tousmo Mouhoumed Mohamed, na Bilan Samir Moubus mu nshingano zabo. Niyo filime ya mbere yerekanwe mu mateka ya sinema ya Djibouti yagaragaye bwa mbere muri Nyakanga 2017. \nFilime ikurikira abakobwa batatu bakomoka mubyiciro bitandukanye byubukungu. Yatewe inkunga na Organisation de la Francophonie, kandi ikorerwa muri Kanada, Somaliya, Ubufaransa na Djibouti. Yafashwe amashusho yose muri Djibouti. Filime yakiriwe neza kandi yegukana ibihembo byinshi mubirori mpuzamahanga bya firime. "}
{"id": "9504", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9504", "title": "Seasons of a Life (film)", "text": "Seasons of a Life, ni filimi yasohotse 2010 nka Malawi Legal drama film iyoborwa na Shemu Joyah na vyahinguwe n'Ivyabona FirstDawn Arts. Muri iyi filime hagaragaramo Bennie Msuku ayoboye hamwe na Neria Chikhosi, Flora Suya na Tapiwa Gwaza bagize uruhare runini. \nIkinamico yemewe ninkiko yibanze kumukozi wo murugo wasambanijwe numukoresha we uharanira kwiha ku imbaraga no kuzamura imibereho ye. Iyi filime yagaragaye bwa mbere mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime rya G\u00f6teborg muri Suwede ku ya 31 Mutarama 2010. Iyi filime kandi yatorewe ibihembo mu birori bya Kenya, Cairo, na Zanzibar. Yatowe mu byiciro 8 mu bihembo bya 6 bya African Movie Academy Awards, harimo abahatanira ibihembo byiza byerekana amashusho meza hamwe n\u2019umwimerere mwiza. Umukinnyi wa filime, Tapiwa Gwaza yatsindiye igihembo cya Nollywood kubera ibikorwa byiza byakozwe numukinnyi ushyigikiwe."}
{"id": "9505", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9505", "title": "Fahavalo, Madagascar 1947", "text": "Fahavalo, Madagasikari 1947, ni Filime ya documentaire y\u2019intambara ya Malagasi ya 2018 iyobowe na Marie-Cl\u00e9mence Paes kandi yakozwe na diregiteri ubwe hamwe na Agn\u00e8s Contensou, Viviane Dahan muri Laterit Productions, film za Cobra na Silv\u00e3o Produ\u00e7\u00f5es. \nIyi documentaire iragaragaza uburambe bwabanzi ba fahavalo 1947 barwanya abategetsi ba gikoloni cyabafaransa muri Madagasikari nabatangabuhamya bazima. Iyi filime yakiriwe neza kandi yegukana ibihembo byinshi mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime harimo na Documentaire zigihembo cyisi ku nshuro ya 42 ku iserukiramuco rya Filime ku isi ndetse no kuvugwa bidasanzwe mu iserukiramuco rya Filime rya Carthage. "}
{"id": "9506", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9506", "title": "Teresa (2010 film)", "text": "Teresa, ni Filime ngufi Equatoguinean 2010 iyobowe na Thato Rantao Mwosa kandi yakozwe na Library of National Gineya. Iyi filime yanditswe na Guillermina Mekuy Mba Obono, umunyamabanga wa Leta ushinzwe amasomero, Ububiko, Inzu Ndangamurage na Sinema. Muri firime hagaragaramo Elena Iyanga, Betty KB, na Dina Anguesomo mubikorwa byingenzi. Niyo filime ya mbere yo hagati yakozwe muri Gineya ya Ekwatoriya. \nFilime izenguruka mubuzima bwingimbi bwabanyeshuri batatu: Teresa, Roc\u00edo na Yolanda bayobowe nibyabaye. Iyi filime ifite umwanya wa mbere mu kigo ndangamuco cya Esipanye cya Malabo no mu Ishuri Rikuru ry\u2019umuco ry\u2019Abafaransa ryerekana Malabo. Filime yakiriwe neza kandi yegukana ibihembo byinshi mubirori mpuzamahanga bya firime. "}
{"id": "9507", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9507", "title": "Cape Verde, My Love", "text": "Cape Verde, Urukundo rwanjye ni filimi yasohotse 2007 muri Cape Verdean iyobowe na Ana L\u00facia Ramos Lisboa. Muri iyi filime hagaragaramo Neusa Cardoso na Eric Bridges Twahirwa mu mwanya wa mbere hamwe na Olivia Garc\u00eda, Isabel Fontes na Cleophas Kabasita mu nshingano zabo. Filime yakiriwe neza. "}
{"id": "9508", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9508", "title": "The Day of My Wedding", "text": "The Day of My Wedding, ni filime ngufi ya Botswana yo mu 2007 iyobowe na Thato Rantao Mwosa kandi yakozwe na Thato Rantao Mwosa nka SaBantu Productions. Muri iyi filime hagaragaramo Erickka Jones mu mwanya wa mbere hamwe na Souleymane Sy Savane na Audrey Aduama mu nshingano zunganira. \nFilime yafatiwe muri Boston no muri Massachusetts, muri Amerika. Filime yakiriwe neza kandi yegukana ibihembo byinshi mubirori mpuzamahanga bya firime. Iyi filime yagaragaye bwa mbere mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Roxbury, muri Amerika ku ya 4 Kanama 2007."}
{"id": "9509", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9509", "title": "Afarit el-asphalt", "text": "Afarit el-asphalt, ni filmi yasohotse 1996 yo mu Misiri iyoborwa na Oussama Fawzi na yakozwe na Hany Gerges Fawzi afatanyije na Aflam Guirguiss Fawzy. Muri iyi filime hagaragaramo Mahmoud Hemida na Salwa Khattab mu nshingano zabo aho nka Hasan Husni, Lotfy Labib, Gamil Ratib na Mohammed Tawfik bagize uruhare runini. Iyi filime yagaragaye bwa mbere mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Lokarno mu Busuwisi ku ya 11 Kanama 1996. "}
{"id": "9510", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9510", "title": "Abi foq al-Shagara", "text": "Abi foq al-Shagara (Data Hejuru ku Giti), ni filime yo mu Misiri yo mu 1969 ikinamico yerekana urukundo yakozwe na Hussein Kamal ikorwa na Abdel Halim Hafez kuri Sawt al-Fann. Muri iyi filime hagaragaramo Abdel Halim Hafez na Nadia Lutfi mu mwanya wa mbere aho nka Mervat Amin Jenita Furneau, Samir Sabri na Salah Nazmi bagize uruhare runini. \nFilime yafatiwe muri Alegizandiriya no mu micungararo yayo. Filime yabaye amashusho yuwo mwaka cyane kubera gusomana. Filime ifatwa nkimwe muri firime nziza zigeze gukorwa mu Misiri. Nibigaragara bwa firime ya nyuma yakozwe n'umukinnyi wa filime Abdel Halim Hafez mbere y'urupfu rwe ku ya 30 Werurwe 1977 kubera kunanirwa kw'umwijima nk'ikibazo cya \"Schistosoma mansoni\". "}
{"id": "9515", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9515", "title": "Nous aurons toute la mort pour dormir", "text": "Nous aurons toute la mort pour dormir, ni 1977 filime ya documentaire ya Franco - Mauritanian iyobowe na Med Hondo kandi ikorerwa muri Les Films du Soleil \u00d4. \nIyi filime yafashwe amezi 4 kuva ku ya 25 Ukuboza 1975 kugeza ku ya 5 Werurwe 1976, mu gace kahoze ari Sahara ya Esipanye. Iyi filime ivuga ku ntambara yitwaje intwaro ya Polisario Front mu burengerazuba bwa Sahara kurwanya ubukoloni bwa Espagne. Iyi filime yakiriwe neza n'abayinenga kandi yerekanwe mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya sinema rya Berlin mu Budage bw'Iburengerazuba muri Kamena 1977."}
{"id": "9516", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9516", "title": "Gambia: Take Me To Learn My Roots", "text": "Gambia: Take Me to Learn My Roots, ni film ya documentaire ya Gambiya yasohotse 2019 iyobowe na Bacary Bax kandi yakozwe na Bud Sugar. Iyi filime ivuga ku butumwa bw'umubyeyi umwe bwo kwigisha abahungu be b'amoko avanze ku mizi yabo yo muri Afurika y'Iburengerazuba. Filime yakorewe mu Bwongereza (Kingston kuri Hull, East Riding ya Yorkshire) no muri Gambiya (Brikama). Filime yakiriwe neza nabayireba."}
{"id": "9517", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9517", "title": "Y\u00e9yamba Wandz\u00e9 Mdrou Ndo?", "text": "Y\u00e9yamba Wandz\u00e9 Mdrou Ndo?, Ni filimi isekeje yasohotse mu 2000 ituruka muri Comore iyoborwa Arsin Soiby na yakozwe ari HMZ productions. Filime niyo filime yambere yerekana Comoros. "}
{"id": "9518", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9518", "title": "Po di Sangui", "text": "Po di Sangui (Igiti cy'Amaraso), ni filimi y'amakinamico y'AbafaransaBissau-Gineya yo mu 1996 iyobowe na Flora Gomes kandi yakozwe na Jean-Pierre Gallepe. Muri iyi filime hagaragaramo Dulceneia Bidjanque mu mwanya wa mbere hamwe na Djuco Bodjan, Dadu Ciss\u00e9, Adama Kouyat\u00e9 na Edna Evora mu nshingano zabo. \nIyi filime yafashwe nkumugani nyafurika mumudugudu wamashyamba ya Amanha Lundju. Filime yakiriwe neza kandi yegukana ibihembo byinshi mubirori mpuzamahanga bya firime."}
{"id": "9519", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9519", "title": "Mapule's Choice", "text": "Mapule's Choice, ni Filime ngufi yasohotse 2008 iyobowe na KaiKaizer Matsumunyane kandi yakozwe na Tumelo Matobako. Filime ivuga ku buzima bwa Mapule, umusore ukora imyenda ukomoka muri Maseru ugomba guhitamo hagati yo kubika ibanga no kwikiza. Iyi filime yerekanwe kandi itorwa ku mugaragaro mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya sinema rya Zanzibar mu 2009. "}
{"id": "9520", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9520", "title": "Souleymane D\u00e9m\u00e9", "text": "Souleymane D\u00e9m\u00e9 (wavutse 1986) ni umukinnyi wa filimi wo muri Tchad. Azwi cyane kubera uruhare rwamamaye muri film \"GriGris\" yakinnye. "}
{"id": "9521", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9521", "title": "Uwera Pelagie", "text": "Uwera Pelagie yavutse mu mwaka wi 1974 ni umunyapolitiki w'umunyarwandakazi,kuva mu mwaka\nwa 2019 akaba numwe mu bagize sena y'u Rwanda yatorewe kuba senasteri Muntara y'amajyepfo\nku itariki ya 13 ugushyingo 2019 nibwo sens yu Rwanda yatoye umusensteri Pelagie Uwera \nkugirango ahagararire inteko ishinga amategeko yu Rwanda mu nteko ishinga amategeko ya\nPan Africa (PAP) ninzego zishinga amategeko zubumwe bw'Afurika yunze Ubumwe (AU).\nImirimo.\nPelagie na Mugenziwe Bideri biyemeje guharanira iterambere nimibereho myiza y'Afurika\nmu guhangana nubushomeri nubukene ndetse n'umutekano muke. bikaba biri no\nmumpamvu abanyafurika bafata ingendo za hato nahato zo kujya mubihugo by' Iburayi\ninjyendo zishobora no guteza akaga bajya gushaka Imibereho myiza.\nAmashuri yize.\nUwera Pelagie afite impamyabumenyi ihanitse munyigisho ziterambere (Development studies) \nakagira Impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu bumenyi bw'imibereho yakuye muri Kaminuza yijyenga ya Kigali.\nInshingano.\nKuva mu mwaka 2012 kugeza 2019 Pelagie yari comiseri wa komisiyo y'Igihugu ishinzwe amatota\nmu Rwanda. yabaye kandi Indorerezi y'Impuguke za Commonwealth mu matora rusange ya Botsuwana\n2014. muri 2018 yongera kuba Indorerezi ya Commonwealth mu matora Rusange ya Siyera Lewone \nIbindi.\nUwera Pelagie kandi yabaye umwarimu mu mashuri yisumbuye."}
{"id": "9522", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9522", "title": "Mukabalisa Donatille", "text": "Honorable Mukabalisa Donatille,Yavutse muri Nyakanga 1960,Akaba ari\u00a0 Perezida w\u2019Umutwe w\u2019abadepite mu Nteko ishinga amategeko y\u2019u Rwanda.\nUmwuga.\nKuva mu 1981 kugeza 1998, yakoraga muri gahunda y\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye ishinzwe iterambere i Kigali mu myanya itandukanye. Kuva muri Nyakanga 2000 kugeza 2003, yari umwe mu bagize Inteko ishinga amategeko y\u2019inzibacyuho mu Rwanda akaba na Perezida wungirije wa Komisiyo ihoraho y\u2019ubukungu n\u2019ubucuruzi.\nKuva mu 1981 kugeza 1998, yakoraga muri gahunda y\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye ishinzwe iterambere i Kigali mu myanya itandukanye. Kuva muri Nyakanga 2000 kugeza 2003, yari umwe mu bagize Inteko ishinga amategeko y\u2019inzibacyuho mu Rwanda akaba na Perezida wungirije wa Komisiyo ihoraho y\u2019ubukungu n\u2019ubucuruzi.\nMu matora y\u2019abadepite yo mu 2003 yatorewe kuba umwe mu bagize umutwe w\u2019abadepite ku rutonde rw\u2019ishyaka riharanira ukwishyira ukizana kwa buri muntu kandi atorerwa kuba umuyobozi wungirije wa komisiyo ihoraho ishinzwe ibibazo bya politiki n\u2019uburinganire.\nKuva mu Kwakira 2011, yari Umusenateri (Urugereko rwo hejuru) kandi yatowe n'abasenateri kuba Umuyobozi wungirije wa Komisiyo ihoraho ishinzwe ibibazo bya politiki n'imiyoborere myiza.\nNyuma yimyaka ibiri muri Sena, ku ya 4 Ukwakira 2013 yatorewe kuba Perezida w\u2019Umutwe w\u2019abadepite / Inteko ishinga amategeko y\u2019u Rwanda. Hon. Mukabalisa Donatille kandi ni Perezida w'ishyaka riharanira ukwishyira ukizana kwa buri muntu."}
{"id": "9523", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9523", "title": "Murumunawabo C\u00e9cile", "text": "Murumunawabo C\u00e9cile (Yavutse 1968) ni umugore w'umunyarwandakazi akaba ari umunyapolitiki wo mu Rwanda. Yatorewe kuba mu mutwe w\u2019abadepite mu Nteko ishinga amategeko y\u2019u Rwanda muri 2013. Ni umunyamuryango wa FPR Inkotanyi ariwo, Rwanda Patriotic Front (FPR), aho ahagarariye Umujyi wa Kigali akaba n'umunyamabanga wa kongere y'abagore ba FPR.\nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nMurumunawabo yavutse 1968, avukira mu buhungiro, kandi ndetse afite icyiciro cya gatatu cya kaminuza mu iterammbere n'amajyambere. Murumunawabo ari mu Banyamuryango bashinze umuryango Imbuto Foundation, kandi akaba ari umwe mu bagize inama jyanama yuwo muryango. Murumunawabo ni umu Krisito wavutse ubwa kabili.\nUmwuga.\nMurumunawabo ni umwe mu bagize urugaga rwo gukunda igihugu cy'u Rwanda (FPR) kandi yatorewe kuba Umutwe w'Abadepite mu Nteko ishinga amategeko y'u Rwanda mu 2013. Mbere, yakoraga mu biro bya Madamu wa Perezida w'u Rwanda. Muri 2013, Murumunawabo yagizwe umunyamabanga wa kongere y\u2019abagore ya FPR. Yongeye gutorerwa kuba umunyamabanga muri 2019 n'amajwi 85.3 ku ijana."}
{"id": "9524", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9524", "title": "Letekidan Micael", "text": "Letekidan Micael (wavutse 1997), ni umukinnyi wa filimi muri Eritereya. \"Azwiho\" uruhare rwa 'Awet' muri filime Feuerherz ishimwa cyane. \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse mu 1997 i Asmara, muri Eritereya. Igihe \"yakinaga muri firime yintambara ya Feuerherz\", umuryango we wakiriye ubutumwa bwiterabwoba butazwi. Ni yo mpamvu bashatse ubuhungiro bwa politiki mu Burayi. \nUmwuga.\nMu 2008, Micael afite imyaka 10, yakinnye muri filime yo mu Budage \"Feuerherz\", nyuma yitwa Icyongereza nka \"Heart of Fire\". Yerekanwe bwa mbere ku ya 25 Nzeri 2008. Iyi filime yerekanwe mu ntambara yo kwigenga ya Eritereya na Etiyopiya, ikaba yari ishingiye ku mibereho y\u2019umuhanzi w\u2019umudage Senait Mehari wavukiye muri Eritereya. Iyi filime yakiriwe neza n'abayinenga kandi ishima uruhare rwa Micael nk'umusirikare w'umwana, 'Awet'. "}
{"id": "9525", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9525", "title": "Kampeta Pitchette sayinzoga", "text": "Kampeta Sayinzoga ni umuyobozi mukuru wa Banki ishinzwe iterambere ry'u Rwanda(BRD).\nAmashuri yize.\nMadamu Kampeta Sayinzoga yarangije kaminuza mw'iterambere ry'ubukungu nububanyi n'amahanga i Witwatersrand muri afurika y'epfo(South Africa) akomereza impamyabumenyi y'Icyiciro cya Kaminuza (Masters Degree) mw'iterambere ry'ubukungu nisesesengura yakuye muri Kaminuza ya Nottingham.\nAho Yakoze.\nMadamu Kampeta yinjiye muri BRD afite uburambe kubukungu bw'u Rwanda, yabaye umuyobozi w'Ibiro bya Minisitiri w'intebe. Yakoze kandi muri Minisiteri y'Imari n'Igenamigambi aho yagiye akora kumyanya itandukanye kandi yubuyobozi harimo no kuba umunyamabanga uhoraho, Mbere yo kwinjira mu mirimo ya Leta kampeta yakoraga muri Banki y'Isi yakoze kandi munama z'ubutegetsi z'amabanki nka The Trade and Development Bank, Banki y'iterambere y'Afurika y'iburasirazuba(EADB), Rwanda Euro Board Committee, GT Bank, no mu kigo Cy'Igihugu Cy'Imisoro."}
{"id": "9526", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9526", "title": "Blandine Yam\u00e9ogo", "text": "Blandine Yam\u00e9ogo (wavutse 1960), ni Umukinnyiwa filimi muri Burkinab\u00e9. Yakinnye muri firime zishimirwa \"La nuit de la v\u00e9rit\u00e9\", \"Delwende\" na \"Notre \u00e9trang\u00e8re\". Usibye gukora firime, ni numukorikori"}
{"id": "9527", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9527", "title": "Shana Dowdeswell", "text": "Shana Elizabeth Dowdeswell (1 Mata 1989 - 12 Ukuboza 2012), yari umukinnyi wa filime wa Hollywood ukomoka muri Zimbabwe.\nUbuzima bwite.\nDowdeswell yavutse ku ya 1 Mata 1989 i Harare, muri Zimbabwe. Se Roger Dowdeswell yahoze akina umukino wa tennis wabigize umwuga. Nyina Laurie Smith numuproducer wakoze firime \"The New Twenty\". Shana yimukiye mu mujyi wa New York, muri Amerika maze yiga mu Mujyi no mu Gihugu, PS 3, arangije amashuri yisumbuye ya PPAS. Yatangiye umwuga wo gukina afite imyaka umunani, nyuma akina Anne Frank mu bicuruzwa muri Paper Mill Playhouse.Yagiranye umubano muremure numukunzi we Cameron Moneo. Yari afite murumuna we Jesse. Se wabo wa Shana, Colin Dowdeswell, yahoze ari umukinnyi wa tennis wabigize umwuga.\nUrupfu.\nKu ya 7 Ukuboza 2012, Shana yagiye mu mujyi wa New York City Greenwich bar bita The Basement maze anywa amacupa menshi ya whisky. Agarutse, yaratsitaye maze asohoka mu muryango. Ugenda n'imbwa yavumbuye umurambo we atazi ubwenge, yihutira kujya ku kigo nderabuzima cya Beth Isiraheli. Nyuma yipimisha, byagaragaye ko muri kiriya gihe harimo alcool mu maraso 0.39, bikubye inshuro eshanu amategeko leta yemerera gutwara. Yapfuye ku ya 12 Ukuboza 2012. \nUmwuga.\nMu 2002, Shana yagaragaye muri ' \"Miracle\" ' ya Frank Higgins akina nka 'Eva', umukobwa wikunda. Muri 2003 yakinnye nka verisiyo ikiri nto ya 'Jenna' muri film \"13 Going on 30\". Ariko, gukina kwe kwakuwe muri firime nyuma yuko abitabiriye ikizamini bakiriye nabi umwimerere. Nyuma yaje gukina inyuguti enye zitandukanye mubyiciro bitatu byibanze byerekana Amategeko &amp; Iteka franchise. Hanyuma yakinnye muri filime izwi cyane nka \"Mercy\", \"Family of the Year\", and \"Body of Proof\"\".\" Hagati aho, Shana yagaragaye no muri filime \"The Stream\", \"The Winning Season\", \"Asylum Seekers\", and \"Choose\" before her death.\nNyuma y'urupfu rwe mu mwaka wa 2012, hasohotse filime eshanu: \"The Big Wedding\" (2013), a short film \"Going South\" (2013), \"An Ornament of Faith\" (2013), short film \"Wish You Were Here\" (2013), and \"Mistress America\" (2015)."}
{"id": "9528", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9528", "title": "Alois Moyo", "text": "Alois Moyo (yavutse 28 Ukwakira 1966), ni umukinnyi wa filimi mu budage akaba yaravukiye muri Zimbabwe akaba na producer. Azwi cyane kubera uruhare muri firime \"The Power of One\" na \"Iron Sky\" kimwe na \"serivise ya Tatort\". \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse ku ya 28 Ukwakira 1966 i Bulawayo, muri Zimbabwe. Ubu atuye mu Budage. \nUmwuga.\nYatangiye umwuga we nk'umukinnyi wa teatre mu 1986 akina ikinamico \"Citizen Mind\". Mu 1980, Moyo yashinze ikinamico ya mbere nyafurika yitwa 'Amakhosi Township Square Cultural Centre' (ATSCC) muri Zimbabwe ikaba yarakoreshejwe nka karate-club ihinduka ikigo ndangamuco muri Zimbabwe. Kuva mu 2005 ajya mu kuba mu Budage kandi akora nk'umukinnyi wa teatre, firime na TV. Yatangiye gukina sinema mu 1992 akoresheje filime \"Power of One\" iyobowe na John Avildsen aho yakinnye nk'umukinnyi w'iteramakofe wo muri Afurika ndetse no guharanira ubwisanzure. Igihe yabaga mu Budage, yakoze umusaruro we wa mbere mu kidage witwa \"Die Zofen\" mu 2005 hanyuma \"Afurika Montage\" muri 2007. Nyuma yo gutsinda kwayo, yakoze umusaruro wa kabiri mu Budage \"Steinstunde der Menschheit\" mu 2008. "}
{"id": "9529", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9529", "title": "Umar Krupp", "text": "Umar Krupp, ni umukinnyi wa filimi muri Gana na producer. Azwi cyane kubera uruhare muri firime \"House of Gold\" na \"Amakye na Dede\".\nUbuzima bwite.\nYavukiye i Accra, muri Gana.\nUmwuga.\nMuri 2015, yatsindiye igihembo cy'umukinnyi witwaye neza muri Pan Africa Cinema Awards (PACA). Krupp yatowe nka Producer mwiza wa Afurika muri Nollywood Entertainment and Leadership Awards (NELAS) muri 2019 kubera gukora firime \"Accra Hustlers\". Muri 2019, Krupp yayoboye \"Ama\" yasohotse mu ikinamico muri Mutarama 2020. Muri 2018, yakinnye muri filime \"Babani\". Nyuma yaje gutsindira ibihembo bine muri Golden Movie Awards harimo; City People Entertainment Award for Face of Ghana Movies.Muri 2020, umukinnyi wa filime Serwaa Akoto uri hafi kuza yaburiye umukinnyi Umar Krupp ku bijyanye no gutandukana na Krupp no kwishyura ibibazo umukinnyi wa filime. "}
{"id": "9530", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9530", "title": "Quasi Blay Jr.", "text": "Qwasi Blay Jnr., ni umukinnyi wa filimi muri Gana. Azwi cyane kubera uruhare rwe muri firime \"Adoma\" na \"Grilled\". Yagaragaye muri firime cumi neshanu na seri enye za TV. \nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nYavukiye muri Gana nk'umwana wa gatatu mu muryango ufite barumuna be batanu: abagabo bane n'umugore. Yarangije amashuri abanza n'ayisumbuye muri Great Lamptey Mills. Hanyuma yakomereje amashuri muri Aburi Secondary Technical (SHS). Amashuri makuru yayize muri kaminuza ya tekinike ya Koforidua ahabwa impamyabumenyi ihanitse (HND) mu kugura no gutanga. \nUmwuga.\nYatangiye umwuga wo gukina mu 2016 akiri umwana, agaragara muri \"Gray Dust\", \"Grilled\", na serial \"Deju Vu\". Yahawe Best Entertainment Male honor at the tertiary level and best male entertainment act at the maiden edition of the Social Media Entertainment awards. Nyuma yaje gutorwa nk'umukinnyi witwaye neza mu mwanya wa mbere mu nshuro ya 9 ya Gana Movie Awards kubera uruhare muri filime \"Adoma\". "}
{"id": "9531", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9531", "title": "Alphonse Menyo", "text": "Alphonse Menyo, ni umukinnyi wa filimi muri Gana, azwi cyane muri filimi \"Freetown\" and \"Gold Coast Lounge\"\nUbuzima bwite.\nYavukiye i Accra, muri Gana. Se, Bernard Menyo, yakomokaga muri Afurika y'Iburasirazuba. Yahoze ari umunyeshuri w'ikigo cy'igihugu cya Filime na Televiziyo (NAFTI). Bernard yatsindiye igihembo mu iserukiramuco rya Filimi na Televiziyo bya Panafrican rya Ouagadougou (FESPACO) kubera filime \"Whose fault\". Nyina wa Menyo, Eugenia, yakomokaga muri Gana yakoraga mu muryango utegamiye kuri Leta. \nUmwuga.\nMenyo yize muri Ghallywood Academy of Film Acting i Accra, muri Gana yiga sinema namakinamico. Yatangiye umwuga we wo gukina amakinamico mu 2009 akoresheje ikinamico. Muri 2015, yakinnye bwa mbere muri sinema muri filime yigenga y'Abanyamerika \"Freetown\" iyobowe na Garrett Batty. Filime yerekanwe mu birori mpuzamahanga bya firime\u00a0, kandi yatorewe ibihembo byinshi bya Gana Movie Awards. \nMenyo yerekanwe bwa mbere muri firime \"Utopia\". Filime yakiriye ibihembo bine muri Ghana Movie Awards. Muri 2017, \"Utopia\" yabaye firime yonyine yo muri Gana yatowe kandi yerekanwa mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Helsinki (HAFF). Muri 2017, yakinnye muri triller y'urukundo rugufi \"Black Rose\" iyobowe na Pascal Aka. Muri 2018, yinjiye muri Pascal Aka ubutaha, akina muri firime ngufi ya \"Ruswa\". Menyo yatsindiye igihembo cya Yaa Asantewaa mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya Filime rya Black Star kubera uruhare rwe ndetse anegukana igihembo cy'umukinnyi witwaye neza mu bagabo mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya Filimi ryabereye i Kinshasa, muri Kongo.\nMenyo has received several awards and nominations for his acting performances. In 2019, he won the Best Actor award at the Ghana Movie Awards for his role in Gold Coast Lounge. He was also nominated for the same award in 2020 for his performance in the film Last Night in dutamovie21 \nYatoranijwe kugirango ahagararire Gana muri Theatre y'urubyiruko ya 2019 muri Egiputa. Nyuma yumwaka, yakinnye 'Daniel' muri film ya \"Gold Coast Lounge\". Ku ruhare rwe, yatsindiye igihembo cyumukinnyi witwaye neza kurusha abandi muri Gana Movie Awards 2019. "}
{"id": "9532", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9532", "title": "\u00c9talon de Yennenga", "text": "\u00c9talon de Yennenga ni igihembo gihabwa abantu b'icyubahiro bagize uruhare muri ecran ya silver ya Burkinabe, gitangwa na Iserukiramuco rya Filime na Televiziyo bya Panafrican ya Ouagadougou (FESPACO), mu rwego rwo gushimira Filime Nziza. Yatangiye bwa mbere mu 1972, ifatwa nkigihembo cyubahwa muri cinema ya Afrika.\nAmateka.\n'\u00c9talon de Yennenga' bisobanura Stallion ya Yennenga bivuga Umuganwakazi Yennenga, umugani washinze ubwami bwa Mossi, ubwoko bukuru muri Burkinafaso. Inkuru ya Yennenga yatangiriye mu ntangiriro z'ikinyejana cya 12 mu bwami bwa Dagomba bwa Mossi. Abasirikare b'umwami wa Dagomba, Nedega, bari intwari kandi hafi buri gihe batsindaga imbaraga zose. Umukobwa wa Nedega, Yennenga, wari umugore w'ifarashi, kandi yari umuhanga mu gukoresha amacumu, amacumu n'umuheto. \nIgihembo.\nIrasangiwe na Burkina Faso abakora amafilime azwi cyane, Idrissa Ouedraogo. Ouedraogo yatsindiye igihembo cya Yennenga mu 1991 kubera filime \"Tilai\". Uwatsindiye iki gihembo ni Volta\u00efque Kollo Daniel Sanou mu 1983 hamwe na film ye \"Paw\u00e9ogo\" (The Emigrant). \nMuri 2005, FESPACO ya 19, ibihembo bibiri bishya byiswe \"Stallion\". Igikombe cya Stallion Award cyakozwe numucuzi wa Burkinabe Ali Nikim\u00e9a. Igihembo cya Yennenga gisanzwe gihinduka igihembo cyiza cya Yennenga, naho ibihembo bishya byitwa Yennenga Silver Standard na Yennenga Bronze Standard. "}
{"id": "9533", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9533", "title": "Tamy Moyo", "text": "Thamsanqa 'Tamy' Moyo (yavutse 5 Mutarama 1998) numuhanzi wumuziki muri Zimbabwe. Yamenyekanye cyane mu ndirimbo \"Ndibereke ya\" \"2016 ndetse anagira\" uruhare muri film ya Gonarezhou 2020. \nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nYavutse ku ya 5 Mutarama 1998 i Harare, muri Zimbabwe. Ise Richard Kohola ni umunyamakuru muri Star FM Zimbabwe izwi cyane nka RK. Yarezwe na nyina Doris Moyo na sekuru Makwara. \nUmwuga.\nAfite imyaka 7, yatangiye kuririmba cyane cyane muri korari nkuru. Yarangije amashuri abanza mu ishuri ribanza rya Lusitania nyuma yiga Ishuri ryisumbuye rya Westridge mu mashuri yisumbuye. Afite imyaka 13 igihe yari muri Form One, yifatanije nabahanzi bazwi cyane Joe Thomas, Oliver Mtukudzi, Stunner, Ba Shupi, na Alexio Kawara. Nyuma yaje kuba Ambasaderi w\u2019umwana muri Childline Zimbabwe, aba umuhererezi wa Zimbabwe wabaye ambasaderi. Mu mwaka wa 2008, Tamy yashinze Korali Nyafurika yo muri Uganda, afatanije n'abandi bakozi batatu mu gitaramo cyo gufasha mu busitani bwa Madison Square i New York. \nMuri 2017, Tamy yatumiriwe gukina muri film \"Gonarezhou\" hamwe na producer wa firime, Sydney Taivavashe. Filime yakozwe ku bufatanye na Parike ya Zimbabwe hamwe n\u2019ikigo gishinzwe imicungire y\u2019ibinyabuzima. Muri filime Tamy yakinnye nka 'Chipo' nka sinema ye ya mbere. Muri uwo mwaka, yatowe bwa mbere muri National Arts Merit Awards (NAMA awards) kubera kuba indashyikirwa mu nshingano ze. \nMuri 2019, Tamy yatorewe kuba umuhanzi mwiza w\u2019umugore ukomoka muri Afurika yepfo mu birori bya All Africa Music Award (AFRIMA) byabereye muri Gana. "}
{"id": "9534", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9534", "title": "Tariro Mnangagwa", "text": "Tariro Mnangagwa (wavutse 1986) numukinnyi wa Zimbabwe no kubungabunga ibidukikije. Azwiho uruhare muri film ya \"Gonarezhou\" 2020. Ni umukobwa muto wa perezida wa Zimbabwe, Emmerson Mnangagwa.\nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nMnangagwa yavukiye i Harare kwa Perezida Emmerson Mnangagwa na Jayne Matarise, wapfuye ku ya 31 Mutarama 2002 azize kanseri y'inkondo y'umura. Mnangagwa afite barumuna be batanu: Farai, Tasiwa, Vimbayi, Tapiwa, na Emmerson Tanaka. Afite kandi barumuna be batatu bavukana kuva se yashyingiwe bwa kabiri. Mnangagwa yabonye Impamyabumenyi mu mafoto yabigize umwuga muri Cape Town's CityVarsity. Yarangije kandi icyubahiro mu micungire ya siporo muri kaminuza y\u2019ikoranabuhanga ya Cape Peninsula.\nUmwuga.\nNyuma yo gusubira muri Zimbabwe, Mnangagwa yifatanije na Akashinga, ishami ry\u2019abagore barwanya inyamanswa. Nyuma yaje kuba umunyamuryango w\u2019ingabo z\u2019abagore barwanya ishimutwa ry'inyamanswa zitwa International Anti-Poaching Foundation. \nNyuma gato, yatumiwe gukina muri film \"Gonarezhou\" bafatanya gutunganya film, Sydney Taivavashe. Filime yakozwe ku bufatanye na Parike ya Zimbabwe hamwe n\u2019ikigo gishinzwe imicungire y\u2019ibinyabuzima. Muri filime Tariro yakinnye nka 'Serija Onai' ndetse anakora film. "}
{"id": "9535", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9535", "title": "Olympia (2018 film)", "text": "Olympia, ni Ikinamico y'urukundo muri Amerika yo muri 2018 iyobowe na Gregory Dixon nk'umukinnyi wambere kandi afatanije na McKenzie Chinn, Gregory Dixon, Lucy Lola Manda na Elliott Lonsdale kumashusho 30, Isosiyete ikora umurongo wa firime. Muri iyi filime hagaragaramo McKenzie Chinn mu mwanya w\u2019icyubahiro mu gihe Charles Andrew Gardner, Ericka Ratcliff, LaNisa Renee Frederick na Penelope Walker bagize uruhare runini. \nFilime yakiriwe neza kandi yatsindiye ibihembo byinshi mubirori mpuzamahanga bya firime. Yagaragaye bwa mbere ku ya 22 Nzeri 2018 mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Los Angeles. Hanyuma yerekanwe ku ya 15 Ukwakira 2018 mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya sinema rya Chicago ku ya 5 Mata 2019 mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya sinema rya RiverRun. "}
{"id": "9536", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9536", "title": "The Tale of Four", "text": "Tale of Four, ni filime ngufi yo muri Amerika yo muri 2017 iyobowe na Gabourey Sidibe nk'umukinnyi we wa mbere ikanakorwa na Kia Perry, Lisa Cortes na Shannon Gibson. filimi igenda izunguruka mubagore bane batandukanye bafite inzira enye zitandukanye aho igishekeje ubuzima bwabo bwose burahura. Ishingiye ku ndirimbo \"\"Four Women\" yaririmbwe na nyakwigendera umuririmbyi akaba n'umurwanashyaka wa politiki Nina Simone. \nMuri iyi filime hagaragaramo Ledisi Young, Meagan Kimberly Smith, Dana Gourrier na Aisha Hinds. Filime yakiriwe neza kandi yegukana ibihembo byinshi mubirori mpuzamahanga bya firime. Iyi filime yagaragaye bwa mbere muri Nzeri 2016 mu mujyi wa New York, muri New York hanyuma yerekanwa ku ya 25 Kamena 2017 mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Nantucket. Yatsindiye igihembo cya filimi ngufi nziza mu Iserukiramuco rya Filime rya Urbanworld 2017. "}
{"id": "9537", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9537", "title": "Ben &amp; Ara", "text": "Ben &amp; Ara, ni Filime yikinamico ya Kameruni iyobowe na Nnegest Likk\u00e9 ayikorana na Joseph Baird, Constance Ejuma, Q'orianka Kilcher, Matthew Norsworthy na Samone Norsworthy for Nursing Tybalt Productions, Wonder Worthy Productions na N- vision production. Filime izenguruka abakandida 2 ba PhD, umwe w\u2019umuyisilamu wo muri Afurika undi agnostic, aho batangira gukundana nyuma yo guhurira mu nzu ndangamurage ariko nyuma bakavumbura ko urukundo hagati yimico itandukanye n\u2019amadini rushobora kugira ingaruka. \nMuri iyi filime hagaragaramo Joseph Baird na Constance Ejuma mu nshingano zabo, hamwe na Akuyoe Graham, Q'orianka Kilcher, Michael Chieffo na William Mark McCullough mu nshingano zabo. Filime yakiriwe neza kandi yegukana ibihembo byinshi ndetse ikanerekanwa mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime. Yerekanwe bwa mbere muri Nzeri 2015 mu iserukiramuco rya Filimi ryigenga rya Miami. Muri 2016, film yatsindiye ibihembo byamafoto meza n\u2019umukinnyi mwiza mu iserukiramuco rya Filime Indie. Umukinnyi w'amafirime nyamukuru Constance Ejuma yatsindiye igihembo cyumukinnyi witwaye neza mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Nevada. Muri 2016, iyi filime yatsindiye igihembo cya Filime nziza ya Diaspora muri African Movie Academy Awards (AMAA). "}
{"id": "9538", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9538", "title": "Finding Samuel Lowe: From Harlem to China", "text": "Finding Samuel Lowe: From Harlem to China, ni film documentaire ya Jamayike 2015 iyobowe kandi ikorwa na Jeanette Kong. Filime irazenguruka uwahoze ari umuyobozi wa tereviziyo, Paula Williams Madison na bakuru be bombi; Elrick na Howard Williams bagiye gushakisha kugira ngo bamenye uko byagendekeye sekuru wabo w'abashinwa witwa Samuel Lowe, wasize nyina wabo w'umushinwa-Jamayike Nell Vera Lowe, mu myaka ya za 1930 muri Jamayike. \nFilime yakiriwe neza kandi yegukana ibihembo byinshi mubirori mpuzamahanga bya firime. Igitaramo cyacyo cya mbere ku rwego rw\u2019igihugu cyabaye ku ya 14 Gicurasi 2017, Umuyoboro w\u2019isi wa Doc World kandi washyizwe kumurongo ku buntu guhera ku ya 15 Gicurasi - 13 Kamena 2017. Iyi filime yerekanwe ku ya 8 Gashyantare 2014 mu iserukiramuco rya Filime rya Afurika. "}
{"id": "9539", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9539", "title": "Evolutionary Blues: West Oakland's Music Legacy", "text": "Evolutionary Blues: West Oakland's Music Legacy, ni film documentaire yo muri Amerika yo muri 2017 iyobowe na Cheryl Fabio ikaba yarakoranye numuyobozi ubwe hamwe na KTOP hamwe na Sarah Webster Fabio Centre yubutabera. Iyi filime irazenguruka umucuranzi wa West Oakland na Oakland Blues aho yasobanuye iterambere nyuma y'intambara yagize ingaruka ku Banyamerika ndetse n'umurage wabo wa muzika. \nFilime yakiriwe neza kandi yegukana ibihembo byinshi mubirori mpuzamahanga bya firime. Filime yerekanwe bwa mbere muri Grand Lake Theatre ku ya 27 Nzeri 2017. "}
{"id": "9540", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9540", "title": "Kbela", "text": "Kbela, ni filime ngufi yo muri Berezile 2015 iyobowe na Yasmin Thayna ikorwa na Princeton yo muri Berezile LAB. Filime yibanze ku ivanguramoko ryinjira mu buzima bw'abagore b'abirabura muri Berezile. \nFilime yakiriwe neza kandi yegukana ibihembo byinshi mubirori mpuzamahanga bya firime. Iyi filime yasohotse mu Buholandi ku ya 24 Mutarama 2019 mu Iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime Rotterdam. Ku ya 28 Ukwakira 2019, yasohotse mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Carolina y'Amajyaruguru, muri Amerika. Muri 2017, iyi filime yahawe igihembo cyiza cya Afurika Diaspora Igihembo cya Afurika cyatanzwe na Africa Movie Academy Awards (AMAA). "}
{"id": "9541", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9541", "title": "Nyakuron Cultural Centre", "text": "The Nyakuron Cultural Centre (or NCC) ni ikigo cya leta gifite kandi kigenzurwa gishinzwe kubungabunga, guteza imbere sinema n\u2019umuco muri Sudani yepfo. \nAmateka.\nCentre ya Nyakuron yubatswe nyuma y\u2019amasezerano ya Addis Abeba yo mu 1972, arangiza intambara ya mbere ya Sudani. Iki kigo cyafunguwe ku mugaragaro mu 1976 kiyobowe na Abel Alier. \nUruganda runini rwarimo ubusitani bunini, ikibuga cyo hanze, inzu yimyidagaduro, club nijoro hamwe na kazino. Benshi mu minsi mikuru yumuco yaho ndetse n\u2019amahanga ikorerwa muri santere, irimo; Iserukiramuco ryamahoro rya Hagana, Iserukiramuco rya Filime rya Juba, igitaramo cya Kilkilu Ana, amarushanwa mpuzamahanga ya bokisi ndetse n\u2019imurikagurisha. Uretse ibyo, iranakodeshwa mubikorwa byihariye nk'ubukwe. "}
{"id": "9542", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9542", "title": "Cheik Doukour\u00e9", "text": "Cheik Doukour\u00e9 (wavutse 1943), ni umukinnyi wa firime wa Gineya. Azwi cyane nk'umuyobozi wa film yamamaye cyane \"Le Ballon d'Or\". Uretse filime, kandi ni filime screenwriter na film producer.\nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse mu 1943 i Kankan, muri Gineya kandi yize amashuri abanza i Conakry. Mu 1964, yavuye muri Gineya yimukira i Paris mu Bufaransa. Yarangije impamyabumenyi y\u2019ubuvanganzo bugezweho muri kaminuza ya Sorbonne mu 1964, mu nyuguti zigezweho kandi icyarimwe muri Cours Simon hanyuma muri Konserwatori ya rue Blanche mu 1965. \nUmwuga.\nIgihe yari mu Bufaransa, yatangiye umwuga we nk'umukinnyi mu ikinamico no kuri televiziyo. Mu mpera z'imyaka ya za 70, Doukour\u00e9 yatangiye kwandika amashusho yatangiranye na \"Bako, l'autre rive\" mu 1978 hanyuma ikina umukino \"uzwi cyane wa Black Mic Mac\" mu 1986. \nMu 1986, yerekanye sinema ye ya mbere muri firime \"Les Ripoux\". Yakinnye kandi muri filime ishimwa cyane 1994 \"Un indien dans la ville\". Mu 1991, yerekanwe bwa mbere mu buyobozi na Blanc d'ebene ibera muri Gineya mu Ntambara ya Kabiri y'Isi Yose. Mu 1993, yashinze isosiyete ikora ibicuruzwa muri Gineya: 'Bako Productions'. Nyuma muri uwo mwaka, yasohoye igice cye cya kabiri \"Le Ballon d'Or\". Filime yibanze ku muhinzi wo muri Afurika wabaye umukinnyi wumupira wamaguru. Mu 2001, yakoze firime \"Les Films de l'Alliance\" hamwe n'umwanditsi we Danielle Ryan. \nMuri 2001, yakoze kandi akora muri \"Paris selon Moussa\". Mu 2003, yatsindiye igihembo cy'umugabo usobanura mu nshuro ya 18 y'iserukiramuco rya Filime na Televiziyo bya Panafrican rya Ouagadougou (FESPACO) kubera uruhare yagize i Paris nk'uko Moussa abitangaza. "}
{"id": "9543", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9543", "title": "\u00c9tienne Goy\u00e9mid\u00e9", "text": "\u00c9tienne Goy\u00e9mid\u00e9 (22 Mutarama 1942-17 Werurwe 1997), yari umunyaCentral African w'umwanditsi w'ibikino na filimi. Azwiho kuba umwanditsi \"wibitabo byamamaye cyane\" \"Le silence de la for\u00eat\" and \"Dernier Survivant de la caravane\"\nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse ku ya 22 Mutarama 1942 i Ippy, muri Repubulika ya Centrafrique mu muryango w'abahinzi. Kuva mu 1991 kugeza 1992, yari Minisitiri w\u2019uburezi n\u2019ubushakashatsi. Mu 1993, yahawe inkunga n'ikigo cy'igihugu gishinzwe ibitabo mu Bufaransa. Nyuma yaje kugirwa Minisitiri w\u2019uburezi hanyuma aba Ambasaderi w\u2019icyubahiro wa UNESCO. Yabaye kandi muri Troupe des Griots mbere yo kuyobora Troupe yigihugu ya Afrika yo hagati. Goy\u00e9mid\u00e9 yapfuye ku ya 17 Werurwe 1997 afite imyaka 55. \nUmwuga.\nGoy\u00e9mid\u00e9 yabonye impamyabumenyi mu bumenyi bw'uburezi kimwe na dipolome y'Icyongereza. Nyuma yaje kuba umwarimu ayoboye ishuri risanzwe ryabarimu i Bangui. Nyuma yaje gukora mu ishami ry\u2019uburezi kandi yari umuyobozi w\u2019icapiro. Yabaye kandi umuyobozi wa Troupe yigihugu bya Afrika yo hagati. \nMu 1984, yanditse igitabo cye kizwi cyane cyitwa \"Le quiet de la for\u00eat (Guceceka kw'ishyamba)\". Iyi nkuru yibanze ku nkuru y\u2019umukozi wa leta wo muri Afurika yo hagati uta ibintu byose ngo ajye gutembera mumashyamba ahura na pyinga pygmies. Igitabo cyaje guhuzwa na sinema mu 2003 na Didier Florent Ou\u00e9nangar\u00e9 na Bassek Ba Kobhio. Iyi filime yakiriwe neza kandi yari no mu gutoranya abayobozi ba Fortnight mu bayobozi ba Cannes 2003. Mu 2003, yakiriwe mu buryo budasanzwe mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya Filime 2003 ryitwa Francophone de Namur (FIFF). \nHanyuma mu 1985 yanditse igitabo cyitwa \"Dernier Survivant de la caravane (Umucikacumu wa nyuma wa Caravan)\". Yibanze ku bucakara bw\u2019Abanyafrika birabura bwakozwe n\u2019abayisilamu bo muri Afurika y'Amajyaruguru aho Ngalandji avuga ikinamico y'umudugudu we mu gihugu cya Banda. Yatsinze amarushanwa ya RFI kubwinkuru ngufi nziza mururimi rwigifaransa inshuro nyinshi. "}
{"id": "9544", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9544", "title": "Barlen Pyamootoo", "text": "Barlen Pyamootoo (yavutse 27 Nzeri 1960), ni umwanditsi ukora na filimi wo muri Mauritius. Azwiho kuba umuyobozi wa firime \"B\u00e9nar\u00e8s\". \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse ku ya 27 Nzeri 1960 i Trou d'Eau Douce, muri Maurice nk'umwana wa gatatu mu muryango wa Tamil ufite barumuna be umunani. Igihe yari afite imyaka 12, nyina yavuye mu rugo ajya gukora mu Budage. Mu 2006, nyina yishwe na bisi igihe yabaga muri Trou d'Eau Douce. \nUmwuga.\nMu 1977, Pyamootoo yagiye muri kaminuza ya Strasbourg hamwe na se yiga igifaransa n'indimi. Hanyuma yabonye impamyabumenyi ya Dipl\u00f4me d'\u00e9tudes (DEA) mu bumenyi bw'indimi na DEA mu bumenyi bw'uburezi. Nyuma yaje kuba umwarimu w\u2019amabaruwa mu Bufaransa kuva 1987 kugeza 1993. Mu 1995, yasubiye muri Maurice yitangira kwandika no gutangaza. Niwe washinze kandi akayobora ibigo bibiri byandika \"Alma\" yashinzwe mu 2005 na \"L'Atelier d'\u00e9criture\" yashinzwe mu 2009. \nAmaze kugaruka, yanditse igitabo cye cya mbere \"B\u00e9nar\u00e8s\". Icyo gihe yari afite imyaka 39. Hanyuma mu 2002, yanditse igitabo cye cya kabiri \"Le Tour de Babilone\". Muri 2008 yanditse \"Salogi\" icyubahiro nyina. Yatangiye kwandika igitabo gikurikira \"L'\u00eele de poissons toxiques\" mu 2002 hanyuma ahagarara muri 2005. Yatangiye imirimo muri 2013 nyuma asohoka muri 2017. \nMu 2005 yakoze filime ye ya mbere \"B\u00e9nar\u00e8s\" mu rwego rwo guhuza igitabo cye gifite izina rimwe. Iyi filime ivuga ku basore babiri bazengurutse Maurice aho bahura n'abagore babiri babashimishije. Hamwe na firime, Pyamootoo abaye umukinnyi wa mbere wa firime wa Maurice wakoresheje igikerewole cya Maurice muri film. "}
{"id": "9545", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9545", "title": "Nasib Farah", "text": "Nasib Farah (yavutse 1981), ni umunyasomaliya uba muri danimarke. Azwi cyane nk'umuyobozi wa firime zizwi cyane My COUSIN PIRATE,\"Warrior from the North\" and \"Lost warrior\". Usibye gukora amafilime, ni umunyamakuru, umusemuzi, umuyobozi ushinzwe umusaruro, umufasha wigisha akaba n'umugiraneza.\nUbuzima bwite.\nYavukiye muri Somaliya mu 1981. Mu 1990 yahunze Mogadishu n'umuryango we nyuma y'intambara yo muri Somaliya. Icyakora, yabuze umuryango we igihe yarokoka hanyuma ahungira ku mupaka yerekeza muri Etiyopiya, mbere yo guhaguruka mu Budage arangije atura muri Danimarike. Ku ikubitiro yari impunzi itaraherekejwe nyuma akurira mu kigo cya Croix Rouge cyo muri Danemarike Avnstrup hafi ya Lejre. \nYashakanye n\u2019umugore wo muri Danemarke, babyarana abana. \nUmwuga.\nYatoje nk'umucuruzi kandi akora nk'umunyamakuru wigenga imyaka mike. Nyuma yaje gushinga umuryango udaharanira inyungu wibanda ku gufasha abandi basore bo muri Somaliya binyuze mu kwigisha no nyuma y\u2019ishuri. Yifashishije iryo shyirahamwe kugira ngo agaragaze ibyamubayeho, Farah yatangije gahunda ya tereviziyo y'abaturage yitwa 'Qaran TV' ku baturage ba Somaliya muri Danimarike. \nMu mwaka wa 2010, Farah yagize uruhare runini muri filime My COUSIN PIRATE, iyobowe na Christian S\u00f8nderby Jepsen. Icyakora buri gihe yakeneraga gukora nk'umuyobozi aho kuba umukinnyi. \nMuri 2015, yakoze \"filime yambere ya Warriors kuva mumajyaruguru\". Yamamaye cyane kandi yerekanwa mu birori mpuzamahanga bya firime. Muri 2018, yayoboye documentaire ya kabiri \"Lost Warrior ari\" kumwe n'umukinnyi wa firime wo muri Danemarike S\u00f8ren Steen Jespersen"}
{"id": "9548", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9548", "title": "Leroy Gopal", "text": "Leroy Gopal (yavutse 6 Nyakanga 1979), ni umukinnyi wa filimi ukomoka muri Zimbabwe na afurika y'Epfo, akina komedii kandi ni umuhanzi ijwi. Azwi cyane kubera uruhare muri firime \"Yellow Card\" and \"Strike Back\". \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse ku ya 6 Nyakanga 1979 i Harare, muri Zimbabwe. Igihe Gopal yari afite imyaka 14, se yarapfuye. Afite mukuru we, Claudia Gopal Muvuti wahoze ari nyiricyubahiro Zimbabwe.. Yarangije amashuri abanza mu ishuri ribanza rya Blackiston hanyuma ayiga ayisumbuye mu ishuri ryisumbuye rya Gateway na Prince Edward Senior School. Afite impamyabumenyi ya BA (Icyubahiro) muri Live Performance na Motion Picture kuva AFDA, Ishuri ryubukungu bwo guhanga. Ni umwe mu banyeshuri babiri batsindiye igihembo cyiza cya M-NET Umunyeshuri Wumwaka 2003 na 2004 bikurikiranye. Gopal yashakanye n'umukobwa wo muri Afurika y'Epfo, Keletso Molefe kuva 2017. Abashakanye bafite abana batatu: Kiki Leroy Gopal, Didi Tadiwa, na Mimi Naima. \nUmwuga.\nMu 2000, yerekanye sinema ye ya mbere hamwe na firime \"Yellow Card\" aho yakinnye cyane nkumukinnyi wumupira wamaguru 'Tiyane Tsumba'. Kuva mu 2006 kugeza 2007, yakinnye 'Thabang Ngema' mu ikinamico ya SABC 3 \"One Way\" yamenyekanye cyane. Muri 2012, yagaragaye muri sitcom ya SABC 1 \", Ses'Top La\" muburyo bwa 'Oleshe'. Muri 2013, yatsindiye igihembo cyumukinnyi witwaye neza mu gukina urwenya muri Afurika yepfo wa Filime kuri uru ruhare. Hamwe nitsinzi kandi agaragara nkumukinnyi wabishoboye, yahawe akazi ko gukina \"serivise za Mzansi Rukundo: Kasi Style\" muri 2013. Uruhare rwe ni umugabo wo muri Kenya witwa 'Joshua Pembe'. Yakinnye kandi muri make \"Binyuze mu Guhaguruka kw'ibaba\" ryerekanwe no mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Cannes. \nMuri uwo mwaka, yakinnye muri filime \"Seal Team 8\" nk'umunyagitugu wa Tongo 'Tonga'. Hanyuma yagaragaye kuri \"serivise ya Mzansi Magic\" hamwe na 'Abomama' yaje kuba umuntu uzwi cyane murukurikirane. Muri 2014, yakinnye muri politiki ya SABC1 \"Ihawu le Sizwe\". Nyuma yaje gushinga 'Creation Station Entertainment Company'. Leroy yayoboye kandi amashusho yindirimbo Zimbabwe kumuririmbyi Audius Mtawarira. "}
{"id": "9549", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9549", "title": "Paul Berenger (actor)", "text": "Paul Marcel Berenger (yavutse ku ya 26 Werurwe 1991), ni umukinnyi wa firime muri Ositaraliya wavukiye muri Zimbabwe.\nUbuzima bwite.\nBerenger yavutse ku ya 26 Werurwe 1991 i Harare, muri Zimbabwe. Ariko rero, yahatiwe kwimukira muri Ositaraliya. \nUmwuga.\nAfite imyaka 11, yagize ishyaka nyuma yo kubona mukuru we kuri stage akina ishuri ryibanze. Ariko, yatangiye gukina igihe yimukiye muri Ositaraliya. Berenger yagaragaye bwa mbere muri sinema hamwe na film ya 2008 \"Two Fists, One Heart.\". Nyuma yaje gukina muri firime ngufi nka \"Brittany\", \"Die Krankenhaus\", \"The Army Within\" and \"Impasse\"."}
{"id": "9550", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9550", "title": "Christopher Hoffman", "text": "Christopher Hoffman (yavutse 15 Gashyantare 1981), ni umukinnyi wa firime wo muri Zimbabwe akaba numuhanzi uzwi. Azwi cyane ku ruhare muri filime \"Lions for Lambs\", \"Molly's Game\" and \"Saints &amp; Sinners\".\nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse ku ya 15 Gashyantare 1981 i Harare, muri Zimbabwe. Afite musaza we w'impanga, Matt Hoffman."}
{"id": "9551", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9551", "title": "Tomas Brickhill", "text": "Tomas Lutuli Brickhill (yavutse ku ya 25 Werurwe 1978), ni umukinnyi wa firime, umwanditsi, akaba n'umucuranzi muri Zimbabwe. Yayoboye filime yamenyekanye cyane muri 2017 muri \"Cook Off\".\nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse ku ya 25 Werurwe 1978 i Londere mu Bwongereza. Se, Paul Brickhill yahoze ari umusirikare wa Zimbabwe (ZIPRA) akaba n'umuvuzi w'abasirikare. Kubera iyo mpamvu, yari mu buhungiro mu Bwongereza icyo gihe Tomas yavutse. Ariko, nyuma gato y'ubwigenge bwa Zimbabwe, umuryango wasubiye muri Zimbabwe. Nyuma yo kugaruka, ise yayoboye ibihangano n\u2019umuco byiswe 'The Book Caf\u00e9'. Se amaze gupfa muri 2014, Tomas ayoboye Caf\u00e9. Afite abavandimwe batatu: Liam, Amy na Declan. Yize mu ishuri ryisumbuye rya Prince Edward, Harare kuva 1991 kugeza 1996. \nUmwuga.\nYavuye muri Zimbabwe mu 1997 yimukira mu Bwongereza maze yiga muri Surrey Institute of Art ; Design, Ishuri Rikuru rya Kaminuza mu 1999. Yize Filime nyuma akora imirimo itandukanye agerageza kunguka ubumenyi butandukanye muri Surrey arangiza na Bachelor of Arts (BA) muri Cinematography na Film / Video Production muri 2001. Hanyuma yigishije amasomo ya firime ya Raindance Film Festival, BBC na VMI imyaka mike. \nYatunze kandi Paw Paw Jam Productions, isosiyete ikora ibijyanye n\u2019umuziki nyafurika ndetse no gufata amashusho mu Bwongereza. Usibye sinema, ni n'umucuranzi aherekejwe n'itsinda 'Chikwata'. "}
{"id": "9552", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9552", "title": "Maggie Lloyd-Williams", "text": "Maggie Lloyd Williams (wavutse 1975), ni umukinnyi wa filime wa Zimbabwe akaba n'umwanditsi. Azwi cyane kubera uruhare muri serivise za tereviziyo nka\"Silent Witness\", \"Secret Diary of a Call Girl\", \"\" and \"The Low Down\".\nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse mu 1975 i Masvingo, muri Zimbabwe."}
{"id": "9553", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9553", "title": "Kevin Hanssen", "text": "Kevin Hanssen, ni umukinnyi wa firime Zimbabwe, umwanditsi akaba n'umucuranzi. Azwi cyane kubera uruhare muri firime \"Mind Games\", \"Mugabe\" na \"The Telling Room\". \nUmwuga.\nMu 1994, yabonye impamyabumenyi ya Bachelor of Arts muri UNISA, Afurika y'Epfo. Ni n'umunyamuryango washinze Over The Edge Theatre Company. Yakinnye mu ikinamico 'A Man Like You' yakinwe mu makinamico menshi ya Zimbabwe. \nIbihembo.\nYatsindiye ibihembo byinshi mu minsi mikuru mpuzamahanga. "}
{"id": "9554", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9554", "title": "Mame Bineta Sane", "text": "Mame Bineta Sane (yavutse 3 Gashyantare 2000), uzwi nka Mama San\u00e9, ni fumukinnyi wa firime muri Senegal. Azwi cyane ku ruhare nka 'Ada' muri filime y\u2019ikinamico ndengakamere ya \"Atlantika\".\nUbuzima bwite.\nYakuriye i Thiaroye, mu nkengero za Dakar, muri Senegali. Ntabwo yize amashuri asanzwe ku ishuri. Yatangiye gukora akazi ko kudoda muri Thiaroye. \nUmwuga.\nNtabwo yigeze akina ikinamico iyo ari yo yose mbere ubwo yatoranyirizwagamo uruhare muri firime ya \"Atlantika ya\" 2019 iyobowe na Mati Diop nka firime ye ya mbere. Sane ntabwo yigeze yiga kwishuri mugihe Diop yamutumiriye gukina. Muri iyo filime, Sane yakinnye cyane 'Ada', uhigwa bukware n'umukunzi we, Souleiman, hamwe n'ubwato bw'abandi basore, yabuze mu nyanja. \nIyi filime yagaragaye bwa mbere mu murwa mukuru wa Dakar mbere yuko isohoka muri Senegali. Filime yari ifite ibitekerezo byiza cyane kubayinenga kandi yerekanwe mubirori byinshi bya firime. Filime yaje gutsindira igihembo cya Grand Prix mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Cannes 2019. Ku bw'uruhare rwe, nyuma Sane yahawe igihembo cya C\u00e9sar ku bakinnyi benshi basezerana mu bihembo bya C\u00e9sar 2020 ndetse anahatanira igihembo cya Lumi\u00e8res ku bakinnyi benshi basezerana mu bihembo bya Lumi\u00e8res 2020 ndetse no mu bihembo bya Black Reel ku bagore. Ibikorwa Byiza Byagezweho muri Black Reel Awards ya 2020. \nAmashusho.\n= references ="}
{"id": "9555", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9555", "title": "Amadou Mbow", "text": "Amadou Mbow, ni umukinnyi wa filimi muri Senegal. Azwi cyane ku ruhare nka 'Issa' muri filime y\u2019ikinamico ndengakamere \"Atlantics\". Usibye kuba umukinnyi, anashushanya ibishushanyo mbonera kandi akunda amafoto.\nUbuzima bwite.\nYavukiye kandi akurira i Dakar, muri Senegali. \nUmuhungu wumucuzi wa Senegali ukomoka muri Fulani ukomoka i Futa, Amadou Mbow numuhungu wa nyina na murumuna wa bashiki be batatu. Mu myaka ye y'ubwangavu, basketball yari ifite umwanya wingenzi mubuzima bwe. Nyuma yimyaka itari mike akora imyitozo muri DUC (Dakar University Club) imwemerera kongera ubumenyi, reaction ndetse no kwiyemeza. Amaherezo yahisemo kureka siporo kugirango arusheho gushimishwa nisi yerekana amajwi yimenyereza nkumuntu wiyigisha. \nUmwuga.\nMuri 2019, Mbow yatoranijwe muri firime \"Atlantics\" iyobowe na Mati Diop nka firime ye ya mbere. Muri iyo filime, yakinnye nk'umupolisi ukiri muto 'Issa' woherejwe gukora iperereza ku muriro udasanzwe utwika mu buriri bwa Ada mu ijoro ry'ubukwe bwe. Iyi filime yagaragaye bwa mbere mu murwa mukuru wa Dakar mbere yuko isohoka muri Senegali. Filime yari ifite ibitekerezo byiza cyane kubayinenga kandi yerekanwe mubirori byinshi bya firime. Filime yaje gutsindira igihembo cya Grand Prix mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Cannes 2019. Muri 2020, Amadou Mbow yatoranijwe muri C\u00e9sars 2020 mubyiciro bya \"Ibyahishuwe\". "}
{"id": "9556", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9556", "title": "Diankou Sembene", "text": "Diankou Sembene, ni umukinnyi wa filimi muri S\u00e9n\u00e9galese. Azwi cyane kubera uruhare nka 'Mr Ndiaye 'muri firime yikinamico yurukundo ndengakamere \"Atlantics\". \nUmwuga.\nMuri 2019, Sembene yatoranijwe muri firime \"Atlantics\" iyobowe na Mati Diop nka firime ye ya mbere. Iyi filime yagaragaye bwa mbere mu murwa mukuru wa Dakar mbere yuko isohoka muri Senegali. Filime yari ifite ibitekerezo byiza cyane kubayinenga kandi yerekanwe mubirori byinshi bya firime. Filime yaje gutsindira igihembo cya Grand Prix mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Cannes 2019. Nyuma neza filimi, yakoze mu televiziyo serial \"ZeroZeroZero\" na filimi ngufi \"ruswa\"\".\" "}
{"id": "9557", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9557", "title": "Nabwana I.G.G.", "text": "Isaac Godfrey Geoffrey Nabwana, uzwi cyane ku izina rya Nabwana IGG, ni umukinnyi wa firime muri Uganda akaba na producer. Uwashinze studio ya firime Wakaliwood, Nabwana azwi cyane kubera urugomo rwubusa muri film ye. Nabwana yatangiye kwamamara nyuma yo kohereza trailer ya film ye Who Killed Captain Alex? kuri YouTube muri 2010 hanyuma nyuma ya firime nyirizina muri 2015. Filime yabonye umwanya wo gusenga none yicaye kuri miliyoni 6.4 kuri YouTube.\nUbuzima bwite.\nNabwana yavukiye muri Uganda ku ngoma ya Idi Amin mu 1973. Mu ntambara yo muri Uganda Bush, bivugwa ko we na murumuna we birukanywe na kajugujugu. Iyi kajugujugu irashobora kugaragara muri Who Killed Captain Alex?.\nUmwuga.\nNkuko atari yarigeze aba mu ikinamico, yishingikirizaga ahanini kuri barumuna be n'inshuti ibisobanuro bya firime zasohotse mu ikinamico. Yagiye mu masomo yo gusana mudasobwa, ariko ahatirwa kureka ishuri nyuma yukwezi kwa mbere kubera kubura amafaranga. Kubwibyo, yatangiye kwiga gukora firime nibice byayo muburyo bwo kwigira wenyine hamwe nubunararibonye bwe bwo kugerageza-kwibeshya hamwe na kamera nibikoresho byo gutunganya. Afite imyaka 32, yatangiye gukina film nkumwuga. Mu 2005, Nabwana yashinze Ramon Film Productions: izina ryakomotse kuri nyirakuru, Rachel na Monica, nyuma rizwi ku izina rya Wakaliwood. \nIbikorwa bye bya firime bishingiye murugo rwe aho yatangiye gukora no gufata amashusho yindirimbo kuva 2009. Ramon Production yitabiriye firime zirenga 44. Zimwe muri firime zizwi zakozwe na Ramon Productions Who Killed Captain Alex?,Bad Black, na \"Tebaatusasula\". Filime \"Who Killed Captain Alex?\" izwi nka firime yambere yuzuye ibikorwa muri cinema ya Uganda. \nIgihe Alan Hofmanis, umuyobozi mukuru mu iserukiramuco rya firime rifite icyicaro mu mujyi wa New York, yagiye muri Uganda, yahuye na Nabwana maze asaba ko yakora documentaire kuri Ramon Film Productions, Hofmanis kuva ubwo yimukira muri Uganda kugira ngo afashe kumenyekanisha sinema ya Wakaliwood ku isi. Yahawe kandi gukina filime ya \"Bad Black mu\" mwaka wa 2016 Nabwana kandi yiswe \"umukinnyi wa mbere wa filime wa Mzungu Uganda.\" \nNabwana yatsindiye ibihembo 6 \nUburyo bwo gufata amashusho hamwe ninsanganyamatsiko.\nNabwana yafashe amashusho ye mu Luganda, imvugo ya Baganda, ubwoko bunini bwa Uganda. Nabwana azwiho ibikorwa nubugizi bwa nabi bivanze no gusetsa muri film ye. Afata ibyemezo muri firime ye bikabije bigizwe ahanini no kurwanisha imbunda Kung-fu nubuhanzi bwintambara. Nabwana afite kandi ibihangano bye yise 'Video Joker' (cyangwa VJ muri make) kugirango atange ibisobanuro kuri firime aho avuga urwenya no gutaka amagambo adasanzwe. Iyi mico yagaragaye muri firime zose za Nabwana."}
{"id": "9558", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9558", "title": "Rokhaya Niang", "text": "Rokhaya Niang, numukinnyi wa S\u00e9n\u00e9galese. Azwi cyane kubera uruhare rwamamaye muri firime \"Le prix du pardon\", \"L'Extraordinaire destin de Madame Brouette\" na \"Teranga Blues\". \nUmwuga.\nMu 2001, Niang yatangiye sinema ye ya mbere akina na film \"Le prix du pardon\" iyobowe na Mansour Sora Wade. Intsinzi ya firime, yatoranijwe muri film \"L'Extraordinaire destin de Madame Brouette\" mu 2002. Filime zombi zatoranijwe mu Iserukiramuco rya Filime na Televiziyo bya Panafrican ya Ouagadougou (FESPACO) mu 2003. Icyakora, filime yakunzwe cyane ya sinema yaje binyuze muri firime ya \"Teranga Blues yo\" mu 2007 iyobowe na Moussa Sene Absa ubwo yakinaga nka 'Rokhaya'. "}
{"id": "9559", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9559", "title": "Ma\u00efmouna Gueye", "text": "Ma\u00efmouna Gueye Fall, ni Umukinnyi wa filimi muri S\u00e9n\u00e9galese. Azwi cyane kubera uruhare muri firime \"The Climb\", \"Payoff, Cuties,\" \"Bacon kuruhande\". \nUbuzima bwite.\nNyuma yo gushyingiranwa n\u2019umugabo w\u2019umufaransa, yagiye mu Bufaransa mu 1998. Ariko, nyuma y'amezi make, yahukanye nyuma yo guhura n'ivanguramoko n'umugabo. Nyuma yo gutandukana, yimukiye i Paris. \nUmwuga.\nGueye yatangiye gukina umwuga wo gukina akina na Sophocles \"Antigone\" iyobowe n'umwanditsi wa Haiti, G\u00e9rard Chenet. Mu 2004, yakinnye mu kindi gikinisho, guhuza Igifaransa na Monologues \"du vagin\" izwi cyane na Eve Ensler. Nyuma yaje kwimukira mu ikinamico maze akora amakinamico azwi cyane, \"Souvenirs de la dame en noir\" and \"She is black, but she is beautiful\"\nNyuma yo gukina amakinamico menshi, amaherezo yaje kugaragara muri sinema afite uruhare rwa mbere muri filime \"Payoff\" mu 2003. Nyuma yaje kugira uruhare runini muri film \"Touristes?Oh yes!\" iyobowe na Jean-Pierre Mocky mu 2004. \nNiwe washinze 'Afrokids', club yimyidagaduro y'abana itanga amarangi, gusoma, kubyina, kuvuga inkuru, n'amahugurwa ya DIY."}
{"id": "9560", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9560", "title": "Moussa Tour\u00e9", "text": "Moussa Tour\u00e9 (wavutse 1958), ni umukinnyi wa firime muri S\u00e9n\u00e9galese. Azwi cyane nk'umuyobozi wa firime \"zizwi cyane Toubab Bi\", \"TGV\" na \"La Pirogue\". Usibye icyerekezo, ni umutekinisiye, umwanditsi, producer n'umukinnyi. \nUbuzima bwite.\nTour\u00e9 yavutse 1958 i Dakar, muri Senegali. \nUmwuga.\nYatangiye umwuga wa sinema nkumutekinisiye. Hanyuma mu 1987, yerekeje kuri firime akoresheje firime ngufi maze ashinga uruganda rwe bwite rwitwa 'Les Films du Crocodile'. Mu 1991, Tour\u00e9 yakoze filime ye ya mbere yerekana \"Toubab Bi\". yahawe ibihembo muri Cannes Film Festival. Nyuma yo gutsinda kwa mbere, yakoze film ye ya kabiri \"TGV\" mu 1998 abifashijwemo na Mak\u00e9na Diop. Nyuma mu 1999, filime yegukanye igihembo cyabaterankunga mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya 9 rya Afurika. \nMu 1996, yagize uruhare runini muri filime \"Les Caprices d'un rivi\u00e8re\" iyobowe na Bernard Giraudeau. Muri 2005, yakoze documentaire \"5x5\" yakiriwe neza. Muri 2011, Tour\u00e9 yagizwe Umuyobozi w'Inteko y'abacamanza mu 2011 Iserukiramuco rya Filime na Televiziyo bya Panafrican rya Ouagadougou (FESPACO). Hanyuma muri 2012, yayoboye filime ye ya gatatu yerekana \"La Pirogue\", filime yerekana igice. Filime yafashwe amashusho kandi ihindurwa hifashishijwe imikorere ya Hollywood. Muri 2020, yayoboye filime \"Red Dust\" ikorwa na Luxembourgish yambaye imyenda ya BAHN na Dakar ikorera mu nzu itunganyirizwamo 'Les Films du Crocodile'. Filime izasohoka mu 2022. "}
{"id": "9561", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9561", "title": "Samba F\u00e9lix Ndiaye", "text": "Samba F\u00e9lix N'diaye (6 Werurwe 1945\u20136 Ugushyingo 2009), yari umukinnyi wa firime wa S\u00e9n\u00e9galese. Imwe mu nkingi za mbere mu nganda za sinema zo muri Senegali, Ndiaye afatwa nka se wa documentaire nyafurika. Yakoze Documentaire zamamaye cyane \"Tr\u00e9sors des poubelles\", \"Ngor, l'esprit des lieux\", \"Les malles\" na \"Geti Tey\". Usibye icyerekezo, ni umwanditsi akaba n'umukinnyi wa sinema.\nUbuzima bwite.\nNdiaye yavutse ku ya 6 Werurwe 1945 i Dakar, muri Senegali. Yahoraga yitabira club ya firime yikigo ndangamuco cyabafaransa i Dakar yabikoraga akamenyero. Nyuma yaje kwiga amategeko nubukungu muri kaminuza ya Dakar. Nyuma yize muri kaminuza ya Paris VIII ahabwa Masters muri Sinema na Audiovisual Studies. Hanyuma yifatanije na Institut Lumi\u00e8re kwiga cinematografi no gutunganya. Yapfuye ku ya 6 Ugushyingo 2009 i Dakar afite imyaka 64 azize ibibazo bya malariya yo mu bwonko. Nyuma yaje gushyingurwa mu irimbi rya Yoff. \nUmwuga.\nMu 1974, yayoboye documentaire ye ya mbere \"yitwa Perantal\", mu rwego rwo kubona impamyabumenyi ihanitse muri sinema. Mu 1978, yakoze \"Geti Tey\" ngufi yaganiriye ku ngorane abarobyi b'abanyabukorikori bahuye na Kayar, Hann cyangwa Soumb\u00e9dioune ibikorwa byabo bibangamiwe n'uburobyi. Nyuma yibyo, Ndiaye yakoze urukurikirane rwa firime eshanu ngufi ziteranijwe ku mutwe wa \"Tr\u00e9sors des poubelles\" mu 1989. Muri uwo mwaka, yakoze \"Aqua\" ngufi, \"metonymy yo mumijyi\" itagira amagambo. \nMu 1994, Ndiaye yakoze filime ye ya mbere ya \"Ngor, l'esprit des lieux\" ivuga ku baturage ba Ngor, umudugudu uherereye mu nkengero za Dakar. Kuva mu mpera za 1990, ahanini yari ahangayikishijwe na documentaire zishingiye kuri politiki maze akora \"Lettre \u00e0 Senghor\" mu 1998. Nkumwanditsi, yanditse documentaire yu \"Rwanda, pour m\u00e9moire\" yibanze kuri jenoside yo mu Rwanda yo mu 1994. Muri 2007 mumyaka ye ya nyuma, Ndiaye yakoze documentaire \"Ibibazo \u00e0 la terre natale\". Muri 2012, yatsindiye igihembo mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Cordoba kubera filime ye \"Tr\u00e9sors des poubelles\"."}
{"id": "9562", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9562", "title": "Mathew Nabwiso", "text": "Mathew Nabwiso, ni umukinnyi wa filimi muri Uganda. Nabwiso azwi cyane kubera uruhare muri firime \"Imbabazi\", \"Rain\" and \"Kyaddala\". Usibye gukina, ni n'umuririmbyi, umuyobozi na producer. \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse nkumwana wa karindwi wumuryango urimo abavandimwe cumi n'umwe. Ababyeyi be bahoze ari abadepite Frank Nabwiso na Mama Christine Nabwiso wa Jinja. Yize amashuri abanza ya Mwiri na Kamuli Boys kumashuri abanza. Nyuma yize muri Busoga College, Mwiri kuri O-level nyuma yiga muri Namasagali College, i Kamuli. Nyuma yaje kubona impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu kwamamaza muri Kupuro Institute of Marketing. Mbere yo kwinjira mu gukina, yari afite akazi k'igihe cyose nk'umuyobozi ushinzwe kugurisha isosiyete ikora ICT. Ariko yaretse akazi kugira ngo akore umwuga binyuze muri sinema. Yashakanye na mugenzi we bakinana, Eleanor Nabwiso wanakinnye muri serivise za \"The Hostel\". Abashakanye bafite abana bane. \nUmwuga.\nMuri 2006, yakoze sinema yumukobwa akina na firime \"Battle of the Souls\".Muri 2011, yinjiye mu bakinnyi ba filimi \"The Hostel\" yanyuze kuri NTV Uganda, ikundwa cyane. Nyuma yo gusoza uruhererekane, yashinze isosiyete ikora firime 'Nabwiso Films'.Muri 2013, yatsindiye igihembo cy'umukinnyi witwaye neza muri Afurika Magic Viewers 'Choice Awards (AMVCA), kubera filime \"A Good Catholic Girl\". Nyuma muri 2016, yatorewe umwanya wa 'Dumba' muri film \"Imvura\" muri AMVCA. Muri 2020, yahawe igihembo cya Film Act muri Vine Awards kubera uruhare yagize muri sinema ya Uganda. "}
{"id": "9563", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9563", "title": "Arnold Oceng", "text": "Arnold Oceng, rimwe na rimwe uzwi ku izina rya Snakeyman, (yavutse ku ya 30 Ugushyingo 1985), ni umukinnyi wa filime ukomoka mu Bwongereza no gihugu cya Uganda. Oceng azwi kunshingano muri \"Grange Hill,\" \"Adulthood\" na \"Brotherhood\"\".\" \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse ku ya 30 Ugushyingo 1985. Mu 1986, igihe yari afite umwaka umwe, umuryango we wimukiye i Brixton, mu majyepfo ya Londere nk'impunzi. \nUmwuga.\nYatangiye gukina afite imyaka 6 nkumuhanzi wabana. Muri iryo shuri, yakinnye nka 'King Herod' mu ikinamico ku ishuri ribanza rya Kiliziya Gatolika ya Corpus Christi ku musozi wa Brixton. Mu 1999, yatangiye gukina bwa mbere nk'umuhanzi w'umwana afite uruhare rwa 'Calvin Braithwaite' mu bice 73 bya filimi y'abana ba televiziyo ya \"Grange Hill\". Urukurikirane rwakunzwe cyane kandi rwarakomeje kugeza 2004. Kuva icyo gihe yakinnye mu ruhare ruto rwo gushyigikira muri tereviziyo nyinshi zirimo, \"Casualty\", \"The Bill\" na \"Sold\". Oceng yerekanye sinema ye ya mbere muri 2008 \"Abakuze\". Nyuma yaje gukurikira afite uruhare runini muri firime zigenga zo mu Bwongereza, \"4.3.2.1.\" na \"My Brother The Devil\" \nMuri 2014, yakinnye na Reese Witherspoon muri filime The Good Lie, ibaye umwanya we wa mbere muri Hollywood. Mu mwaka wa 2016, yakinnye nka 'Charles' muri filime \"A United Kingdom\" yari afite umwanya wa mbere muri BFI London Festival Festival. Hanyuma yakinnye muri biopic yo muri Danemarike \"The Greatest Man\" yerekanwe muri 2016. Muri uwo mwaka, yinjiye mu bakinnyi ba filime '. Muri 2017, yatorewe igihembo cy\u2019umugabo witwaye neza muri Filime muri Screen Nation Film na Televiziyo Awards yabereye muri hoteri ya Park Plaza London Riverbank ku ya 7 Gicurasi 2017. Muri uwo mwaka, yatsindiye igihembo cyumukinnyi witwaye neza kurusha abandi muri National Film Awards UK kubera uruhare yagize muri '"}
{"id": "9564", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9564", "title": "Sam Bagenda", "text": "Sam Bagenda uzwi cyane ku izina ry'ubuhanzi Dr. Bbosa, (yavutse ku ya 31 Werurwe 1965), ni umukinnyi w'icyamamare akaba n'umuririmbyi wa Uganda. Yatangiye umwuga we nk'umuririmbyi, Bagenda yaje kuba umukinnyi wamamaye, uzwi cyane kubera uruhare muri Malayalam Movie \"Escape from Uganda\" and film \"That's Life Mwattu\". Hagati aho, Bagenda yatorewe kandi kuba umukinnyi wa Uganda w'ikinyagihumbi mu 2000. \nCareer.\nBagenda yatangiye kuririmba muri Korali Itorero Anglican Itorero rya Mutagatifu Pawulo i Mulago akiri muto. Ariko, umupadiri wa paruwasi amaze kumwirukana muri iryo torero, yaje kwifatanya nabandi banyamuryango bo muri korari yitorero maze ashinga korari Ivanjili \"Sun Rose-85\" mu 1985. Ukuboza 1986, yinjiye bwa mbere muri The Ebonies akomeza gukora nk'umuririmbyi wijwi ryimbitse, ari kumwe na nyakwigendera Jimmy Katumba, baririmbye mu minsi mikuru myinshi nyuma baza gukora ballad ikunzwe cyane \"Twalina omukwano neguf\". Igitaramo cye cya mbere gikomeye cyabaye muri Mutarama 1987 ubwo hafungurwaga ikinamico ya Bat Valley. \nYatangiye gukina bwa mbere nka 'padiri' mu ikinamico ya \"Dollar\". Igihe yari ageze ku rwego rwo gukundwa cyane nk'umuririmbyi, yahuye n'umwanditsi w'amakinamico n'umuyobozi, JWK Ssembajwe. Mu 1993, yakinnye 'Dr. Sam Bbosa 'muri \"seri izwi cyane za Uganda That's Life Mwattu\". Yabaye icyamamare mu bitangazamakuru nyuma yuruhererekane, aho bakunze kwita 'Dr. Bbosa 'mubaturage. "}
{"id": "9565", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9565", "title": "Owas Ray Mwape", "text": "Owas Ray Mwape, ni umukinnyi wa firime wa Zambiya, ni umukinnyi akaba n'umwanditsi. Umukinnyi wa firime ufite ubuhanga bukomeye, Mwape yatangiye umwuga we nkumukinnyi kandi azwi cyane mubikorwa bya Mwansa the Great\", \"\" and \"Fever \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavukiye i Ndola. Yabanje gushyingiranwa n'umunyamuziki w'indirimbo uzwi cyane wo muri Zambiya, Saboi Imboela. Nyuma baje gutandukana aho Imboela yerekanye ihohoterwa rikorerwa mu ngo rya Owas. Icyakora, nyuma Owas yahakanye ibirego n'ibihuha bitari byo kuri we na Imboela. \nUmwuga.\nMwape yatsindiye ibihembo by'igihugu byumukinnyi witwaye neza mumyaka itatu ikurikiranye ya 1990, 1991 na 1992, abaye umunya Zambiya wenyine wageze kuriyi ntsinzi kugeza ubu. Yatangiye gukina bwa mbere kuri filimi \"Kabanana\" kuva 2004 kugeza 2008. Nyuma yaje gukina filime nyinshi hamwe na serial nka \"The Lawyer\", \"Redbag\", \"Complicated Affairs\", \"Justice at Stake\", \"The Wife\", \"Mwansa the Great\", \"Chidongo\", \"The ticket\", \"A beautiful Lie\" and \"Guilt\".. Muri 2013, yashinze sosiyete ye bwite itunganya filimi 'Owas Films' maze ahindukira akora amashusho yigihe cyose. Muri 2015, yayoboye filime ebyiri \"Chenda\" na \"Secrets Untold\" aho iyi ifite premier yayo muri Ster Kinekor i Lusaka. "}
{"id": "9566", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9566", "title": "Becky Ngoma", "text": "Becky Ngoma, ni umukinnyi wa filime wa Zambiya akaba n'umwanditsi. Umukinnyi wa firime, Mwape yatangiye umwuga we nk'umukinnyi kandi azwi cyane kubera uruhare muri \"Mwansa the Great\", \"I Am Not A Witch\" and \"Temzu Town\". Usibye gukina, ni umuyobozi na producer.\nUbuzima bwite.\nShe was born in Lusaka, Zambia. She is a graduate of TV production at Zambia Institute of Mass Communication (ZAMCOM).\nUmwuga.\n\"Yakoze nk'umukinnyi w'amafirime\" n'umwanditsi mu biganiro byinshi bya televiziyo 'nka, Kabanana, Ikinamico ya mbere muri Zambiya na \"Love Games na Fever\" ndetse no muri firime, \"Suwi\" na \"Mwansa the Great\"\".\". Hagati aho, yakoraga kuri opera ikunzwe cyane yo muri Afrika yepfo,\"Generations\". Ni n'umwanditsi wa seri izwi cyane \"Zuba\", telenovela ya mbere muri Zambiya, yerekana kuri Zambezi Magic. Yakinnye kandi muri filime ashimwa cyane kuri \"I Am Not a Witch\" yabaye filime yatsindiye BAFTA afite uruhare 'Bwalya'. \nYatsindiye ibihembo byinshi kubuhanga bwe bwo kwandika-kwandika nka; Igihembo cya Filime, Televiziyo na Radiyo Zambiya 2014 (Zafta) igihembo cy\u2019umwanditsi mwiza, igihembo cya Zafta cya 2016 kuri filimi nziza, na 2018 ibihembo by\u2019abagore bo muri Zambiya ku mugore w\u2019umwaka. "}
{"id": "9567", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9567", "title": "Carlos Concei\u00e7\u00e3o", "text": "Carlos Miguel V. Concei\u00e7\u00e3o (yavutse 5 Kanama 1979), ni Umukinnyi wa firime ukomoka muri porutigali wavukiye muri Angola. Concei\u00e7\u00e3o azwi cyane nk'umuyobozi wa firime \"Goodnight Cinderella\", \"Serpentarius\" na \"Bad Bunny\". Usibye kuyobora, ni numuproducer, umwanditsi wamashusho hamwe nuwashushanyije amajwi. \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse ku ya 5 Kanama 1979 muri Angola. Mu 2002, yabonye impamyabumenyi mu Cyongereza, afite ubuhanga mu buvanganzo bwa Romantike. Nyuma yaje kubona indi mpamyabumenyi, kuri iyi nshuro muri sinema, mu ishuri rya Theatre na Lisbonne mu 2006. \nUmwuga.\nYatangiye umwuga mu 2005 nka videwo yindirimbo nuwatunganya amashusho y'ubuhanzi. Muri 2013, yakoze \"Versailles\" ngufi, yari mu marushanwa muri Lokarno Festival, Curtas Vila do Conde na Mar Del Plata Festivals. Filime ye ya \"Goodnight Cinderella\" 2014 yagaragaye bwa mbere mucyumweru cya Critics ' Festival ya Cannes. Muri 2017, filime ye \"Bad Bunny\" yongeye kugaragara i Cannes. "}
{"id": "9568", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9568", "title": "Mukakarangwa Clotilde", "text": "Mukakarangwa Clotilde (yavutse 1 Mutarama 1966) ni umugore akaba umunyarwandakazi, ubarizwa mu ishyaka rya Parti Democrate Centriste (PDC). Ku wa 24 Nzeri 2020 nibwo Ihuriro ry\u2019Igihugu ry\u2019Imitwe ya Politiki mu Rwanda ryatoreye Hon. Mukakarangwa Clotilde kwinjira mu Nteko Ishinga Amategeko, Umutwe wa Sena asimbuye umwe muri babiri bari basoje manda yabo. \nAmashuri yize.\nMukakarangwa Clotilde afite impamyabumenyi y'ikirenga y'ikiciro cya gatatu cya kaminuza muri siyansi.\nAkazi.\nMUKAKARANGWA Clotilde ubu ni umusenateri akaba na visi perezida w'akomisiyo w'ububanyi n'amahanga, ubufatanye n'umutekano muri sena yu rwanda. "}
{"id": "9569", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9569", "title": "Uwimanimpaye Jeanne d' arc", "text": "Uwimanimpaye Jeanne d'arc (yavutse 1978) ni umunyapolitiki wo mu Rwanda. Yabaye umunyamuryango w\u2019Umutwe w\u2019abadepite kuva mu 2008. Kuva mu 2013 kugeza 2018, yabaye Visi Perezida w\u2019Umutwe.\nUbuzima.\nUwimanimpaye Jeanne d'Arc yarangije muri Economics muri kaminuza nkuru yu Rwanda. Mbere yo kwinjira mu Nteko, yakoraga nk'umwarimu w\u2019ishuri ryisumbuye, ndetse no mu nzego z'ibanze nk'umugenzuzi w'imbere mu karere akaba n'umukozi ushinzwe imibanire rusange.\nUwimanimpaye yinjiye mu Nteko Ishinga Amategeko mu matora y\u2019abadepite yo mu Rwanda mu 2008, nk'umwe mu bahagarariye abagore batandatu mu Ntara y'Iburasirazuba. Mu mwaka wa 2010, yagiye mu Bwongereza nk'indorerezi y'amatora ya Commonwealth ku matora rusange yo mu Bwongereza 2010.Mu matora y\u2019abadepite 2013, Uwimanimpaye yasubijwe mu mutwe w\u2019abadepite nk'uhagarariye abagore mu Ntara y'Iburasirazuba. Mu Kwakira 2013, yatorewe kuba Visi Perezida wungirije ushinzwe kugenzura no gushyiraho amategeko, ahabwa amajwi 70 kuri 80. Nk\u2019Umuvugizi wungirije, yerekanye icyifuzo cyo kwemerera Perezida Kagame kwiyamamariza manda ya gatatu, nyuma y\u2019uko icyifuzo cyari kimaze gusinywa miliyoni 3.8\nAbasaba barashimira perezida Kagame kuba yarahagaritse itsembabwoko no kuzamura ubukungu vuba\nUwimanimpaye yatoranijwe nk'umukandida wa FPR-Inkotanyi mu matora y'abadepite yo mu 2018, atorerwa guhagararira Akarere ka Gatsibo mu Ntara y'Iburasirazuba. Yeguye ku mwanya wa Perezida wungirije, asimburwa na Edda Mukabagwiza wa FPR-Inkotanyi. Muri Nzeri 2019, Uwimanimpaye yasabye ko hakorwa iperereza ku kibazo cy\u2019amafaranga cyerekeranye n\u2019amasoko yatanzwe n\u2019ikigo cy\u2019ubuhinzi cy\u2019u Rwanda, kandi anenga amasoko yatanzwe n\u2019ikigo cy\u2019amakoperative y\u2019u Rwanda. \nAkazi yakoze.\nUwimanimpaye Jeanne d'Arc yabaye umukozi mu bintu bidandukanye harimo:"}
{"id": "9570", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9570", "title": "Hadija murangwa ndangiza", "text": "Hadija Ndangiza Murangwa.\nMurangwa Hadija yavutse tariki 30 Gicurasi 1975. \nuyu Murangwa hadija wimyaka 44 tariki ya mbere zuku kwezi ku ukwakira nibwo yatanzwe n'ishyaka rya PDI\nkugirango ajye muri sena.murangwa yatorowe gusimbura Uwamurera Salama muri sena warusanzwe ari umukozi w 'Akarere ka Rusizi\nushinzwe imisoro mukigo cy'ubutuka cyako karere (BILLING OFFICER).\nMurangwa hadija nimuntu ki??\nMurangwa ni umunyamategeko kandi akaba ari n'umujyanama muby' imisoro kandi ibyo byose akaba abimazemo igihe.\nMurangwa yabaye mu nama z'ubutegetsi za MMI,RDB na BRD.Murangwa ubu akaba ari mu nama y'ubutegetsi \nya Banki nkuru y'u Rwanda (BNR).. "}
{"id": "9571", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9571", "title": "MUKASINE MARIE CLAIRE", "text": "Mukasine Marie Claire.\nMukasine Marie claire ni umunyarwanda kazi wa vutse muwi 1959. Mukasine wakoraga muri sosiyete sivile\nnkumunyamuryango w'umuryango uharanira uburenganzira bw'umugore n'umwana,haguruka, yayoboye \nhagati ya 1994-1996.\nInama y'abaminisitiri iyobowe na nyakubahwa perezida Paul Kagame ku ya 16 kamena yashyizeho \nMarie Claire Mukasine nk'umuyobozi wakomisiyo y'igihugu cy'u Rwanda ishinzwe uburenganzira bwa \nmuntu asimbuye Madelein Nirere wari kubuyobozi bw'umubiri kuva kuya 17 Mata 2012.\nMukasine ni muntu ki ??\nMukasine claire mukasine afite impamya bumunye Y'ikirenga ya PHD mu by'amategeko na masters\nmu by'imicungire (management). kandi kugeza atorewe kuba umunyamanga uhoraho muri minisiteri y'ibikorwa \nremezo yabaye Mukasine umuyobozi mukuru w'istinda ishoramari mu Rwanda(RIG).\nKuya 29 kamena 2020 nibwo Madame Mukasine Marie Claire yarahiriye imbere y'urukiko rukuru rw'ikirenga\nrwari ruyobowe na perezida na perezida w'inama nkuru y'Ubucamanza,DR Nteziryayo Foustin."}
{"id": "9572", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9572", "title": "Joyce uwamahoro", "text": "Joyce uwamahoro.\nJoyce uwamahoro ni umunyarwandakazi ndetse akaba yikorera ibijyanye n'imideli akaba ariwe washinze joyce fashion designs iherereye i Kigali mu isoko rya Nyarugenge.\nyashinze joyce fashion designs muri 2018.\nUmwuga.\nJoyce uwamahoro yatangije uruganda rwe muri 2018 aho bitari byoroshye kuko atari afite igishoro gihagije gusa yagiye amanyekana binyuze ku mbuga nkoranyambaga\nbituma atangira kugenda abona abikiriya batandukanye hirya no hino bimwe mu bikorwa bye harimo; Guma mu Rugo Collection,Nyampinga dedicated Collection, ingenzi \ncollection. akaba akora iyi mideli yabagabo ndetse nabagore afite intego yo kugirango u Rwanda rwihaze mu bijyanye ni isoko ry'imyenda ndetse bibashe no kugera ku rwego mpuzamahanga."}
{"id": "9573", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9573", "title": "Gangb\u00e9!", "text": "Gangb\u00e9! ni film ya documentaire yumuziki yo muri B\u00e9nine 2018 iyobowe na Arnaud Robert kandi yakozwe na Aline Schmid kuri Intermezzo Films. \nIyi filime ishingiye ku rugendo rwa Gangb\u00e9 Brass Band, itsinda ry\u2019umuziki rigizwe n\u2019abanyamuryango 10 bo muri B\u00e9nine ryitwaye neza hamwe na j\u00f9j\u00fa yo muri Afurika y\u2019iburengerazuba ndetse n\u2019umuziki gakondo wa Vodou hamwe n\u2019iburengerazuba bwa jazz hamwe n\u2019amajwi manini, mu nzira ijya i Lagos kugira ngo bakore hamwe na Femi Kuti kuri Shrine. Filime yakiriwe neza nabayireba. "}
{"id": "9574", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9574", "title": "Sara Lalama", "text": "Sara Lalama (yavutse 14 Gashyantare 1993), ni umukinnyi wa filime wo muri Aligeriya. Yagize uruhare muri \"seri za\" televiziyo Masha'er, \"Le rendez-vous\" na \"Hob Fi Kafas El Itiham\".\nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse ku ya 14 Gashyantare 1993 i Constantine, muri Aligeriya. \nUmwuga.\nYatangiye umwuga we muri Theatre y'Ubufaransa. Yatojwe sinema muri Toulon Regional Conservatory (Ecole De Musique Toulon Initiation), mu Bufaransa imyaka ine. Muri 2013, yakinnye filime ya mbere muri mu ikinamico \"Asrar el madi\" yerekanwe kuri Aligeriya 3. Amaze gutsinda muri serial, yatumiriwe gukina urukurikirane \"rwurwenya, La classe\" muri 2014. Muri serial, yakinnye nka 'Nourhane'. Hanyuma muri 2015, Lalama yakinnye cyane 'Yasmine' muri \"seri ya televiziyo Hob Fi Kafas El Itiham\" iyobowe na Bachir Sellami.\nMuri 2016, yakinnye bwa mbere muri sinema 'Nedjma' hamwe na film \"El boughi\". Nyuma muri uwo mwaka, yakinnye nka 'Quamar', muri \"ikinamico Qoloub Tahta Ramad\" iyobowe na Bachir Sellami. Muri 2017, yakinnye muri serial \"Samt El Abriyaa\". Kuva mu 2019, yagaragaye ku ikinamico \"Masha'er yatangajwe\" muri Aligeriya na Tuniziya. Muri uwo mwaka, yitabiriye umukino wo \"kwidagadura wo muri Alijeriya witwa Chiche Atahaddak\". "}
{"id": "9575", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9575", "title": "Brahim Haggiag", "text": "Brahim Haggiag (1934\u20131997), yari umukinnyi wa filimi muri Alijeriya. Azwi cyane ku ruhare muri filime \"Intambara ya Algiers\", \"Patrouille \u00e0 l'Est\" na \"L'opium et le baton\". \nUmwuga.\nMu 1966, yatangiye gukina umukino wa mbere afite imiterere ya ' Ali La Pointe ' muri filime \"Intambara ya Algiers\" iyobowe na Gillo Pontecorvo. Filime yabaye icyamamare muri uwo mwaka maze Haggiag atoranywa muri filime \"L'opium et le baton\", \"Les hors-la-loi\" na \"Chronicle of the Year of Fire\"."}
{"id": "9576", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9576", "title": "In Search Of Voodoo: Roots To Heaven", "text": "In Search Of Voodoo: Roots To Heaven ni film ya documentaire ya biografiya yo muri B\u00e9nine 2018 iyobowe numukinnyi wamamaye wa Hollywood uzwi cyane Djimon Hounsou kandi afatanije numuyobozi ubwe hamwe na Eric McGaw. \nIyi filime ishingiye ku bintu byabayeho mu buzima bwumukinnyi Djimon Hounsou kandi yibanda ku nkuru z\u2019umuntu ku giti cye, umuco, ndetse n\u2019umwuka za Voodoo, muri Afurika y\u2019iburengerazuba. Filime yakiriwe neza nabayireba. "}
{"id": "9577", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9577", "title": "Souhila M\u00e2allem", "text": "Souhila Mallem (yavutse ku ya 13 Kamena 1988), bakunze kwita Bibicha, ni umukinnyi wa filime wo muri Alijeriya. \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse ku ya 13 Kamena 1988 i Algiers, Alijeriya. Yize amategeko mu ishami ry'amategeko muri kaminuza ya Algiers 1.\nUmwuga.\nMu mwaka wa 2010, yakiriye porogaramu yatewe inkunga na 'Cevital group' yo gushyigikira ikipe y'igihugu ya Alijeriya isakaza umuyoboro wa ENTV. Muri iki gitaramo, yabonywe n\u2019umuyobozi Djafar Gassem, nyuma atanga uruhare muriserial \"Djemai family 1\" nka 'Faty'. Hanyuma yakinnye muri serial \"Dar Bahdja\" nka 'Zina'. Nyamara gukina filimi yakunzwe cyane byaje mu ruhare rwa 'Bibicha' muri serial izwi cyane ya \"Bibiche na Bibicha\". Nyuma yaje gukina nka 'Princess Abla' muri serial \"Sultan Achour 10\" nizindi nshingano nka 'Sabrina' muri serial \"El Khawa\" ndetse na 'Lila' muri sitcom \"Wlad Hlal\"."}
{"id": "9578", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9578", "title": "Merouane Guerouabi", "text": "Merouane Guerouabi (yavutse ku ya 11 Mutarama 1989), bakunze kwita Bibich, ni umukinnyi wa filimi muri Alijeriya akaba n'umunyarwenya. \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse ku ya 11 Mutarama 1989 i Algiers, Alijeriya. Se El Hachemi Guerouabi yari umuririmbyi wo muri Alijeriya akaba n'uwahimbye Cha\u00e2bi akaba n'umwe mu ba Masters bakuru b'umuziki wa Cha\u00e2bi ukomoka muri Alijeriya. Mbere yo gukina, yari umukinnyi wumupira wamaguru. \nUmwuga.\nNyuma y\u2019abakinnyi benshi batatsinze, Guerouabi yahisemo kwandika igishushanyo cya mbere cyacishijwe kuri interineti mu 2013 hamwe n\u2019izina rya \"MGDZ\". \nMuri 2017, yagaragaye mu kiganiro kuri televiziyo \"Huiti\u00e8me Jour\" (J8). "}
{"id": "9579", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9579", "title": "Numidia Lezoul", "text": "Numidia Lezoul (yavutse 10 Gashyantare 1996), ni umukinnyi wa filime wo muri Alijeriya. Yavukiye mu ishami rya Tizi Ouzou. Yize umuziki n'umurage wa Andalusiya imyaka 8. Muri 2016, yatangiye umwuga wo gukina afite uruhare runini 'mushiki wa Bouzid Zahra' kuri tereviziyo ya \"sitidiyo ya Buside\". Hanyuma yagaragaye muri \"seri ya Taht almuraqaba yo muri 2017\" nka 'fianc\u00e9e wumunyamerika Abdullah'. Muri uwo mwaka, yitabiriye umukino wo \"kwidagadura wo muri Alijeriya witwa Chiche Atahaddak\". "}
{"id": "9580", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9580", "title": "Meriem Oukbir", "text": "Meriem Oukbir (yavutse 26 Gashyantare 1991), ni umukinnyi wa filime wo muri Alijeriya. Azwi cyane ku ruhare 'Dalya' muri filime \"Wlad Lahlal\". Yarangije kaminuza muri 2013. Igihe yari muri kaminuza, yatangiye umwuga we w'icyitegererezo. Muri 2016, yagize uruhare rukomeye rwumukobwa wa Zahra murukurikirane \"rwurwenya\". Maryam yageze ku ntsinzi nk'umukinnyi wa filime kubera uruhare rukunzwe rwa 'Zahra' muri serie \"On Watch\", aho yakiriwe neza na rubanda. "}
{"id": "9581", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9581", "title": "\u00c2ngelo Torres (actor)", "text": "\u00c2ngelo Torres (yavutse ku ya 14 Mata 1968), ni umukinnyi wa filimi Porutugali akaba n'umuyobozi wa S\u00e3o Tom\u00e9an. Azwi cyane kubera uruhare muri firime \"Kunta\", \"Hay Road\" na \"Magnetick Pathways\". \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse ku ya 14 Mata 1968 muri Gineya ya Ekwatoriya. Ababyeyi be bari S\u00e3o Tom\u00e9ans naho Torres afite abavandimwe 24, nubwo batatu gusa bakomoka kuri se na nyina. Afite imyaka itandatu, yavuye muri Gineya ya Ekwatoriya yimukira muri Cuba, aho yize ibijyanye n'ubuhanga kugeza afite imyaka 21. Amaze imyaka irindwi muri Cuba, yimukiye muri Porutugali yiga mu kigo cya Polytechnic i Lisbonne. Nyuma, yatangiye gukina umukino wa mbere muri \"Por Por preto\". Arubatse kuri Galician n'umugore afite umukobwa umwe, Mar. \nUmwuga.\nGukina sinema ye ya mbere yaje kunyura muri firime \"A Ilha dos Escravos\". Yatorewe kuba Umukinnyi witwaye neza mu mwaka wa 2012, kubera filime yitwa \"Estrada de Palha\". Nyuma muri uwo mwaka, yatsindiye igihembo kimwe kuri firime imwe muri 18 Festival Caminhos do Cinema Portugu\u00eas. "}
{"id": "9582", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9582", "title": "Miguel Hurst", "text": "Miguel Jo\u00e3o de Andrade Hurst (yavutse ku ya 6 Kamena 1967), uzwi cyane nka Miguel Hurst, ni umukinnyi wa filimi muri Angola akaba n'umuyobozi wa filimi ukomoka mu Budage no muri Porutugali. Azwi cyane kubera uruhare muri firime\"Foreign Land\", \"Le pacte du Silence\" and \"Filhos do Vento\"\nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse ku ya 6 Kamena 1967 i Freiburgo mu Budage arahakurira kugeza ku myaka icyenda. Kuva mu 1977 kugeza 1979, yabaga muri Gineya Bissau hanyuma yimukira i Lisbonne, Porutugali kuva 1979 kugeza 2003. Muri kiriya gihe, yize mu ishuri rya Theatre na Sinema rya Lisbonne nyuma ashinga itsinda ry\u2019imikino rya Pau Preto i Lisbonne. Mu 2003, yimukiye i Luanda, muri Angola maze agirwa umuyobozi w'ikigo cya Angola Institute of Audiovisual and Multimedia Cinema (IACAM). \nUmwuga.\nMu 1995 yinjiye mu bakinnyi ba \"Teatro Nacional D.Maria II-Lisboa\". Mu 2007, yakoze nk'umwarimu muri disipuline Intangiriro yubuhanzi muri Universidade Independente, Luanda. Hanyuma guhera mu 2005, yakoraga ku mateka yikinamico mu kigo cyigihugu gishinzwe amahugurwa yubuhanzi umwaka umwe. \nHagati ya 2010 na 2016, akora muri Goethe-Institut Angola (Instituto Cultural Alemao), aho yaje gusaba umushinga Christiane Schulte umushinga wo kwerekana umuco wa sinema wa Angola. Yabaye umuyobozi wubuhanzi muri Semba Comunica\u00e7\u00e3o, akina kuri televiziyo \"Fora de S\u00e9rie\". Nyuma yaje gukorana na opera nyinshi nka \"Sede de Viver\", \"O Comba\", \"O Testamento\" na \"Minha Terra Minha M\u00e3e\". Hagati aho, mu 2015, yasohoye igitabo cyitwa \"Angola Cinemas\", ku bufatanye n\u2019umufotozi Walter Fernandes. Nkuwashinze, umuyobozi nuyobora ibicuruzwa bya Pau Preto Theatre Group, atunganya amakinamico menshi arimo; \"Os Condenados\", \"Museu do Pau Preto\", \"Cabral\", \"Alim\u00e1ria\", \"Id\u00e9ia Karapinha\", Quem, \"Inyenzi yo\" \"Kuririmba\" na \"Woza Albert\". "}
{"id": "9583", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9583", "title": "Ant\u00f3nio Tavares (writer)", "text": "Ant\u00f3nio Tavares (yavutse 1960), n'umwanditsi wa Porutugali na Angola. Ni n'umunyamakuru, umwarimu n'umunyapolitiki wo muri Porutugali. \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse mu 1960 i Lobito, muri Angola. Mu 1975, afite imyaka 15, yimukiye muri Porutugali nyuma yo gukoronizwa muri Afurika. Nyuma yize amashuri yisumbuye i Porto. Nyuma, yarangije amategeko mu ishami ry'amategeko muri kaminuza ya Coimbra. Nyuma yaje kubona impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya kabiri cya kaminuza mu by'amategeko agenga itumanaho muri kaminuza imwe. Amaze kurangiza amashuri, yatangiye gukora nk'umwarimu mu mashuri yisumbuye mu Ishuri ryisumbuye Domingos Rebelo (Escola Secund\u00e1ria Domingos Rebelo), i Ponta Delgada, nyuma mu ishuri rya Dr. Joaquim de Carvalho (Escola Secund\u00e1ria Dr. Joaquim de Carvalho), muri Figueira da Foz. \nHagati aho, yinjiye muri politiki ya Porutugali maze aba umuyobozi muri komine ya Figueira da Foz kuva 2005 kugeza 2009, nyuma aba umuyobozi mu nzego z'umuco, imijyi n'ibidukikije kuva 2009 kugeza 2013. Kuva mu 2013 gushika 2017, Tavares ni visi perezida wa komine. \nUmwuga.\nMuri 2013, yakiriye icyubahiro mu gihembo cya Alves Redol kubera igitabo cyitwa 'O Tempo Adormeceu sob o Sol da Tarde'. Tavares yanditse igitabo \"kizwi cyane nka Palavras que Me Dever\u00e3o Guiar um Dia\" aho yari yarangije igihembo cya Leya 2013. Ariko, muri 2015 yatsindiye igihembo cya Leya kubera igitabo \"O Coro dos Defuntos\" (Korali y'abapfuye). Yashinze kandi ikinyamakuru yo mu karere 'A Linha do Oeste' n'ikinyamakuru 'Litorais'. "}
{"id": "9584", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9584", "title": "Orlando S\u00e9rgio", "text": "Orlando S\u00e9rgio (wavutse 1960), ni Umukinnyi wa filimi muri Angola. Azwi cyane ku ruhare muri filime \"Amabaruwa y'intambara\", \"Liberdade\" \"n'Intwari\". "}
{"id": "9585", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9585", "title": "Erica Chissapa", "text": "\u00c9rica Sofia de Jesus Chissapa Bicho (yavutse ku ya 22 Ukuboza 1988), uzwi cyane nka Erica Chissapa, ni umukinnyi wa filime akaba n'umunyamakuru wa Angola. Azwi cyane kubera uruhare muri firime\"\", \"Voo Directo\" and \"Jikulumessu\".\nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse ku ya 22 Ukuboza 1988 i Huambo, mu kibaya cyo hagati cya Angola. Nyuma yaje kwimukira i Luanda afite imyaka ibiri gusa kandi abana na ba sekuruza, asize ababyeyi be na barumuna be batatu mu gihugu cye. \nUmwuga.\nAfite imyaka 14, Erica yinjiye mu ikinamico. Mugihe yari mu myitozo yitsinda ryamakinamico i Luanda, yatumiriwe gusimbura umwe mubakinnyi bakinnye, wagombaga gufungura nyuma yiminsi itatu. Hanyuma yimukiye kuri seri ya televiziyo abitumiwe n'umukinnyi Orlando S\u00e9rgio. Ariko, ntabwo yatsinze ikizamini cyambere. Nyuma yaje gutsinda guhitamo miniseries, ariko ikibabaje nuko umusaruro wahagaritswe nyuma yimitwe ibiri yanditswe. Icyakora, yakomeje kwigaragaza mu ikinamico ya Angola hamwe nitsinda ryamakinamico 'Henriques Artes'. \nMu 2005, yakinnye muri opera yisabune \"Sede de Viver\" anakina nka 'K\u00e1tia'. Intsinzi imaze gutsinda, yatumiwe kugira uruhare runini muri Brezil-Angola \"ikorana na Minha\" \"Terra Minha M\u00e3e\". Mu mwaka wa 2010, yakinnye muri filimi ya Porutugali - Angola \"Voo Directo\". Muri uruhererekane, \u00c9rica yagize uruhare nka 'Weza Oliveira'. Muri 2014, yatumiriwe kujya mu ikinamico \"Jikulumessu\" n'umuririmbyi Cor\u00e9on D\u00fa. "}
{"id": "9586", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9586", "title": "Filipe Duarte (actor)", "text": "Lu\u00eds Filipe Duarte Ferreira da Silva, uzwi cyane ku izina rya Filipe Duarte (5 Kamena 1973 - 17 Mata 2020), yari umukinnyi wa filimi muri Portugal akaba n'umuhanzi w'ijwi. Azwi cyane kubera uruhare muri firime \"Varia\u00e7\u00f5es: Umumarayika Murinzi\", \"Cinzento e Negro\" na \"Urusaku\".\nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse ku ya 5 Kamena 1973 i Nova Lisboa, icyo gihe avukira mu gihugu cya Porutugali na Angola. Yashakanye n'umukinnyi wa filime wo muri Espagne, Nuria Menc\u00eda. Abashakanye bafite umukobwa umwe, Antonia wavutse muri Werurwe 2011. Duarte yapfuye ku ya 17 Mata 2020, ubwo COVID-19 yafungwaga bwa mbere muri Porutugali, afite imyaka 46 azize indwara ya myocardial. \nUmwuga.\nDuarte yarangije amasomo yikinamico kuri theatre kuri Theatre ya Lisbonne na School of Film. Hanyuma yarangije amahugurwa yabakinnyi mu kigo cyubushakashatsi no guhanga amakinamico. Yatangiye umwuga we wo gukina akina amakinamico menshi ayobowe n'abayobozi b'amakinamico bazwi cyane Adolfo Gutkin, Rog\u00e9rio de Carvalho, Geraldo Touch\u00e9, Francisco Salgado, Carlos J. Pessoa, Laila Ripol na Miguel Seabra.\nKuri televiziyo, yakinnye kuri filimi\"Teorema de Pit\u00e1goras\", iyobowe na Gon\u00e7alo Galv\u00e3o Telles. Hanyuma yinjiye muri \"serivise ebyiri za televiziyo A Ferreirinha\", iyobowe na Jorge Paix\u00e3o da Costa na \"Jo\u00e3o Semana\", na Jo\u00e3o Cayatte. Amaze kuba umukinnyi uzwi cyane muri serial, yagize uruhare runini muri serie ya \"Ecuador\" yari ishingiye ku gitabo cyanditswe na Miguel Sousa Tavares. Muri 2013, yakinnye cyane 'Jo\u00e3o Belmonte' muri seri ya televiziyo \"Belmonte\". \nHagati aho, Filipe yakoraga amajwi asanzwe yerekana amakatuni na firime zirimo umuntu uzwi cyane 'Sanosuke Sagara' muri animasiyo ya \"Samurai X\"\".\" Igihe yapfaga mu 2020, yafataga amajwi y'ikinamico yo muri Berezile \"Amor de M\u00e3e\", yerekanaga kuri SIC, yinjira mu bakinnyi ba filime \"Nothing Ever Happened\" iyobowe na Gon\u00e7alo Galv\u00e3o Teles."}
{"id": "9587", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9587", "title": "Eric Santos", "text": "Eric Santos (yavutse ku ya 31 Mutarama 1972), ni umukinnyi wa filimi n'umwanditsi wa Porutugali. Azwi cyane kubera uruhare muri firime \"Scoundrel\", \"The Compass\", \"Jikulumessu\" na \"Kaminey\". \nUmwuga.\nSantos yatangiye umwuga we mu 1996 akoresheje filimi \"Pra\u00e7a da Alegria\". Kuva icyo gihe yagiye mu ikinamico, filime, urukurikirane, muri Angola no mu Giportigale. \nNiwe washinze kandi akaba n'umuyobozi mukuru wa 'Cast 39', Ikigo gishinzwe impano gikorera muri Porutugali. "}
{"id": "9588", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9588", "title": "Carlos Paulo", "text": "Carlos Paulo Sim\u00f5es (yavutse ku ya 11 Kamena 1951), ni umukinnyi wa filimi muri Angola akaba n'umwanditsi. Azwi cyane kubera uruhare muri firime \"Operation Autumn\", \"Konseye wa Bordeaux\" na \"Cacau da Ribeira\". "}
{"id": "9589", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9589", "title": "Ciomara Morais", "text": "Ciomara Otoniela Morais (yavutse ku ya 14 Werurwe 1984), ni umukinnyi wa filime ukomoka muri Porutigali wavukiye muri Angola ufite inkomoko ya Macanese. Morais azwi cyane nk'umuyobozi wa firime \"Querida Preciosa\", \"\" and \"A Ilha dos C\u00e3es\"\nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse ku ya 14 Werurwe 1984 i Benguela, muri Angola. \nUmwuga.\nMu 2005, yakinnye bwa mbere muri filimi ya \"Morangos com A\u00e7\u00facar\". Muri uruhererekane, uruhare rwe nka 'Salom\u00e9' rwamenyekanye cyane kandi yakiriye imirimo myinshi mumyaka iri imbere kuri tereviziyo. Bamwe muribo barimo, uruhare 'Leonor' muri \"Di\u00e1rio de Sofia\", uruhare 'Masara' muri \"Equador\" hanyuma muri \"Makamba Hotel\". Hagati aho, yimukiye mu ikinamico akina umukino wa mbere \"A Balada da Margem Sul\" iyobowe na H\u00e9lder Costa. \nYakoze sinema ye ya mbere muri firime ya 2009 \"The Abused\" afite uruhare ruto. Uruhare rwe rwa mbere muri cinema rwanyuze muri 2011 rwamamaye cyane \"All Is Well\" with the role 'Leonor'. Yatsindiye igihembo cy'umukinnyi witwaye neza muri Festival du Cin\u00e9ma Africain de Khouribga (FCAK), Maroc na The Carthage Film Festival, Tuniziya mu mwaka wa 2012 kubera uruhare yagize muri filime \"\". Muri uwo mwaka, iyi filime yatsindiye igihembo cya Filime nziza y\u2019igiportigale mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga ryigenga rya IndieLisboa. \nMuri 2012, yerekanwe bwa mbere \"mubuyobozi no kwandika hamwe na firime ngufi Encontro com o Criador\". Hagati aho, yanavuze kuri firime ya animasiyo 'Nayola'. "}
{"id": "9590", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9590", "title": "Cyiza Beatrice", "text": "CYIZA Beatrice (yavutse 23 werurwe 1983), avukira muri zayire, congo y'ubu, ni umwana w'umuhererezi mu muryango avukamo. Ise akaba yitwaga Athase NTIBANYURWA Nyina akitwa Beatrice BAZIZANE.\nImirimo akora ubu.\nCYIZA Beatrice Ni Umuyobozi mukuru, W\u2019Ibidukikije n\u2019imihindagurikire y\u2019ikirere muri Minisiteri y\u2019ibidukikije mu Rwanda, agenzura iterambere n\u2019ikwirakwizwa ry\u2019amategeko, ingamba na gahunda bijyanye no kurengera ibidukikije, imihindagurikire y\u2019ikirere no kurwanya umwanda. Binyuze mu myanya itandukanye n'amahugurwa, yakusanyije ubunararibonye mu micungire y\u2019ibidukikije.\nImirimo yakoze.\nMbere yo kwinjira muri Minisiteri y\u2019ibidukikije, yakoraga mu kigo cy\u2019u Rwanda gishinzwe kubungabunga ubuhinzi nkumuhuzabikorwa w\u2019ubuyobozi ushinzwe amasomo, kwagura no gukoresha ubushakashatsi.\nMbere yibyo, yabaye umuyobozi ushinzwe igenzura n\u2019ibidukikije mu kigo gishinzwe imicungire y\u2019ibidukikije mu Rwanda (REMA) ndetse anakora nka Nagoya Protocol Focal point mu myaka irenga 7.Nkigihugu cyibanze kuri Protokole ya Nagoya, yayoboye imishinga itandukanye igamije kugenzura uburyo bwo kubona umutungo wa genetike ategura ingamba na gahunda zitandukanye.\nMubushobozi bwe nk'umukozi ushinzwe kugenzura no gukurikirana ibidukikije; yakoze ibikorwa byo kugenzura ibidukikije kumishinga itandukanye ikorwa kandi akurikirana iyubahirizwa ry'amabwirizwa y\u2019ibidukikije."}
{"id": "9591", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9591", "title": "Umuhire Adrie", "text": "Amavu n' amavuko.\nHon. Umuhire Adrie (yavutse taliki 25.07.1977) ni umunyapolitiki wo mu Rwanda, senateri watowe ahagarariye mu ntara y'amajyepfo. Umuhire afite Impamyabumenyi y'ikirenga mu inyigisho z'iterambere. \nUmwuga.\nGuhera mu Kwakira 2019,yabaye umusenateri na perezida wa komite ishinzwe imibereho myiza n'uburenganzira bwa muntu, iyi mirimo aracyayikomeje (Senator and the chairperson of the committee on Social Affairs and Human Rights from October 2019- ongoing), kuva mu mwaka wa 2006 kugera Ukwakira 2019 yakoze muri kaminuza y'u Rwanda ishami ryigisha ubugeni cg ubuhanzi n'ubumenyi bw'imibereho (Assistant Lecturer at University of Rwanda, College of Arts and Social Science from 2006 up to October 2019), sibyo gusa kuko kuva 2011 kugera 2016 yabaye umwe mu bagize akanama k'abagore bashinzwe imibereho myiza mu murenge wa Ngoma mu akarere ka Huye, mu intara y' amagepfo (A member of National Women Council in Charge of Social Affairs in Ngoma Sector of Huye District /Southern Province: 2011- 2016), mu nama y'abasenateri yabaye kuwa 30 Werurwe 2021, umuyobozi wa sena Hon Adrie Umuhire yavuze ko ubushakashatsi bwabo bwakozwe mu turere 12 muri 30, bugaragaza iterambere ry'ubumwe n'ubwiyunge ko bishoboka niba abaturage bose babishishikarijwe.\nAmashakiro.\nhttps://www.rba.co.rw/post/Abasenateri-bavuze-ko-hari-ibikwiye-gukorwa-mu-kunoza-ireme-ryuburezi\nhttps://web.archive.org/web/20211111084408/https://www.parliament.gov.rw/senate-2/senators-profiles/senators-profile-1\nhttps://web.archive.org/web/20211120193109/https://www.ktpress.rw/2021/03/senate-recommends-best-practices-in-unity-and-reconciliation-initiatives/\nhttps://web.archive.org/web/20211120193101/https://imvahonshya.co.rw/sena-yemeje-prof-lyambabaje-nkumuyobozi-mukuru-wa-kaminuza-yu-rwanda/"}
{"id": "9592", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9592", "title": "Th\u00e9r\u00e8se Bishagara Kagoyire", "text": "Th\u00e9r\u00e8se Bishagara Kagoyire (yavutse ku wa 25 Ukuboza 1952 \u2013 apfa ku wa 8 Nyakanga 2019) yari umushakashatsi mu by'ubuzima, umwarimu akaba n'umunyapolitiki w'Umunyarwandakazi. \nKuva mu Ukwakira 2011 kugeza apfuye, yari Senateri watorewe guhagararira Intara y'Iburengerazuba mu Nteko Ishinga Amategeko, Umutwe wa Sena.\nAmashuri.\nBishagara yari afite impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya kabiri cya kaminuza (\"Master's\") mu bijyanye n'ibinyabuzima, by'umwihariko \"Molecular Biology Sciences\".\nImirimo yakoze.\nMuri Sena.\nMu Ukwakira 2011, Bishagara yatorewe kuba Senateri uhagarariye Intara y'Iburengerazuba muri manda ya kabiri ya Sena y'u Rwanda. Muri Sena yari umwe mu bagize Komisiyo y'Ububanyi n'Amahanga, Ubutwererane n'Umutekano, kugeza apfuye.\nUrupfu.\nSenateri Bishagara Kagoyire yitabye Imana ku wa Mbere, tariki ya 8 Nyakanga 2019, aguye mu bitaro bya Johns Hopkins i Baltimore muri Leta ya Maryland, muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe z'Amerika, aho yari yaragiye kwivuriza. Umurambo we wagejejwe mu Rwanda, maze inshuti, umuryango n'abayobozi batandukanye bamusezeraho bwa nyuma."}
{"id": "9594", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9594", "title": "BAKUNDUFITE Christine", "text": "Bakundufite Christine ni umunyarwandakazi wavutse taliki 29 Nzeri 1970, Afite ikiciro cya Gatatu cya kaminuza muri business (Master of Business Administration). Ubu ni umunyapolitiki akaba n'umuhanga mu by'ubukungu mu Rwanda. kuri ubu ni umudepite mu inteko ishingamategeko umutwe w'abadepite mu karere ka Gatsibo mu intara y'iburasirazuba. Yatorewe kuba mu inteko ishingamategeko mu mwaka wa 2018, mbere yakoraga nk'uyobozi w'ikigo, umucungamari n'inzobere mu ibaruramari. \nImirimo yakoze.\nBakundufite Christine yabaye umuyobozi w' urwunge rw' amashuri rwa Bumba kuva 2003-2005(Headmistress at Groupe Scolaire Bumba), kuva 2005-2011 yabaye umucungamari muri OCIR-CAFE (Accountant at OCIR \u2013 CAF\u00c9), 2011-2012 yakoraga mu kigo cy'igihugu gishinzwe iterambere ry'ubuhinzi n'ibyoherezwa mu mahanga (NAEB) aho yari ashinzwe gutegura no gukurikirana ingengo y'imari (In charge of Budget at NAEB), 2012- 2018 yakomereje imirimo ye muri NAEB/price ar'inzobere mu ibaruramari. Ubu ni umwe mu abagize inteko ishingamategeko y'u Rwanda, akaba n'uhagarariye abagore mu inteko ishingamategeko mu Rwanda kuva mu mwaka wa 2018.\nAmashakiro.\nhttps://web.archive.org/web/20211111084408/https://www.parliament.gov.rw/senate-2/senators-profiles/senators-profile-1\nhttps://web.archive.org/web/20211121090938/https://naeb.gov.rw/index.php?id=27\nhttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Christine_Bakundufite\nhttps://web.archive.org/web/20220307203956/https://nec.gov.rw/uploads/media/URUTONDE_RW_ABADEPITE_BEMEJWE_KO_BATOWE_BURUNDU_MU_MATORA_YA_2018.pdf\nhttps://web.archive.org/web/20211121090940/https://naeb.gov.rw/index.php?id=331"}
{"id": "9595", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9595", "title": "Sylvie Mpongera", "text": "Sylvie Mpongera ni umuvudizi wungirije Mu ishyaka (PSR).\nUbumenyi N'ubushobozi.\nNi Umwigisha mu buzima bw'umubyeyi n'umwana, ubuzima rusange cyangwa Gutanga serivisi za Clinical, amateka muri rusange\nubuvuzi cyangwa urwego rwo hejuru mu buforomo, hamwe n'imyaka 5 y'uburambe ku bumenyi mu buzima bw'ababyeyi."}
