{"id": "9597", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9597", "title": "Solange Uwingabe", "text": "UWINGABE Solange (yavutse 5 ukwakira 1970) ni umunyarwandakizi w' umunyapolitiki, ni umuvugizi w ' imitwe ya politiki yemewe mu Rwanda, akaba yaratowe uwo mwanya ku wa 25 werurwe 2021 ubwo inteko rusange y imitwe ya politiki yateranaga mu gushiraho abayobozi b'amanda yarikurikiye. UWINGABE yabanje gukora imirimo itandukanye aho yakoze mu bigo bitanga ubwishingizi mu Rwanda, mbere yo kuba umudepite mu nteko ishinga amategeko mu Rwanda.\nUbuzima Bwite.\nUWINGABE Solange ni umunyepolitiki uzwi akaba afite impamyabumenyi y\u2019icyiciro cya Gatatu cya Kaminuza mu bijyanye n\u2019Amategeko, mu bijyanye n\u2019ubucuruzi, aho yayikuye mu yahoze ari Kaminuza Nkuru y\u2019u Rwanda. Mbere ya 2018, yakoze mu bigo by'ubwishingizi bitandukanye mu Rwanda, aho yagiye ayobora amashami atandukanye yabyo atandukanye ndetse akaba yaragiye akora mu myanya ushinzwe abakozi ndetse akaba yaragiye aba umujyanama mu by\u2019amategeko. Uwingabe ni uwo mu Ishyaka rya PSR, akaba ari umuvugizi wa NFPO. \nAkazi yakoze.\nUWINGABE Solange yakoze imiromo mwinshi harimo:"}
{"id": "9598", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9598", "title": "Christine Nkulikiyinka", "text": "Christine Nkulikiyinka (yavutse ku 1 Gashyantare 1965) mu w'u Rwanda ariwo Kigali. Ni umudiporomete w'u Rwanda ndetse ni n'umukozi wa leta. Ubu akaba ahagarariye u Rwanda mu burayi bw'amanjyaruguru.\nUbumenyi.\nKuva 1985 yize ikidage mu mahanga arangije agaruka mu Rwanda, Kuva 1991 kugeza 2005 yakoraga muri ambasande y'u Rwanda mu Budage, Yatangiye akazi kubunjyanama n'umusezeguzi mu 2006, yakoze no muri Minisiteri y'Ububanyi n'amahanga i Kigali, Yize muri kaminuza ya Ludwigshafen mu Binganye n;ubumenyi ngiro aho yaje kubona ni impamyabumenyi y'ubucuzi bwa mbukiranya imipaka.\nAkaba avuga indimi zingera kuri enye(4) arizo ikidage, icyongereza, ikinyarwanda n'igifaransa.\nIbikorwa y'akoze.\nAmbasaderi Christine Nkulikiyinka yateguye igikorwa Muza mahanga cyo kunamira abacu bazize Genocide yakorewa Abatutsi muri 1994 Cyabaye kakoreshejwe ikorana buhanga kubera icyorezo cya kovide-19. Yasobanuye ko kwibuka ari igikorwa gikomeye kandi gifite akamaro ku banyarwanda kandi gifite n'uburemere bikwiye kubahirizwa.\nUbuzima Bwite.\nAmbasaderi Christine Nkulikiyinka arubatse kandi afite abana babiri"}
{"id": "9599", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9599", "title": "Uwimana Consolee", "text": "AMATEKA\nUwimana Consol\u00e9e yavukiye mu Karere ka Burera mu mwaka wa 1971. Amashuri abanza yayatangiriye i Burera, akomereza i Cyabingo mu Karere ka Gakenke, naho ayisumbuye ayiga muri Lyc\u00e9e Notre-Dame de C\u00eeteaux i Kigali. Yize ibijyanye n\u2019ubukungu, nyuma akora igihe kinini muri Banki y\u2019Abaturage, aho yagiye akora imirimo itandukanye.\nUwimana Consolee yahoze ari perezida wa sena yu Rwanda. Uwimana ni rwiyemezamirimo akaba n'umunyamabanki wa bizobereyemo\nImirimo yakoze.\nHon Consolee Uwimana Yakoze ibushakashatsi mu turere twose tw'u Rwanda uko tungana ari 30 atuzegurukamo ashaka imibare yabasigajwe inyuma na amateka ariko yasanze imubare ukiri hasi cyane, gusa ibibazo bahura nabyo aribyo byinshi. Muri ibyo bibazo basanze abana babo batajya ku ishuri uko bikwiye.\nHon Consolee yifatanyije na bagore bo mu karere ka Gakenke ku italiki ya 25/10/2014 wari umunsi mukuru wahariwe umugore wo mu cyaro, umuco nyarwanda wagaragaye ko ubazitira mu iterambere.\nMu ishyaka FPR.\nMu matora yabaye ku itariki ya 2 Mata 2023, nibwo ku cyicaro cy\u2019ishyaka rya FPR Inkotanyi hazwi nka Intare Conference Arena, nibwo kongere y\u2019igihugu ya cumi na gatandatu ya FPR yatorewemo komite Nyobozi nshya y\u2019igihugu bituma Uwimana Consol\u00e9e atorerwa kuba visi perezida mushya waryo, asimbuye Bazivamo Christophe, Uwimana yabonye amajwi 1945 ahagarariye 92.7% yabatoye bose aho yungirije umuyobozi mukuru Paul Kagame. \nIbimwerekeyeho.\nConsolee Uwimana arubatse kandi afite abana batatu."}
{"id": "9600", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9600", "title": "Valentine Uwamariya", "text": "Madam Valentine Uwamariya (wavutse ku ya 14 Gicurasi mu mwaka 1971) akora ubu ni Minisitiri w\u2019uburinganire n\u2019iterambere ry\u2019umuryango mbere yari Minisitiri w\u2019uburezi mu Rwanda, yashyizweho na Perezida wa Repuburika yu Rwanda muri Gashyantare mu mwaka 2020. \nAmavu n'amavuko.\n.Madam Valentine Uwamariya yavutse ku ya 14 Gicurasi mun mwaka1971 mu Murenge wa Shangi mu Karere ka Nyamasheke. Yabonye impamyabumenyi y'amashuri yisumbuye muri Groupe Scolaire Sainte Famille, Nyamasheke. Yakomeje amashuri ye kandi abona impamyabumenyi ihanitse muri Chimie Organic yakuye muri kaminuza nkuru y\u2019u Rwanda. Mu mwaka 2005, Uwamariya yabonye impamyabumenyi ihanitse muri Electrochemistry yakuye muri kaminuza ya Witwatersrand muri Afurika y'Epfo. Nyuma yaho, mu mwaka 2007, yabonye buruse yo kwiga Porogaramu ya PhD muri UNESCO-IHE naho mu mwaka 2013 abona impamyabumenyi y'ikirenga. \nUmwuga.\nUwamariya Valentine yabaye umuyobozi wungirije ushinzwe amahugurwa, iterambere ry\u2019ibigo n\u2019ubushakashatsi muri Rwanda Polytechnic iherutse gushingwa mbere gato yuko aba Minisitiri w\u2019uburezi. "}
{"id": "9601", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9601", "title": "Christine Nyatanyi", "text": "Christine Nyatanyi (16 Nyakanga 1965 - 26 Nzeri 2011) yari impuguke mu by'ubukungu n\u2019umunyapolitiki, yabaye umunyamabanga wa Leta ushinzwe imibereho myiza muri minisiteri y\u2019ubutegetsi bw\u2019igihugu, kuva mu Kwakira 2003 kugeza apfuye muri Nzeri 2011. \nAmavu n'amavuko.\nYavukiye mu Rwanda ku ya 16 Nyakanga 1965. Yize muri kaminuza nkuru y\u2019ubukungu ya Kharkiv, i Kharkiv, muri Ukraine, ari naho yakuye impamyabumenyi ya Bachelor of Economics mu 1987. Nyuma yize muri \"Odessa Institute of National Economy\", arangiza mu 1991 afite Masters mu bijyanye n\u2019inganda. \nUmwuga.\nNyuma ya jenoside yo mu Rwanda yo mu 1994, Nyantanyi yakoranye na komite mpuzamahanga ya Croix-Rouge (ICRC), muri \"Department of Tracing\", i Goma, Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo ni Nairobi muri Kenya. Mu 1997, yagizwe umuyobozi ushinzwe umushinga mu nama ya \"Flemish ishinzwe impunzi\", ifite icyicaro i Buruseli mu Bubiligi. Mu Kwakira 2003, yagizwe Minisitiri w\u2019igihugu ushinzwe imibereho myiza muri Minisiteri y\u2019ubutegetsi bw\u2019igihugu cy\u2019u Rwanda, akora muri urwo rwego kugeza muri Nzeri 2011. \nUrupfu.\nNyatanyi yapfuye ku ya 26 Nzeri 2011, mu bitaro bya kaminuza ya Saint-Luc, i Buruseli mu Bubiligi, nyuma yo kuvurwa igihe kirekire. Umurambo we usubira i Kigali, yurira Brussels Airlines ku wa gatandatu, 1 Ukwakira 2011. Nyuma yigihe kinini cyo kumusezeraho mu teko ishingamategeko na misa ya requiem kuri \"Kiliziya Gatolika ya Regina Pacis\" i Remera, mu nkengero za Kigali, umurambo we washyinguwe mu gihugu. Yasabiwe mu irimbi rya Rusororo i Kabuga, ku wa mbere, 3 Ukwakira 2011. \nIbindi bitekerezo.\nIbihugu byunze ubumwe byahaye igihembo Christine Nyatanyi, mu 2008, mu rwego rwo kumushimira ibikorwa bye ndetse no kubazwa ibyo akora muri gahunda y'igihugu y'u Rwanda Ubudehe '. "}
{"id": "9602", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9602", "title": "Anita Asiimwe", "text": "Anita Asiimwe ni umunyamabanga wa Leta w\u2019u Rwanda akaba n'inzobere mu Ubuzima rusange. Kuva mu Kwakira 2017, yabaye Umuhuzabikorwa w\u2019igihugu muri gahunda y\u2019iterambere ry\u2019abana bato. "}
{"id": "9603", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9603", "title": "Madeleine Ayinkamiye", "text": "Madeleine Ayinkamiye yari umunyapolitiki wo mu Rwanda. Yagizwe Minisitiri w\u2019Imibereho Myiza y'Abaturage mu 1964, bimugira minisitri wa mbere w'abayeho w'umugore mu Rwanda. \nAyinkamiye yakoraga mu biro bya minisitiri kuva ku ya 6 Mutarama 1964 kugeza ku ya 8 Ugushyingo 1965. Niwe minisitiri w\u2019umugore wenyine mu Rwanda hagati y\u2019ubwigenge bw\u2019u Rwanda mu 1962 na Mata 1992. "}
{"id": "9604", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9604", "title": "Jeanne d'Arc Debonheur", "text": "Jeanne d'Arc Debonheur ni umunyamategeko n'umunyapolitiki wo mu Rwanda wabaye Minisitiri w\u2019impunzi n\u2019imicungire y\u2019ibiza kuva ku ya 30 Kanama 2017. \nAmavu n'amavuko.\nYavutse ku ya 19 Mata 1978, kandi yiga mu mashuri yo mu Rwanda mbere yo kwiga kaminuza. Mu 2012 yahawe impamyabumenyi ya masters ny nategeko muri Kaminuza Nkuru y'u Rwanda. \nUmwuga.\nDebonheur yatangiye umwuga we mu 2008, akora nk'umwanditsi w'urukiko mu rukiko rw'ubucuruzi, rufite icyicaro i Musanze na Nyarugenge, akora muri urwo rwego kugeza mu 2011.\nKuva 2011 kugeza 2012 yakoraga nka Legal Drafter ndetse n'Umujyanama mu Mutwe w'Abadepite mu nteko ishingamategeko imitwe yombi. Mu gihe cy'amezi atatu, kuva muri Mutarama 2013 kugeza ku ya 23 Mata 2013, yabaye umuyobozi ushinzwe amategeko muri \"Rwanda Environmental Management Authority\" (REMA). \nKuva ku ya 24 Mata 2013, Debonheur yabaye inzobere mu gutegura amategeko no kuba umujyanama mu by'amategeko muri Sena y'u Rwanda, akora muri urwo rwego kugeza ku ya 29 Kanama 2017. \nKu ya 31 Kanama 2017, yarahiriye kuba Minisitiri w\u2019u Rwanda ushinzwe imicungire y\u2019ibiza n\u2019impunzi. \nUbuzima bwite.\nJeanne d'Arc Debonheur ni umubyeyi wubatse ufite abana batatu. "}
{"id": "9605", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9605", "title": "Aloisea Inyumba", "text": "Aloisea Inyumba (28 Ukuboza 1964 - 6 Ukuboza 2012) yari umunyapolitiki wo mu Rwanda, akaba yari Minisitiri w\u2019uburinganire n\u2019iterambere ry\u2019umuryango ndetse akaba umunyamabanga nshingwabikorwa wa komisiyo y\u2019ubumwe n\u2019ubwiyunge. \nMu gihe yigaga ibijyanye n'imibereho n'imibereho myiza muri kaminuza ya Makerere muri Uganda, yinjiye mu Rwanda Patriotic Front. \nAmagambo yo kumushyingura yatanzwe na Perezida Paul Kagame. \nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nAloisea Inyumba yavutse ku ya 28 Ukuboza 1964 muri Uganda, avuka ku babyeyi bavuka mu Rwanda. Yavutse nyuma y\u2019impinduramatwara yo mu Rwanda yo mu 1959, aho hashyizweho Repubulika yiganjemo Abahutu benshi, no gutoteza abatutsi. [2] Mu gihe ababyeyi be bari bakibera mu Rwanda, kandi mbere yuko avuka, se yiciwe mu bwicanyi bwakorewe abatutsi; nyina yaratorotse hamwe na barumuna be batanu maze umuryango uhungira mu mutekano wa Uganda. \nInyumba yabayeho mu bwana bwe muri Uganda, arangiza amashuri ye, hanyuma akomereza muri kaminuza ya Makerere i Kampala, abona impamyabumenyi mu mibereho myiza y'abaturage. Mu 1985, yabonanye bwa mbere na Paul Kagame, undi wari impunzi iva mu Rwanda icyo gihe yari mu gisirikare cy\u2019inyeshyamba cya Yoweri Museveni. [4] Nyuma y'umwaka umwe, Museveni yigaruriye igihugu maze azamura Kagame na mugenzi we wo mu Rwanda Fred Rwigyema kuba abayobozi mu ngabo z\u2019igihugu. [5] Kagame na Rwigema bafashe iyo myanya, ariko intego yabo nyamukuru kwari ukugaruka mu gihugu cyabo, kugira ngo borohereze impunzi nuko inyumba nawwe yemera kubafasha. \nUmwuga wa politiki.\nNyuma yo gutsinda kwa FPR muri Nyakanga 1994, Inyumba yashyizwe muri guverinoma nshya y\u2019inzibacyuho. yari iyobowe Perezida Pasteur Bizimungu. [8] Yari yashyizweho ku mwanya wa Minisitiri w'Uburinganire n'Iterambere ry'Umuryango, atangira gahunda ikomeye yo kumvisha uruhare rwabo abagore mu kubaka Rwanda. \nMu mwaka wa 2011, yongeye kugirwa inshingano yari yarahoze ari Minisitiri w\u2019uburinganire n\u2019iterambere ry\u2019umuryango, uruhare yagize kugeza apfuye mu 2012. \nUbuzima bwa muntu n'urupfu.\nInyumba yashakanye na Dr Richard Masozera, wahoze ari Umuyobozi mukuru w'ikigo gishinzwe indege za gisivili mu Rwanda (RCAA). Bombi batangiye gukundana igihe bombi bari abanyeshuri muri kaminuza ya Makerere i Kampala. Babyaranye abana babiri, umukobwa n'umuhungu. \nInyumba yapfuye ku ya 6 Ukuboza 2012 iwe i Kigali. Yari arwaye kanseri yo mu muhogo, kandi yari aherutse gusubira mu rugo nyuma yo kwivuriza mu Budage. Inyumba yahawe imihango yo gushyingura leta mu Nteko ishinga amategeko y\u2019u Rwanda i Kigali kandi amagambo ye yatanzwe na perezida w\u2019igihugu, Paul Kagame. Kagame yamusobanuriye ko ari umuyobozi utitanga \"wari umukandida mwiza kandi usobanutse neza\". Abandi batanze ibiganiro mu muhango wo gushyingura barimo Minisitiri w\u2019ibikorwa by\u2019inama y\u2019abaminisitiri Protais Musoni na visi guverineri wa Banki nkuru y\u2019u Rwanda, Monique Nsanzabaganwa. "}
{"id": "9606", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9606", "title": "Fanfan Rwanyindo Kayirangwa", "text": "Fanfan Rwanyindo Kayirangwa ni umunyapolitiki wo mu Rwanda wabaye Minisitiri w\u2019abakozi ba Leta n\u2019umurimo muri guverinoma y\u2019u Rwanda, kuva ku ya 31 Kanama 2017. \nAmavu n'amavuko.\nAfite Impamyabumenyi y'ikirenga, yabonye mu 1997, yakuye muri kaminuza nkuru y'u Rwanda. Yagize kandi Impamyabumenyi ya amasters of Laws, mu 2010 muri Kaminuza ya Witwatersrand, mu Johannesburg, South Africa. \nUmwuga.\nMbere ya 2004, Rwanyindo Kayirangwa yakoraga mu bucuruzi bwa serivisi z'imari. Kuva mu 1998 kugeza 2004, yabaye umujyanama mu by'amategeko akaba n'umukozi ushinzwe inguzanyo muri Banki y'Ubucuruzi y'u Rwanda, uyu munsi icuruza nka I&amp;amp;M Bank Rwanda Limited. \nKuva 2004 kugeza 2017, yakoraga mu bucamanza bw'u Rwanda. Mu 2004, yagizwe umucamanza w'Ubutabera bw'Urukiko Rukuru rw'u Rwanda. Mu 2008 yimuriwe mu Rukiko Rukuru rw'Ubucuruzi. Yagizwe Visi-Perezida w'Urukiko Rukuru rw'Ubucuruzi mu Rwanda mu Kwakira 2013. \nMu ivugurura ry\u2019abaminisitiri ryo ku ya 31 Kanama 2017, Fanfan Rwanyindo Kayirangwa yagizwe minisitiri mushya w\u2019abakozi ba Leta n\u2019umurimo, asimbuye Judith Uwizeye, wabaye Minisitiri mu biro bya Perezida. "}
{"id": "9607", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9607", "title": "Solina Nyirahabimana", "text": "Solina Nyirahabimana ni umudipolomate w\u2019umunyarwanda akaba n'umunyapolitiki wabaye Minisitiri w\u2019uburinganire n\u2019iterambere ry\u2019umuryango muri guverinoma y\u2019u Rwanda kuva ku ya 18 Ukwakira 2018. \nMuri 2020, yagizwe Umunyamabanga wa Leta ushinzwe Itegeko Nshinga n\u2019amategeko. \nNyirahabimana yabaye Ambasaderi w'u Rwanda mu Busuwisi, mbere yuko ahamagarwa mu 2013. "}
{"id": "9608", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9608", "title": "Pauline Nyiramasuhuko", "text": "Pauline Nyiramasuhuko (yavutse ku ya 1 Mata 1946) ni umunyapolitiki wo mu Rwanda wari Minisitiri w\u2019imibereho myiza y\u2019umuryango no guteza imbere abagore. Yahamijwe icyaha cyo kuba yarashishikarije ingabo n\u2019abasirikare gufata ku ngufu mu gihe cya jenoside yo mu Rwanda yo mu 1994. Yaburanishijwe muri jenoside no gushishikariza gufata ku ngufu i \"Butare \" mu rukiko mpuzamahanga mpanabyaha rw\u2019u Rwanda (ICTR) i Arusha, muri Tanzaniya. Muri Kamena 2011, yahamijwe ibyaha birindwi akatirwa gufungwa burundu. Nyiramasuhuko ni we mugore wa mbere wahamwe n'icyaha cya jenoside na ICTR, n'umugore wa mbere wahamwe n'icyaha cyo gufata ku ngufu."}
{"id": "9609", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9609", "title": "Nyiramilimo Odette", "text": "Odette Nyiramilimo (yavutse 1956) ni umunyarwandakazi akaba umuganga ndetse n'umusenateri. Yabaye umunyamabanga wa Leta ushinzwe imibereho myiza muri guverinoma ya Paul Kagame kuva muri Werurwe 2000 kugeza Ukwakira 2003.\nAmavu n'amavuko.\nNyiramilimo, yavukiye i Kinunu, perefegitura ya Gisenyi muri 1956. ni uwa cumi na karindwi mubana ba se cumi n'umunani, yabyawe n'umugore we wa kabiri.\nUburezi.\nYarangije kaminuza muri 1981 ari umuganga w'ubuvuzi muri kaminuza nkuru y rwanda Butare. \nUbuzima bwite.\nKu myaka itatu, abantu benshi bo mu muryango we baguye mu ntambara yo gushaka ubutegetsi nyuma y'ubwigenge. Nyuma yo kwirukanwa kuko yari umututsi Nyuma yaje gushyingiranwa na Jean-Baptiste Gasasira, na we wari umuganga, maze nyuma baza gushinga ubuvuzi bwihariye bwo kubyara no kuvura abana i Kigali buzwi nka Le Bon Samaritain (\" Umusamariya Mwiza \")Nyiramilimo yari umwe mu banyarwanda bagera ku 1.000 bahungiye muri Hotel des Mille Collines mu gihe cya jenoside yakorewe abatutsi muri 1994 \nAmateka.\nAmateka y'ubuzima bwe yanditswe mu burebure mu gitabo cya Philip Gourevitch Turashaka kukumenyesha ko ejo tuzicwa n'umuryango wacu. Dr Odette Nyiramilimo ni umwe mu badepite bari bagize abadepite bo muri EALA bahagarariye u Rwanda, aho yaje no kuba umwe mubakuriye Komite y\u2019abadepite ba EALA muri afurika y'iburengerazuba, aho bakiraga abantu benshi batandukanye."}
{"id": "9610", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9610", "title": "Fatou Harerimana", "text": "Hon Fatou Harerimana ni Visi perezida w'inteko ishinga amategeko Umutwe wa Sena, kandi Hon Fatou Hareriman yaje gutorerwa kuyobora kuba Umuvugizi w'ihuriro rw'igihugu Nyugurabitekerezo ry'imitwe ya politike.\nImirimo ya koze.\nTaliki 19 Mutarama 2018 yatangije ukukaguramba ku bahohotera abagabo mu Karere Ka musanze, aho Senateri yavuze ko bidakwiye ko umugore ahohotera umugabo yitwaje ko yasubijwe agaciro. naho taliki 22 Mata 2017 yari Mu Karere Ka Huye mu murenge wa Karama aho ya giye mu gikorwa cyo kwibuka Jenoside Yakorewe Abatutsi ku nshoro 27 nibwo yibukije abatunge ko nabo ar'inshingano zabo kwiyukakira Urwibutso rwayo rukomeye. \nNyuma yaho gato aho yaravuye mu karere ka Karongi taliki 27/08/2017 aho yaragiye gusobanurira abayobozi b\u2019Inzego zitandukanye, amahame Remezo Itegeko Nshinga rya Repubulika y\u2019u Rwanda yubakiyeho Hon Fatou niwe wa rubakuriye.\nYagiye kwigisha \"Ndi Umunyarwanda\" ku kigo cy\u2019ishuri Intwari kiri mur Murenge wa Rwezamenyo kibutse Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi niwe wari umuyobozi mukuru."}
{"id": "9611", "revid": "12228", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9611", "title": "Gertrude Kazarwa", "text": "Hon sen. Gertrude Kazarwa afite imyaka mirongo itanu ni rindwi(57) yubukure, ni umunyapolitike wo mu Rwanda kandi ni umusenateri mu nteko ishinga amategeko ya kabiri ya sena y'u Rwanda.\nIbikirwa ya Koze.\nYasuye yabanyeshuri bo muri Tumba College of Technology aho yari yaje kwibutsa urubyiroka ruharererwa rwiga ikoranabunga ko rwabyaza umusaruro imbuga nkoranyambaga ntibahere mu makayi, ahubwo bagomba kurikoresha banahangana n\u2019abapfobya Jenoside.\nYagize uruzinduko yakoreye mu ihuriro, aho bareberagahamwe imiyoborere yashimye uko ihuriro rifata imitwe ya politike Kubahiriza amahame Remezo, Hon sen,Gertrude Kazarwa niwe waruyoboye iri huriro, taliki ya 15 Mutarama 2019 yitabiriye Inama yari isanzwe y\u2019igihembwe y\u2019abagize inama njyanama y\u2019Akarere, hanacyirwa indahiro y\u2019umujyanama mushya uhagarariye umurenge wa Gahengeri Hon sen. Gertrude Kazarwa nawe yarayitabiriye, yaje kunyarukira ku karere ka Ngoma taliki ya 30 werurwe 219 aho yari yagiye kwifatanya n'urubyiruko mu gikorwa cy'umuganda wasozaga ukwezi kwa Werurwe 2019\nUbuzima Bwite.\nHon sen. Gertrude Kazarwa ni umundamu w'imyaka 57 kandi arubatse afite n'abana."}
{"id": "9612", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9612", "title": "Francine Tumushime", "text": "Francine Tumushime, ni umunyapolitiki wo mu Rwanda ukora nka minisitiri i w\u2019ubutaka n\u2019amashyamba (Minilaf), kuva ku ya 31 Kanama 2017. Nyakubahwa Francine TUMUSHIME yagizwe Minisitiri w\u2019ubutaka n\u2019amashyamba kuva ku ya 30 Kanama 2017, afite inshingano zo kurengera, kubungabunga no guteza imbere ubutaka n\u2019amashyamba. \nAmavu n'amavuko.\nTumushime yayoboye ikigo gishinzzwe abakozi ba leta yu Rwanda guhera mu 2012. Ing. Francine TUMUSHIME afite impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu buyobozi bw\u2019ubucuruzi, afite impamyabumenyi muri ' Project Management from Maastricht School of Managementt, mu Buholandi. Afite kandi impamyabumenyi y\u2019ubuhinzi mu buhinzi na \"Dipl\u00f4me de Candidature\" mu bumenyi yakuye muri kaminuza nkuru y\u2019Uburundi\nUmwuga.\nMbere yo gushyirwa mu Nama y'Abaminisitiri, Eng. Francine TUMUSHIME yabaye Umuhuzabikorwa wa Banki y'Isi ishami rishinzwe gushyira mu bikorwa imishinga imwe muri Minisiteri y\u2019ubuhinzi n\u2019ubworozi. Yakoze kandi imyaka irenga nkumuhuzabikorwa wigihugu wumushinga uterwa inkunga na IFAD ushinzwe guteza imbere imishinga mito n'iciriritse yo mucyaro muri Minisiteri yubucuruzi ninganda.\nKuva mu 2012, kugeza muri Werurwe 2016, Hon. Francine Tumushime yabaye umuyobozi mukuru ushinzwe iterambere ry\u2019abaturage n\u2019imibereho myiza muri minisiteri y\u2019ubutegetsi bw\u2019ibanze (Minaloc). Ubwo yavaga i Minaloc ku ya 3 Gicurasi 2016, yasimbuwe na Sheikh Hassa Bahame. \nKu ya 31 Kanama 2017, yarahiriye kuba minisitiri w\u2019abaminisitiri w\u2019ubutaka n\u2019amashyamba. Ubutaka n\u2019amashyamba byakozwe muri minisiteri y\u2019umutungo kamere, muri Kanama 2017, bituma minisiteri y\u2019ibidukikije iba icyicaro cyayo kandi isenya minisiteri y\u2019umutungo kamere. "}
{"id": "9613", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9613", "title": "Mpembyemungu Winifrida", "text": "Mpembyemungu Winifrida (yavutse 1972) ni umunyapolitiki wo mu Rwanda, ubu ari mu bagize Umutwe w'Abadepite mu Nteko Ishinga Amategeko y'u Rwanda. \nMpembyemungu yahoze ari umuyobozi wa karere ka Musanze. Muri 2013 inzu ye yibasiwe n\u2019ibisasu, bituma umwana yicwa abandi babiri barakomereka. Muri 2015 abantu batandatu bakatiwe igifungo cya burundu, kubera ibi nibindi bitero bya FDLR iterwa inkunga. \nMuri Mata 2016, abagizi ba nabi bateye iwe nijoro, bituma umugabo araswa yicwa n'inzego z'umutekano. \nMuri Kamena 2018, Mpembyemungu yatsinze byimazeyo uwahoze ari Depite Marie Therese Murekatete kugira ngo abone itike y'abagore yo mu Rwanda Patriotic Front mu karere ka Musanze. \nIbyo yize.\nMpembyemungu Winifrida ari muri politiki, kuvuga muri 2000, ubwo yarari mu gusoza icyiciro cya gatatu cya Kaminuza mu bijyanye n\u2019iterambere (Master of development studies) muri Kaminuza nkuru yigenga ya Kigali (ULK).\nImirimo yakoze.\nMpembyemungu Winifrida yakoze imirimo itandukanye mu gihugu cyu Rwanda, harimo:"}
{"id": "9614", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9614", "title": "B\u00e9atrice Nirere", "text": "Nirere B\u00e9atrice ni umunyapolitiki wo mu Rwanda wahamwe n'icyaha cya jenoside kubera uruhare yagize muri Jenoside yo mu Rwanda mu 1994. Igihe yacirwaga urubanza mu 2009, yari umwe mu bagize umutwe w\u2019abadepite mu Rwanda, inteko ishinga amategeko umutwe w\u2019igihugu.\nIbyabaye.\nMu 1993, Nirere yari guverineri wungirije ushinzwe imibereho myiza muri perefegitura ya Byumba. Muri uwo mwaka, yahunze ingabo z\u2019u Rwanda Patriotic Front (FPR) yimukira mu nkengero za Kigali. Ababibonye bavuze ko mu gihe cya Jenoside yo mu Rwanda yo mu 1994 Nirere yari umwe mu bari bagize umutwe w\u2019interahamwe zateguye ubwicanyi bw\u2019Abatutsi b\u2019Abatutsi, uruhare rwa Nirere hamwe n\u2019interahamwe rwakomotse kuri politiki ye. Nirere yemeye ko yahaye abayoboke ba Interahamwe imyenda n'ibindi bikoresho, ariko ahakana ko atigeze akorana nabo. Yashinjwaga kandi gushyiraho no kugenzura bariyeri aho abatutsi bafungiwe mbere yuko bicwa. \nMuri Nzeri 2008, Nirere yongeye gutorerwa kuba mu mutwe w'Abadepite nk'umunyamuryango wa FPR uri ku butegetsi. Nyuma y'amezi atanu ari umwe mu bagize inteko ishinga amategeko, yashinjwaga itsembabwoko maze aburanishwa mu rukiko rwa gacaca i Giporoso, mu Karere ka Gasabo. Ku ya 2 Werurwe 2009, Nirere yahamijwe icyaha cya jenoside maze akatirwa gufungwa burundu. Ikibazo cyo gusimburwa kwa Nirere mu nteko kivugwa muri Gicurasi yakurikiyeho, kubera ko yari atarasimburwa na FPR. Umuvugizi w\u2019iyo nzu, Rose Mukantabana, yazamuye iki kibazo kubera ko amategeko y\u2019inteko ishinga amategeko arenze iminsi icumi. "}
{"id": "9615", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9615", "title": "Julienne Uwacu", "text": "Uwacu Julienne ni umunyarwandakazi akaba ari umunyapolitiki mu Rwanda, wabaye minisitiri w\u2019imikino n\u2019umuco n'a siporo,yari mu baminisitiri muri Guverinoma y\u2019u Rwanda, kuva ku ya 24 Gashyantare 2015. Mu ivugurura ry\u2019abaminisitiri ryo ku ya 31 Kanama 2017, Julienne Uwacu yagumanye inshingano ze. \nAmavu n'amavuko.\nYavukiye mu Rwanda, ahagana muri 1979. \nUmwuga wa politiki watangiye mbere ya 2008, ubwo yakoraga nka Visi Meya w'Akarere ka Nyabihu, ushinzwe ubukungu n'iterambere. Muri 2008, yatorewe kuba inteko ishinga amategeko, akora muri urwo rwego kugeza muri Gashyantare 2015. Igihe yari mu nteko, yabaye umuyobozi wungirije wa komite y\u2019inteko ishinga amategeko y\u2019ububanyi n\u2019amahanga, ubutwererane n\u2019umutekano. Muri 2015, yabaye minisiteri wa siporo n\u2019umuco mu Rwanda (Minispoc); umugore wa mbere wakoraga muri urwo rwego, asimbuye Joseph Habineza, waQvanywe muri guverinoma. \nIbindi.\nUwacu Julienne uyu munsi rero akaba ashinzwe ubudaheranwa muri Minisiteri shyashya y\u2019Ubumwe bw\u2019Abanyarwanda n\u2019Inshingano mboneragihugu (yitwa Minubumwe. Uwacu Julienne kandi akaba yiciwe ababyeyi muri Jenoside, aho i Se bamuziza ko yashakanye n\u2019Umututsikazi. Uwacu yavutse ku babyeyi babiri badahuje amoko abahutu n\u2019abatutsi. genoside yakorewe Abatutsi yabaye afite imyaka igera kuri 13, ku itariki 8 Mata 1994, kuwa Gatanu saa munani nibwo ababyeyi be bombi bishwe. Nyina yari Umututsikazi, papa akaba yari Umuhutu. Uwacu Julienne kandi yabaye Umunyamabanga Nshingwabikorwa wa Komisiyo y\u2019Igihugu yo kurwanya Jenoside, CNLG (National Commission for the Fight Against Genocide)."}
{"id": "9616", "revid": "11347", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9616", "title": "Manirarora Annonc\u00e9e", "text": "Annonc\u00e9e Manirarora (wavutse ku ya 30 Kamena 1976) ni umunyarwandakazi w'umunyapolitiki mu Rwanda, kuri ubu akaba umwe mu bagize umutwe w'abadepite mu Nteko ishinga amategeko y'u Rwanda. \nManirarora ni umwe mu bagize urugaga rwo gukunda igihugu cy'u Rwanda. Intara ayobora ni intara y'uburengerazuba n' Akarere ka Ngororero.\nManirarora mbere yakoraga mu Muryango w'Abibumbye kandi afite impamyabumenyi y'ikirenga mu bushakashatsi no gukumira Jenoside. \nIncamake.\nAnnonc\u00e9e Manirarora (wavutse ku ya 30 Kamena 1976) ni umunyapolitiki mu Rwanda, kuri ubu akaba umwe mu bagize umutwe w'abadepite mu Nteko ishinga amategeko y'u Rwanda. Manirarora ni umwe mu bagize urugaga rwo gukunda igihugu cy'u Rwanda. Intara ye nintara yuburengerazuba naho akarere ke ni Akarere ka Ngororero."}
{"id": "9617", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9617", "title": "Marie Claire Uwumuremyi", "text": "Uwumuremyi Marie Claire (yavutse 1979) ni umunyapolitiki wo mu Rwanda. Kuva mu 2018 yabaye umwe mu bagize Umutwe rw'Abadepite mu nteko ishingamategeko y' u Rwanda. \nUbuzima.\nUwumuremyi Marie Claire mbere yo kuba umudepite yakoraga kuri Biro y'Ubutaka, nk'umukozi ushinzwe ubutaka mu Karere akaba n'ushinzwe guha agaciro ubutaka mu Karere. Yabaye Perezida w'Inama y'Abagore (CNF) mu Ntara y'Amajyepfo. Ku munsi mpuzamahanga w\u2019abagore bo mu cyaro 2011 yashishikarije abagore bo mu Murenge wa Tumba, mu Karere ka Huye, gukoresha amahirwe leta itanga, no guteza imbere ubucuruzi bwabo bafata inguzanyo. \nMuri Nzeri 2018 yabaye umudepite mu Karere ka Nyanza, Intara y'Amajyepfo, nk'uhagarariye abagore. Mu Kwakira 2018, yitabiriye ibirori by\u2019umunsi w\u2019ibiribwa ku isi, ashyigikira gahunda ya Girinka ya guverinoma y\u2019u Rwanda (Inka imwe ku muryango ukennye). Ukuboza 2019 yatorewe kuba muri Komite Nyobozi y\u2019umutwe w\u2019Abadepite bagize Inteko ishinga amategeko ya Commonwealth (CWP). Muri Kamena 2019, ubwo yavugaga mu muhango wo kwibuka wabereye mu Murenge wa Mukingo, mu Karere ka Nyanza, yibukije abamuteze amatwi akamaro ko kwibuka jenoside yo mu Rwanda.\nAkazi ya koze.\nUwumuremyi Marie Claire yakoze akazi kenshi kandi gatandukanye harimo:"}
{"id": "9618", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9618", "title": "Rose Mukantabana", "text": "Rose Mukantabana (wavutse ku ya 31 Kanama 1961) ni umunyamategeko uharanira uburenganzira bw'umugore. Yahoze ari Perezida w\u2019Umutwe w\u2019abadepite mu Rwanda kandi ni we mugore wa mbere watorewe uwo mwanya. Yatorewe kuba umuyobozi w\u2019umuryango w\u2019inteko ishinga amategeko nyafurika kuva 2013-2015.\nUbuzima bwa Biografiya.\nRose Mukantabana yavutse ku ya 31 Kanama 1961 mu Karere ka Nyanza, Intara y'Amajyepfo, u Rwanda. Yarangije amashuri yisumbuye atangira gukora mu bakozi ba Leta mu 1980, abanza muri Sosiyete y'u Rwanda ishinzwe ubwishingizi nyuma muri Minisiteri ishinzwe abakozi ba Leta. Mu 1992, yinjiye muri kaminuza nkuru y\u2019u Rwanda arangiza impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu 1996. Muri uwo mwaka, yatangiye gukorera Ishyirahamwe Haguruka, umuryango utegamiye kuri leta wibanda ku burenganzira bwa muntu n\u2019uburenganzira bw\u2019umugore n\u2019abana. Amaze imyaka icyenda muri iryo shyirahamwe, yatangiye kuba umufasha mu by'amategeko kandi akora kugeza ku muhuzabikorwa ushinzwe amategeko. Nyuma gusukura Umunyamabanga Nshingwabikorwa y'Igihugu, Mukantabana asubira kw'ishure. Yize mu Bubiligi, yabonye impamyabumenyi ihanitse \"impamyabumenyi yihariye mu burenganzira bwa muntu\" yakuye muri Universit\u00e9 Saint-Louis Bruxelles. \nMu 2002, yabaye visi perezida wa Pro-Femmes, umuryango w\u2019amahoro wahuzaga ingufu za ONG 43 zigamije iterambere ry\u2019umugore n\u2019uburenganzira. Mu 2005, yatangiye gukora nk'umuhuzabikorwa w\u2019igihugu w\u2019umuryango uharanira uburenganzira bw\u2019umugore uterwa inkunga na USAID maze mu 2007, yimukira muri ActionAid International Rwanda, abanza kuba Umuhuzabikorwa w\u2019Uburenganzira bw\u2019umugore nyuma aba umuyobozi ushinzwe gahunda. Mu mwaka wa 2008, yatorewe kuba Umudepite uhagarariye intara y\u2019Umujyi wa Kigali. Ku ya 6 Ukwakira 2008, yatowe na bagenzi be badepite kugira ngo abere Perezida w\u2019Umutwe w\u2019abadepite mu Rwanda kugeza mu 2013 ku majwi 70 kuri 100 na. Amatora ye yamugize umugore wa mbere uyoboye inteko ishinga amategeko. Mu mwaka wa 2012, yatorewe kuba umuyobozi w\u2019umuryango w\u2019inteko ishinga amategeko nyafurika (APU) kugeza mu 2015. "}
{"id": "9619", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9619", "title": "Donatille Mukabalisa", "text": "Donatille Mukabalisa (yavutse ku ya 30 Nyakanga 1960 i Nyamata) ni umunyamategeko n'umunyapolitiki wo mu Rwanda, cyane cyane Perezida w'Umutwe w'Abadepite. Yatorewe kuba Perezida w\u2019inteko ishinga amategeko y\u2019u Rwanda mu 2013 nyuma y\u2019amatora y\u2019igihugu. \nUbuzima bwa Biografiya.\nDonatille Mukabalisa yavutse ku ya 30 Nyakanga 1960 i Nyamata. Yigisha amategeko muri kaminuza yigenga ya Kigali. \nYakoze mu ishyirahamwe ry\u2019ubuzima ku isi arangije amasomo ye ndetse n\u2019imyaka 16 muri gahunda y\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye ishinzwe iterambere. "}
{"id": "9620", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9620", "title": "Fred Kudjo Kuwornu", "text": "Fred Kudjo Kuwornu (yavutse ku ya 6 Nzeri 1971), ni Umutaliyani, umukinnyi wa filime wo muri Gana, producer, uharanira uburenganzira bwa muntu akaba n'umwarimu ufite icyicaro i New York. \nAzwi cyane nk'umuyobozi wa documentaire zizwi cyane nka \"Blaxploitalian Imyaka 100 Yirabura muri Sinema y'Ubutaliyani\", \"Imbere ya Buffalo\" na \"18 IUS SOLI\". Inyandiko ze zivuga ku nsanganyamatsiko za politiki n'imibereho myiza y'abaturage, nk'ivanguramoko, umubano hagati y'amoko, ubudasa, Abanyafurika-Abataliyani ndetse n'irangamuntu ya Diaspora mu Butaliyani na diaspora ya Afurika ku isi. Niwe mutaliyani wambere ukomoka muri Afrika abaye umuyobozi.\nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse ku ya 6 Nzeri 1971 i Bologna mu Butaliyani kwa se uva Gana na nyina w\u2019umutaliyani. Se Perviss Kuwornu akomoka mu mudugudu wo mu karere ka Volta, muri Gana, wageze mu Butaliyani mu 1965 yiga ubuvuzi. Se wize ibijyanye no kubaga umutima nubuvuzi rusange nyuma arangiza kaminuza. Nyina Alessandra Giacomelli ni Umuyahudi wo mu Butaliyani wo muri Bologna. Kuwornu yakuriye i Bologna, nyuma yimukira muri Gana, Ferrara, Roma. \nUmwuga.\nAmashuri yisumbuye mu Butaliyani no muri Amerika, yabonye impamyabumenyi ya siyanse ya politiki n'itangazamakuru, yakuye muri kaminuza ya Bologna. Ku myaka 16, Fred Kuwornu atangira ubunararibonye bwe nk'umuvugizi wa Radio Estense, radiyo yo muri Ferrara, bityo anonosora ubuhanga bwe bwo guhanga hamwe n'ishyaka rye rya muzika, mu myaka intsinzi ya Rap n'inzu mu muco w'Ubutaliyani. Umwuga we nka DJ uzakomeza kumyaka 15 iri imbere kumaradiyo atandukanye, nka \"Radio Bologna International\", na \"Radio Jam FM.\" Ku izina ry'irihimbano \u201cFreddy Ajya mu nzu\u201d akora nka producer wa label Mantra Vibes, amenya imbyino imwe yise \u201cIfirimbi\u201d (1998) na \u201cSun Train\u201d (1999). Azahagarika umwuga we wa radio igihe azaba yimukiye i Roma gukora muri sinema na TV."}
{"id": "9621", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9621", "title": "Imen Nouel", "text": "Imen Nouel (yavutse ku ya 13 Mutarama 1985), rimwe na rimwe nka Imen No\u00ebl, ni umukinnyi wa filime wo muri Alijeriya. Azwi cyane mubikorwa bya tereviziyo na sinema nka \"Krim Belkacem\", \"Rayes Korso\" na \"Kugeza ku mperuka\".\nUmwuga.\nYatangiye umwuga we nkumunyamideli Muri 2004, yatorewe kuba Miss Ubukerarugendo muri Alijeriya. Muri 2005, yatumiriwe gukina urukurikirane ruzwi cyane rwo gusetsa rwo muri Alijeriya \"Nass Mlah City 3\". Hamwe na serial, yamenyekanye cyane kandi amenyekana nkumwe mubastari bazamuka bakina ikinamico uri Alijeriya. Muri 2009, yabaye umunyamuryango wa muzika \"Al saha\". Mu 2011, yinjiye mu Tunisia umuyoboro ' Nessma ' ari umwanditsi kuko gore kuvuga show \"Memnou Al Rjel\" (babujijwe Bagabo)."}
{"id": "9622", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9622", "title": "Idrissou Mora-Kpai", "text": "Idrissou Mora-Kpai (yavutse 14 Nyakanga 1967), ni umukinnyi wa firime wo muri B\u00e9nine. Azwi cyane nk'umuyobozi wa firime zizwi cyane \"Indochina Traces of\" the Mother, \"Arlit The Second Paris\", na \"Si-Gueriki Umwamikazi Mama\". Niwe wahawe igihembo cy\u2019igikomangoma cy\u2019Ubuholandi kubera ibyo yagezeho mu buhanzi agamije guteza imbere imibereho myiza mu majyepfo y\u2019isi. \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse ku ya 14 Nyakanga 1967 i B\u00e9roubouay, mu majyaruguru ya B\u00e9nin mu muryango w'aborozi. Se yari Mora-Kpai Sounon Dangnon naho nyina yari Bougnon Yarou Signangui. \nYarangije impamyabumenyi ya BA muri kaminuza ya Konrad Wolf Film ya Babelsberg, mu Budage. Yakoze kandi nk'umwarimu wasuye muri Kaminuza ya Cornell, Kaminuza ya Dukena kaminuza ya Pittsburgh. Kuri ubu aba muri Amerika. Ni Assistant Professor mu ishami ryitangazamakuru ryubuhanzi, siyanse nubushakashatsi muri Ithaca College. \nUmwuga.\nAfite imyaka 13, yimukiye i Cotonou maze yiga mu mashuri yisumbuye. Afite imyaka 19, yagiye muri Alijeriya hanyuma yimukira mu Butaliyani no mu Budage. Hanyuma yize muri Amerika y'Amajyaruguru muri kaminuza yubuntu ya Berlin kuva 1988 kugeza 1993. Amaze kubona impamyabumenyi, yize ibijyanye no gutunganya amashusho muri kaminuza ya Konrad Wolf Film kuva 1994 kugeza 1999. Muri iki gihe cya kaminuza, yakoze firime ebyiri ngufi, \"Transient\" na \"Fake Soldiers\". \nMu 1999, Idrissou yimukiye i Paris maze ashinga isosiyete ikora ibintu yitwa 'MKJ Films'. Hamwe n'inzu itunganya, yakoze documentaire ye ya mbere, \"Si-Gueriki\" mu 2002. Filime yakiriwe neza kandi yitabirwa n\u2019amahanga. Yerekanwe mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime Rotterdam (IFFR), Sinema du R\u00e9el, Paris ndetse n\u2019iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya sinema rya Copenhagen (CIFF). Nyuma film yaje guhabwa igihembo cyiza cya Documentaire muri Festival International du Film Francophone de Namur. \nMuri 2019, yakoze film documentaire \"Amerika Street\". Irasobanura urugamba rwa buri munsi rwumuryango nyafrica wabanyamerika i Charleston, muri Caroline yepfo nyuma yubwicanyi bwa Walter Scott 2015. Iyi filime yakiriwe neza kandi yerekanwe mu birori byinshi bya firime. "}
{"id": "9623", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9623", "title": "Pantheon (film)", "text": "Pantheon ni filime ngufi y\u2019igifaransa yo muri 2017 iyobowe na Ange-R\u00e9gis Hounkpatin ikorwa na Myrina Man\u00e9 kuri TS Productions. Muri iyi filime hagaragaramo William Edimo mu mwanya wa mbere hamwe na Bass Dhem, Sophia Elisabeth na Hugo Mar\u00ed. Filime irazenguruka Saloman, umushoferi wa tagisi wimyaka 35 akaba umuhungu wumwimukira wa B\u00e9nin.\nIyi filime yagaragaye bwa mbere ku ya 22 Kamena 2017 mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya Filime rya Palm Springs, muri Amerika. Iyi filime yakiriwe neza kandi ihitwamo kumugaragaro kugirango yerekanwe mu iserukiramuco rya sinema nyafurika 2017, iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Atlanta 2018 na Filmfest Dresden 2018. Filime yatsindiye igihembo cya Bridging the Borders muri Palm Springs International Festival ya Filime ngufi 2017. Muri uwo mwaka, filime yakiriye icyubahiro mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime rya Kolkata. "}
{"id": "9624", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9624", "title": "Ange-R\u00e9gis Hounkpatin", "text": "Ange-R\u00e9gis Hounkpatin, ni Umufaransa - Umukinnyi wa firime wo muri B\u00e9nine akaba n'umwanditsi. \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavukiye kandi akurira i Cotonou, muri B\u00e9nin. \nUmwuga.\nNyuma yo kurangiza amashuri yisumbuye, Hounkpatin yimukiye mu Bufaransa kwiga ubuvanganzo. Amaherezo yinjiye mu ishuri rya Femis rya sinema muri 2009. Yakoze filime \"R\u00eaves de intare\" mu mwaka wa nyuma aza gutsindira igihembo cy'urubyiruko mu iserukiramuco rya C\u00f4t\u00e9 Court of Pantin mu 2014. Filime ye \"Cage\" yahisemo mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Champs-\u00c9lys\u00e9es mu 2016. Mu mwaka wa 2015, yakoze filime \"Vindicte\" yafatiwe muri B\u00e9nin maze atoranywa mu iserukiramuco rya Devant Festival rya Paris mu 2016. Iyi filime kandi yatsindiye igihembo cyiza cya Cinematografiya mu iserukiramuco rya Filime ryabereye i Toronto. \nMuri 2017, yayoboye filime ye ya gatanu ngufi \"Pantheon\". Iyi filime yakiriwe neza kandi ihitamo kumugaragaro kugirango yerekane iserukiramuco rya sinema nyafurika 2017, iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Atlanta 2018 na Filmfest Dresden 2018. Filime yatsindiye igihembo cya Bridging the Borders muri Palm Springs International Festival ya Filime ngufi 2017. Muri uwo mwaka, filime yakiriye icyubahiro mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime rya Kolkata. "}
{"id": "9625", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9625", "title": "Ernest Napoleon", "text": "Ernest Napoleon, numurusiya - umukinnyi wa firime muri Tanzania. \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavukiye i Moscou mu Burusiya kuri se wo muri Tanzaniya na nyina w'Uburusiya. Igihe yari afite imyaka 5, umuryango we wimukiye muri Tanzaniya. Amaze kuba i Dar es Salaam, muri Tanzaniya imyaka 14 na Los Angeles imyaka 8, kuri ubu yimukiye i Stockholm, muri Suwede. \nUmwuga.\nAfite imyaka 3, yakinnye bwa mbere mu ikinamico ya Noheri yise \"Umwaka mushya muri\" \"New Year's in the old Soviet Union\". Igihe yari muri Tanzaniya, yakoraga kuri EATV, televiziyo nini muri Afurika y'Iburasirazuba icyo gihe. Yakinnye kandi nkumu DJ muri 'Club Billicanas', club izwi cyane muri Afrika aho yabaye umuhanzi ufata amajwi ya Bongo Flava, injyana yumuziki muri Afrika yuburasirazuba. Yakoreyeyo ku izina rya 'MC Napo'. \nErnest akiri ingimbi, yimukiye i Los Angeles ahabwa impamyabumenyi ya mudasobwa. Hanyuma yize gukina no kwandika imyaka 7 akiri i Los Angeles. Abifashijwemo n'inshuti na bagenzi be, yakoze filime ye ya mbere ya \"Going Bongo\". Iyi filime yatewe inkunga n'ubuzima bw'abaganga babaga mu Bwongereza, Dr Lewis Burger, aho Ernest yakinnye. Filime ye ifatwa nka firime ya mbere mpuzamahanga yakozwe na Tanzaniya ndetse na film ya mbere yo muri Afrika yuburasirazuba yemerwa na iTunes. \nMuri 2017, yakoze film \"Kiumeni\" yafatiwe i Dar es Salaam. Iyi filime yakiriwe neza nyuma iza gutsindira ibihembo bibiri mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya Zanzibar. Niwe washinze inzu itanga umusaruro, \"Enigma Pictures\". Muri 2017, yagizwe perezida wa 'D Street Media Group', isosiyete mpuzamahanga ikora no gukwirakwiza. Yakoze kandi TV Series \"Mother City\" na firime ya gatatu \"Peponi\". Muri icyo gihe, yafatanyije gukora filime yo mu Bwongereza \"Reka Ntamuntu Umenye\" izenguruka inkuru yukuri ivuga ku mugaragu w\u2019umunyamerika. "}
{"id": "9626", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9626", "title": "Pablo Garc\u00eda P\u00e9rez de Lara", "text": "Pablo Garc\u00eda P\u00e9rez de Lara (yavutse 29 Ukwakira, 1970), ni umunya Esipanye ukora ndetse akandika filimi. Azwi cyane nkumuyobozi wa documentaire nyafurika z\"izwi cyane\" nka Tchindas. \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse mu 1970 i Barcelona, Espanye. Yize muri Centre d'Estudis Cinematogr\u00e0fics de Catalunya (CECC).\nUmwuga.\nMu 1996, yatangiye gukina bwa mbere muri firime \"Fuente \u00c1lamo, Caress of Time nkimpano\" yumushinga watanzwe na Barcelona Alternativa festival. Yarangije filime muri 2001 hanyuma ahitamo muri SEMINCI muri Valladolid. Filime yari yatoranijwe kumugaragaro muri Karlovy Vary. Hanyuma muri 2007, yakoze firime \"Butterfly\" ikora igice cyemewe cya Karlovy Vary na San Sebasti\u00e1n. Muri 2015, yakoze documentaire yamamaye cyane \"Tchindas\" afatanya na Marc Serena. Yatoranijwe mu birori mpuzamahanga bya firime kandi yegukana ibihembo 14 mpuzamahanga. Film nyuma yatsinze Outfest 's Grand Jury Award for Excellence mu sinema. \nMu 2002, yakoze filime ngufi \"Alicia Portrayed\" yatoranijwe muri Cannes Festival's Critics 'Week 2003. Hagati aho, Pablo yakoze documentaire ebyiri \"Son de Galicia\" muri 2006 na \"Mura, un poble de cine\" muri 2010 kuri tereviziyo. Nyuma yaje gukora nka \"cinemateri wa\" documentaire Familystrip yamenyekanye cyane muri 2009. Muri 2011, yakoze documentaire \"Oblidant a Nonot\". Yakiriye igihembo cya City of Alcal\u00e1 muri Alcine 2011, ndetse nigihembo cyabateze amatwi muri l'Alternativa de Barcelona 2011 na Filime ngufi nziza mu rurimi rw'amarenga muri Cinemobile de Sevilla 2011. Noneho muri 2012, yabaye umukinnyi wa \"cinemateri wa film El efecto K. El montador de Stalin\" yerekanwe mumunsi mukuru 60 mpuzamahanga kwisi. "}
{"id": "9627", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9627", "title": "Stefanos Pavlakis", "text": "Stefanos Pavlakis (yavutse 1974), ni umukinnyi n'umwanditsi wa filimi ukomoka mu Bugereki. Yagize uruhare runini muri sinema ya B\u00e9nin akora documentaire zizwi cyane,\"The Eye of the Beholder\", \"Studio Harmattan\" and \"Drive Through\"\nUbuzima bwite.\nMuri 2003, yarangije impamyabumenyi ya BA muri Film &amp; Photography muri kaminuza ya Edinburgh Napier. Hanyuma muri 2005, yarangije MFA nyuma aza kubona Ph.D. muri kaminuza ya Dundee, Duncan of Jordanstone College of Art and Design. \nUmwuga.\nMu mwaka wa 2009, yatangiye gukorana n\u2019amasosiyete abiri akorera mu mujyi wa Berlin 'Expedere', 'Uruganda rw\u2019Inkuru' maze akora documentaire ngufi, amatangazo n'ibikorwa byerekana. "}
{"id": "9628", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9628", "title": "Pablo C\u00e9sar (director)", "text": "Pablo C\u00e9sar (yavutse 26 Gashyantare 1962) ni umukinnyi wa firime wo muri Arijantine. Yagize uruhare muri sinema muri Afurika akora firime zizwi cyane \"Equinox, Ubusitani bwa Roza\", \"Los dioses de agua\" na \"Aphrodite,\"mu bihugu bitandukanye bya Afurika. \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse ku ya 26 Gashyantare 1962 i Buenos Aires, muri Arijantine. Ni umwarimu muri Fundaci\u00f3n Universidad del Cine Buenos Aires kuva mu 1992. \nUmwuga.\nKu myaka 6, C\u00e9sar yatangiye gukora urwenya. Hanyuma afite imyaka 10, yanditse kandi asohora akanyamakuru ke ka mbere. Nyuma yaje kuyigurisha ku ishuri ribanza, Champagnat College. Mu 1975, musaza we Jos\u00e9 Mar\u00eda, yamuhaye amashusho yakoresheje cyane. Hanyuma mu 1977, yanditse inyandiko akora firime ngufi. Hagati aho mu 1980, yahawe igihembo cya mbere mu cyiciro cya \"Experimental\" mu marushanwa ya Rosario Foto-Cine Ateneo kubera filime ye ngufi \"Del g\u00e9nesis\". Filime ngufi kandi yavuzweho ibihembo byiza byo gutunganya no guhabwa igihembo cya gatatu (nta cyiciro) mubakora amafilime ya C\u00edrculo de Mar del Plata hamwe na UNCIPAR. Mu 1983, yakoze filime \"De las caras de los espejos\" maze filime yegukana igihembo cya mbere cya UNICA, Umuryango mpuzamahanga w\u2019amafirime yabatarabigize umwuga murii uwo mwaka. \nAzwiho kuba intangarugero mu gutunganya amafilime hagati y\u2019ibihugu byinshi na Arijantine nka Tuniziya, Mali, Benin, Angola, Etiyopiya, Ubuhinde na Namibiya. Mu 1991, yakoze filime yamamaye cyane yitwa \"Equinox, the Garden of the Roses\" hamwe na Tuniziya. Hanyuma mu 1996, yafatanije nu Buhinde gukora \"Unicorn,\" \"the Garden of the Fruits\". Mu 1998, yakoze firime \"Aphrodite,\" afatanya na Mali. \nYashyizwe kandi mu nama y'abacamanza mu birori mpuzamahanga bya firime birimo, Amiens (Ubufaransa), Iserukiramuco rya Sinema rya Montreal (Kanada), Kelibia (Tuniziya), Huy (Ububiligi), Hyderabad (Ubuhinde), FESPACO (Burkina Faso), na Villa Carlos Paz. Mu mwaka wa 2012, yari mu ntumwa zajyanye na Perezida wa Arijantine Cristina Kirchner muri Angola. Nyuma y\u2019amasezerano y\u2019ubufatanye bw\u2019umuco yashyizweho umukono na guverinoma zombi, C\u00e9sar yayoboye filime \"The Water Gods\", ivugwa ko ari yo ya mbere yatunganijwe muri sinema hagati ya Arijantine na Angola. \nMuri 2018, yayoboye film \"Pensando en \u00e9l\". Iyi filime ishingiye ku mubano uri hagati y\u2019umusizi w\u2019umuhinde watsindiye Nobel witwa Rabindranath Tagore n\u2019umwanditsi wo muri Arijantine, Victoria Ocampo, ubwo basuraga Buenos Aires mu myaka ya za 1920. "}
{"id": "9629", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9629", "title": "Heidi Specogna", "text": "Heidi Specogna (yavutse 5 Mutarama 1959) ni umukinnyi wa firime wo mu Busuwisi. Yagize uruhare muri sinema yo muri Amerika yepfo no muri Afrika akora firime zizwi cyane, \"Das kurze Leben des Jos\u00e9 Antonio Gutierrez\", \"Cahier africain\" na \"Tupamaros\". \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse ku ya 5 Mutarama 1959 i Biel / Bienne, mu Busuwisi.\nUmwuga.\nYize mu ishuri ry\u2019itangazamakuru i Zurich hanyuma akora nk'umunyamakuru mu bitangazamakuru bitandukanye byo mu Budage n'Ubusuwisi. Nyuma yize mu Ishuri rya Filime na Televiziyo mu Budage i Berlin kuva 1982 kugeza 1988. Amaze kurangiza muri iryo shuri, yabaye umwarimu muri Film Academy Baden-W\u00fcrttemberg ku ma firime ya documentaire kuva 2003. Mu 1985, filime ye ngufi ya \"Traces\" yatsindiye igihembo cya Bern. \nYibanze cyane kuri sinema yo muri Amerika y'Epfo na Afurika kubera gukina amashusho cyane cyane binyuze mu nzu ye bwite yashinzwe mu 1990. Mu 1991, yakinnye bwa mbere hamwe na documentaire \"Tania la Guerillera\" ivuga ku barwanyi bo muri Boliviya ' Tamara Bunke '. Mu 1993, yakoze filime \"Rosa\" ivuga ku bikorwa bitemewe n\u2019umukoresha wa radiyo kuri Rote Kapelle. Hanyuma mu 1996 yakinnye nka \"Tupamaros\", umutwe w'inyeshyamba kuva Uruguay, muri documentaire y'izina rimwe. \nMuri 2011 yakoze documentaire ya \"Carte Blanche\" yibanda kuri Repubulika ya Centrafrique. Filime ye \"Ubuzima Bugufi bwa Jos\u00e9 Antonio Gutierrez\" yatsindiye igihembo cya Film yo mu Busuwisi 2007 kubera documentaire nziza ndetse nigihembo cya Adolf Grimme. Hanyuma filime \"Carte Blanche\" yahawe igihembo cya filime nziza y\u2019ururimi rw\u2019ikidage i Duisburg mu 2011 nyuma iza guhabwa igihembo cy\u2019itangazamakuru Gatolika. Filime \"Goal hunter's ship\" bwahawe igihembo cyabacamanza bagize urubyiruko muri Leipzig naho 'inkuru yumukobwa' yise \"Esther und die Geister\" yahawe igihembo cyuburenganzira bw\u2019ikidage. Muri 2017, filime ye \"Cahier Africain\" ishingiye kuri Repubulika ya Centrafrique yibasiwe n\u2019ibibazo, yakiriye igihembo cy\u2019amafirime cy\u2019Ubudage Lola, ndetse n\u2019igihembo cy\u2019amafirime yo mu Busuwisi kubera filime nziza mu bihembo by\u2019Ubudage by\u2019Uburenganzira bwa Muntu, ndetse na the Silver Dove in Leipzig muri 2018 igihembo cya Adolf Grimme. \nMuri 2019, Specogna yahawe igihembo cya Konrad Wolf muri Academy yubuhanzi. Muri 2020, iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Solothurn ryeguriye gahunda idasanzwe \u201cRencontre\u201d kuri Specogna kubera kwibuka uruhare rwe muri sinema nyafurika. "}
{"id": "9630", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9630", "title": "Arcade Assogba", "text": "Arcade Assogba, ni umukinnyi wa firime muri Bene. Yagize uruhare runini muri sinema ya B\u00e9nin atanga amahugurwa menshi yo gutumanaho hakoreshejwe ikoranabuhanga mu birori bitandukanye by\u2019umuco muri B\u00e9nin nko mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya sinema rya Ouidah ndetse n\u2019ibirori mpuzamahanga bya Benin, Fitheb. Azwiho kandi kuba umuyobozi wa firime ngufi, \"ZanKlan\".\nUbuzima bwite.\nKuva mu 2006 kugeza 2009, Assogba yize sinema muri Institut Cin\u00e9matographique de Ouidah (ICO). Nyuma yakuye impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu bumenyi bw\u2019abantu n\u2019imibereho yakuye muri kaminuza ya Paris 1 Pantheon Sorbonne naho impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu by'amategeko yakuye muri kaminuza ya Abomey-Calavi muri B\u00e9nin. \nUmwuga.\nAssogba yatangiye umwuga wa sinema nkumuyobozi wungirije wa mbere kuri firime nyinshi zerekanwe muri Benin. Yakoranye n'abayobozi mpuzamahanga bazwi nka Sylvestre Amoussou, Jean Odoutan, Pablo C\u00e9sar na Heidi Specogna na Pascale Obolo muri firime nyinshi. Muri 2018, yerekanwe bwa mbere mubuyobozi hamwe na documentaire \"Crossing.\" \".\" \".\". Nyuma yo gutsinda kwa firime, yakoze Short \"ZanKlan\" mumwaka umwe. Muri make yakiriwe neza nabanegura kandi yerekanwa kandi atsindira ibihembo mubirori byinshi bya firime. Muri 2019, film yatsindiye igihembo cya 2 cyiza muri Rebiap festival international de film, Benin. "}
